# TODO: Translation updated at 2025-12-03 08:54

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:10
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_619653b7:

    # p "Sorry, Bandile. I really don't feel like facing crowds in the city."
    p "抱歉，Bandile。我真的不想去城里面对人群。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:12
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_6f33fe21:

    # p "I think I'm going to stay on board, at least for a little longer. I can't remember the last time things were quiet around here."
    p "我想我会继续待在船上，至少再待一会儿。我都记不清上次这里这么安静是什么时候了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:16
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_be8783e9:

    # b "No trouble at all! It's your free time as much as it is mine."
    b "一点不麻烦！这是你的自由时间，也是我的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:18
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_7998bf0b:

    # b "Well, it's not mine, technically. I'm still shackled to my duties."
    b "呃，严格来说，这不是我的自由时间。我还被我的职责束缚着呢。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:20
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_47d1cae9:

    # b "But I'm planning to take at least one—actually, let's make that two—two detours for my own amusement!"
    b "不过我打算至少绕个——不，还是两个吧——绕两个弯给自己找点乐子！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:22
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_ae9aec2b:

    # b "If you happen around the city later and bump into me, you're invited to tag along."
    b "如果你待会儿碰巧在城里遇到我，欢迎你一起来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:24
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_838732e3:

    # p "I'll keep that in mind!"
    p "我会记住的！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:26
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_87d61433:

    # b "Good! Though no special treatment for you. That honour must now go to someone else."
    b "很好！不过没有特殊待遇给你。那份荣幸现在得留给别人了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:28
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_f61b8ad5:

    # b "And with that, I'll be off. Time to find myself a well-learned seaman wanting to share in the mysteries of this page."
    b "那么我走了。是时候去找个想一起探讨这页纸上奥秘的博学船员了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:36
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_b9007842:

    # "The hare hops off his crate, speedily walking past you. A vigorous pat on your shoulder signals curtains for this whole conversation."
    "兔子从他的木箱上跳下来，快步从你身边走过。一记有力的拍肩，为整个对话画上了句号。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:38
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_51b362fb:

    # "You watch him turn a corner and vanish up the stairs leading to the deck. {w}What a mysterious fellow, you think."
    "你看着他转过拐角，消失在通往甲板的楼梯上。{w}真是个神秘的家伙，你想。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:44
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_041af9f9:

    # "For someone with next to no reading ability, he sure seems to have the wit and vocabulary of a veteran poet."
    "对于一个几乎不识字的人来说，他看上去确实有着老练诗人般的机智和词汇量。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:47
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_65a84817:

    # "You shake your head, clearing your thoughts. What was it you were doing again?"
    "你摇摇头，清空思绪。你刚才在做什么来着？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:49
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:51
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_02a04b49:

    # "... Right! Wolf."
    "……对了！要去找Wolf。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:58
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_8198d1cf:

    # "You follow in Bandile's tracks and start heading towards the deck."
    "你沿着Bandile的足迹，开始朝甲板走去。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:60
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_43b8f501:

    # "Bandile mentioned he was put on anchor watch. You're not sure what that entails, but..."
    "班迪勒提到他被安排去值锚更。你不确定这具体意味着什么，但是……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:64
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_fc5cb679:

    # "...Well, can't go wrong with checking the bow. It stands to reason that someone watching over an anchor must be located near where the anchor was dropped."
    "……嗯，去船艏看看总没错。按理说，看锚的人应该在抛锚的位置附近。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:66
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_136d043d:

    # "It takes you until you're directly above said anchor to remember that the Conway is moored, not anchored."
    "直到你直接走到那个锚的正上方，你才想起“康威”号是系泊的，不是抛锚的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:68
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_7d803ec1:

    # "You look at the ropes connecting your ship to dry land, fastly secured to the mooring posts. {i}Of course{/i}."
    "你看着将船只与陆地相连、牢牢固定在系缆桩上的绳索。{i}当然了{/i}。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:70
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_b2f88a4b:

    # "We can conclude by process of elimination that anchor watch does not necessarily involve an anchor being in use."
    "通过排除法，我们可以得出结论：有人值锚更不一定意味着锚就在使用中。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:72
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_cfb421f1:

    # "You're just amusing yourself, at this point. Wolf doesn't seem to be around here either, and you have no idea where else to look for him."
    "你此刻只是在自娱自乐。Wolf似乎也不在这里，而且你也不知道该去哪里找他。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:80
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_7f22e8f3:

    # alden "Anchor watch? Oh, at port it's usually a very relaxed affair. He could be anywhere."
    alden "锚更？哦，在港口这通常是很轻松的活儿。他可能在任何地方。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:82
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_8c59cee2:

    # alden "As long as you look like you're keeping an eye on things, you're free to be wherever."
    alden "只要你看起来像是在照看什么东西，你就可以待在任何地方。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:84
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_7332db19:

    # alden "It's mostly, y'know, making sure no thieves or drunkards come on board. Boring as all sin, usually."
    alden "主要是——你知道的，确保没有小偷或醉鬼上船通常无聊得要命。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:86
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_ae649f6d:

    # alden "People tend to wait it out at the gangway."
    alden "人们往往会在舷梯口消磨时间。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:88
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_48d19486:

    # alden "Anyway, if you'd excuse me, I still have to figure out where they've hidden the laundry house in in this town."
    alden "总之，失陪了，我还得搞清楚他们把镇上的洗衣房藏哪儿了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:90
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_49bd6aca:

    # p "Oh, I wouldn't know about that. I appreciate the help though!"
    p "哦，这个我可不知道。不过还是谢谢你的帮助！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:92
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_81c979d1:

    # p "You don't just hang them on the ship?"
    p "你们不是直接把衣服晾在船上的吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:94
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_cafbd793:

    # p "We've just been through a storm."
    p "我们刚刚经历了一场风暴。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:96
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_e4dfd948:

    # alden "I forgot to do it, and now look what it got me!"
    alden "我忘了晾，现在看看这给我带来了什么麻烦！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:98
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_646ffc9d:

    # alden "Anyway, good luck finding him."
    alden "总之，祝你好运，能找到他。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:107
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_56964f35:

    # "And that's where you finally find Wolf—at the place you first left when you went looking for him."
    "而这就是你最终找到Wolf的地方——就在你开始寻找他时离开的那个位置。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:109
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_02f38f81:

    # p "Hey there!"
    p "嘿！这儿呢！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:111
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_f0788d38:

    # "Wolf is leaning on the gunwale, head resting on his hand, elbow firmly planted on the wood."
    "Wolf正靠在船舷上，头枕着手，手肘稳稳地搭在木头上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:115
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_43f26e0a:

    # "A grunt is all you get in response."
    "回应你的只有一声低低的咕哝。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:120
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_6dc28dab:

    # "You lean on the gunwale right next to him. He's staring at the docks, his eyes lazily wandering from sailor to sailor, from stall to stall, from mooring post to mooring post."
    "你倚在他身边的船舷上。他正望着码头，目光懒散地掠过一个个水手、一个个货摊、一根根系缆桩。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:122
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_25a1a702:

    # "He looks bored out of his mind."
    "他看起来无聊得要命。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:124
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_f4b49a30:

    # p "So... Anchor watch, is it?"
    p "所以……是锚更，对吧？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:126
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_2e2a2009:

    # "Wolf doesn't even turn his head to answer."
    "Wolf回答时甚至没有转头。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:128
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_067c600e:

    # w "Yep. {w}Great time. {w}No crowds. {w}Nobody barking orders. {w}Just me and the docks and the sea."
    w "对。{w}好时光。{w}没人挤。{w}没人发号施令。{w}只有我、码头和大海。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:130
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_887e8699:

    # "But he's clearly lying. Or maybe he's going through the exact same cycle of relaxation you did. {w}Appreciation turning to boredom, but yet to turn to restlessness."
    "但他显然在撒谎。或者也许他正经历和你完全一样的放松循环。{w}从欣赏变成无聊，但尚未转为烦躁。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:132
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_d4c6ae50:

    # "A little odd though, you think. For someone deep in the throes of boredom, you'd expect his tone to be slow, sarcastic, slightly slurred even. {w}But his voice is as sharp and focused as ever."
    "不过你觉得有点奇怪。对于一个深陷无聊之苦的人，你还以为他的语调该是是缓慢、讽刺，甚至有点含糊不清的。{/w}但他的声音一如既往地锐利而专注。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:134
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_92b5accf:

    # p "Never heard of anchor watch before. So it's just people keeping track of things when the ship isn't sailing, is it?"
    p "我以前从没听说过锚更。所以就是在船不航行时负责照看东西是吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:136
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_9d920ae0:

    # "Wolf grunts positively in response."
    "Wolf肯定地咕哝了一声作为回应。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:138
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_b4cdcd7d:

    # "You've never seen him like this. Usually he's... well, {i}a bundle of nerves{/i} isn't the right description, but he's extremely alert."
    "你从未见过他这个样子。通常他……嗯，{i}神经紧绷{/i}这个描述不太准确，但他极其警觉。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:140
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_c305860f:

    # "Now he seems to be bored to an unreal degree, lazily watching the dock from his vantage point aboard the {i}Conway{/i}."
    "现在他似乎无聊到了不真实的地步，正懒洋洋地从{i}Conway{/i}甲板上的有利位置俯瞰码头。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:142
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_38589375:

    # "It makes some sense. He's not new to being by himself—you know that well by now. But there's a difference between intentionally finding the quiet room at a party and being alone in an empty building."
    "这倒也说得通。他并非不习惯独处——你现在已经很清楚这点了。但在派对上刻意寻找安静的房间，和独自待在一栋空楼里，还是有区别的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:144
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_1e04bae1:

    # "And, unlike previous times, he has to stay somewhere where people can see him on the watch."
    "而且，与以往不同，他必须待在别人能看到他在值班的地方。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:151
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_9d6d5baa:

    # "He's still his usual loner self, but he's not pushing you away. You lean there, watching the docks and its distant bursts of activity."
    "他还是那个惯常的独行侠，但他没有推开你。你靠在那里，看着码头和远处偶尔迸发的活动。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:153
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_b6ce3439:

    # "You enjoy the quiet rolling of the waves and creaking of the wood."
    "你享受着海浪轻柔的起伏和木头的吱呀声。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:155
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_39f84e97:

    # "It's not long, however, before restlessness rears its ugly head again."
    "然而没过多久，烦躁不安又抬起了它丑陋的头。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:162
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_50875d79:

    # p "So... Got any plans for after the watch is over?"
    p "那么……值班结束后有什么计划吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:164
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_8337703c:

    # w ". . ."
    w ". . ."

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:166
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_9efb4b57:

    # w "Yes."
    w "水温刚刚好。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:168
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_ab286d60:

    # "You know better than to wait for any expanding on that."
    "你心知再等也不会等到更多解释。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:170
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_4d4a0df3:

    # "What comes next does surprise you, however."
    "不过，接下来的话确实让你感到惊讶。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:172
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_f87d7c84:

    # w "You?"
    w "你呢？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:174
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_fde4fa5a:

    # p "Oh! I... don't know, actually. I might head to town, take a walk in the markets."
    p "哦！我……其实没想好。我可能会去镇上，在市场里走走。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:176
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_cbd9619a:

    # p "I've been enjoying the peace on board, but it's starting to get to me. Stretching my legs sounds better and better with each passing minute."
    p "我一直很享受船上的宁静，但现在开始有点受不了了。活动活动腿脚听起来越来越诱人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:178
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_c8607862:

    # w "Probably a good idea. Change of environment will do you good."
    w "可能是个好主意。换个环境会对你有好处的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:180
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_90855684:

    # p "How about you? Planning to remain on board for the whole duration of our stay?"
    p "你呢？打算在我们的整个停留期间都待在船上吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:182
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_639ae270:

    # w "... I'm fine where I am."
    w "……我待在这里就挺好。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:184
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_38d154a2:

    # w "Not a fan of crowds. Plus, someone needs to keep watch. Might as well be me."
    w "我不喜欢人群。况且总得有人值班。那不如就我来干吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:186
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_e3208c01:

    # p "A noble attitude. But... You don't exactly look like you're having a good time. {w}I think."
    p "态度真高尚。但是……你看起来并不像是在享受。{w}我觉得。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:188
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_4d0972a3:

    # w "...{w} It's work. Nobody in their right mind has ever enjoyed work."
    w "……{w}这是工作。没有哪个头脑正常的人会享受工作。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:190
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_4f2e5e53:

    # w "Terribly boring task. That's evident. But I can't say I-"
    w "很明显，这是项极其无聊的任务。但我不能说我不——"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:194
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_42ce8353:

    # "Suddenly, Wolf goes quiet."
    "突然，Wolf沉默了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:198
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_ee1c068b:

    # "He straightens himself up, and you see the shadow of a startle cross behind his eyes. {w}Or do you? His face returns to his stony unreadability so fast, it's hard to tell you saw anything."
    "他挺直身子，你看到他眼中闪过一丝惊慌的阴影。{w}还是说只是错觉？他的脸迅速恢复了那副难以捉摸的冷硬表情，快得让你难以确定是否真的看到了什么。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:200
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_8337703c_1:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:202
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_de4b0596:

    # w "... Hey. Take over for me, will you."
    w "……嘿。替我一下，好吗。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:204
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_1b640dae:

    # p "What?"
    p "什么问题？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:206
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_b67544d7:

    # w "Just for a second. I'll be back soon."
    w "就一会儿。我很快回来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:212
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_773c0269:

    # "Before you can get another word in, he leaves, saddling you with his task."
    "没等你说出下一句话，他就离开了，把他的任务丢给了你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:214
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_02e85460:

    # p "Hey, where are you-"
    p "嘿，你去哪——"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:221
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_c859c335:

    # w "Takin' a piss."
    w "撒尿。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:223
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_2d1a40c7:

    # "He waves off your curiosity without even the decency of turning around. {i}What the...{/i}"
    "他甚至没有礼貌地转身，就挥挥手打发了你的好奇。{i}搞什么……{/i}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:225
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_bb8c730a:

    # "You consider following him, but he's right—someone has to hold down the fort while the sailor on watch is occupied. Whatever that's supposed to be."
    "你考虑过跟着他，但他说得对——值班水手有事时，总得有人守住岗位。不管那岗位具体是干什么的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:232
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_01df24c2:

    # "And you don't want to run the risk of angering Arthur."
    "而且你不想冒惹恼Arthur的风险。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:235
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_6bf55367:

    # "You {i}really{/i} don't want to run the risk of angering Arthur."
    "你{i}真的{/i}不想冒惹恼Arthur的风险。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:237
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_61274bb4:

    # "You stare at the docks below you. Maybe there's an explanation there."
    "你盯着下方的码头。也许答案就在那里。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:242
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_36d14b1a:

    # "But you can't notice anything out of the ordinary. {w}Sailors carrying crates. {w}Some official-looking people talking to officers about papers or something. {w}Fishermen animatedly discussing the weather."
    "但你察觉不到任何异常。{w}水手们在搬运木箱。{w}一些看起来像官员的人正在和军官们讨论文书之类的事情。{w}渔民们正热烈地讨论天气。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:244
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_b77d134a:

    # "Minutes go by with no trace of Wolf's return."
    "几分钟过去了，不见Wolf回来的迹象。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:249
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_515184ba:

    # "The docks continue their anthill-like activity. The bureaucrats, or whoever they are, complete their tour of the berths and leave. The fishermen are still arguing."
    "码头的喧闹仍如蚁穴般不息。那些官僚，或者不管他们是谁，完成了对泊位的巡视后离开了。渔民们仍在争论。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:251
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_6c38affe:

    # "A hand suddenly taps you on the shoulder."
    "一只手突然拍了拍你的肩膀。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:258
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_40b5e3c7:

    # w "Back."
    w "回来了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:260
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_57f5347f:

    # "You take a long look at him."
    "你仔细打量了他一番。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:262
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_7752d7be:

    # "No more signature unreadable expression, just the same lightless and uninterested look he had when you first arrived here."
    "没有了标志性的难以捉摸的表情，只有你刚来这里时他那种空洞与漠然的模样。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:264
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_bb83ff1d:

    # "Weird."
    "奇怪。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:266
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_8b6d5087:

    # p "Wolf?"
    p "Wolf？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:272
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_f1d90117:

    # w "Hmm?"
    w "嗯？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:274
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_5a4ff639:

    # p "Are you faking being bore-"
    p "你是在假装无聊——"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:278
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_93edd13c:

    # sailmullein "Hey! You're Wolf, right?"
    sailmullein "嘿！你是Wolf，对吧？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:288
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_e456ee64:

    # "The sudden shout makes you jolt. You turn—a {i}Conway{/i} sailor you've seen around a few times is waltzing his way towards the two of you."
    "突然的喊声让你吓了一跳。你转过身——一个你在{i}康威{/i}号上见过几次的水手正大摇大摆地朝你们俩走来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:290
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_3965c815:

    # w "... That's me, right."
    w "……是我，没错。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:299
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_6ce284b6:

    # sailmullein "Great! Nobody knew where you were s'posed to be. Took me a while to find you."
    sailmullein "太好了！没人知道你该在哪儿。我找了你一会儿。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:301
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_3f5b8088:

    # sailmullein "It's time out for your watch. I'm supposed to take it from here."
    sailmullein "你的值班时间到了。我该从现在接手了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:303
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_bef1933a:

    # w "... Oh. That won't be necessary."
    w "……哦。那没必要。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:305
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_17cd7bf9:

    # w "I'm more than happy to take over your watch as well. Go have fun."
    w "我很乐意也替你值班。去找点乐子吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:307
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_4d755a38:

    # sailmullein "Uh... Well, I got my orders. And they were pretty clear."
    sailmullein "呃……嗯，我接到了命令。而且命令相当明确。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:311
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_e754678e:

    # w "Yeah, yeah. And I'm saying you can take the morning off. I'll be doing it."
    w "知道知道。但我是说你可以上午休息。我来值班。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:313
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_233bfc5e:

    # sailmullein ". . ."
    sailmullein ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:315
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_89f9b3fb:

    # p "Maybe he should ask Samuel first."
    p "也许他应该先问问Samuel。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:317
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_6db9aa25:

    # w "But he won't."
    w "但他不会。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:322
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_86c5f558:

    # w "... I mean, I'm being nice. I can be nice if I want to."
    w "……我是说，我这是好意。我想友善的时候自然可以友善。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:324
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_9c87becf:

    # p "I don't know, Wolf. If it's his name on the schedule, he's got to be here."
    p "我不确定，Wolf。既然排班表上写的是他的名字，他就必须到岗。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:326
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_392e4d42:

    # a "And he's going to do exactly that!"
    a "而他也会去值班的！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:330
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_74a026ce:

    # "The three of you turn to the gangway simultaneously."
    "你们三人同时转向舷梯方向。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:344
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_68b8028f:

    # "Arthur's coming aboard, a stack of papers under his arm."
    "Arthur正登上船，腋下夹着一叠文件。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:346
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_1b0f8a67:

    # "On his face, the expression of a man who's had a morning with enough annoyances to last the entire rest of the day."
    "他脸上的表情，活像一个早晨遇到的烦心事足够糟蹋一整天的人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:350
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_309a87b8:

    # a "You!"
    a "你！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:352
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_38220d54:

    # "He points at the sailor."
    "他指着那名水手。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:354
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_70a9b0ac:

    # a "Go do a round of the deck. See everything's all right. Do the job you've been tasked with."
    a "去甲板上巡视一圈。确保一切正常。执行分配给你的任务。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:356
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_3cdb65f4:

    # sailmullein "Yes sir!"
    sailmullein "是，长官！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:360
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_61599d1e:

    # a "And you..."
    a "至于你……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:362
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_8337703c_2:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:366
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_e020aea5:

    # "The officer snorts."
    "这位长官哼了一声。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:368
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_62de12d6:

    # a "In the nicest manner possible, Mr. Hvidt;{w} while your dedication to our ship is commendable, {i}insubordination remains insubordination{/i}."
    a "用最客气的方式说，Hvidt先生；{w}虽然你对本船的奉献精神值得称赞，但{i}抗命就是抗命{/i}。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:370
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_9b1ac940:

    # a "Your task is over. It's time for relax and recreation.{w} Go.{w} Off my ship, now."
    a "你的任务结束了。现在是放松和娱乐时间。{w}走吧。{w}立刻离开我的船。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:372
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_daa63b48:

    # a "And as for {i}you{/i}..."
    a "至于{i}你{/i}……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:376
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_ebf2e8ea:

    # "The officer turns towards you."
    "长官转向你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:378
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_f13e3962:

    # a "...What exactly is your purpose for being here?"
    a "……你在这里到底又要干什么？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:380
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_9c2aa349:

    # p "I, uh..."
    p "我，呃……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:382
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_d4388f75:

    # p "I was just having a chat. I'm off duty. I'm about to head off as well."
    p "我只是在聊天。我下班了。我也正准备离开。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:384
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_d9de081c:

    # a "I'm glad to see someone still has a head on their shoulders. Or a semblance of one, at least."
    a "很高兴还有人脑子清醒着。哪怕只是看起来像那么回事。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:386
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_3894cf71:

    # w "...Sir. {w}I believe I can still be of help aboard the {i}Conway{/i}."
    w "……长官。{w}我相信我在{i}Conway{/i}上仍然能帮上忙。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:388
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_8dce5ef3:

    # w "Work is never lacking on a ship. Plus, a watch would be safer with at least two sailors splitting-"
    w "船上从不缺活儿。而且，至少有两名水手分担，瞭望也会更安全——"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:392
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_54c1f83e:

    # a "{i}Mr. Hvidt.{/i}"
    a "{i}Hvidt先生。{/i}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:394
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_63e2db60:

    # "You gulp. {w}You haven't manned a cannon in your sailing career yet, but this must be what waiting for gunpowder to ignite feels like."
    "你咽了口唾沫。{w}你的航海生涯中还没操作过火炮，但这感觉一定就像等待火药点燃。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:396
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_f7a5daf5:

    # a "It would not be incorrect to assume that I may know more about the difficulties and logistics of ship management than you do, yes?"
    a "若说我可能比你更懂操持船只的难处与琐碎，应当没有问题吧？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:400
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_4518ba09:

    # w "...Yes."
    w "……是的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:402
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_495ea5ca:

    # a "And we're also securely moored in the fair port of Mogador, therefore needing no more than one man for checking we don't float off to sea, yes?"
    a "而且我们也已安全停泊在摩加多尔这个优良港口，因此只需要一个人检查我们不会漂到海上去，对吧？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:406
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_9efb4b57_1:

    # w "Yes."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:410
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_ab270a38:

    # a "In fact, some would argue even a single man on watch would be in excess, given the constant presence on the ship and the impossibility of a sudden and inexplicable detachment from the pier, yes?"
    a "事实上，有些人甚至会认为连一个人瞭望都多余，毕竟船上一直有人，也不可能突然莫名其妙地从码头脱离，对吧？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:412
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_9efb4b57_2:

    # w "Yes."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:416
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_cf9e6335:

    # a "Yes...?"
    a "是……？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:420
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_26ca5cf7:

    # w "Yes, sir."
    w "是的，长官。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:426
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_74a123f7:

    # a "Right. And I for one am glad we agree on that."
    a "很好。我个人很高兴我们在这点上达成了一致。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:428
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_1da93c9f:

    # a "But re-establishing the hierarchy of command isn't the point here. As much as I believe it to be a useful reminder."
    a "但此时重点并非重建指挥层级，尽管我确实认为这提醒不无益处。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:430
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_3cc7a17e:

    # a "The point, and do forgive me for indulging, is fostering an understanding of your role."
    a "重点是，请原谅我直言不讳，是让你理解你自己的角色。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:432
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_25f26850:

    # a "You work. {w}You toil, you labour, you travail, you struggle."
    a "你工作。{w}你辛苦，你劳作，你操劳，你奋斗。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:434
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_18cc954c:

    # a "The more you do, the more energy is squeezed not just from your body but mind as well.{w} Rest, Mr. Hvidt, is how you make sure you have enough spirit to do it all again the next week."
    a "你做得越多，身体甚至精神被榨取能量的也会越多。{w}休息，Hvidt先生，是为了确保你下周有足够的精力把这些事再做一遍。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:438
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_10031635:

    # a "I have seen seamen collapse from exhaustion, or reduced to babbling fools unable to comprehend any order more complicated than 'pull on this rope.'"
    a "我见过水手因精疲力竭而倒下，或者沦为胡言乱语的傻瓜，连“拉这根绳子”以外更复杂的命令都无法理解。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:440
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_57e7ae84:

    # a "Much as some distinguished colleagues might disagree, working a crew to the bone does not make for a more efficient, nor safer vessel."
    a "尽管一些杰出的同僚可能不同意，但把船员逼到极限并不会让船更高效，也不会更安全。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:442
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_65cf26e7:

    # a "This is why I {i}demand{/i} my crew take well-earned time off their duties. Some believe it a nicety, I believe it a need."
    a "这就是为什么我{i}要求{/i}我的船员享受应得的休息时间。有些人认为这是种优待，我认为这是种必需。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:444
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_856ffb5b:

    # a "Not even the Lord himself was above taking a day to rest."
    a "即便是上帝本人，也得为自己留一日休憩。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:448
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_8337703c_3:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:450
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_22f4abcf:

    # w "I understand, sir. {w}But I don't feel the need for..."
    w "我明白，长官。{w}但我不觉得有必要……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:456
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_f78edcce:

    # a "Oh, for fuck's sake..."
    a "哦，真他妈服了……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:458
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_eec6372f:

    # "Arthur pinches between his eyes. You notice his fingers are gripping tighter around the folder he's carrying."
    "Arthur捏了捏鼻梁。你注意到他拿着文件夹的手指收得更紧了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:462
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_6f72754c:

    # a "Okay. {w}I don't have time for this."
    a "好吧。{w}我没时间耗在这上面。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:464
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_c0e2bad8:

    # a "You want your orders, Mr. Hvidt? Here you have them."
    a "你想要命令是吗，Hvidt先生？给你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:466
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_1f22e94d:

    # a "You're to head ashore and spend the rest of the day on dry land."
    a "你要上岸去，今天剩下的时间待在陆地上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:468
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_55e9b317:

    # a "Doing what, feel free to exercise your own judgment. But you are not allowed back on board before sundown."
    a "做什么，随你自行决定。但在日落之前，你不准回到船上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:470
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_08d3a7c3:

    # a "{i}That is an order{/i}."
    a "{i}这是命令{/i}。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:475
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_fb23ba61:

    # "There's a glimpse of fear in Wolf's eyes. His voice trembles for a fraction of a second. This time you're sure."
    "Wolf眼中闪过一丝恐惧。他的声音颤抖了一瞬间。这次你确信了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:477
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_255b5e33:

    # w "S-sir. With all due respe-"
    w "长-长官。恕我冒昧——"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:481
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_d269059d:

    # a "Allow me to stop you {i}right there{/i}, Mr. Hvidt."
    a "请允许我{i}就此打住{/i}，Hvidt先生。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:485
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_3251cf7d:

    # a "Now, let's see..."
    a "现在，让我看看……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:488
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_4026fe7a:

    # "Arthur squints, turning your way."
    "Arthur眯起眼睛，转向你这边。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:490
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_db9c311b:

    # "At first you think he might be waiting for you to say something, but you soon realise he's looking well past you."
    "起初你以为他可能在等你说话，但你很快意识到他的目光早已掠过你，投向更远处。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:499
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_cca26f79:

    # "You turn around but see nothing, except for docks, sea, a couple ships, a few houses, and off in the distance..."
    "你转过身，但除了码头、大海、几艘船、几栋房子，以及远处……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:501
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_c1a2316b:

    # a "There. Those ruins."
    a "那里。那些遗迹。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:503
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_954c1bde:

    # a "I want you to head there and come back with a detailed report of their appearance, architecture, history... Whatever strikes your fancy."
    a "我要你去那里，带一份关于它们外观、建筑结构、历史……任何你感兴趣的东西的详细报告回来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:505
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_b601f258:

    # a "Really, the contents don't matter. What matters is that you freely exercise the gift of gab that you so clearly cannot do without, {i}once you've returned{/i}."
    a "真的，内容无关紧要。重要的是，你{i}回来后{/i}，可以尽情施展你那显然不可或缺的舌上功夫。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:507
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_f2699b49:

    # a "And that you spend the day far away from this ship. {w}Until sundown."
    a "并且你要离这艘船远远地待上一整天。{w}直到日落。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:509
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_d98eaea1:

    # a "Say a word again, and I will {i}personally{/i} examine the maps of this island in my possession to send you to the farthest landmark I can find."
    a "再说一个字，我将{i}亲自{/i}查阅我手头的这座岛的地图，把你派到我能找到的最远的地标去。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:518
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_4fd6bb91:

    # a "Have I made myself clear enough?"
    a "我说得够清楚了吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:522
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_8337703c_4:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:526
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_4b5fcb45:

    # a "...Very good."
    a "……非常好。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:528
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_4d603d06:

    # "Suddenly, Arthur points his finger at you."
    "突然，Arthur用手指着你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:531
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_5ba454e4:

    # a "You. Still here. Why?"
    a "你。还在这儿。为什么？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:535
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_f128cb03:

    # p "W-well..."
    p "呃……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:537
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_9cdade09:

    # a "I see I am surrounded by overeager sailors today. Very well."
    a "看来我今天被一群过分积极的水手包围了。很好。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:541
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_7c85ce5e:

    # a "Let this be a teaching moment. Mr. [family_name], you are to accompany Mr. Hvidt in his task. That is also an order."
    a "就当这是教学时刻。[family_name]先生，你要陪同Hvidt先生执行他的任务。这也是命令。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:543
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_84552e68:

    # a "Do not let the other out of your sight. {w}Do not return before sunset. {w}Any disobedience shall be considered gross insubordination and will be punished accordingly."
    a "别让对方离开你的视线。{w}日落前不要回来。{w}任何违抗都将被视为严重抗命，并受到相应惩罚。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:545
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_fe2bd62a:

    # a "Get to those ruins. Write a report, draw a sketch, sing me a ballad about them once you're back, I don't care. Just stay.{w} Off.{w} This.{w} Ship."
    a "去那些遗迹那儿。写报告，画草图，回来给我唱首关于它们的民谣，我不管。只要{i}离开{/i}。{w}这艘。{w}船。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:547
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_5df29c0a:

    # a "Do I hear any further complaints?"
    a "还有人要抱怨吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:549
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_e089e55e:

    # "Neither of you dared to voice so much as a single noise."
    "你们俩谁也不敢发出哪怕一丁点声音。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:553
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_822f5852:

    # a "That's what I like to hear."
    a "这才像话。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:557
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_1e022dcb:

    # a "Next time, don't think twice before taking your time off."
    a "下次，轮到你们休息时别再犹豫。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:559
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_d39ee16e:

    # a "Now leave. I have wasted long enough on this."
    a "现在离开。我已经在这事上浪费够多时间了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:564
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_8337703c_5:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:566
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_d9f6e763:

    # p "Well... Looks like we've got the rest of the day to ourselves."
    p "嗯……看来我们今天剩下的时间归自己了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:571
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_8337703c_6:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:578
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_f0c691a7:

    # "You bring a hand to your forehead and stare at the horizon."
    "你抬手搭在额前，凝视着地平线。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:582
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_35478f04:

    # "It's a clear day and the wind is blowing. Seagulls cry, the smell of saltwater mixes with sand and rocks in a not unpleasant way. You think you detect a whiff of spices."
    "天气晴朗，风吹拂着。海鸥鸣叫，海水的咸味与沙石混合，并不难闻。你似乎还闻到了一丝香料的气息。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:586
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_37974d1b:

    # "The ruins you sailed past on your approach to the island shine in the distance, rock against stone against sand."
    "你们驶近岛屿时经过的那些遗迹在远处闪耀，岩石、石墙与沙地交错斑驳。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:588
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_a120437f:

    # p "How are we even going to get there? It's an island..."
    p "我们怎么过去啊？那是个岛……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:593
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_dff1e0ea:

    # p "We better get on the road and figure out what you have to say to hire a boat..."
    p "我们最好现在出发，想想得说些什么才能租到船……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:595
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_6c0a9b70:

    # p "HEY!" with hpunch
    p "喂！" with hpunch

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:600
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_48d374e1:

    # "While you're busy planning your journey, Wolf is already hopping off the gangway, making his way up the creaky pier towards town."
    "就在你忙着规划行程时，Wolf已经跳下舷梯，沿着吱呀作响的码头朝镇上走去。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:606
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_c3da96aa:

    # p "Hey! Wait, we're supposed to stick together!"
    p "喂！等等，我们应该一起行动的！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:608
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_c4141a5d:

    # "You hurry off the ship, chasing after the nonchalant sailor whose hip you're now joined at for your task."
    "你匆匆下船，追赶着那个因为任务得与你形影不离、此刻却显得漠不关心的水手。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:610
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_c8de8992:

    # p "Hey!"
    p "嘿！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:612
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_aff6e4aa:

    # "It's a clear day and the wind is slowing."
    "天气晴朗，风势渐缓。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:614
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_bfc62702:

    # "For the first time in what feels like forever, you're on dry land."
    "感觉像是过了如此之久后，你终于又踏上了坚实的陆地。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:617
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_f6911e1e:

    # p "Hey! Wait up!"
    p "喂！等等我！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:623
translate Chinese day14_wolf_start_7f5ec5e9:

    # "But Wolf doesn't wait."
    "但Wolf没有等。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:651
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c64daa4d:

    # "You follow him up the pier, past the docks, well into the inner part of the harbour."
    "你跟着他走上码头，经过船坞，深入港口内部区域。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:653
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a5397f77:

    # "You stagger slightly as you walk."
    "你走路时有点踉跄。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:655
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_b5fdffa9:

    # "For the first time in weeks, your legs don't have to balance against the rocking of a ship."
    "几周以来第一次，你的双腿不必再对抗船只的摇晃以保持平衡。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:657
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ca081a1a:

    # "They feel like jelly, but you pay it no mind."
    "它们感觉像果冻一样软，但你并不在意。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:661
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_36418100:

    # "You're too focused on catching up with him, fearing that this might be a similar outburst to the one he aimed at you a few days ago."
    "你太专注于追上他，担心这可能是类似几天前他冲你发火的那种突然爆发。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:665
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bcec72b1:

    # "You're too focused on catching up with a companion who's being even more weirdly mysterious than usual."
    "你太专注于追赶一个比往常更加神秘古怪的同伴。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:670
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_701cf202:

    # "But not running over the few people working or loitering around the docks turns out to be a challenge."
    "但避免撞到码头上那几个正在工作或只是在闲逛的人成了一种挑战。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:672
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e060421d:

    # "A few sailors turn into a small crowd. {w}A small crowd turns into a populated throng. {w}A populated throng turns into a veritable mass of workers, customers, guards, and layabouts."
    "几个水手渐渐聚成一小簇人。{w}一小簇人扩散成三五成群的人堆。{w}人堆又汇聚成实实在在的工人、顾客、卫兵与闲汉的洪流。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:674
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_397134ef:

    # "Soon you're wading your way through people, swimming in a sea of unknown faces from unknown places. {w}Languages and spices you don't recognize hit your ears and nose."
    "很快，你就在人群中艰难穿行，游弋在来自未知之地的陌生面孔汇成的海洋里。{w}听不懂的语言和认不出的香料气味冲击着你的耳朵和鼻子。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:676
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_dd68269a:

    # "You sneeze. Wolf disappears behind someone wearing a dark, loose-fitting outfit you can't name."
    "你打了个喷嚏。Wolf消失在一个身穿深色宽松袍子的人身后，那款式你叫不上名字。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:678
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2cb2233f:

    # "You nudge people aside, then push, trying to stop just short of shoving.{w} You realise your {i}excuse me, sorry, pardon me{/i}'s are worthless in this foreign land."
    "你侧身避让，接着用力推挤，在几乎要冲撞的前一刻勉强停住。{w}你意识到在这异乡之地，那些{i}借过、抱歉、劳驾{/i}的说辞毫无用处。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:680
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_11293ffb:

    # "The sun is rising higher by now. Heat is starting to swell."
    "此时太阳越升越高。热浪开始升腾。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:685
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ae8414e3:

    # "Your walk speeds up."
    "你的脚步加快了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:687
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e730edf3:

    # "You elbow someone by mistake. You catch a glimpse of Wolf, turning a corner on his way out of the docks.{w} You apologise and get a string of profanities in return. At least they {i}sound{/i} like profanities."
    "你不小心用胳膊肘撞到了别人。你瞥见Wolf，他正转过一个拐角离开码头。{w}你道歉，却换来一连串咒骂。至少{i}听起来{/i}像是咒骂。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:689
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_919cf4a2:

    # "Your walk turns into a jog. You turn the corner and nearly run over someone in a very expensive-looking outfit."
    "你的快步走变成了小跑。你转过拐角，差点撞上一个穿着看起来非常昂贵衣服的人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:691
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a663abf3:

    # "{i}Qu'est-ce que c'est-{/i} is all you manage to hear before leaving them behind. You see—or at least, think you saw—a part of Wolf's tail vanish behind another house."
    "{i}Qu'est-ce que
  c'est-{/i}（法语：这是什么——）是你唯一听到的半句话，然后你就把ta甩在了身后。你看到——或者至少以为你看到了——Wolf的一部分尾巴消失在另一栋房子后面。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:693
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_807c8bc6:

    # "Your jog turns into a proper sprint."
    "你的小跑变成了真正的冲刺。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:701
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_46652161:

    # "You turn the second corner and, this time, you get a full view of your runaway lupine comrade."
    "你转过第二个拐角，这次，你完全看清了你那位逃跑的狼族同伴。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:703
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_6bc0252d:

    # "And runaway might be the best term. Head low, fast step, Wolf looks like someone who's got places to be and nothing worth stopping for."
    "而“逃跑”可能就是最贴切的词。低着头，步伐飞快——Wolf看起来像是个有地方要去、没什么值得他停下的人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:710
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1376318e:

    # "He gives the impression of someone with a goal. Focused, annoyed, perfectly blending in."
    "他浑身透着股有目标在身的劲儿：专注、烦躁，完美地隐没在人群里。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:712
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f54e3617:

    # "He's faking it well."
    "他装得很好。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:719
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1cb368fd:

    # "Enough is enough. You put some speed into your legs."
    "够了。你加快了脚步。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:726
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_6598c187:

    # "The alley is devoid of people. Whatever's up with him, now's the best time for a confrontation."
    "小巷里空无一人。不管他怎么了，现在是对质的最佳时机。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:733
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8414259a:

    # "You gulp nervously. But at this point, you're tired of being treated like a complete stranger. "
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:740
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_b8fe0eaf:

    # "It's a matter of respect."
    "这关乎尊重。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:747
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_692f97c6:

    # "You place a hand on his shoulder."
    "你将一只手放在他的肩膀上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:752
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ba398fb5:

    # "Wolf startles."
    "Wolf吓了一跳。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:756
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9d935d99:

    # "You watch as he tenses up."
    "你看着他绷紧了身体。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:758
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0dfbc2b6:

    # "Then, a fist."
    "然后，一拳先到。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:762
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d940b1c0:

    # "Knuckles connecting with your face.{p}A surge of pain.{p}Then..."
    "随后指关节打中了你的脸。{p}一阵剧痛袭来。{p}接着……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:773
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_81006887:

    # "Or so you think. It's hard to tell after all this running, but at least he's stopped now."
    "至少你是这么觉得的。跑了这么久很难判断，但至少他现在停下来了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:775
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a4e92637:

    # "When he turns around, you can't see a shred of emotions on his face."
    "当他转过身时，你在他脸上看不到一丝情绪。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:777
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_7dcf718e:

    # w "What?"
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:779
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9306be0d:

    # p "What are you doing?!"
    p "你在干什么？！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:781
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_672438f0:

    # w "I'm getting to the ruins. As ordere-"
    w "我要去遗迹。按命令——"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:783
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d246b25b:

    # p "Do you think I'm stupid?"
    p "你以为我傻吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:787
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ac605ec4:

    # "In reply, Wolf tenses up. He lets out a snarl."
    "作为回应，Wolf绷紧了身体。他发出一声低吼。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:794
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_5c8a792c:

    # "You flinch and take half a step back."
    "你退缩了，后退了半步。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:796
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_4db5cd40:

    # "For a second there, you were {i}sure{/i} he was about to introduce his knuckles to your face."
    "有那么一瞬间，你{i}确信{/i}他要把指关节招呼到你脸上了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:798
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2ee4e62d:

    # "Instead, he talks."
    "然而，他开口了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:800
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2650f348:

    # w "We don't have all day. What do you want?"
    w "我们没时间了。你想干什么？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:802
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ceba22d6:

    # p "I... What..."
    p "我……什么……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:804
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_875ce35a:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:806
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_349fddf2:

    # p "No. You know what? We {i}do{/i} in fact have all day."
    p "不。你知道吗？我们其实有的是时间。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:810
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_4d27a775:

    # p "That's the whole reason we're here.{p}To burn a day on pointless work. {p}Because of you."
    p "这就是我们来这里的全部原因。{p}为了把一整天浪费在一项毫无意义的工作上。 {p}都是因为你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:812
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e095ec17:

    # "Be it the heat or his antics, frustration forces your voice to rise."
    "不知是炎热还是他的古怪行为，挫败感让你的声音提高了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:814
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_fe4136b0:

    # p "Seriously! What are we even doing here? Arthur just wants to teach us some kind of... of life lesson about being our true salt selves!"
    p "说真的！我们到底在这儿干嘛？Arthur只是想给我们上某种……关于让我们里头有盐的生活课！（译者注：原文借用自马可福音9:50，“里头有盐”大意是指纯洁自省和睦，详见原文）"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:816
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_fc86a018:

    # p "All because {i}you{/i} have something going on and keep pretending you don't!"
    p "全都是因为你有什么事，还一直假装没有！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:818
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_070844b9:

    # "Wolf shows no reaction. It only makes you angrier."
    "Wolf毫无反应。这只让你更加生气。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:820
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_75dd9a6c:

    # p "You keep getting weirder and weirder today and I have no idea why!"
    p "你今天变得越来越奇怪，我完全不知道是为什么！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:822
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2e0d097e:

    # p "So please, Wolf! For the last time..."
    p "所以拜托了，Wolf！最后一次……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:824
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f737144f:

    # p "What's-"
    p "到底——"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:830
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_68a21f86:

    # "But before you can finish your question, Wolf grabs your muzzle."
    "但没等你说完问题，Wolf就抓住了你的口鼻。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:832
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_4e615e1f:

    # p "Mmff-!"
    p "唔——！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:834
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_830fd622:

    # "His hand smells of salt and tar and wood."
    "他的手上有盐、焦油和木头的气味。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:836
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2d0ce9e4:

    # "His grip is strong."
    "他的手劲很大。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:838
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_5da755ae:

    # "Not painful, but decisive."
    "不疼，但很坚决。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:840
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_64cd1717:

    # "You pull on his wrist, but it's pointless. {w}This must be what hauling an entire ship by yourself feels like. That rope isn't going to move."
    "你拉扯他的手腕，但毫无用处。{w}这大概就是独自拖拽一整艘船的感觉吧。那根绳子是不会动的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:842
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_79f98d49:

    # "You knew you could probably never be able to best him in a fight. You didn't realise, up until now, how one-sided that beatdown would be."
    "你早知道在打斗中自己可能永远无法胜过他。但直到现在，你才意识到那种碾压会有多一边倒。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:844
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9ef26f9f:

    # w "Listen."
    w "听着。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:851
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_3c54560a:

    # "He pulls your face closer."
    "他把你的脸拉得更近。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:853
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8d7e99c4:

    # "The sun shines from behind him. His eyes are impossible to see."
    "阳光从他身后照射过来。你看不清他的眼睛。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:855
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9700a807:

    # w "We need to get to those ruins."
    w "我们需要去那些遗迹。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:857
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_6ab72bc5:

    # "He stops."
    "他停顿了一下。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:859
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ef761465:

    # "You can feel his breath on your face. {w}You have no idea what he's thinking."
    "你能感觉到他的呼吸喷在你脸上。{w}你不知道他在想什么。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:861
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0d04128e:

    # w "..."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:863
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_4e4b3a2b:

    # "But then..."
    "但是接着……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:865
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_48be1363:

    # "He does something you didn't expect."
    "他做了一件你意想不到的事。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:869
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_83617ddc:

    # w "{i}Please{/i}."
    w "{i}求你了{/i}。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:871
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_31860de8:

    # "Your righteous anger immediately evaporates."
    "你的义愤立刻烟消云散。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:873
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_58b63cf8:

    # "You've seen Wolf angry. You've seen him evasive, you've seen him frustrated and pissed off."
    "你见过Wolf生气。你见过他逃避，你见过他沮丧和恼火。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:875
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e01cb969:

    # "You've seen him terrified."
    "你见过他害怕。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:877
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_62e878cc:

    # "But you've never seen him {i}pleading{/i}."
    "但你从未见过他{i}这般恳求{/i}的模样。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:879
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_918ac09b:

    # "And you don't know how to react."
    "你不知道该如何反应。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:881
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e8ec5fac:

    # w "I need to get to those ruins as fast as I can."
    w "我需要尽快赶到那些遗迹。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:883
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_b78c9141:

    # w "And I can't have you running around screaming at me."
    w "我不能由着你到处乱窜，冲我嚷嚷。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:885
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d7db8aff:

    # w "Please. Be quiet. {w}Will you?"
    w "求你了。安静点。{w}好吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:887
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点点头"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:894
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_796611b4:

    # "He lets you go."
    "他放开了你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:896
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d646f956:

    # "You balance yourself, coughing, massaging your snout. {w}{i}Ow.{/i} You've been standing on your tippy-toes this entire time."
    "你稳住身子，咳嗽着揉了揉口鼻。{w}{i}哎呦。{/i}你竟一直踮着脚站着。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:898
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_48df9eb1:

    # "You look at him. Now that he's not an inch from your face, his eyes are visible again."
    "你看向他。此刻他离你不再是咫尺之距，那双眼睛你又能看清了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:900
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9e86d55a:

    # w "I..."
    w "我……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:902
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_91c604f9:

    # "In them, fear."
    "在他的眼中，是恐惧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:906
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_81d0e448:

    # w "I can promise an explanation."
    w "我可以保证会解释。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:908
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_33b30572:

    # w "But we need to go. {w}Now."
    w "但我们需要走了。{w}现在。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:912
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2b1176db:

    # w "We need to go. {w}Now."
    w "我们需要走了。{w}现在。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:916
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9ef77e3b:

    # "You swallow."
    "你咽了下口水。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:918
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0f35311e:

    # "You think."
    "你思考着。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:920
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_dac72dd4:

    # "The sound of seagulls echoes faint in the distance."
    "远处隐约传来海鸥的叫声。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:922
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d0575a8d:

    # "Then you make a decision."
    "然后你做出了决定。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:924
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a9ffd93c:

    # p "Okay, let's... Let's just get there then."
    p "好吧，我们……那我们就去那儿吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:926
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_79a9079e:

    # p "We can talk about this later.{w} Sure. No problem."
    p "我们可以晚点再谈这个。{w}当然。没问题。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:928
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_27a4620d:

    # "He nods. Then turns around and resumes his sped-up walk."
    "他点了点头。然后转身，恢复了他那加快的步伐。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:930
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_7d970cb2:

    # p "I'm sure you won't just go all stumm on me again..."
    p "我相信你不会再对我一言不发了吧……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:938
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_de814db9:

    # "It's just a few minutes before you reach the ruins."
    "没过几分钟，你们就到了遗迹附近。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:945
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_af0321b1:

    # "Or rather, before you reach the stretch of sea that separates that islet from the mainland."
    "或者说，到了那片将小岛与大陆隔开的海域。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:947
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_dd8d52a7:

    # "You chose to respect his wishes. Wolf's behavior is concerning, but you're confident he means no harm."
    "你选择尊重他的意愿。Wolf的行为令人担忧，但你确信他没有恶意。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:949
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_469cd171:

    # "Maybe."
    "也许吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:951
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_373a152b:

    # "Though you hope he's not dragging you into any trouble."
    "尽管你希望他不是在把你拖进什么麻烦里。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:955
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_24a5ecad:

    # "Thankfully, it's a short walk to the waters near the island."
    "幸好，走到岛屿附近的水域并不远。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:957
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0d76f68d:

    # "Not long enough for an awkward silence to make its presence felt."
    "还没长到让尴尬的沉默开始显现。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:959
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_7408a887:

    # "Still long enough for emotions to calm down, and for Wolf to return to his usual unreadable facade."
    "但足够长到让情绪平复下来，让Wolf恢复到他往常那难以捉摸的样子。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:961
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_73dd9629:

    # "In fact, long enough to start asking yourself questions."
    "事实上，长到足以让你开始问自己一些问题。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:963
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_5b4e4270:

    # "Question such as:"
    "比如："

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:965
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8ec77088:

    # p "How are we supposed to get there? By swimming?"
    p "我们该怎么过去？游过去吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:967
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_df5208db:

    # "Wolf is staring at the horizon—or rather, at the island dotted with occasional ruins."
    "Wolf正盯着海平线——或者说，望着那座散落着零星遗迹的岛屿。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:969
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_24230599:

    # w "Was hoping for the tide to be in our favor."
    w "本来希望潮水顺咱们的意。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:971
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0b6c30b6:

    # p "It's not though, is it?"
    p "但看来不是，对吧？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:973
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_7268aa73:

    # w "I can see as much."
    w "我看得出来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:977
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c266da05:

    # "A spark of recognition lights itself into your brain. It's just like that other island he mentioned a couple days ago."
    "你的脑海里闪过一丝似曾相识的感觉。这就像他几天前提到的另一个岛。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:979
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f381abc5:

    # "That island with the low tide. That you could walk to."
    "那个退潮时可以走过去的岛。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:981
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0dfdb8cc:

    # "What was it called again? Ba, uh... Belu..."
    "它叫什么来着？贝，呃……贝鲁……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:989
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a2134e69:

    # p "Beldun?"
    p "贝尔敦？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:993
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_3aa8d651:

    # "Wolf raises an eyebrow."
    "Wolf挑起眉梢"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:995
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_7dcf718e_1:

    # w "What?"
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:999
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e8763d15:

    # p "Nothing."
    p "没什么"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1003
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_74c73241:

    # "Your eyes shift away from him. {i}Good job.{/i}"
    "你的目光从他身上移开。{i}干得真好。{/i}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1007
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_6693d6e8:

    # p "Bultrun?"
    p "贝尔特伦？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1009
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d04b2054:

    # w "Bless you."
    w "愿上帝保佑你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1011
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9a28d080:

    # "Your eyes shift away from him. You don't bother explaining yourself."
    "你的目光从他身上移开。你懒得解释。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1017
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c51c6978:

    # p "Baltrum?"
    p "贝尔特鲁姆？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1019
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f1da597a:

    # "Wolf nods."
    "Wolf点了点头。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1021
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1cd805f8:

    # w "Just like in Baltrum. But the water looks too strong."
    w "就像在贝尔特鲁姆那样。但水流看起来太急了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1025
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f5112f7b:

    # w "We'd never make it."
    w "我们绝对过不去。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1027
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0c9d8c1b:

    # "You nod back."
    "你也点了点头。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1031
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1b11d0c8:

    # w "Good memory, though."
    w "不过，记性不错。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1033
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bb473089:

    # "You nod back again, unsure of how to take this moment of camaraderie."
    "你又点了点头，不确定该如何应对这份突如其来的同伴情谊。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1037
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_483281df:

    # p "Nothing special."
    p "没什么。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1041
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_685f0b40:

    # p "Beluga?"
    p "贝鲸？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1045
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bb693538:

    # w "... What?"
    w "……什么？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1047
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_67f1a9ae:

    # p "Nothing. Just thinking about, uh... {w} Never mind."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1049
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_aacf25c8:

    # "Wolf raises an eyebrow but says nothing."
    "Wolf扬了扬眉毛，但没说话。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1053
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_dda0a4cf:

    # p "What for? Leaving port?"
    p "怎么整才能过去？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1057
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d98f6467:

    # w "Doesn't matter."
    w "无所谓了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1061
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9e6ae3b5:

    # "You take a look around."
    "你环顾四周。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1067
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_051527cd:

    # "Short buildings make way for seagulls and the sound of waves as you reach the waterfront."
    "当你到达水边时，低矮的建筑让位给了海鸥和波浪声。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1075
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d0bef8be:

    # "There's not much to see there. Scattered rowboats dragged ashore on a small strip of beach, the occasional rock, some fishing equipment."
    "没什么可看的。零星的划艇被拖上狭小的沙滩，偶尔有几块石头，还有一些渔具。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1077
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_396b24f2:

    # "There's a couple people in sight, but sparse. You assume most folks on the island are off to lunch."
    "能看见零散几个人影，但很稀疏。你猜岛上多数人这会儿都吃午饭去了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1079
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9a4a72ab:

    # "You ponder what to do."
    "你在思考该做什么。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1081
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bc7182b7:

    # "Wolf has no intention to wait."
    "Wolf没打算等。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1086
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_7e897bfc:

    # p "Hey! Hang on-"
    p "嘿！等等——"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1088
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_32f34a59:

    # "Your lupine companion is pushing one of the rowboats into the water."
    "你的狼族同伴正在把一艘划艇推入水中。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1090
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_045a605b:

    # "It's a heavy job, even for someone with his physical build. The small vessel is moving, inch by inch, but sand and weight hold it back."
    "这活儿很重，即使对他这种体格的人来说也是。小船在一点一点地移动，但沙子和重量拖住了它。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1092
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_3d1481b7:

    # "Wolf pants and strains, pushing it towards the end of the small strip of sand."
    "Wolf气喘吁吁地用力推着，把它推向那狭长沙滩的尽头。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1094
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bb6a4203:

    # "You remember a story you were told as a kid, about a Roman hero. Or maybe Greek."
    "你想起小时候听过的一个故事，关于一位罗马英雄。也可能是希腊的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1096
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_45d95505:

    # "Maybe your mom told it to you. Or the village priest. Or a relative. Doesn't matter."
    "也许是妈妈告诉你的。或者是村里的牧师。又或者是个亲戚。随便吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1098
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1fa5293a:

    # "The hero of that story was condemned to spend eternity pushing a boulder up a hill, forever. For some reason or another."
    "那个故事的英雄被罚永世推石上山，周而复始——出于某种缘由。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1100
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_af4000f0:

    # "Some crime against the gods and the universe you don't remember."
    "犯了什么冒犯神祇和宇宙的罪行，你不记得了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1102
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ebcc52be:

    # "You do remember one thing, however. And isn't memory a funny thing?"
    "然而，你确实记得一件事。记忆这东西，不是很奇妙吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1104
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_73d70ce5:

    # "Faces and places fade. But thoughts, impressions, flashes of ideas seem to last decades without ever obfuscating a single detail."
    "面容和地点会褪色。但思绪、印象、灵光一现的想法，似乎能存续数十年，连一个细节都不会模糊。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1108
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_82d0fb74:

    # "Wolf groans. He wipes his forehead before resuming his push."
    "Wolf呻吟了一声。他擦了擦额头，继续推。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1110
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2ffbd30c:

    # "You remember wondering why the hero wouldn't just give up and leave. {w}Or... give up, period."
    "你记得自己曾想过，为什么那英雄不干脆放弃，然后一走了之。{w}或者……就放弃得了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1112
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_cad350f1:

    # "Or why no one else would lend him a hand. Or stop him."
    "或者为什么没有其他人愿意帮他一把。或者阻止他。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1114
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_99ebde86:

    # "It always felt like a self-inflicted punishment, you think."
    "你总觉得那是一种自我施加的惩罚。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1118
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_fc859cf5:

    # "You stop the boat dead in its track with a single hand."
    "你一只手就让小船停了下来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1120
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_dfcc6456:

    # p "Hang on."
    p "坚持住。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1122
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_5ba1a910:

    # "Wolf looks at you."
    "Wolf看着你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1124
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1c0e81ce:

    # "You place both palms firmly on the wood and put your entire weight into it."
    "你将双掌牢牢按在木头上，用上全身的重量。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1126
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_36819cb3:

    # "Your paws dig into the soft, hot sand."
    "你的爪子陷进柔软滚烫的沙子里。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1130
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_be025ece:

    # "You push."
    "你推。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1134
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_5b2e0f69:

    # "Wolf pushes."
    "Wolf推。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1140
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f47049fd:

    # "With your strength combined, the boat reaches the waves."
    "你们合力之下，小船抵达了浪边。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1150
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9d615ec6:

    # p "So..."
    p "那么……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1152
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0c188c1f:

    # "After crewing the Conway, rowing on a boat feels like a pleasant vacation."
    "在Conway上干过活之后，划船愉快得就像在度假。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1154
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2715eaac:

    # "The heat is fighting against you, though. That might be a problem."
    "不过，炎热正在与你们作对。这可能是个问题。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1161
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e7870508:

    # p "Do you think Arthur was serious about the ruins report?"
    p "你觉得Arthur关于遗迹报告的话是认真的吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1165
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bfe1cce6:

    # "Wolf raises an eyebrow at your question."
    "Wolf对你的问题扬了扬眉毛。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1167
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_71da5ad7:

    # p "I mean, that clearly wasn't the point of this... exercise."
    p "我是说，那显然不是这次……"锻炼"的目的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1169
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9647e62c:

    # p "But, he did give us a direct order. We should bring him something."
    p "但是，他确实给了我们直接命令。我们应该给他带点东西回去。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1173
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2d72f56d:

    # w "He did also say he didn't care."
    w "他也说了他不在乎。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1175
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_48b38d79:

    # w "But, whatever."
    w "但是，随便吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1177
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_06c966ea:

    # w "If it's going to shut you up."
    w "如果能让你闭嘴的话。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1179
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f8149c51:

    # "You chuckle. {w}Now that you're off Mogador, although barely a few dozen meters off the coast, Wolf's mood seems to have returned to normal."
    "你轻笑了一声。{w}现在你们离开了摩加多尔，虽然离海岸只有几十米远，但Wolf的情绪似乎已经恢复正常了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1181
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8ae423ec:

    # p "Hey, I'm not rowing all this way for nothing."
    p "嘿，我划这么远可不是白费力气。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1185
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_765cfce2:

    # "You pant. With morning almost over, the day's turning to a level of heat that's starting to surpass your threshold of tolerability."
    "你喘着气。上午快过去了，白天的热度开始超过你的耐受阈值。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1187
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2c1c1827:

    # p "These ruins better be the most magical place we'll ever see."
    p "这些遗迹最好真是我们这辈子见过最神奇的地方。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1189
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2101af12:

    # w "Heh. All right."
    w "呵。好吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1191
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_92235cf8:

    # w "How do you want to go about it?"
    w "你打算怎么执行任务？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1193
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_3e2fea1c:

    # p "Well... he did mention a few options."
    p "嗯……他确实提了几个选项。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1195
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2deacce5:

    # w "Pick one. However you want to do it, it's fine by me."
    w "选一个。无论你想怎么做，我都没意见。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1205
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c5e7d1cc:

    # p "We can just tell him what we found. No need to be fancy about it."
    p "我们可以直接告诉他我们发现了什么。没必要搞得太花哨。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1209
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_3486c8c0:

    # p "He wouldn't appreciate it anyway."
    p "反正他也不会认真听。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1211
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f384c09a:

    # w "Good idea."
    w "好主意。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1217
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_b07c1f6b:

    # p "Maybe we can put it in writing. Show a little more effort than requested."
    p "也许我们可以写下来。表现得比要求的更努力一点。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1219
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_b0ff612c:

    # p "I'm not sure he will appreciate, but... Might as well show our good side."
    p "我不确定他会不会看，但是……不妨展现我们好的一面。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1223
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bdc939f6:

    # p "Get him off our back."
    p "让他别再来烦我们。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1225
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9c2b6402:

    # w "Hmm."
    w "嗯。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1227
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_738c3bf3:

    # w "It was your idea, so you'll do the writing."
    w "这是你的主意，所以你来写。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1229
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_b2c187df:

    # p "It wasn't my {i}idea{/i}. It just feels like the correct thing to do for it to look official."
    p "这不是我的{i}主意{/i}。只是觉得这样做看起来正式一点，比较正确。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1233
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_879a0cdf:

    # p "You're not even going to help a little bit?"
    p "你连一点忙都不帮吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1235
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f79233e0:

    # "He glares at you and you raise your hands defensively."
    "他瞪着你，你防御性地举起双手。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1237
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1d9bd4e4:

    # p "Alright, alright. Just was a suggestion."
    p "好吧，好吧。只是个建议。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1239
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_96f95235:

    # w "Keep rowing."
    w "继续划船。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1241
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_dd56ae57:

    # p "I could ask Nomax for some paper, I think."
    p "我想我可以向Nomax要点纸。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1245
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_09eb0a20:

    # p "Don't worry about that. I'll take care of it."
    p "别担心那个。我来处理。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1247
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_de5d47d8:

    # w "I said keep rowing."
    w "我说了，继续划船。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1253
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_3f4090e2:

    # p "He said we can sing about it. I say let's sing about it."
    p "他说我们可以唱出来。我说我们就唱出来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1257
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bb693538_1:

    # w "... What?"
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1259
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c10511b9:

    # p "We'd still be sticking to the letter of what he told us."
    p "我们仍会严格遵守他告诉我们的字面意思。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1261
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0203c86d:

    # w ". . .{w} Again, what?"
    w "……{w} 再说一遍，什么？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1263
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_63b8fa1e:

    # p "Just a thought. If we have to pay extreme attention to all his orders, then he should pay extreme attention to what they say."
    p "只是个想法。如果我们必须特别关注他的所有命令，那他也应该特别关注这些命令的字面含义。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1267
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8337703c:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1271
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_fa97472d:

    # w "I take back everything I said... It was a mistake to let you decide."
    w "我收回我说过的一切……让你决定是个错误。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1273
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_4f6d5216:

    # "He sighs audibly."
    "他大声地叹了口气。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1275
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_b6b0a070:

    # w "... I'm not going to stop you, if you're set on it."
    w "……如果你决定了，我不会阻止你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1277
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_95867f52:

    # w "But I'm not going to be a part of it either."
    w "但也不会参与。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1279
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2da5bdcb:

    # w "Good luck, I suppose."
    w "祝你好运吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1281
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_5d01f88a:

    # p "Uh... thanks."
    p "呃……谢谢。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1287
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_74c3df8a:

    # "The rest of the rowing is quiet and fast."
    "剩下的航程安静而迅速。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1289
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_261121fb:

    # "Fifteen minutes or so later, you finally make land at the island Arthur pointed you towards."
    "大约十五分钟后，你们终于登陆了Arthur指给你们的那座岛。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1293
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_372c05b8:

    # "It's perhaps a mile from where you started. But it feels like it took an odyssey to get there."
    "那里距离你们的起点或许不过一英里，但感觉像是经历了一场漫长的奥德赛才到达这里。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1295
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9127d7a6:

    # "Your landing is nowhere near as grand or involved as the Conway's. There's no coordination of rope pulling or lowering of the sails."
    "你们的登陆远不如Conway那样隆重或复杂。没有协调一致的拉绳，也没有降帆。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1305
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_4136fd77:

    # "You just hop off the rowboat, drag it fully ashore, then collapse panting on the beach, lying there like God's most tired sand angel."
    "你们只是跳下划艇，把它完全拖上岸，然后气喘吁吁地瘫倒在沙滩上，躺在那里，像上帝创造的最疲惫的沙天使。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1307
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_39e96ba3:

    # "You could go for a nap, if only the blazing sun would stop flashing bright red hues through your eyelids."
    "你本想小睡一会儿，只要那灼热的太阳不再透过你的眼皮闪烁出鲜红的色调。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1309
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_44c5c315:

    # "It's so hot."
    "太热了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1311
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_180b59f6:

    # w "Get up. You'll get sunburnt."
    w "起来。你会晒伤的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1313
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_52fd1eb0:

    # "Wolf is pulling the oars inside the boat. If he's as tired as you feel, he certainly isn't showing it."
    "Wolf正把船桨收进船里。就算他和你一样累，也丝毫没显露出来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1317
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ad783e92:

    # "He's right, though. You raise your back and push up against the sand—{i}ow, that's hot{/i}—and you're back to the task at hand."
    "不过，他说得对。你抬起后背，撑起身子离开沙子——{i}哎哟，好烫{/i}——然后回到了手头的任务上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1319
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1732e782:

    # "It's a short and uneventful walk to the ruins, which tower above you with the help of what little elevation exists on this island."
    "到遗迹的路程很短，也很平淡，借助岛上仅有的那点高度，遗迹高耸在你们面前。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1327
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_fce59849:

    # "The two of you start exploring."
    "你们俩开始探索。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1329
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_13a6948f:

    # "You have to clamber over a couple of rocks and weave through a few spots of plants. Plants that you're sure Nomax might enjoy, even if they look unpleasant to the touch."
    "你们必须爬过几块岩石，在几处植物丛中穿梭——你相信Nomax 可能会喜欢那些植物的，即使它们摸起来看起来不太舒服。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1335
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_6638a4cd:

    # "But nothing in the way would pose any actual risk to your progress."
    "但没有任何障碍能真正阻碍你们前进。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1345
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_70b82aa4:

    # "It's evident that whatever these ruins used to be, they've been abandoned for a long time now."
    "显而易见，无论这些遗迹曾经是什么，如今早已被遗弃多时了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1347
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c5de4ced:

    # "Years. Centuries. Maybe more?"
    "几年。几个世纪。或许更久？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1349
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_adb91e99:

    # "You can't tell. Maybe Nomax could, you think—or he'd just be smitten with that strange spiked plant over there."
    "你说不准。也许Nomax知道，你想——或者他只会痴迷于那边那株奇怪的带刺植物。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1351
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_26c93942:

    # "One or the other..."
    "总归是其中一种..."

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1353
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_eece7b8a:

    # "Bookish type that he is, he might have read something about this place at some point."
    "像他那种书呆子类型的家伙，说不定在某个时候读过关于这个地方的资料。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1355
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_55803d5b:

    # "You can feel your mind wandering, thinking about the painted dog and his glasses."
    "你能感觉到自己的思绪在飘荡，想着那只彩绘狗和他的眼镜。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1362
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_fd7ab268:

    # "You stop just short of your breeches tightening too visibly as you picture him wearing those exclusively."
    "当你想象他只戴着眼镜的样子时，你赶紧停下，免得你的马裤绷得太明显。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1366
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_824b8549:

    # "But one thing's clear, by now."
    "但现在有一件事显而易见。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1368
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_83037c11:

    # "You're getting bored."
    "你开始感到无聊了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1370
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_041d772c:

    # "And you're nowhere near learning more about Wolf."
    "而你对Wolf的了解，依旧毫无进展。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1372
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_b0cb8ec8:

    # "The two of you walk around the ruins, but there's not much to see. A few walls. Some sparse small buildings around them."
    "你们俩在遗迹周围走着，但没什么可看的。几堵墙。周围有些稀疏的小建筑。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1374
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1ccda45c:

    # "You can't really recognise any identifiable style or culture. No writing or decoration either."
    "你实在辨认不出任何风格或文化，以及文字或装饰。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1376
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bb08f65e:

    # "A few boats pass by as you walk. As far as the two of you can tell, you draw nothing more than a couple curious looks from a minimal number of sailors."
    "你们走动时，有几艘船经过。据你们俩判断，你们最多只引起了极少数水手投来的几道好奇目光。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1378
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1510c004:

    # "You and Wolf complete a lap around what seems to be the main building. {w}It's odd."
    "你和Wolf绕了似乎是主建筑的地方一圈。{w}很奇怪。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1380
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ef4c307e:

    # "Not much in the way of identity. Incredibly plain, if it weren't for the few collapsed walls and plants that pepper them."
    "你和Wolf绕着那栋似乎是主建筑的遗迹走完一圈。{w}真奇怪。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1382
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_03e4832e:

    # p "Any idea what this was for?"
    p "看得出这地方原来是做什么用的吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1386
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8337703c_1:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1390
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_418541c3:

    # w "... Not from the outside, no."
    w ".... 从外面看不出来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1392
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bd78ebdb:

    # p "Sounds like we have to go in, then."
    p "听起来我们得进去了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1396
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c1f632b2:

    # w "Do we?"
    w "有必要吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1400
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bc68a725:

    # w "I think this is about as much ruins as we need to see."
    w "我想我们要看的遗迹，到这儿也差不多了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1402
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a49da8c5:

    # w "We can just tell Arthur that and he should be satisfied. He said as much."
    w "我们直接这样告诉Arthur，他应该就会满意了。他自己也这么说过。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1406
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9abafbde:

    # w "I say we wait out the rest of the day on this island. {w}Preferably in the shade."
    w "我说我们就在这个岛上待到今天结束。{w}最好是在阴凉处。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1408
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_dd90a0ac:

    # "You wipe your forehead with a sleeve."
    "你用袖子擦了擦额头。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1410
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0c8ae516:

    # "Can't argue with that."
    "这话没法反驳。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1412
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d3477d92:

    # "But... Now that you see them in front of you, you don't just want to turn back either."
    "但是... 既然它们就在你眼前，你也不想就这么掉头回去。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1414
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a3f3411b:

    # "Perhaps it's the call to adventure—ruins at the end of the world, ready to be plundered for treasure by our intrepid adventurers."
    "也许是冒险的召唤——世界尽头的遗迹，正等着我们这些无畏的冒险者们去掠夺宝藏。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1416
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_7b2aa391:

    # "Maybe it's just how you've never seen anything like this before. A drip of romantic adventure, at last, as compensation for a very tough, very workmanlike journey."
    "或许这只是因为你从未见过这样的景象——终于，旅途的艰辛与劳碌得到了一丝浪漫冒险的补偿，哪怕只有点滴。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1418
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_dcb583e8:

    # "But something is drawing you towards these ancient stones."
    "但有什么东西正把你引向这些古老的石头。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1420
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9120705d:

    # "And there's another thing."
    "还有另一件事。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1422
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_b3dc853f:

    # "For someone so eager to get to these ruins, Wolf is oddly uninterested in them."
    "对于如此渴望来到这些遗迹的人来说，Wolf对它们却出奇地不感兴趣。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1424
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_21dce398:

    # "Like the destination wasn't the point."
    "就好像目的地并不是重点。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1426
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d8ea2598:

    # "A thought about curiosity, cats, and the killing thereof flashes through your head..."
    "“好奇害死猫”的念头在你脑中一闪而过……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1428
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_88edb917:

    # "You do your best to ignore it."
    "你尽力去忽略它。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1430
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_cdbd0a0a:

    # "Then a realization strikes you. {w}And an idea."
    "接着，你突然意识到了什么。{w}并且有了个主意。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1432
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_09929142:

    # p "Well... If we go in, we can find some cover. From the sun, and from prying eyes."
    p "嗯... 如果我们进去，可以找到些遮蔽。能遮阳，也能避开窥探的目光。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1434
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a96ffcd5:

    # p "If we stay out here, people can easily spot us from the coast. Or whenever a boat passes by."
    p "如果我们待在外面，海岸上的人很容易发现我们。或者只要有船经过就能看到。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1436
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a9504b3b:

    # p "Which seems to be what you're trying to avoid."
    p "而你似乎正是想避免这件事。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1438
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_376dc32f:

    # p "Getting noticed."
    p "被人注意到。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1440
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8337703c_2:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1442
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_905cec35:

    # "Wolf looks around the island."
    "Wolf环视着小岛。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1444
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_24acbd46:

    # "One day you'll hear the island's name again, and you'll feel disappointed at the banality of it."
    "总有一天你会再次听到这座岛的名字，并且会对它的平庸感到失望。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1446
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_880e5dfe:

    # "Perhaps, by then, thinking back to this place will fill your heart with sweet nostalgia."
    "也可能到那时，回想起此地，心中会泛起温柔的怀旧之情。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1448
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_5b811c18:

    # "Until that day comes, all you know is what the two of you can see."
    "但在那一天到来之前，你所知的只是你们二人眼前所见。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1450
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bae9c76a:

    # "And all you can see is a somewhat rocky, reasonably flat, entirely treeless piece of land, with no cover of any kind."
    "而你们能看见的，只是一片略多岩石、还算平坦、毫无树木遮蔽的光秃土地。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1454
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_6025a54d:

    # "Except for some weirdly rectangular ruins."
    "除了一些形状奇怪的矩形遗迹。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1456
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_5f71a217:

    # w "... All right. We're going in."
    w ".... 好吧。我们进去。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1461
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0e305343:

    # w "But don't be cute about it."
    w "但别耍小聪明。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1463
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2b36b7ba:

    # p "I won't. Promise."
    p "我不会的。保证。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1465
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_b0d3693a:

    # "You both look up at the wall in front of you."
    "你们俩都抬头看着面前的墙。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1467
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f461caba:

    # w "There's still the question of how."
    w "怎么进去还是个问题。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1469
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a3987888:

    # "He has a point. You can't remember any entrance from your brief tour—it might have collapsed."
    "他说得有道理。你从刚才简短的绕行中不记得有任何入口——可能已经塌了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1471
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_6b2ebe12:

    # "You did notice more than a few collapsed sections, though."
    "不过，你确实注意到了不止几处坍塌的部分。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1473
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_5f316533:

    # "Maybe, with some careful squeezing and pushing, you could find a gap large enough to get inside."
    "也许，经过一些小心地挤推，你能找到一个足够大的缝隙钻进去。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1475
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c3d4848f:

    # "Or, alternatively, take advantage of the gashes in the walls for getting on top of them. It looks walkable, up there. Just be careful of loose pieces of stone."
    "或者，也可以利用墙上的裂缝爬到墙顶上去。上面看起来可以走。只是要小心松动的石块。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1477
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_4d165e85:

    # "Your plans just make you more aware of how heavily you're panting."
    "你的这些计划只是让你更清楚地意识到自己现在喘得有多厉害。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1479
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_68c0a197:

    # "Can you even make it up there? The day keeps getting hotter. If you're feeling starved for air now, pretending to be a spider might not be a smart idea."
    "你真的能爬上去吗？天气越来越热。要是现在都觉得喘不上气，装蜘蛛开爬恐怕不会是个明智的主意。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1481
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1cc96a8b:

    # "You swallow, realizing for the first time how dry your throat is."
    "你咽了口唾沫，第一次意识到喉咙有多干。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1492
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0bd99058:

    # "You and Wolf do another lap around the ruins."
    "你和Wolf又绕着遗迹走了一圈。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1494
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8b4a110c:

    # "Most of the cracks in the walls are barely an inch large, but some sections look a tad more promising."
    "墙上多数裂缝还不到一寸宽，但有些部分看起来更有希望。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1496
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_3a1ac14c:

    # "There's parts where time and weather pushed those cracks aside, forcing stone and mortar to make way."
    "岁月与风雨侵蚀之处，裂缝已被撑开，顽石与灰浆被迫退让。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1498
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_eaa9e2b8:

    # "You stop in front of a rather noticeable structural failure."
    "你们在一处相当显眼的墙体垮塌前停步。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1500
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_de0fb710:

    # p "Here. This might work."
    p "这儿。或许能行。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1504
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_81608c29:

    # w "Hmm..."
    w "哼……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1506
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_83e2e845:

    # w "For you, maybe. I won't make it through anytime soon."
    w "对你来说也许行。我短时间内是过不去的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1508
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_44e22c40:

    # w "... Actually, it looks tight even for your build."
    w ".... 实际上，就算以你的体型来看，这也显得很挤。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1510
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e50fb8fa:

    # p "I think we can make it larger."
    p "我想我们可以把它弄大点。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1512
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_3d84c257:

    # p "Shouldn't be too hard. Hang on-"
    p "应该不会太难。等一下-"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1514
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_6439dcdc:

    # p "Would be easier with a tool, but..."
    p "有工具会更容易，但是..."

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1519
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d0d3c78e:

    # "You pull on some stones until they're loose, raining dry dirt and dust onto the ground around your paws as you try to widen a potential entrance."
    "你拉动一些石头直到它们松动，在你试图拓宽一个可能的入口时，干土和灰尘像雨点一样落在你爪子周围的地上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1521
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_4b10e6a5:

    # "After a few moments Wolf joins in and helps you."
    "过了一会儿，Wolf也加入进来帮助你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1525
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9b2574d1:

    # "With the power of sheer muscle and will, you manage to remove enough pieces to make the gap wide enough for you to push through."
    "凭着纯粹的蛮力与意志，你们终于挪开足够多的碎石，将缝隙拓宽到你能挤身而过的程度。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1527
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_04dc7e74:

    # "At least you think so, as you toss aside the last rock you managed to pry loose. Watching as it tumbles down the steeper side of the island."
    "至少当你扔掉最后一块撬松的石头，看着它滚下岛屿更陡峭的一侧时，你是这么想的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1529
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_77c65cbf:

    # p "All right. Deep breaths. {w}Let's see what's in there."
    p "好了。深呼吸。{w}让我们看看里面有什么。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1536
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_630b365a:

    # "You push your body against the stone. It's a struggle, but you manage to inch your way forward."
    "你用身体抵着石块，虽艰难，仍设法一寸寸挤了进去。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1538
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_faceb8b8:

    # "Snugly surrounded by the walls on either side."
    "两侧的墙壁紧紧地包围着你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1540
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e456a607:

    # "The deep breath was a mistake, your realize. You exhale."
    "你意识到深呼吸是个错误。你呼出气。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1542
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_56b5e9c4:

    # "But it's not the anxiety-inducing squeeze you feared."
    "但这并不是你害怕的那种令人焦虑的挤压。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1546
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_582f387d:

    # "You reach the other side in a handful of seconds. Seems like this building, whatever it was, isn't just a solid chunk of rocks."
    "几秒钟后你就到了另一边。看来这座建筑——不管它是什么，并不只是一大块实心岩石。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1552
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_dde9cb05:

    # "You find yourself in what feels like a room."
    "你发现自己身处一个感觉像是房间的地方。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1554
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_87db631c:

    # w "See anything interesting?"
    w "看到什么有趣的东西了吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1556
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_7858ebe6:

    # p "Uh..."
    p "呃..."

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1558
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_7083a2ae:

    # "You squint, trying to eek out whatever you can from your feline sight. The answer, though, is a simple {i}no{/i}, you're afraid."
    "你眯起眼睛，试图从你的猫科动物视力中榨取出任何能看清的东西。然而，答案恐怕只是一个简单的{i}没有{/i}。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1560
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_b296cc47:

    # "Wolf's leaning against the gap, trying to take a look himself. He's also blocking your only source of light."
    "Wolf正靠在缝隙边，试图自己看一眼。他也挡住了你唯一的光源。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1562
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_15d8aafa:

    # "It's way too dark to make out any detail. But you know, from your time going up and down the Conway, that it will take a few seconds for your eyes to adapt."
    "光线太暗了，看不清任何细节。但你知道，从你在“Conway”上上下下的经验来看，你的眼睛需要几秒钟来适应。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1564
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_5f1d250f:

    # p "Give me some time. Hey, can you-"
    p "给我点时间。嘿，你能不能-"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1568
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f1ca3545:

    # "Suddenly, something brushes along the back of your head."
    "突然，有什么东西擦过你的后脑勺。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1570
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_adf5a0b8:

    # "You startle and look around, fearing that you might not be alone."
    "你吓了一跳，环顾四周，担心这里可能不止你一个人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1572
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_97d7e1ff:

    # "...Nothing."
    "……什么都没有。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1574
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d0dce8bf:

    # p "Huh. What is..."
    p "嗯？这是……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1576
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ded17c8a:

    # "And again."
    "又来了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1578
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0cb02c3e:

    # "Some dust falls on your snout. You sneeze."
    "一些灰尘落在你的鼻子上。你打了个喷嚏。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1580
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_965b89bc:

    # "And again, something hits you. {w}This time, though, your arm is fast enough to catch whatever it is that's..."
    "又有东西砸中了你。{w}不过这次，你的手臂足够快，抓住了那个正在……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1582
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_dde83c31:

    # "That's..."
    "那是……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1584
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_b62be523:

    # "Falling on you..."
    "掉到你身上的……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1586
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ba0562c8:

    # p "A pebble?"
    p "一颗小石子？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1592
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f78b2b8d:

    # "Then the world comes crashing down." with vpunch
    "随后，天地轰然坍塌。" with vpunch

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1594
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_73a8d414:

    # "You cough."
    "你咳嗽起来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1596
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1aebcf70:

    # w "{alpha=0.3}[name]!{/alpha}"
    w "{alpha=0.3}[name]!{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1598
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_99cc0b63:

    # "Wolf's voice is dull."
    "Wolf'的声音很沉闷。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1600
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ff2db561:

    # "It's like it's coming from somewhere else. Somewhere distant."
    "仿佛来自别处。来自某个遥远的地方。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1602
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_788ce486:

    # w "{alpha=0.5}[name]!{/alpha}"
    w "{alpha=0.5}[name]!{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1604
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_eeace4d9:

    # "You open your eyes."
    "你睁开眼睛。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1606
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_35e2ec77:

    # "{cps=2}. . .{/cps}"
    "{cps=2}……{/cps}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1608
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e5b5dcd0:

    # "You try opening them again. {w}It makes no difference."
    "你又试着睁了睁眼。{w}没什么区别。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1610
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a53f84fe:

    # w "{alpha=0.5}[name]! Are you all right?{/alpha}"
    w "{alpha=0.5}[name]! 你还好吗？{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1612
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8038d5d9:

    # "Damn..."
    "该死……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1614
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ce0b509a:

    # "Is this what being dead is like?"
    "这就是死掉的感觉吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1616
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_4424a973:

    # "You didn't even have time to say goodbye..."
    "你甚至没来得及道别……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1618
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_5928da22:

    # "Pain pulses at the back of your head along with some hard sensation."
    "后脑勺传来一阵阵疼痛，伴随着某种坚硬的感觉。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1620
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a0509c48:

    # "Pain?"
    "痛？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1622
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bc21695c:

    # "Probably still alive then."
    "那可能你还活着。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1624
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_96ee56c1:

    # "It takes you a few seconds to realise you're lying down on a hard floor."
    "过了几秒你才意识到，自己正躺在一块坚硬的地板上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1626
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_837bd980:

    # "Something moves across your leg."
    "有什么东西从你的腿上爬过。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1628
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c2945705:

    # "You wish it hadn't."
    "你宁愿它没有。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1632
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_fec6f452:

    # "The strain of your muscles makes sitting back up more of a struggle than you're used to."
    "紧绷的肌肉让你坐起身的动作比平时费力得多。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1634
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c0a01a2e:

    # "Testing your jaws, you feel the grating sensation of chewing sand and dust—which you instantly expel with another series of hearty coughs."
    "你试探着动了动颌骨，立刻感到嚼了满口沙土的粗砺感——随即又爆发出一阵剧烈的呛咳，全吐了出来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1636
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1b59623a:

    # p "I'm—{i}ugh{/i}—I'm here!"
    p "我——{i}呕{/i}——我在这儿！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1638
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8568227d:

    # "You blindly follow the sound of what little of his voice makes it past the stone walls, your non-cough-covering arm outstretched in the complete darkness."
    "你循着他那穿透石墙的微弱声音，在完全的黑暗中，伸出没有用来捂嘴咳嗽的手臂盲目地摸索着。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1640
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_6f510197:

    # p "What happened? I... I can't..."
    p "发生什么了？我……我看不……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1642
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_afa59110:

    # w "{alpha=0.5}The wall collapsed!{/alpha}"
    w "{alpha=0.5}墙塌了！{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1644
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_384bc1f1:

    # "You finally touch what's left of your entrance. {i}Oh no.{/i}"
    "你终于摸到了入口的残骸。{i}糟了。{/i}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1646
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e0e4e3f1:

    # w "{alpha=0.5}Are you hurt!?{/alpha}"
    w "{alpha=0.5}你受伤了吗！？{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1650
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0cbca51a:

    # "You pat yourself down. A few spots ache, but nothing major. You can't feel any suspicious wetness on your head either."
    "你拍了拍身上。有几处地方在疼，但没什么大碍。头上也感觉不到任何可疑的湿意。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1652
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_6d13445a:

    # p "I... I don't think so, no!"
    p "我……我想没有，我没受伤！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1654
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0fa10ace:

    # p "What's it look like from the outside?"
    p "从外面看是什么样子？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1656
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8baa9308:

    # "There's a pause that's longer than you expected."
    "停顿的时间比你预想的要长。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1660
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_85678fc1:

    # "Then you hear a faint sound of scraping and thudding, following by the rustling of small stones."
    "然后你听到微弱的刮擦和重击声，接着是小石子滚落的沙沙声。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1662
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0a2a1506:

    # w "{alpha=0.5}Not good. I might be able to force an opening, but it looks like it could collapse any minute.{/alpha}"
    w "{alpha=0.5}不妙。我或许能强行开个口子，但这里看起来随时可能再次坍塌。{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1664
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_15a7ca98:

    # w "{alpha=0.5}You better get as far away as possible. Any exit in sight on your end?{/alpha}"
    w "{alpha=0.5}你最好尽可能离远点。你那边能看到任何出口吗？{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1666
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_4f3b6dcd:

    # "You squint. No luck."
    "你眯起眼睛。运气不佳。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1668
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d3c3a55e:

    # p "No, it's... pitch black in here."
    p "没有，这里……一片漆黑。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1670
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1f535c31:

    # "You feel a way too familiar bump on the top of your head."
    "你感觉到头顶传来一阵过于熟悉的撞击感。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1672
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_4b128782:

    # p "Listen, Wolf."
    p "听着，Wolf。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1674
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8b6d5087:

    # p "Wolf?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1676
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_7dcf718e_2:

    # w "What?"
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1678
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9ccf95ab:

    # p "I'm going to see if there's another way out."
    p "我去看看有没有别的出路。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1680
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_25f2cb59:

    # "You place your hand on the wall."
    "你将手放在墙上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1682
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a2ea5cfe:

    # p "Let's... Let's both head to my left. We'll meet up wherever we get the chance."
    p "我们……我们都往我的左边走。有机会就会合。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1684
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8337703c_3:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1686
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a9f1e27f:

    # w "Don't..."
    w "别……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1688
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0d3bae85:

    # w "... Don't die in there, all right?"
    w "……别死在里面，好吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1690
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2b36b7ba_1:

    # p "I won't. Promise."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1692
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d523c4cf:

    # w "... Okay. Let's go."
    w "……好吧。走吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1694
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8960b4c9:

    # "You start walking, more than happy to leave the creaking, possibly spider-infested death-trap behind."
    "你开始行走，非常乐意将那吱呀作响、可能爬满蜘蛛的死亡陷阱甩在身后。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1696
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8534ca42:

    # ". . ."
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1700
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a8f69b55:

    # "You follow along the wall, one hand sliding over stones to not lose your bearings."
    "你沿墙摸索前进，一手扶着石块以免迷失方向。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1702
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_5d3efe3c:

    # "It's completely quiet, stones cutting off seagulls and waves from the soundscape you've become accustomed to for the past few weeks."
    "这里面一片死寂，石头隔绝了海鸥声和海浪声这些在过去几周里你早已习惯的声音。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1704
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_87f1ea32:

    # "You soon hit another wall, forming a corner with the one you've been following."
    "你很快碰到了另一面墙，和你一直沿着的那面墙形成了一个拐角。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1706
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0497770a:

    # "Tracing your hand along it reveals an opening—a doorway to another room, you assume."
    "你的手沿着墙摸索，发现了一个开口——你猜想，这是通往另一个房间的门道。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1708
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_46328d0a:

    # "No door, luckily."
    "幸好没有门。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1710
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_3dad8718:

    # "You enter it, trying your hardest to keep going straight."
    "你走了进去，竭尽全力保持直线前进。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1712
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_09216b72:

    # "Your right hand feels another wall, in the same direction as the first—then... wood. And metal."
    "你的右手摸到了另一面墙，方向与第一面相同——然后……是木头。还有金属。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1714
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_3b33936a:

    # "Then more wall, then more wood and metal.{w} And again—wall, wood and metal, wall, wood and metal."
    "接着又是墙，然后又是木头和金属。{w}如此重复——墙，木头和金属，墙，木头和金属。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1716
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_43779902:

    # "Doors. To rooms, maybe? With a... weird focus on security."
    "门。也许是通往房间的？而且……对安全有种诡异的执着。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1718
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_358e48b4:

    # "Reinforced?"
    "加固过的？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1720
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_40b6a715:

    # "Very small rooms, though. The doors are frequent, and the corridor you're in is long."
    "不过房间非常小。门很密集，你所在的走廊很长。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1722
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8997ccb0:

    # "An inn?{w} Doesn't make much sense, though. The island is extremely isolated, without even a trace of an ancient port."
    "旅馆？{/w} 但这不太合理。这座岛极其偏僻，连古代港口的痕迹都没有。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1724
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9d39d640:

    # "And you can't imagine what kind of inn would force its guests into such tiny, claustrophobic..."
    "而且你无法想象，什么样的旅馆会把客人塞进如此狭小、能引发幽闭恐惧的……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1726
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8534ca42_1:

    # ". . ."
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1728
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_00c939a3:

    # "You take your hand off the wall."
    "你把手从墙上拿开。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1730
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_88d91d9e:

    # "You blindly cross the corridor to the other side, until your other hand feels the safe texture of stone—and only stone."
    "你摸黑穿过走廊到另一边，直到另一只手摸到了石头——而且只有石头——那安全的质感。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1732
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ec327d4e:

    # "You reach the end of the corridor and cross through the doorway into another room."
    "你走到走廊尽头，穿过门道进入另一个房间。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1734
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_990a525c:

    # "You pray this prison was emptied before being abandoned."
    "你祈祷这座监狱在被遗弃前已经清空了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1736
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0edd9d78:

    # "It's a deathtrap, probably inhabited by a bunch of creepy-crawlies, and the last thing you need is to suddenly walk across the left-behind skull of some poor inmate."
    "这是个死亡陷阱，很可能住着一堆令人毛骨悚然的爬虫，而你最不想遇到的，就是突然踩到某个可怜囚犯留下的头骨。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1738
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0b856d2f:

    # "You might actually just burst through the ceiling in that case."
    "真那样的话，你恐怕会直接冲破天花板。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1740
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2469db5d:

    # "At least you'd have made it out then."
    "至少那样你就出去了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1742
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8534ca42_2:

    # ". . ."
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1747
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_74e0333e:

    # "It's a couple more minutes of crossing rooms and corridors before a glimmer of hope shines in front of you. {w}A light."
    "又穿过了几个房间和走廊，几分钟后，一丝希望在你眼前闪烁。{w}是一道光。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1749
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2442d54a:

    # "You rush ahead, before immediately returning to a careful shimming along the wall. Breaking an ankle on the last stretch would be extremely stupid."
    "你冲向前，但立刻又退回来，小心翼翼地贴着墙挪动。在最后一段路上摔断脚踝可就蠢到家了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1751
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_fecf4385:

    # "The light gets slightly larger. You get slightly more hopeful."
    "光稍微变宽了一点。你的希望也稍微增加了一点。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1753
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9614c1a1:

    # "Then you feel something wet on your paw."
    "然后你感觉到爪子上有湿湿的东西。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1757
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c5716f20:

    # "You jump, pushing a hand on your mouth to stop the scream that's trying to leave your lungs."
    "你跳了起来，一只手捂住嘴，阻止那即将冲出肺部的尖叫。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1759
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_53be013e:

    # "There's a faint sloshing sound."
    "传来微弱的哗啦声。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1761
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d9bf5195:

    # "You can't hear anything else. You smell the air, but... {w}nothing."
    "你听不到其他声音。你嗅了嗅空气，但是……{w}什么都没有。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1763
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9158a8d2:

    # "You kneel down, carefully touching the floor with the tip of your fingers."
    "你跪下来，用指尖小心地触碰地面。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1765
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_863f9582:

    # "You touch... liquid."
    "你摸到了……液体。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1767
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_51ebfab8:

    # "A lot of liquid.{w} Water, you hope. Seems like the ruins might be flooded from this point on."
    "很多液体。{w}你希望是水。看来从这里开始，遗迹可能已被淹了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1769
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_7c4246ca:

    # w "{alpha=0.3}[name]!{w} Are you there?{/alpha}"
    w "{alpha=0.3}[name]！{w}你在那儿吗？{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1771
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_19300c4a:

    # "You can hear Wolf's faint voice, coming from the direction of the light."
    "你能听到Wolf微弱的声音，从光的方向传来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1773
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_42563a4c:

    # p "Yeah! Stay right where you are, I'm coming!"
    p "在！就待在那儿别动，我过来了！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1775
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e8e9ef8a:

    # "Hearing your lupine companion's voice reinvigorates you. It's time to leave this place behind."
    "听到你那位狼族同伴的声音让你重新振作起来。是时候离开这个地方了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1777
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_b9a95e77:

    # "Not much you can do about the water, though."
    "但是，对于这水，你也没什么办法。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1781
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_7a603834:

    # "You wade through the ankle-deep liquid until it gets knee-deep."
    "你蹚过脚踝深的液体，直到它没到膝盖。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1783
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1d764b3e:

    # "You're getting close, though. You can see streaks of light starting to litter your dark surroundings."
    "不过你越来越近了。你可以看到一道道光线开始点缀你黑暗的周遭。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1785
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_845c67af:

    # "You trace them back to a wall. They're filtering through cracks in a door."
    "你顺着光线找到一面墙。它们正从一扇门的裂缝中透过来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1787
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_81f23f57:

    # "You try to force it open, but no luck."
    "你试图强行打开它，但没成功。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1789
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_342d7e5f:

    # "You examine it as best as you can in the extremely dim light. It doesn't look too thick. And it's definitely old."
    "你在极其昏暗的光线下尽可能仔细地检查它。它看起来不算太厚。而且绝对很旧了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1791
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d87f7ac7:

    # "So you take a step back."
    "于是你后退一步。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1793
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_3ec0e1a8:

    # "Ready your legs."
    "摆好腿的姿势。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1795
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c5603f21:

    # "And kick it with all your strength."
    "然后用尽全力踹了过去。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1816
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_4e8641db:

    # w "Hey."
    w "嘿。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1818
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_451afe16:

    # p "I... whuh..."
    p "我……呃……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1820
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_48fc3417:

    # w "Glad you're finally out."
    w "很高兴你终于出来了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1822
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_b4e9ac9b:

    # p "Wh..."
    p "什……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1824
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_37b46eb2:

    # "The inside of the ruins seem to include a rather large yard. Not a single building, as you thought, but a perimeter."
    "这片遗迹内部似乎包含一个相当宽阔的庭院。并非如你所想是孤立的单栋建筑，而是一圈围合的结构。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1826
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_446ba837:

    # "You stand in a shady, flooded area on the edge of it. Between the cooler stones and the water, it's quite the pleasant change of environment."
    "你站在边缘一处阴凉的水淹区域。凉爽的石壁与积水让环境变得宜人不少。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1836
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_66076c72:

    # "Said environment also includes your companion. In a rather undressed state."
    "这环境中还包括你的同伴——正处在相当衣不蔽体的状态。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1838
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8871a21f:

    # p "Why are you naked?"
    p "你为什么光着身子？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1840
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_df1fba92:

    # w "... Hm?"
    w "……嗯？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1842
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_07187d9b:

    # "You don't know what to reply to that."
    "你不知道该如何回应这个问题。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1844
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_12f59f88:

    # p "Uh...{w} Yeah."
    p "呃……{w} 是啊。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1846
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c3a0b0c5:

    # "Wolf sighs in frustration."
    "Wolf沮丧地叹了口气。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1848
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d878ea6f:

    # w "Because a wall nearly crushed us and covered me in dust and grime."
    w "因为一堵墙差点压扁我们，还让我沾满灰尘污垢。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1850
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_45d4703e:

    # w "I don't like how it feels."
    w "我不喜欢那种感觉。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1852
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_00ea90c5:

    # w "You hardly look much better yourself."
    w "你自己看起来也没好到哪里去。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1854
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f25ba468:

    # "You look down at your body, finally able to in the clear light of the day."
    "你低头看了看自己的身体，终于能在白昼的清晰光线下看清了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1856
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8ea653b6:

    # "It looks like you've been rolling in mud. Your clothes are dirty, your fur's all matted and the water you waded in is making it all stick to your body."
    "你看起来像是在泥地里打过滚。衣服脏了，皮毛全都缠结在一起，蹚过的水让污垢牢牢粘在身上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1858
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_4f36e7cd:

    # "Not to mention the spiderwebs you must have picked up on the way through the ruins."
    "更别提穿越遗迹时肯定沾上的蜘蛛网了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1860
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_25f95e22:

    # w "Come on. Wash up properly."
    w "来吧。好好洗洗。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1862
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bdefbcc3:

    # w "I've already been reprimanded by Arthur once today. I'm not eager to repeat that when I drag you back in the state you're in."
    w "我今天已经被Arthur训过一次了。可不想拖着你这么脏兮兮的样子回去再挨一顿骂。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1864
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9c2aa349:

    # p "I, uh..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1866
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_00223427:

    # p "... I guess?"
    p "……我想是吧？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1870
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_605d7609:

    # "You undress. If there's any sense of impropriety in Wolf, he's not letting it show."
    "你脱下衣服。如果Wolf心里有任何不合时宜的感觉，他也没有表现出来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1872
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_89c37741:

    # "You take off your breeches as well. Nothing left to hide, you think, as you squeeze the dirt out of them as best you can, mimicking his movements."
    "你也脱下马裤。没什么好遮掩的了，你一边模仿他的动作，一边尽力拧掉裤子上的泥污。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1874
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_15ca921d:

    # "Zero reaction from him as you do."
    "他对此毫无反应。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1876
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_436b26b2:

    # p "I don't understand you, Wolf."
    p "我不明白你，Wolf。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1878
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8337703c_4:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1880
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e695669f:

    # p "I don't understand why you're like this."
    p "我不明白你为什么要这样。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1884
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_765f871c:

    # p "I'm not stupid, you know?"
    p "我可不傻，你知道吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1886
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bedf0eeb:

    # p "Back then, something caused the way you lashed out at me that day."
    p "那时候，肯定有什么原因让你那天那样对我发火。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1888
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bdd25c87:

    # p "And today, something caused you practically fleeing through the harbor."
    p "而今天，又有什么原因让你几乎是从港口逃走的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1890
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_33601eb4:

    # p "Sorry, I mean... I don't think there's anything wrong with you."
    p "抱歉，我是说……我觉得你没什么问题。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1892
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_af6013b1:

    # p "You're smart. You always seem to know what to do or how to react."
    p "你很聪明。你似乎总是知道该做什么或如何应对。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1894
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_503994dc:

    # p "Your world is clearly far larger than mine."
    p "你的世界显然比我的广阔得多。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1896
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f75347fd:

    # p "But you behave like you're afraid of sharing it with anyone else."
    p "但你表现得好像害怕与任何人分享它。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1898
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_30527d28:

    # w "Why do you even care?"
    w "你干嘛要在乎呢？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1900
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_300701d2:

    # p "I..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1902
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_45ce95be:

    # p "I care because you do."
    p "我在乎是因为你在乎。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1904
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_14eae44a:

    # p "You had to {i}sprint{/i} to get here before I did. And find a way through."
    p "你不得不{i}冲刺{/i}才能比我先到这里。还找到了一条通路。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1906
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_600623ba:

    # p "You sounded genuinely concerned when you, uh... When you told me to not die."
    p "当你，呃……当你叫我别死的时候，听起来是真心担心我。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1908
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8337703c_5:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1910
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_40dfcfc7:

    # p "I think... {w}I think deep down, you care."
    p "我想……{w}我想在内心深处，你是在乎我的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1912
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1a427001:

    # p "I don't know if it's because of me specifically, or because we're crew."
    p "我不知道是因为我这个人，还是因为我们是船员。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1914
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_863cdcbd:

    # p "On the far side of the world, only able to rely on each other."
    p "在这世界的遥远角落，我们唯一能依靠的只有彼此。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1916
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_5cf8574e:

    # p "I think you care. But it's like you're forcing yourself not to."
    p "我觉得你在乎。但好像你在强迫自己不在乎。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1918
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_149ffe5c:

    # p "And I don't know what to make of that."
    p "而我搞不懂这是为什么。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1920
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8337703c_6:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1922
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_7b481cc6:

    # "Wolf is silent."
    "Wolf沉默了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1924
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e332e84f:

    # "He stares at the water, ripples reflecting a distorted version of his face."
    "他凝视着水面，涟漪映照出他面容的扭曲倒影。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1926
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8a3ba409:

    # "He says nothing."
    "他什么也没说。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1928
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0be30bb2:

    # "But... You know him by now."
    "但是……你现在了解他了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1930
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c00d72d8:

    # "And give him the moment of silence that he appears to need."
    "于是你给了他此刻似乎需要的沉默。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1934
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_03098e00:

    # "So you oblige his wishes, wash yourself, and keep quiet."
    "所以你顺从了他的意愿，清洗自己，保持安静。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1936
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_27db0543:

    # "A few times, Wolf closes his eyes and looks like he's about to say something. {w}But doesn't."
    "有好几次，Wolf闭上眼睛，看起来像是要说什么。{w}但终究没有说。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1940
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f1d9b7d5:

    # "You leave the pool temporarily, to place your clothes to dry out in the sun."
    "你暂时离开水潭，把衣服摊在阳光下晾干。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1942
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9e181ded:

    # "Shouldn't take too long with the sun beating down as it is today."
    "今天太阳这么毒，应该用不了多久就能晒干。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1944
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_3ac74e26:

    # "You come back to Wolf giving you a strange look."
    "你回来时，Wolf用一种奇怪的眼神看着你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1946
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a95f5fd9:

    # "But again, not because you're naked. Or because he is."
    "但需要再次说明的是，这不是因为你光着身子，也不是因为他自己光着。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1948
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_5d5e792d:

    # "It's a strange, nostalgic look."
    "那是一种奇怪的、带着怀旧意味的眼神。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1950
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_04ed7759:

    # "There's a sigh as he takes a deep breath."
    "他深吸一口气，随之是一声叹息。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1960
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2da47c7e:

    # "You touch the wall. Solid, mostly smooth, not a lot of grip to be had even with the aid of your claws."
    "你摸了摸墙壁。坚固，大体光滑，即使借助爪子也没什么抓握点。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1962
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_4797444c:

    # "But the various gaps and cracks in it offer more purchase."
    "但墙上各种缝隙和裂缝提供了更多着力处。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1964
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f5709604:

    # "You're panting. It must be past noon by now, and boy are you starting to feel it."
    "你气喘吁吁。现在肯定已过正午，天哪，你开始感觉到热了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1966
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_64475e00:

    # "Wolf is handling heat a lot better. Or maybe just a lot quieter."
    "Wolf对高温的耐受性好得多。或者只是他安静得多。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1968
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_566f46a2:

    # "You find a diagonal crack large enough to fit your fingers, if not entire paws."
    "你找到一道足够宽的斜向裂缝，即使塞不进整个爪子，也能容下手指。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1970
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0e4ef4e1:

    # p "All right... This looks promising."
    p "好吧……这块看起来有希望。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1972
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_6cb68b76:

    # "You attempt a few tentative grips on the naked stones jutting out from the old mortar."
    "你试探性地抓握了几次从古老灰浆中凸出的裸石。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1974
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_808a6af9:

    # "They hold. You see if they can support your weight."
    "它们很牢固。你试了试它们能否承受你的体重。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1976
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_aa93c272:

    # "They can."
    "可以。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1978
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_6ffa0d72:

    # w "Go for it."
    w "那就上吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1982
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_545cd568:

    # p "Will you manage to make it yourself?"
    p "你自己能行吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1984
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_3e3fd8b4:

    # w "Do you think I won't?"
    w "你觉得我不行吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1986
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d1277233:

    # p "Not really, no."
    p "不太行。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1990
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1a4e7fc6:

    # w "There's your answer."
    w "这就是你的答案。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1992
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8f4f445b:

    # "You ready yourself, looking up along the sheer wall in front of you, and take a last full inhale."
    "你做好准备，抬头望了望面前陡峭的墙壁，最后深吸一口气。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1994
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_90a7a02e:

    # "No more hesitating, then. With a huff, you pull yourself up and start climbing the ruins."
    "你不再犹豫了，呼了口气，撑起身子，开始攀爬遗迹。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1996
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2b50bd5c:

    # "Wolf silently follows."
    "Wolf默默跟在后面。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:1998
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_07ffc7d5:

    # "One hand in front of the other."
    "一手接一手，交替向前。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2000
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_99cf5a45:

    # "A third of the way through, you start having regrets."
    "爬到三分之一时，你开始后悔了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2002
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f4bbebb8:

    # "Sweat drops like light rain from your forehead."
    "汗珠像小雨点一样从额头滴落。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2004
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2615918c:

    # "You don't look down. No point. Wolf is right behind you anyway."
    "你不往下看——没必要。反正Wolf就在你正下方。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2006
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c9e73cf2:

    # "Maybe a minute or so passes interminably."
    "过了十分煎熬的一分钟左右。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2008
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_107c6ce4:

    # "The heat is unbearable."
    "实在是热得难以忍受。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2010
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1bf45214:

    # "Two thirds of the way through, you start feeling a little woozy. Almost sleepy."
    "爬到三分之二时，你开始感到有点晕眩。几乎昏昏欲睡。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2012
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_5ecbc7bb:

    # "But the end is in sight. You shake your head and push forward."
    "但终点在望。你摇摇头，继续向上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2014
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_439396b0:

    # "Just a little more.{w} One last push, and it's done."
    "就差一点了。{w}最后加把劲，就成功了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2017
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1c0ef345:

    # "Your paw slips."
    "你的爪子滑了一下。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2019
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_59ddab63:

    # "A terrifying jolt runs up your spine."
    "一阵恐怖的战栗窜上你的脊梁。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2021
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ccbcbe38:

    # "Sending your fur to stand on edge in an instant."
    "让你全身的毛发瞬间竖立。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2023
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_89a310f8:

    # "You immediately grab as tight as possible with your fingers, claws extended and scraping the rock."
    "你立刻用尽全力抓紧，爪子伸出，刮擦着岩石。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2027
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_4685ab4c:

    # "A few pebbles and mortar fall down behind you, hitting Wolf in the face."
    "几块碎石和灰浆从你身后落下，砸在Wolf脸上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2029
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_92adf7cd:

    # "You stand still."
    "你僵住不动。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2031
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0d04128e_1:

    # w "..."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2033
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f967e19c:

    # w "Everything all right up there?"
    w "上面没事吧？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2037
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_6e0e8298:

    # p "... {w}Yeah...{w} Yeah, I think I'm good."
    p "……{w}没事……{w}没事，我觉得没啥问题。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2039
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_30035153:

    # p "Stupid wall..."
    p "这傻逼墙……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2041
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_5259cacb:

    # "You resume your climb, slightly slower than before this enforced break."
    "你继续攀爬，比这次被迫停顿前稍慢了一些。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2043
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f50290f3:

    # "Shortly afterwards, you make it to the top. Though, it takes a couple of tries before you can actually push yourself up the edge."
    "不久后，你攀到了顶端。不过试了好几次，才真正把自己撑上边缘。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2045
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_fffef8f3:

    # "You sit down. Your muscles ache and you're breathing heavily."
    "你坐下来。肌肉酸痛，呼吸沉重。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2049
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_cc9d85f0:

    # "Weird. You'd have sworn you were used to much harder stuff on the Conway."
    "怪了。你敢发誓自己本该早就习惯了Conway上那些更艰难的活计才对。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2051
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_978b4dc2:

    # "Wolf climbs up right behind you."
    "Wolf紧跟在你后面爬了上来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2053
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_927d43d5:

    # w "We're here. Let's check our surroundings then."
    w "我们到了。那就检查一下周围环境吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2055
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9cf15398:

    # p "Right, hah... Yeah. Sure. Right behind you."
    p "对，哈……是啊。当然。我马上跟上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2059
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c9b5f5e9:

    # "You try to stand up."
    "你试图站起来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2064
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8c6f1902:

    # "But your balance forsakes you."
    "但你的平衡感抛弃了你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2066
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_43523d77:

    # "{i}That's weird{/i}, you think."
    "{i}这不对劲{/i}，你想。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2068
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_752c7397:

    # w "Hey. Come on, we need to get inside."
    w "嘿。快点，我们得进去。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2070
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_fd5f55ba:

    # p "Oh."
    p "哦。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2072
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_22658f91:

    # w "Come on."
    w "快点。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2074
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_cca7e978:

    # p "Oh, shut up."
    p "哦，闭嘴吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2078
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_73017248:

    # w ". . . ?"
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2080
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_6e56d912:

    # p "I... I didn't ask to be here, did I?!..."
    p "我……我又没求着来这儿，对吧？！……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2086
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8337703c_7:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2088
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9bb0c7ae:

    # p "I just...{w} Just wanted to relax..."
    p "我只是……{w}想放松一下……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2090
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_5511ba56:

    # p "But you had to go and make it weird!"
    p "可你非要搞些莫名其妙的事！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2092
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_425f497a:

    # p "And now we're on some stupid island...{w} With stupid ruins."
    p "现在倒好，我们困在这破岛上……{w}还有这些破遗迹。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2096
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e1a739dc:

    # w "... Are you all right?"
    w "……你还好吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2098
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1e5a2346:

    # p "You and... your weird secrets!"
    p "你和你那些……莫名其妙的秘密！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2100
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1264b139:

    # p "It's just... one thing after the other on this ship!"
    p "这船上简直……一件事接一件事！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2102
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1b6927a4:

    # p "I can't... can't catch a break..."
    p "我都要……喘不上气了……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2105
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c38898d1:

    # p "At least Nomax was... heh... He smelled so nice..."
    p "至少Nomax他……呵……他很好闻……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2108
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_239dbb1a:

    # p "And he gave me plants to take care of and... I don't know if I can... If I'm good enough..."
    p "他还让我照顾那些植物……我也不知道我能不能……我够不够格……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2111
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_599765b5:

    # p "But that drawing... I still look at it when I'm... alone..."
    p "但那幅画……我一个人的时候……还会拿出来看……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2116
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_b7e760b8:

    # p "And..."
    p "还有……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2119
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_b2b38a84:

    # p "God! I can't believe I had to show you my bare... ugh..."
    p "天啊！我居然得让你看到我光着……呃啊……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2122
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_323bd930:

    # p "Julian... may be an asshole but he's... so good at doing it..."
    p "Julian……可能是个混蛋……但他混蛋得可真专业……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2125
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_b963bf89:

    # p "And you should be nicer to the lizard... He did teach you how to... play..."
    p "你对那只蜥蜴也该好点……他好歹教过你……怎么玩……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2128
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_4b7c5f8c:

    # p "And your shirt... You know who fixed that? Hah..."
    p "还有你的衬衫……知道谁补的吗？哈……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2131
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_17cf43ac:

    # p "Everyone is so nice here... even the Surgeon..."
    p "这儿每个人都那么好……连船医也是……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2135
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_cd11ea1c:

    # p "And everyone has secrets, or... things they're afraid of..."
    p "大家都有秘密，或者……害怕的东西……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2138
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9a0d4d44:

    # p "But... ugh.. I still feel his taste in my mouth..."
    p "可是……呃……我嘴里好像还有他的味道……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2148
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8337703c_8:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2174
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_b7e760b8_1:

    # p "And..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2176
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_6b954122:

    # p "{cps=4}And...{/cps}"
    p "{cps=4}还有……{/cps}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2199
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_35e2ec77_1:

    # "{cps=2}. . .{/cps}"
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2221
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0d04128e_2:

    # w "..."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2228
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_6a4a0c51:

    # "You let that slip without even thinking. {w}And immediately regret it."
    "你脱口而出，想都没想。{w}随即就后悔了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2230
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2ca39169:

    # "Wolf blinks."
    "Wolf眨了眨眼。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2235
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_69f23989:

    # "Your voice sounds so weak."
    "你的声音听起来是那么的虚弱。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2237
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_59957f88:

    # "He keeps staring at you from above. {w}Then, slowly and carefully, he places a hand on your forehead."
    "他居高临下地凝视着你。{w}然后，他缓慢而小心地将一只手放在你的额头上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2239
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e630f4da:

    # w "Sit still."
    w "别动。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2241
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_7b3b9296:

    # "You obey, a burning sensation in your cheeks."
    "你照做了，脸颊一阵发烫。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2243
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1e1c3a9d:

    # w "{cps=3}. . . . . . . . . . .{/cps}"
    w "{cps=3}. . . . . . . . . . .{/cps}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2245
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_7b95bea8:

    # w ". . . your temperature's lower. Good."
    w "……体温降下来了。很好。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2247
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9a63f182:

    # "He removes his hand. You remember you can breathe again."
    "他收回手。你这才想起自己还能呼吸。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2249
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_46fd87b0:

    # p "What... what happened?"
    p "怎么……怎么回事？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2251
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ed2b405e:

    # w "The heat must have gotten to you."
    w "八成是中暑了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2253
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_efc5a6a2:

    # w "You started blabbering like a mad man before collapsing to the ground."
    w "你像个疯子一样胡言乱语，然后就倒在地上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2255
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d9fd746f:

    # w "No idea what you were talking about. Most of it was unintelligible."
    w "不知道你在说什么。大部分都含糊不清。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2257
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9d8993f8:

    # "You look away. You have only a vague memory of what you said, but it doesn't paint you in a good light."
    "你移开视线。对自己说过的话只有模糊的印象，但听起来可不太妙。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2259
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c6ff2535:

    # w "I searched for some shade to cool you down. Found an easy way to get down to the courtyard."
    w "我找了处阴凉地方给你降温。还发现一条容易下去的路，通到庭院。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2261
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a4099319:

    # w "Then stumbled upon our first spot of luck of the day."
    w "然后碰上了我们今天第一桩走运的事。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2263
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9f20e412:

    # p "Ah... which is?"
    p "啊……是什么？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2279
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d1f60679:

    # w "You're lying in it."
    w "你正躺在里面。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2281
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_38f84628:

    # "You take a look at your surroundings for the first time."
    "你第一次打量四周。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2283
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8694e654:

    # "You're in the shade, first thing you notice. To your right, the ruin's courtyard. Or whatever it's meant to be."
    "你首先注意到的是你在阴凉处。右边是遗迹的庭院。或者说，大概是庭院吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2285
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_4720ca55:

    # "Below... You're sitting in a pool of water. Not saltwater—you can tell by the smell. This is fresh."
    "身下……你坐在一滩水里。不是海水——闻得出来。这是淡水。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2287
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9645ec4d:

    # "And your throat is {i}parched{/i}."
    "而你的喉咙已经{i}干得冒烟{/i}了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2289
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2eabdf5f:

    # p "Is... Can we drink this?"
    p "这……我们能喝吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2291
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_812a2cac:

    # w "Probably. Might even be fresher than what we had on the Conway."
    w "大概能。说不定比Conway上的还新鲜。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2293
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_af5bbd0d:

    # w "It must have rained before we got here. And hard."
    w "我们到这儿之前肯定下过雨。还挺大。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2295
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d85aea68:

    # w "Drink up."
    w "喝吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2297
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e10f4ddb:

    # p "... Well, actually, I think-"
    p "……呃，其实，我觉得——"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2299
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0b597611:

    # w "I'm not going to repeat myself. Drink up."
    w "我不会说第二遍。喝。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2301
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_08580f1f:

    # w "Don't overdo it. But you need some liquid, and fast."
    w "别喝太多。但你需要补充水分，立刻。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2303
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bd8683a2:

    # w "This is how you survive. You don't wait for second chances—when you get one, you take it."
    w "想活下去就得这样。机会不等人——一旦出现，就得抓住。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2305
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1f173c1d:

    # w "You can deal with dysentery tomorrow. But that means there will be a tomorrow."
    w "痢疾可以明天再操心。但至少那意味着你还有明天。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2307
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_4b813ae6:

    # w "I'm not carrying a desiccated corpse back to the ship."
    w "我可不想扛一具干尸回船上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2309
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8534ca42_3:

    # ". . ."
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2311
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_598566bf:

    # "You take a closer whiff of the water before you silently lap at it. It's...{w} not rank, at least. And Wolf is right—you've definitely tasted worse after a week at sea."
    "你凑近水闻了闻，然后默默地小口啜饮。这水……{w}至少不臭。Wolf说得对——在海上待了一周后，你确实喝过更糟的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2313
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_53d7b96d:

    # "Your eyes refocus. And the sensation of a cool drop of water making its way down your chest is rather heavenly."
    "你的视线重新聚焦。一滴凉水顺着胸口滑下的感觉，简直美妙如天堂。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2315
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f4bfd18e:

    # "You try to push yourself up."
    "你试图撑起身子。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2323
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_762f34e1:

    # w "Don't."
    w "别这样。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2325
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_cf805035:

    # "You stay there, sitting half-submerged in the cool water."
    "你保持原状，半身浸在凉水里坐着。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2327
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_75136581:

    # w "Don't stand up. You're not all here yet."
    w "别站起来。你人还没完全清醒。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2329
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1abf38c3:

    # w "Give it some time. Wait for your temperature to lower first."
    w "缓一缓。等体温先降下来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2331
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_7858ebe6_1:

    # p "Uh..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2333
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8a09436f:

    # "Your brain does pirouettes inside your head."
    "你的脑袋里天旋地转。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2335
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e77b9996:

    # p "Wolf, uh..."
    p "Wolf，呃……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2337
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_fdb8f0f9:

    # p "One question though..."
    p "我还是有个问题……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2339
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_77ad85f1:

    # w "Hm?"
    w "嗯？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2341
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_02a26d9b:

    # p "Why are you not wearing any clothes?"
    p "你怎么没穿衣服？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2343
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_60cfa90e:

    # w "Same reason you are."
    w "原因和你一样。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2345
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_4fa173d5:

    # "You look down.{w} He's... right. You're naked."
    "你低头看去。{w}他……说得对。你光着身子。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2347
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_6f672bd5:

    # "You feel a virginal instinct to cover yourself. But it's far too late for that."
    "你感到一种近乎本能的羞怯，想遮住自己但显然为时已晚。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2349
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ab824686:

    # p "Did... did you undress me?"
    p "是……是你帮我脱的？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2351
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0f8fcd26:

    # w "Did you want to take a bath in your clothes?"
    w "难道你想穿着衣服洗澡？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2353
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_34b4b0e4:

    # w "They look expensive. I wasn't sure if you would mind them getting wet."
    w "看着挺贵的。我不确定你介不介意它们弄湿。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2355
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2696a341:

    # "Point taken."
    "有道理。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2357
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_25e1e8d6:

    # "You think?"
    "你觉得呢？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2359
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bd3b3196:

    # p "I do wear them for work, you know?"
    p "我穿它们可是为了工作，懂吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2361
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_786dab63:

    # w "Put them back on then."
    w "那就穿回去。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2363
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_72cba7dd:

    # "You may feel some vague sense of shame at the thought of Wolf seeing you in this state, but it's clear the sentiment isn't reciprocal."
    "想到Wolf看到你这副模样，你或许隐约感到羞耻，但很明显对方并无同感。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2365
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_15559271:

    # "His silent, unreadable demeanor is the exact same as always. Nothing at all paints him as feeling any different than on the deck of the Conway."
    "他沉默难测的神态一如既往。和在Conway甲板上时毫无二致。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2367
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c2d496f8:

    # "He's just... less clothed."
    "他只是……穿得少了点。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2376
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c8ea8a4a:

    # p "..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2378
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f79102de:

    # "Very less clothed."
    "少了很多。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2380
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_38eac931:

    # "Your head is still spinning. You're nowhere near lucid enough to make sense of what's happening today."
    "你的头还在发晕，远没清醒到能理清今天发生的这一切。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2382
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_55c73d04:

    # "And so, your mouth runs completely free."
    "于是，你的嘴完全不受控制了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2384
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_436b26b2_1:

    # p "I don't understand you, Wolf."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2386
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8337703c_9:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2388
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e695669f_1:

    # p "I don't understand why you're like this."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2392
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_765f871c_1:

    # p "I'm not stupid, you know?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2394
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bedf0eeb_1:

    # p "Back then, something caused the way you lashed out at me that day."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2396
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bdd25c87_1:

    # p "And today, something caused you practically fleeing through the harbor."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2398
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_33601eb4_1:

    # p "Sorry, I mean... I don't think there's anything wrong with you."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2400
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_af6013b1_1:

    # p "You're smart. You always seem to know what to do or how to react."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2402
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_503994dc_1:

    # p "Your world is clearly far larger than mine."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2404
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f75347fd_1:

    # p "But you behave like you're afraid of sharing it with anyone else."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2406
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_30527d28_1:

    # w "Why do you even care?"
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2408
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_300701d2_1:

    # p "I..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2410
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_45ce95be_1:

    # p "I care because you do."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2412
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f7c0c0e9:

    # p "You... I don't know, saved my life might be too far. But... "
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2414
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_fae1e6e1:

    # p "You sprinted into action. Dragged my unconscious body down here, with no hesitation."
    p "你当时毫不犹豫就冲过来，把我失去知觉的身体一路拖到了这里。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2416
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9fe205b3:

    # p "You, heh, even took off my... Ooooh..."
    p "你，呵，甚至还脱了我的……哦……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2418
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_edad3f4d:

    # "Your head does a little spin and a twist.{w} You close your eyes until it passes."
    "你的头又是一阵晕眩。{w}你闭上眼，等这阵过去。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2420
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8337703c_10:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2422
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d7ba8d7d:

    # p "The... The point is..."
    p "重……重点是……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2424
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a6343b42:

    # p "You push people away... But can't ignore them when they're in need."
    p "你总把别人拒之门外……可人家真需要帮忙时，你又不会不管。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2426
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_40dfcfc7_1:

    # p "I think... {w}I think deep down, you care."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2428
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1a427001_1:

    # p "I don't know if it's because of me specifically, or because we're crew."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2430
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_863cdcbd_1:

    # p "On the far side of the world, only able to rely on each other."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2432
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_5cf8574e_1:

    # p "I think you care. But it's like you're forcing yourself not to."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2434
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_149ffe5c_1:

    # p "And I don't know what to make of that."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2436
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8337703c_11:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2438
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_7b481cc6_1:

    # "Wolf is silent."
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2440
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e332e84f_1:

    # "He stares at the water, ripples reflecting a distorted version of his face."
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2442
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_3c7f3526:

    # "He takes comfort in his trademark silence. {w}But only for a short while."
    "他安于自己标志性的沉默。{w}但只维持了一小会儿。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2444
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d7e369d0:

    # "There's a sigh as he takes a deep breath. He leans on the arch even further."
    "他深深吸了口气，叹了一声。身子更往拱门边靠了靠。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2457
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ea10806b:

    # w "We used to do this all the time."
    w "我们以前常这样。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2459
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_fe21966a:

    # p "Exploring old ruins?"
    p "探索古老遗迹？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2461
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_dfb29fe5:

    # w "No..."
    w "不……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2463
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_31ce1557:

    # w "Wasting time at the river, or washing our clothes."
    w "在河边消磨时间，或者洗衣服。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2465
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_cce2d5ce:

    # w "There were shacks sometimes, but when the group started to get large, we'd only use them if it rained."
    w "有时会有棚屋，但人一多起来，我们就只在下雨时才用。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2467
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_65834464:

    # w "During those endless summers... We'd just be outside, spending the hottest part of the day wherever we could find some water."
    w "在那些漫长的夏日里……我们就在户外，一天中最热的时候，找片有水的地方待着。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2469
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0a1bf206:

    # p "As children?"
    p "小时候吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2473
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9d8bb4f1:

    # "Wolf chuckles. It's soft, and lonely, and rare."
    "Wolf轻轻笑了。那笑声柔和、孤寂，且罕见。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2477
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9aa2eb7e:

    # w "No, not children. Well..."
    w "不，不是小时候。嗯……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2479
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8b7d6d5a:

    # w "I was a kid when they took me in, yeah."
    w "我那时还是个孩子，没错，是他们收留了我。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2481
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_7ec277b0:

    # p "Did you run away or... {w}How did you even meet them?"
    p "你是逃走的还是……{w}你究竟怎么遇到他们的？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2483
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e1abaf20:

    # w "I had lost my parents. They found me wandering with no idea what to do."
    w "我失去了父母。他们发现我漫无目的地游荡，不知所措。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2487
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_016459c2:

    # w "That's... the short version. I owed them a lot."
    w "这就是……简短的版本。我欠他们很多。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2489
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ade83570:

    # p "I'm sorry..."
    p "我很遗憾……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2491
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a8561737:

    # "Wolf accepts your words with a slow nod."
    "Wolf缓缓点头，接受了你的话。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2493
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_902604db:

    # p "So it was like a... a foster family?"
    p "所以那就像个……收养家庭？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2495
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_de67b7b4:

    # w "Of a kind."
    w "算是吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2499
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_66aea482:

    # w "[name]?"
    w "[name]?"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2501
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_061e5381:

    # p "Yes?"
    p "怎么了？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2505
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_618f678a:

    # w "Can I trust you? Trust that you won't tell a soul?"
    w "我能相信你吗？相信你不会告诉任何人？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2509
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f423e8cb:

    # p "Wolf... You almost tore my head off. You told me to never talk with you again."
    p "Wolf……你之前差点把我的头拧下来，还让我别再和你说话。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2511
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e334462c:

    # p "I could have done so.{w} Certainly thought about it."
    p "我本可以那么做的。{w}我确实这么想过。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2513
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e012aaab:

    # p "Do you think that after all that I'd want to turn around and break your trust?"
    p "你觉得经历了这些之后，我还会想转身就背叛你的信任吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2517
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_6186867a_1:

    # "You nod."
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2519
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ecf88b3b:

    # w "Not Samuel.{w} Not Torres.{w} Not Arthur."
    w "我不会告诉Samuel。{w}不会告诉Torres。{w}不会告诉Arthur。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2523
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_b30789e4:

    # w "Nobody."
    w "我不会告诉任何人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2525
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f0c43150:

    # p "Of course, but why?"
    p "当然，但为什么你突然说这些？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2527
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_61169bba:

    # p "You've just been brushing aside anyone since you came aboard."
    p "自从你上船以来，你一直在回避所有人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2529
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d70e83a3:

    # "He swallows instead of providing an answer. His gaze falling out the blinding doorway."
    "他没有回答，而是吞咽了一下。他的目光落向那扇刺眼的门外。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2531
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ddb13b85:

    # w "A tribe is the better word for what we were, maybe. No real parents to speak of."
    w "也许用“部落”来形容我们更贴切。我们没有真正意义上的父母可以倾诉。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2533
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9341a387:

    # w "We were just a handful. Those older took care of the rest and made sure to keep things running."
    w "我们人很少。年长的照顾年幼的，确保一切运转。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2535
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_328940fe:

    # w "Me and her, we... we had to grow up fast. Marie and me."
    w "我和她，我们……我们不得不快速长大。Marie和我。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2537
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_593da1fd:

    # w "The others were but kids as well. The oldest was barely 10 years my senior."
    w "其他人也都是孩子。最年长的也只不过比我大十岁。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2539
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_3d82df83:

    # w "Over time we took more in. Some left. I started taking care of the younger ones along with the others."
    w "随着时间推移，我们收留了更多人。有些人离开了。我开始和其他人一起照顾更小的孩子。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2541
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c8ea8a4a_1:

    # p "..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2543
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_624d294e:

    # p "What... did you {i}do{/i}, exactly?"
    p "你们具体……{i}做{/i}什么？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2547
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_5bbc1458:

    # w "What do you think?"
    w "你觉得呢？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2549
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_cc3cf2c2:

    # w "Not a lot of work opportunities for a gang of good-for-nothing homeless runaways."
    w "一群一无是处、无家可归的流浪儿，没什么工作机会。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2551
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0c0deacf:

    # w "Villages stick together. They don't trust strangers."
    w "村庄里的人抱团。他们不信任陌生人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2553
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8dc24a8b:

    # w "Not that we ever felt much like working the fields and shoveling shit."
    w "况且我们也没怎么想过要去田里干活或者铲粪。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2557
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c84569cb:

    # w "No offense."
    w "无意冒犯。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2559
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ec96e419:

    # w "We stole whatever we could. Vegetables, chickens, coins if someone forgot the front door unlocked."
    w "我们偷任何能偷的东西。蔬菜、鸡、还有硬币——要是有人忘了锁前门的话。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2561
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ad208431:

    # w "Some we sold, most we ate ourselves."
    w "有些卖掉，大部分我们自己吃掉。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2563
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_95003b79:

    # w "Not just thievery, though. We did what we had to so everyone would survive. And when we could we... made sure others could do the same."
    w "不光是偷盗。我们做那些是为了让大伙都能活下来。而且只要有可能……我们也会确保别人能有同样的活路。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2567
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ae1eefcf:

    # w "Unlike the world around us, we'd never accept one of our own having to beg for their right to be fed, and to simply exist and live."
    w "不像我们周围的世界，我们绝不会接受自己人为了吃饭、为了生存和活着的基本权利而去乞讨。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2569
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1c4a7c9a:

    # w "Or to be abandoned in a time of need."
    w "或者在需要时被抛弃。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2571
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bcfdee8f:

    # w "Of course it drew attention.{w} Usually would, sooner or later."
    w "这当然引起了注意。{w}通常迟早会的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2573
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_faba2f28:

    # w "We'd move whenever we felt it became too much."
    w "每当我们觉得风声太紧时，我们就会转移。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2575
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_707534fb:

    # p "... Sisyphus."
    p "……西西弗斯。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2577
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f1d90117:

    # w "Hmm?"
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2579
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_5bc4cd9a:

    # p "Sisyphus. Don't ask me to spell it."
    p "西西弗斯。别让我拼写它。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2581
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_5efd98e3:

    # w "What's that?"
    w "什么事？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2583
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e8d2719a:

    # p "Nothing. Just an old story."
    p "没什么。只是一个古老的故事。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2585
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_b3fe7ca7:

    # p "Please, go on."
    p "请继续。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2587
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0d04128e_3:

    # w "..."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2589
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ec76642e:

    # w "That's it, really."
    w "就是这样了，真的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2591
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_764873ec:

    # w "Things changed in France, however."
    w "然而，在法国，情况发生了变化。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2593
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1f393543:

    # w "And it became... in some places it became a kingdom with the powerful fearing for the might they wield and looking for scapegoats."
    w "它变成了……在某些地方，它变成了一个王国，掌权者畏惧自己掌握的力量，并寻找替罪羊。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2595
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_545093bd:

    # w "...Tribe...{w} Perhaps that glorifies it. We were just a band of orphans, really, who only had each other as we drifted from place to place."
    w "……部落……{w}也许这美化了它。我们真的只是一群孤儿，只是彼此相依，从一个地方漂泊到另一个地方。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2597
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_4aecdd4e:

    # w "Until the end."
    w "直到最后。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2599
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c8ea8a4a_2:

    # p "..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2601
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_4f571819:

    # p "What happened?"
    p "发生了什么？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2605
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_16b8cb94:

    # "Silence."
    "死寂般的沉默"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2607
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_eb27d380:

    # "It draws long. Longer than you ever experienced."
    "这沉默持续了很久。比你经历过的任何一次都长。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2609
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_baae3098:

    # "But you know you can't breach it first. It has to come from him."
    "但你知道你不能首先打破它。必须由他来开口。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2611
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_fbb71577:

    # "So you give him all the time he needs."
    "于是你给了他所有需要的时间。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2613
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a72c64ba:

    # "He opens his mouth, then closes it again."
    "他张了张嘴，然后又闭上了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2615
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_42b3a8f0:

    # "When he finally speaks, for the second time today, it shocks you."
    "当他终于开口时，他的话让你震惊——这是今天的第二次。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2617
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_984e6b86:

    # w "Have you ever wanted a man dead?"
    w "你有没有想过要一个人死？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2619
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2ba2c31a:

    # "His voice barely passes as a whisper."
    "他的声音几乎像耳语。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2621
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0560c2ea:

    # w "I don't mean in a fit of anger."
    w "我不是指一时愤怒。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2623
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2d709081:

    # w "Nor to rid the world of a monster, or a king. Most people wish that at some point in their lives."
    w "也不是指要除掉世上的一个怪物，或一个国王。大多数人在生命的某个阶段都曾这样希望过。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2625
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_baa9f9a7:

    # w "I mean someone you know. Someone you once trusted with your life."
    w "我指的是你认识的人。一个你曾经以性命相托的人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2629
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a7dcaa47:

    # w "Yet...{w} You want to push the blade in yourself.{w} Slowly."
    w "然而……{w}你想要亲手把刀推进去。{w}慢慢地。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2631
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_16b58d0e:

    # w "More than just \"This person should die.\""
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2633
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0b447ecb:

    # w "To intimately take their life. To be the one holding the knife."
    w "是亲手夺走他的生命。成为那个持刀的人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2635
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_00ad38ba:

    # w "Have you ever felt that?"
    w "你有过这种感觉吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2637
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_5b26c34f:

    # "The way he says it scares you. More than... any other threat of his ever did before."
    "他说话的方式让你害怕。比……他之前任何一次威胁都更让你害怕。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2639
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bbafa4f5:

    # "It's not a rhetorical question."
    "这不是一个反问句。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2641
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9ef77e3b_1:

    # "You swallow."
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2644
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_3bb9912f:

    # "A certain officer comes to mind. {w}But just as you think back to the humiliation he inflicted upon you, you realise you wouldn't push things that far."
    "你想起某个长官。{w}但就在你回想起他施加于你的羞辱时，你意识到你不会把事情做到那种地步。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2646
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_64094d0d:

    # "Not that you'd ever be able to. But..."
    "也不是说你能够做到。但是……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2648
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_fc1c5129:

    # p "No. I can't—I've never felt that."
    p "不。我不能——我从未有过那种感觉。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2650
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bfa9294a:

    # p "Throwing punches, maybe. But I've never thought about someone that way."
    p "也许想过挥拳揍人。但我从未那样想过谁。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2654
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_b1ee14aa:

    # w "I have."
    w "我有过。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2656
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8d3a21f1:

    # w "Many times. Daily, sometimes."
    w "很多次。有时，每天都有。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2658
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bb5f3c8d:

    # w "It keeps you up at night."
    w "它让你夜不能寐。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2660
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_3ddd991b:

    # "A pause."
    "停顿。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2662
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ba9e8d7a:

    # "You dare not break the silence."
    "你不敢打破这沉默。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2666
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_378c2f86:

    # w "Few people have a single person to blame for everything falling apart."
    w "很少有人能只怪罪某一个人，就可以解释清楚一切分崩离析。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2668
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e1e59fc7:

    # w "He sold us out. And... {w}I wasn't there."
    w "他出卖了我们。而且……{w}我当时不在场。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2670
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_df305c60:

    # w "I... I should have..."
    w "我……我本该……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2672
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8337703c_12:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2674
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_26368ad3:

    # w "Revenge... It becomes a hunger that hollows you out."
    w "复仇……它变成一种饥饿，掏空了你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2676
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_30adc132:

    # w "You can't sleep. You can't focus. You can't find anyone else worth caring about."
    w "你无法入睡。你无法集中精神。你找不到其他任何值得关心的人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2678
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e4812758:

    # w "You just drift, hoping something will push you in the right direction one day."
    w "你只是漂泊，希望有一天有什么能把你推向正确的方向。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2680
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_7f1da769:

    # w "Either it devours you, or you starve the desire until only ash remains."
    w "要么被它吞噬，要么将这份渴望饿到只剩灰烬。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2682
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9fdb57f4:

    # w "That's the rest of the story."
    w "这就是剩下的故事了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2686
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_875ce35a_1:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2688
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c1cd0cb1:

    # p "Where are they now?"
    p "他们现在在哪里？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2692
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9e40dee9:

    # "Wolf looks away. You see the undulations across his throat."
    "Wolf移开视线。你看到他喉咙的起伏。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2694
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_4c73707a:

    # w "Last I checked, the place we were hiding at was torched."
    w "我最后得知的消息是，我们藏身的地方被烧毁了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2696
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8337703c_13:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2698
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_3c2db802:

    # w "I'll spare you the details, but I don't have much hope I'll see them again."
    w "细节我就不说了，但我不抱什么希望还能再见到他们。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2702
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_6dc9a3be:

    # "He kneels in front of his breeches, pulling out the coin.{w} The French coin."
    "他在他的马裤前跪下，掏出那枚硬币。{w}那枚法国硬币。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2706
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_feeab5ab:

    # w "I only know where they're not."
    w "我只知道他们不在哪里。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2708
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_82be1317:

    # w "Here."
    w "给。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2710
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_77ab53ee:

    # "He flips it, as you've seen him do many times over."
    "他将硬币弹起，就像你多次看到的那样。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2712
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e1bf6f05:

    # "You wait for him to catch it and put it back as he always does."
    "你等着他像往常一样接住它，然后放回去。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2714
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c4942a9d:

    # "But this time..."
    "但这一次……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2717
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_93297734:

    # "He doesn't."
    "他没有。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2719
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c6407bc2:

    # "The coin falls into the water with a small, pathetic {i}plunff{/i}."
    "硬币落入水中，发出一声轻微、可怜的{i}扑通{/i}声。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2723
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1f137875:

    # w "Ever since then... I couldn't stay anywhere for long."
    w "从那以后……我无法在任何地方久留。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2725
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_7217d884:

    # "Wolf stands there, staring past the ripples it left behind."
    "Wolf站在那儿，目光越过它留下的涟漪投向更远处。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2727
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_dca6acea:

    # w "Before I left I heard even Morocco wouldn't be safe."
    w "在我离开之前，我听说连摩洛哥都不会安全了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2729
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_dfbf2662:

    # w "I had hoped to just stay on the ship until we leave this place behind."
    w "我曾希望能一直留在船上，直到我们离开这个地方。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2733
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f48dc825:

    # w "But, this is why..."
    w "但是，这就是为什么……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2735
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_cb0f5b36:

    # w "... Why you should keep away."
    w "……为什么你应该远离我。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2737
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_53d8acb1:

    # w "Nothing good will come to the people around me. That includes you...{w} [name]."
    w "我身边的人不会有好下场。这包括你……{w} [name名]。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2739
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_6c49ce8e:

    # "The coin stares back at Wolf from under the water."
    "那枚硬币在水底回望着Wolf。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2741
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c3781426:

    # "An empty man on an empty island."
    "一个空虚的人，在一座空虚的岛屿上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2743
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_6e4e4a22:

    # w "They're hard."
    w "他们很坚硬。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2745
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f9595cda:

    # w "People. They're hard."
    w "人群。他们很坚硬。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2747
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a7b5db93:

    # "He doesn't say anything else. But you get it."
    "他不再多说什么。但你明白了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2749
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8982b2c5:

    # "You can't say you feel it. There might be nobody else in the world who can feel it. But you can try to imagine it."
    "你无法说你感同身受。这世上或许再无人能体会。但你可以试着想象。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2751
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_105d945f:

    # "Having your universe ripped away from you. Running from all you've ever known."
    "整个世界被从你身边撕裂。逃离你所熟知的一切。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2753
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_65d1b437:

    # "Having to mingle with people who don't know, who will keep going on with their lives as if a world hadn't just ended."
    "不得不与那些一无所知的人相处，他们将继续自己的生活，仿佛世界并未刚刚终结。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2755
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_b2febc3f:

    # "Nobody who can understand you. Being unable to tell them anyway, if you want to stay alive."
    "没有人能理解你。而为了活下去，你甚至无法向他们诉说。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2757
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_cb64e404:

    # "And..."
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2759
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a2f7dde1:

    # "The terror that, if you found yourself a new tribe..."
    "那种恐惧——如果你为自己找到了一个新的群体……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2761
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e905d129:

    # "It might happen again."
    "它可能再次发生。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2763
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a33d313d:

    # "You might be alone again."
    "你可能再次孤身一人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2765
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_766af361:

    # "The water gently laps at you, taking grime and sweat away."
    "水轻轻拍打着你，带走了污垢和汗水。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2767
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e777e281:

    # "You look down. The coin shines intermittently from under the placid water, moved only by you and Wolf's motions."
    "你低头看去。硬币在平静的水面下断断续续地闪烁，只随着你和Wolf的动作而移动。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2769
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_41a16754:

    # "The guilt of responsibility."
    "那份负罪的责任感。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2771
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a640aa4b:

    # "The fear of forgetting while wanting to forget."
    "既渴望遗忘，又恐惧遗忘。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2775
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d6305e5d:

    # p "You said it was a gift, right?{w} The coin."
    p "你说过这是份礼物，对吧？{w}那枚硬币。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2777
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c42f61e4:

    # w "One of the last coins we earned before..."
    w "那是我们赚到的最后几枚硬币之一……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2779
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8b2123d6:

    # p "I can see why you'd keep it, but..."
    p "我明白你为何留着它，但是……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2783
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d1f1c206:

    # p "I always see you with that coin. Did you get it from... them?"
    p "我总是看到你带着那枚硬币。你是从……他们那里得到的吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2785
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_68a737a7:

    # w "In a way."
    w "从某种意义上说，是的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2787
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_12fcca56:

    # w "It's one of the last ones we earned before..."
    w "那是我们赚到的最后几枚硬币之一……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2789
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_231d5058:

    # p "Have you..."
    p "你有没有……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2791
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9642629f:

    # p "Have you thought about burying it?"
    p "你有没有想过把它埋了？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2793
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_89eaf667:

    # p "In their stead."
    p "替他们而活。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2795
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_70a98aee:

    # "Wolf doesn't reply."
    "Wolf没有回答。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2797
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_b6aa6e23:

    # p "I don't think they'd want you to keep doing this. Living in fear."
    p "我不认为他们会希望你一直这样下去。活在恐惧中。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2799
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_3c64320b:

    # p "But... You probably thought this already."
    p "但是……你可能已经想过这些了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2801
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c4909ee6:

    # p "I don't know what to say about all this. This... this is way above my experience in life."
    p "对于这一切，我不知道该说什么。这……这远远超出了我的生活经验。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2803
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_26c75e30:

    # p "But I know funerals aren't for the people we lost."
    p "但我知道葬礼并非为了逝去的人而存在。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2805
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_98c698b1:

    # p "They're for us. To move on."
    p "它们是为了我们。为了让我们继续前行。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2807
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_18c144fb:

    # p "So we can give ourselves what we need to return to living."
    p "这样我们才能给予自己重新回到生活中所需要的力量。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2809
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c48c969b:

    # p "But never forget."
    p "但又永不遗忘。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2811
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8337703c_14:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2815
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9995d350:

    # w "... It's not your place to decide."
    w "……这不是该由你决定的事。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2819
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_7e888159:

    # w "But... I'll think about it."
    w "但是……我会考虑的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2821
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d9890ba5:

    # w "I'll think about it."
    w "我会考虑的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2823
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8337703c_15:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2825
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_875ce35a_2:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2827
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8337703c_16:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2831
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_4dd2a8bb:

    # w "... Scare me like that again and I'll drown you in the next port we stop at."
    w "……再那样吓我，下次停靠港口时我就把你淹死。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2833
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2c4de430:

    # w "Is that clear?"
    w "听明白了吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2835
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_875ce35a_3:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2837
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_4f2c4a73:

    # p "... Get all mysterious with no explanation again and I'll be the one doing the drowning."
    p "……再那样故弄玄虚不给解释，淹人的那个就会是我。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2839
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_6ceb18fc:

    # p "Is {i}that{/i} clear?"
    p "听{i}明白{/i}了吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2843
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_11bbf3d5:

    # "Wolf is taken aback. Almost shocked."
    "Wolf吃了一惊。几乎是震惊。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2845
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f6ab00b3:

    # "Then... a crack."
    "然后……一道裂痕出现。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2849
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9c39b0b0:

    # "He starts laughing."
    "他开始大笑。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2851
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d7cf92c4:

    # "Not a sneer, not a chuckle. Not the defensive sarcasm you've become so accustomed to."
    "不是讥笑，不是轻笑。也不是你已习以为常的那种防御性的讽刺。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2853
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f97f5a7f:

    # "A genuine, heartfelt laughter."
    "一种真诚的、发自内心的笑声。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2855
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_00d8f129:

    # w "Oh, be my guest. I'd love to see you try."
    w "哦，请便。我倒想看看你怎么做。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2857
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_badac19a:

    # "You laugh along with him, your voices echoing in the shadowy pool."
    "你和他一起笑起来，你们的笑声在幽暗的水池中回荡。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2861
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_aa1f6428:

    # "Until they're reduced to a chuckle, and then an echo."
    "直到笑声渐弱成轻笑，然后变成回声。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2865
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_5b2fbc4b:

    # "He sniffs."
    "他吸了吸鼻子。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2873
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_923162c1:

    # w "So..."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2875
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_23181cf6:

    # w "What about my gorgeous eyes?"
    w "那我迷人的眼睛呢？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2877
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ddb2b728:

    # "You feel your temperature immediately rise back to life-threatening levels."
    "你感觉自己的体温瞬间回升到了危及生命的水平。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2879
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9c2aa349_1:

    # p "I, uh..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2881
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_12cd3a24:

    # p "Well..."
    p "好吧……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2885
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_081c9b41:

    # p "Well, I was, you know..."
    p "那个，我当时，你知道的……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2887
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1c7abd8c:

    # p "Just, couldn't think clearly, and..."
    p "只是，脑子不清楚，而且……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2889
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_97a76599:

    # p "Obviously, I mean..."
    p "显然，我是说……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2893
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_7e6c3c06:

    # w "Hah. Relax."
    w "哈。放松点。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2895
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_354d1a52:

    # "He's smirking."
    "他坏笑着。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2897
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e098e047:

    # w "Let's pretend you never said anything of the sort, then."
    w "那我们就假装你从没说过那种话吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2899
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_64d43967:

    # p "I... Yeah, sure."
    p "我……嗯，当然。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2901
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_70b2f5d5:

    # p "Let's... pretend it didn't happen."
    p "我们……就当它没发生过吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2903
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_35eeb8ff:

    # "{i}He's never letting me live this down.{/i}"
    "{i}他绝对不会让我忘了这事的。{/i}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2906
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0d04128e_4:

    # w "..."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2908
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_72b2323f:

    # w "... We should start heading back. I think we've seen enough."
    w "……我们该开始往回走了。我想我们看得够多了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2910
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a8f2e839:

    # w "And I'm getting hungry."
    w "而且我饿了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2912
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_35efb1e5:

    # w "Let's find the cheapest local food... {w}possibly in the least crowded tavern."
    w "去找找本地最便宜的吃食吧……{w}可能得去最冷清的酒馆里了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2914
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2020152b:

    # "You agree enthusiastically, and so does your stomach."
    "你热烈附和，你的肚子也同样赞成。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2916
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ea95de40:

    # "It's been one hell of a day and it's barely the afternoon."
    "真是要命的一天，而这还只是午后。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2918
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f1a6789e:

    # "But, food aside..."
    "但是，除了食物……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2920
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c20baf79:

    # "There's one last thing to take care of."
    "还有最后一件事要处理。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2960
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_76716f14:

    # w "... But we couldn't place its age, or even its purpose."
    w "……但我们无法确定它的年代，甚至它的用途。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2964
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_59e0e2eb:

    # p "Though my best guess is that it might have been a prison of sorts."
    p "尽管我最好的猜测是，它可能曾经是某种监狱。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2966
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2f4cf1f2:

    # p "It seems to have been abandoned for a long time, however. It's also entirely emptied out, so there's not much worth scavenging for either."
    p "不过，它似乎已被遗弃了很久。而且里面完全搬空了，所以也没什么值得搜刮的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2970
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_84cdca3f:

    # p "It looks to be unstable. Abandoned for a long time, no doubt, and might pose a danger if you're not careful."
    p "它看起来很不稳固。无疑被遗弃了很久，如果不小心可能会有危险。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2972
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a6e6b392:

    # p "It's entirely emptied out, so there's not much worth scavenging for either."
    p "而且里面完全搬空了，所以也没什么值得搜刮的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2974
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ece2a913:

    # p "Not that we would, of course."
    p "当然，我们也不会那么做。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2976
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_5e2f0d1b:

    # w "Overall, there wasn't much to see. No documents or decorations either."
    w "总的来说，没什么可看的。里面也没有文件或装饰。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2978
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_6280ccdf:

    # p "Some parts were partially flooded."
    p "有些部分被水部分淹没了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2980
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9ea20085:

    # w "The ruins are too old to have left behind much of anything. Just rocks and mortar."
    w "遗迹太古老了，几乎没留下什么东西。只有石头和灰泥。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2982
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_61d60b03:

    # p "With the Island being much of the same. Plain, just a bunch of nothing."
    p "岛上大部分地方也是如此。平淡无奇，只是一片荒芜。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2988
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d8252dd3:

    # "Arthur examines the few badly written notes you scraped together with unordinarily intense eyes."
    "Arthur用异常专注的眼神检查着你们拼凑起来的几份字迹潦草的笔记。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2990
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_b6415f5c:

    # "There's not much in there worth reading. Empty ruins. Old buildings of unknown use."
    "没什么值得读的东西。空荡的遗迹。用途不明的旧建筑。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2992
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_34bd2f3e:

    # "No recognizable decorations, no documents. Some partially flooded interiors."
    "没有可辨认的装饰，没有文件。一些内部空间被部分淹没了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2994
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_63ca072f:

    # "You and Wolf stand by. You're not on attention, but you feel like you should be."
    "你和Wolf站在一旁。你们并未被注视，但你觉得你们应该立正。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2996
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_dfd80610:

    # "He takes his time. You'd say he's savouring it, but there's a surprising lack of emotions behind his eyes."
    "他从容不迫。你会说他在细细品味，但他眼中却出奇地缺乏情感。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:2998
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bb8e4b4e:

    # a "..."
    a ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3000
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_cfedecf4:

    # "Arthur remains silent, much like you and your companion."
    "Arthur保持着沉默，很像你和你的同伴。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3002
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e54570e7:

    # "You mentally cross your fingers."
    "你在心里暗暗祈祷。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3004
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_66916766:

    # "He eyes you up and down."
    "他上下打量着你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3008
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_026b638c:

    # a "I don't remember you sporting those scrapes before, Mr. [family_name]."
    a "我不记得你之前身上有这些擦伤，[family_name]先生。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3010
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_17a79d26:

    # "You tense up, having hoped that they'd be subtle enough not to notice."
    "你紧张起来，原本希望这些伤痕足够细微，不会被注意到。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3012
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2883274c:

    # a "Nothing untoward happened today, did it? I don't have to fear the local gendarmerie to come seek out our captain, do I?"
    a "今天没发生什么意外吧？我不必担心当地的宪兵队来找我们船长的麻烦吧？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3014
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8ea5ec61:

    # p "Nothing sir, I was just a little..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3016
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_e777ebc7:

    # "Don't say careless.{alpha=0.8} Don't say careless.{/alpha}{alpha=0.5} Don't say careless.{/alpha}"
    "别说“不小心”。{alpha=0.8}别说“不小心”。{/alpha}{alpha=0.5}别说“不小心”。{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3018
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_92da45c7:

    # p "un-...{w}thoughtful."
    p "欠……{w}考虑。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3022
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9fbd39b5:

    # "Smooth."
    "漂亮。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3024
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_493baecd:

    # p "I lost my footing on the island's rocky ground. Just a few scrapes, nothing more."
    p "我在岛上的岩石地面上滑了一下。只是几处擦伤，仅此而已。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3028
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2b6c2a36:

    # a "Why are you so out of breath, Mr. [family_name]?"
    a "你为什么喘得这么厉害，[family_name]先生？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3030
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_4b1a0671:

    # a "It was but a small excursion, was it not?"
    a "这只是一次小小的远足，不是吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3032
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_61c70934:

    # p "Yessi-"
    p "是的——"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3034
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_6685895e:

    # w "He's still getting used to the sun, Sir. With hardly any shade on the island it turned out to be a bit more difficult than we anticipated."
    w "他还在适应阳光，先生。岛上几乎没什么阴凉处，结果比我们预想的要困难一点。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3040
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_9cdf6c5e:

    # "Arthur folds the piece of paper back together and sets it down on the table."
    "Arthur将那张纸重新折好，放在桌上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3042
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_57b493bf:

    # a "Is he alright?"
    a "他没事吧？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3044
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1e79f21e:

    # w "I think so, sir."
    w "我想是的，长官。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3048
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_5b8f3610:

    # "He looks at you sternly, finger tapping on the piece of paper"
    "他严厉地看着你，手指敲击着那张纸。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3052
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d9278acc:

    # "He looks at you sternly."
    "他严厉地看着你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3056
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_eed947f0:

    # p "Yes, sir. It's much better already. I'm sure after a little rest I'll be back to normal."
    p "是的，长官。已经好多了。我相信稍微休息一下我就能恢复正常。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3058
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_26c8c55e:

    # a ". . ."
    a ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3060
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ee548023:

    # a "... Very well."
    a "……很好。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3065
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a1781bce:

    # a "My apologies for underestimating just how warm it would become today."
    a "很抱歉我低估了今天会变得这么热。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3067
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2f03c163:

    # a "I will let the cook know to supply you with an extra mug of ale to aid in your recovery."
    a "我会通知厨师多给你们一杯麦芽酒，帮助你们恢复。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3069
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_68f06682:

    # a "Should you feel yourself getting worse then, you know where to find our Surgeon."
    a "如果你感觉病情加重，你知道在哪里能找到我们的船医。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3071
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_43ec7abc:

    # p "Thank you, sir."
    p "谢谢您，长官"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3075
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8a9a9a9b:

    # a "And next time, get yourself a hat, lad."
    a "下次记得给自己弄顶帽子，小伙子。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3079
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bd3e5d66:

    # "His gaze lingers on you, then on Wolf."
    "他的目光在你身上停留，然后落在Wolf身上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3081
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_56580c09:

    # "It keeps lingering on him far longer than you'd expect."
    "目光在他身上停留的时间远比你预想的要长。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3083
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f8f918ef:

    # "But whatever he's thinking, he doesn't deem you two worth sharing thoughts with."
    "但无论他在想什么，他都认为不值得和你们俩分享。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3085
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_13a97b48:

    # a "Dismissed.{w} I hope you have learned something today."
    a "解散。{w}我希望你们今天学到了点东西。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3087
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_35efeed6:

    # a "Do not make me do this again."
    a "别让我再这么做了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3089
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2f818a3f:

    # w "No, sir."
    w "不会的，长官。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3094
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f5928b22:

    # p "No, sir."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3103
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_83160c31:

    # j "So... What was all that about?"
    j "那么……刚才那些是怎么回事？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3105
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c8ea8a4a_3:

    # p "..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3107
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0b6dad4f:

    # p "Nothing out of the ordinary. We pissed Arthur off. He made us work to get back in his good graces."
    p "没什么特别的。我们惹恼了Arthur。他让我们通过干活来重新获得他的好感。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3109
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_153ef648:

    # "Julian bites his lip, inhaling, in a display of frustrated anxiety."
    "Julian咬着嘴唇，深吸一口气，表现出一种沮丧的焦虑。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3113
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_99a5719b:

    # j "I'd recommend you avoid that in the first place. But hey, I'm not your mum."
    j "我建议你们一开始就避免那样。不过，嘿，我又不是你老妈。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3117
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_541a1717:

    # j "Did you two have... fun?"
    j "你们两个……玩得开心吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3119
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ce2d30f2:

    # "Oh, that smirk."
    "哦，那抹坏笑。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3123
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0f578fe4:

    # "You prepare a snarky retort, but Wolf beats you to it."
    "你准备了一句尖刻的反驳，但Wolf抢在了你前面。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3125
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_82433843:

    # w "An entire day without you. It was heaven. Heard angels singing until the sun went down."
    w "一整天没有你。完全是天堂。天使歌唱声直到日落都听得见。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3127
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_7c1b6480:

    # w "But... back to hell we fell."
    w "但是……我们又掉回了地狱。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3133
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f2f2330c:

    # j "... Hah!{w} Hear that? Guy's actually funny!"
    j "……哈！{w}听到了吗？这家伙其实挺幽默的！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3135
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_cbfcb4d3:

    # j "Well, I'm glad Arthur didn't manage to {i}completely{/i} break your spirit."
    j "好吧，我很高兴Arthur没能{i}完全{/i}摧毁你们的意志。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3139
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d6f75861:

    # j "I'm going to join Sam and the others, we've got a few stories to share. You two aren't the only one who've had quite the day!"
    j "我要去找Sam他们了，我们有些故事要分享。你们俩可不是唯一今天过得相当精彩的人！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3141
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_b5e8f399:

    # "A very theatrical wink accompanies his exit."
    "他离开时，附带了一个极其夸张的眨眼。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3159
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_b437208a:

    # p "{cps=15}{i}'Twas ten and four days ago I took to sea / On the brave ship Conway{/i}{/cps}{nw=3}"
    p "{cps=15}{i}十四天前我出海远航 / 在勇敢的Conway上{/i}{/cps}{nw=3}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3163
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_7d8372c5:

    # p "{cps=15}{i}I spent all my days learning tricks of the trade / On the brave ship Conway{/i}{/cps}{p=4}{nw}"
    p "{cps=15}{i}我整日学习航海诀窍 / 在勇敢的Conway上{/i}{/cps}{p=4}{nw}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3165
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_5d552fc8:

    # p "{cps=15}{i}Until the day that we reached the coast of Morocco{/i}{/cps}{p=5}{nw}"
    p "{cps=15}{i}直到我们抵达摩洛哥海岸的那天{/i}{/cps}{p=5}{nw}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3167
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_23823db2:

    # p "{cps=15}{i}I still curse the day that we reached the coast of Morocco{/i}{/cps}{p=5}{nw}"
    p "{cps=15}{i}我至今仍在诅咒我们抵达摩洛哥海岸的那天{/i}{/cps}{p=5}{nw}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3169
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_0f612d75:

    # p "{cps=15}{i}For nary a captain would dare send a man / To the Ruins of Despair{/i}{/cps}{p=4}{nw}"
    p "{cps=15}{i}因无船长敢遣人 / 前往绝望遗迹{/i}{/cps}{p=4}{nw}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3171
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_51fc5226:

    # p "{cps=15}{i}Yet me and my brave friend, we charted a course / To the Ruins of Despair{/i}{/cps}{p=3.0}{nw}"
    p "{cps=15}{i}然我与勇伴偏勘航线 / 驶向绝望遗迹{/i}{/cps}{p=3.0}{nw}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3173
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_7996a15b:

    # p "{cps=15}{i}And I will not forget for the rest of my life what we found there{/i}{/cps}{p=4.5}{nw}"
    p "{cps=15}{i}而我此生终难忘怀所见景象{/i}{/cps}{p=4.5}{nw}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3175
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1239db5b:

    # p "{cps=15}{i}'Twas something that no man alive ever laid eyes upon:{/i}{/cps}{p=5}{nw}"
    p "{cps=15}{i}那是世间活人未曾得见之物：{/i}{/cps}{p=5}{nw}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3177
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_19036bad:

    # p "{cps=15}{i}A bunch of rocks{/i}{/cps}{p=2.5}{nw}"
    p "{cps=15}{i}一堆石头{/i}{/cps}{p=2.5}{nw}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3179
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_4916b4d6:

    # p "{cps=15}{i}A bunch of rocks{/i}{/cps}{p=5}{nw}"
    p "{cps=15}{i}一堆石头{/i}{/cps}{p=5}{nw}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3181
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_136df6fa:

    # p "{cps=15}{i}It was all just a stupid mind-numbingly boring amount{/i}{/cps}{p=6}{nw}"
    p "{cps=15}{i}全然是堆又愚蠢又令人麻木又无聊透顶的{/i}{/cps}{p=6}{nw}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3183
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_2f835378:

    # p "{cps=15}{i}Of rocks.{/i}{/cps}{p=5}{nw}"
    p "{cps=15}{i}石头。{/i}{/cps}{p=5}{nw}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3187
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_875ce35a_4:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3189
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8337703c_17:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3191
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_26c8c55e_1:

    # a ". . ."
    a ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3193
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_526a4307:

    # j "{alpha=0.5}Woo!{/alpha}"
    j "{alpha=0.5}呜呼！{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3197
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8337703c_18:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3199
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_26c8c55e_2:

    # a ". . ."
    a ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3203
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_972929f0:

    # a "... You sure did not ignore my orders."
    a "……你确实没有无视我的命令。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3207
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a29453a8:

    # a "But I do not appreciate being made a fool of."
    a "但我不喜欢被当成傻瓜。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3209
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f2fcd513:

    # a "However..."
    a "不过……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3213
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_dec33415:

    # "Arthur stares at the two of you."
    "Arthur盯着你们俩。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3215
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_aeef9fce:

    # "His eyes meet yours. But they linger a lot longer on Wolf."
    "他的目光与你的相遇。但更多地停留在Wolf身上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3217
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8670ccc7:

    # "Well, he is the reason for this whole situation.{w} Makes sense."
    "嗯，他是整件事的起因。{w}说得通。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3219
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_da78fda5:

    # "And yet..."
    "然而……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3221
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_446c5e30:

    # "Only when he resumes talking does his stare break."
    "直到他再度开口，那凝视才终于中断。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3223
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_408143b7:

    # a "Considering your dedication and the strictness of your adherence to them..."
    a "考虑到你们的奉献精神以及严格遵守命令的态度……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3228
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_54540b37:

    # a "I will let it slide. This time."
    a "我决定放过你们。仅此一次。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3230
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_1b39feb2:

    # "Arthur gets up, heading to the exit from the common area. {w}But before he disappears to the deck, he turns towards the two of you."
    "Arthur起身，朝公共区域的出口走去。{w}但在消失到甲板上之前，他转向你们俩。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3232
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_16c8e925:

    # a "If only because I suspect I'm the only one who will. {w}Rest well, gentlemen."
    a "或许仅仅因为我怀疑我是唯一会这么做的人——{w}好好休息，先生们。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3237
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_3096b0e0:

    # "On the other side of the room someone is staring at you with the strength of a hundred suns."
    "房间的另一头，有人正用如同百个太阳般炽热的目光盯着你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3241
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bcfcd2f6:

    # "The lizard locks eyes with you, an expression of sheer, unbridled, {i}ungovernable{/i} joy on his face as he walks past."
    "那只蜥蜴与你四目相对，脸上洋溢着纯粹、奔放、{i}无法抑制{/i}的喜悦，从你身边走过。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3243
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ba18b6c3:

    # "Go ahead, you mouth at him. Say it."
    "说吧，你对他做口型。说出来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3245
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_59bd2d88:

    # "{i}You are never living this down{/i}, he mouths back with the glee of a child at his first recess."
    "{i}你永远别想摆脱这个了{/i}，他回以口型，带着孩童第一次课间休息般的欣喜。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3247
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_31a2d668:

    # "{i}I will make fun of you MERCILESSLY for this{/i}."
    "{i}我会为此毫不留情地嘲笑你的{/i}。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3249
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d1126d66:

    # "You roll your eyes. {i}Sure. Whatever.{/i}"
    "你翻了个白眼。{i}当然。随你便。{/i}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3255
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f735ecac:

    # p "So... Got plans?"
    p "那么……有什么计划吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3257
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_044cc277:

    # w "Other than drowning him in the harbour? No."
    w "除了把他淹死在港口里？没有。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3261
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_ee5f2242:

    # p "Want to know what everyone else has been up to?"
    p "想知道其他人都在忙些什么吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3263
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_8337703c_19:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3267
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_872850e7:

    # w "... Heh. Sure, why not."
    w "……嘿。当然，有何不可。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3269
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_c45a0cf4:

    # w "Lead the way."
    w "带路吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3277
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_fa0ac9aa:

    # "You join up with the others, sitting in the common area."
    "你和其他人汇合，坐在公共区域。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3279
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_bd648590:

    # "There are laughs, there are stories, there are gasps of surprise."
    "有笑声，有故事，有惊讶的喘息。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3281
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_a706aeb3:

    # "Konrad tells a joke so dirty it makes you choke on your drink."
    "Konrad讲了一个极其下流的笑话，让你呛到了酒。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3283
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_641fd430:

    # "Torres recalls an anecdote about that time he bedded two noblewomen at the same time."
    "Torres回忆起他同时与两位贵妇人共度良宵的轶事。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3285
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_eb2b9285:

    # "Julian mimics pouring a drink on his head."
    "Julian模仿着往自己头上倒酒。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3287
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_26af64a4:

    # "Sam pours an actual drink on his head."
    "Sam真的往他头上倒了一杯酒。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3289
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_5b9b48c0:

    # "Wolf, at the edge of the table, is mostly quiet."
    "Wolf坐在桌子边缘，大部分时间都很安静。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3291
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_b2720811:

    # "But you can spy him nodding, occasionally. Getting a pat on the back or a friendly punch in the shoulder."
    "但你能窥见他时不时点头，后背被人轻拍或肩膀被人友善地轻锤一拳。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3293
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_4b21112e:

    # "And chuckling."
    "还有低声轻笑。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3295
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_f22bc125:

    # "Maybe it's true what they say."
    "也许他们说的是真的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3297
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_d0b19e3e:

    # "That things turn out all right."
    "事情会好起来的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3299
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_624b506a:

    # "In the end."
    "最终都会如此。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3301
translate Chinese day_14_wolf_ruins_437345de:

    # "Whenever that may come."
    "无论那一刻何时到来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3330
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_433c1b11:

    # "You dream of a raging fire."
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3332
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_6e0d193d:

    # "It engulfs everything around you, taking down wooden walls and furniture alike. It chews through paintings and wallpaper, turning woods to embers and embers to ashes."
    "它吞噬你周围的一切，摧毁木墙和家具。它啃噬画作和墙纸，将木头化为余烬，余烬化为飞灰。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3334
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_25f48d46:

    # "You run."
    "你奔跑起来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3336
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_970a2759:

    # "You run across bedrooms, kitchens, living rooms, corridor after corridor after corridor. The house you're in never seems to end."
    "你跑过卧室、厨房、客厅，一条又一条走廊。你所在的房子似乎永无尽头。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3338
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_0b6bdbb2:

    # "The roaring crackle of fire is overwhelming. It comes and goes in waves, flames fanning with each gust of air passing through the building. The raging inferno itself is breathing."
    "火焰咆哮的噼啪声铺天盖地。它如潮水般吞吐起伏，每次风穿过建筑都扇起一阵新的火浪。那狂暴的炼狱本身就在呼吸。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3340
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_4a3b7928:

    # "You run faster."
    "你跑得更快了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3342
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_a8bd07f9:

    # "You jump over chairs and tables, past armchairs and closets and nightstands."
    "你跳过无数桌椅，越过无数扶手椅、衣柜和床头柜。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3344
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_a8f0cd2a:

    # "You fly down a hallway that disappears into darkness, hoping it will provide a way out of wherever it is you're lost in."
    "你飞奔进一条消失在黑暗中的走廊，希望它能提供一条出路，无论你迷失在何处。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3346
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_f7de753b:

    # "And then you turn a corner right into a dead end."
    "然后你转过一个拐角，直接撞进了一个死胡同。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3348
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_329f04f6:

    # "You look back."
    "你回头望去。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3352
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_4f83e35a:

    # "It's too late now. The doorway collapses, a catastrophic failure entirely silent under the constant roar that blocks any other sound from your ears."
    "现在太迟了。门道坍塌了，在持续不断的咆哮声中，这灾难性的崩塌完全寂静无声，那咆哮声阻挡了任何其他声音传入你的耳朵。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3356
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_e69a226f:

    # "A wave of flames spreads from the gaps in the rubble. It hesitates for a second, before another breath of air pushes the fire further in."
    "一股火焰从瓦砾的缝隙中蔓延开来。它犹豫了一秒，随后另一股气流将其进一步推入。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3362
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_9cfb8415:

    # "You flatten yourself against the wall."
    "你将自己紧贴在墙上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3366
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_e50b60b2:

    # "The flames catch up with you."
    "火焰追上了你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3368
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8534ca42:

    # ". . ."
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3370
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_64d677a1:

    # "But nothing happens."
    "但什么都没发生。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3377
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_24db4e2e:

    # "Everything is on fire. The floor is on fire. The walls are on fire. The ceiling is on fire. {w}But you're not."
    "一切都在燃烧。地板在燃烧。墙壁在燃烧。天花板在燃烧。{w}但你没有。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3379
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_0f5f26fb:

    # "You stare at your paws. Nothing."
    "你盯着自己的爪子。什么事也没发生。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3381
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_f4a5e34e:

    # "Around you, burning debris turn to ash. Each repetitive push of air that once propelled the flames spreads those remains into the ether. Pillars of smoke thin more and more until they finally vanish from sight."
    "你周遭，燃烧的残骸化为灰烬。曾催动火焰的每一次往复气流，都将这些残迹扬入虚空。烟柱越来越稀薄，终至消散于视野。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3383
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_38e219d1:

    # "Soon, the endless house that trapped you is nothing but wind and memories."
    "很快，困住你的无尽房屋只剩下了风声和回忆。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3388
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_b93a8203:

    # "You're in a meadow, surrounded by gentle hills and grass. The rhythmic pulsing of that breeze caresses your fur at regular intervals."
    "你身处一片草甸，四周缓丘起伏，绿草如茵。那阵律动般的微风有节奏地拂过，抚弄你的皮毛。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3390
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_bcd47188:

    # "Above you, the stars—more than you know, more than you can ever count. {w}Brighter than the brightest you've seen at sea, or on those lonely nights walking around the farm fields you once called home."
    "头顶的繁星——多过你所知，多过你能数。{w}比你在海上见过的，在故乡农田独行时那些寂夜的苍穹里的任何星光都更明亮。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3394
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_b3f86ce6:

    # "Everything is peaceful. The wind is gentle on your fur."
    "一切都很宁静。风轻柔地拂过你的皮毛。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3396
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_adcb0c46:

    # "But the noise..."
    "但那噪音……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3398
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_2f5810d5:

    # "You can still hear it. A rumble that increases in volume every time the wind picks up."
    "你仍能听见它。每当风势增强，那隆隆声便随之加剧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3400
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_50cb3fb9:

    # "You look around, but it's only grass and stars as far as the eye can see. And on the horizon..."
    "你环顾四周，但目之所及唯有青草与星辰。而在地平线上……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3402
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_a8913f84:

    # "Hills that turn to mountains. {w}Mountains that start to move."
    "丘陵渐变为山峦。{w}山峦开始移动。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3406
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_6344e9f6:

    # "They shift, twist, churn, until they reveal themselves to not be mountains at all."
    "它们移位、扭曲、翻腾，最终显露出真容——那根本不是山。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3412
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_6a038c9c:

    # "An arm. Colossal, covering the entire horizon in its shadow."
    "一条手臂。庞然巨臂，其阴影笼罩了整个地平线。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3418
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_477044d7:

    # "It starts reaching for you."
    "它开始向你伸来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3426
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_5294f68a:

    # "And then you open your eyes."
    "接着你睁开了眼睛。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3434
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_616f3cc0:

    # "It must be shortly before dawn, judging from what little light filters into your tight communal bedroom."
    "从透进狭小集体卧室的微光判断，天肯定快亮了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3436
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_cecfde2c:

    # "Around you the crew is deep in their slumber, lost in whatever dream they might be tormented—or delighted—by. Nobody's making a sound."
    "周围的船员们深陷梦乡，正被各自或折磨或愉悦的梦境所困。没人发出一点声响。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3438
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_3e9de255:

    # "Except for Julian, who's snoring as if silence were a personal offence."
    "除了Julian——他鼾声大作，仿佛寂静是对他个人的冒犯。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3440
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_012c7b10:

    # j "Snnnrtt... Pssshhh... {w}Snnnrrrrtt... Pssshhhhh... {w}Snnnnnrrrtt..."
    j "呼哧……噗嘶……{w}呼噜噜……噗嘶嘶……{w}呼哧哧……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3442
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_93f8e717:

    # j ". . ."
    j ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3444
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_b21852f0:

    # j "... snnrrKKRTRTTRTT... Psssshhh..."
    j "……呼噜喀喀喀……噗嘶……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3448
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_1b576dba:

    # "You kick the lizard gently in the ribs—well, gently might be too kind a word. You kick the lizard trying not to hurt him. {w}Much."
    "你轻轻踢了这蜥蜴的肋骨一脚——好吧，“轻轻”可能说得太客气了。你踢了这蜥蜴一脚，尽量不伤到他。{w}太尽量了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3452
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_3590796b:

    # "Julian snorts and smacks his lips, rolling on his side. {w}He snores a couple more times, a sleepy violinist trying to tune his favorite instrument, before returning to his dreams with a smug smile and no further sound from his nostrils."
    "Julian哼了一声，咂咂嘴，翻身侧卧。{w}他又打了几声鼾，活像个昏昏欲睡的小提琴手在调试心爱的乐器，随后带着得意的笑容重回梦乡，鼻孔再无声响。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3454
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_90df0a2e:

    # "Mission accomplished. After enough days of sharing the deck, you've gotten good at this."
    "任务完成。在甲板与他共处足够多天后，你已对此驾轻就熟。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3458
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_b3ac5e60:

    # "You close your eyes and make yourself comfortable. Time for the sleep of the just."
    "你闭上眼睛，调整到舒服的姿势。正直者该享受安眠了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3462
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_0bb0fe3c:

    # ".{w} .{w} .{w} .{w} ."
    ".{w} .{w} .{w} .{w} ."

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3468
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_a930f352:

    # "Well. Sleep's nowhere to be found."
    "好吧。睡意无处可寻。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3470
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_c36538c1:

    # "You rise with a grunt. The sun is coming up, might as well get the day going."
    "你咕哝着起身。太阳即将升起，不如就此开始新的一天。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3472
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_2300beb0:

    # "You did get plenty of rest, at least - last night's drinks helped with that. But it will take a while before you're fully among the living."
    "你确实休息得不错——昨晚的酒帮了大忙。但要完全恢复清醒还得花点时间。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3474
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_1cc68cb5:

    # "Some fresh air might help, you think."
    "你觉得，或许新鲜空气会有所帮助。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3478
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8ea9f492:

    # "You head for the upper deck."
    "你走向上层甲板。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3490
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_bc468390:

    # "The outside of the ship is fairly empty, save for a couple of sailors boringly handling watch duties."
    "甲板上颇为空旷，只有几名水手无聊地执行着瞭望任务。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3492
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_7eadff4d:

    # "You exchange greetings with a nod of the head, but they don't seem in the mood for a chat. And neither are you."
    "你们点头致意，但他们似乎无心交谈。你也一样。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3500
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_0370dc3a:

    # "They say it's darkest before dawn, but it doesn't feel like it. Although, it may still take a while for the sun to come up."
    "都说黎明前最黑暗，但此刻并无这般感受。不过，太阳升起可能还需一段时间。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3502
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_201547fd:

    # "You take a deep breath. Nothing like fresh morning air to properly wake up."
    "你深吸一口气。没有什么比清晨的新鲜空气更能让人彻底清醒了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3504
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_b87b8b61:

    # "Your stomach grumbles, forcing you to reclassify fresh morning air as the second best thing after breakfast."
    "你的肚子咕咕作响，迫使你将清晨新鲜空气重新归类为仅次于早餐的第二佳品。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3506
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_2aeec99b:

    # "Whatever, you think. We can take care of that later."
    "管他呢，你想。这事可以稍后再处理。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3508
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ae6e98ae:

    # "You continue your little walk toward the bow. {w}You don't spot much out of the ordinary. Seagulls, clouds, the ever present sound of waves."
    "你继续向船头漫步。{w}没发现什么异常。海鸥、云朵、永不停歇的海浪声。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3510
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_7b0554af:

    # "And... someone sitting on the gunwale, apparently."
    "还有……显然有个人坐在船舷上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3512
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_3d60173d:

    # "Someone very much out of the ordinary."
    "一个极不寻常的人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3524
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_875ce35a:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3526
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_4e8641db:

    # w "Hey."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3528
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_42b01cbe:

    # p "Hey."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3530
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_2d5de6a4:

    # "Bathed in the orange and blue light of a morning-to-be, Wolf is apparently taking care of Michael, the friendlier of the two ship's cats."
    "沐浴在破晓前橙蓝交织的晨光里，Wolf显然正在照料Michael——船上两只猫中较亲人的那只。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3532
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_a4377106:

    # "Between the dim light and your yet-to-fully-awaken brain, it's an almost surreal moment of tenderness."
    "昏暗的光线加上你尚未完全清醒的大脑，这温情一幕几乎显得超现实。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3534
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_52ab5e77:

    # "But it's there, right in front of your eyes."
    "但它就在那里，就在你眼前。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3536
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8337703c:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3538
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_4dff25d3:

    # "Wolf keeps quiet. At this point, you know him well enough that his silence barely registers in your head as anomalous."
    "Wolf保持沉默。此时你已足够了解他，他的安静在你脑中几乎不会被视作异常。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3540
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_fb435ce6:

    # "But things feel different this time. Less aggressively isolationist, more... reflective."
    "但这次感觉不同了。少了那种尖锐的疏离感，多了几分……沉静。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3542
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_4c6b9c36:

    # "And the cat is being fed."
    "而且他在喂猫。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3544
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_566f1c1b:

    # "Which isn't just an unusual display of friendliness from him, but also forbidden by the rules of the ship."
    "这不仅是他罕见的友善表现，也违背了船上的规矩。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3546
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_bc18b8c3:

    # "And even if the sun is yet to rise, and there isn't a single soul in the immediate vicinity on the upper deck..."
    "即便太阳尚未升起，上层甲板近处空无一人……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3548
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_1bdac63f:

    # "Wolf is breaking the rules right where anyone could spot him."
    "Wolf正在任何人都可能发现的地方违反规定。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3550
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_4736c1c8:

    # "It feels... strange seeing him like this."
    "看到他这样……感觉很奇怪。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3552
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_c5ec0c69:

    # "His back turned and his attention fully taken, you have some time to think on how to break the ice."
    "他背对着你，全神贯注，让你有时间思考如何打破僵局。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3554
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_a057d66d:

    # "Yesterday's event weigh heavy in your mind. Thing have taken an entirely unexpected turn."
    "昨日之事沉甸甸地压在你心头。事态已转向完全出乎意料的方向。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3556
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_14ad4f44:

    # "You don't know how to approach the topic. You felt wholly unprepared to deal with grief and trauma of that magnitude."
    "你不知道该如何提起这个话题。面对那般沉重的伤痛与创伤，你感到全然无措。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3558
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_de33d13b:

    # "So you didn't. You let the rest of yesterday go by without ever mentioning the fragments of his past he shared with you."
    "所以你并未提起。你任由昨日余下的时间流逝，始终未曾提及他与你分享的那些往事碎片。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3560
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_615a87cb:

    # "It was... complicated. Asking about it felt wrong, akin to staring at a person in a time of mental crisis. Satisfying curiosity at the expense of someone's anguish."
    "那很……复杂。询问似乎不妥，犹如在他人经历精神危机时盯着对方看，以他人痛苦为代价满足好奇心。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3562
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_dea81b16:

    # "And you're afraid trying to help might make things worse."
    "而且你担心试图帮忙可能让事情更糟。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3564
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d6355333:

    # "In the back of your head, a voice wonders how much of what he shared is actually true."
    "脑海深处，有个声音质疑着他所分享的内容究竟有多少属实。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3566
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_a2af392b:

    # "And yet... Something does feel different. Something has shifted, or started to shift."
    "然而……确实有些东西感觉不同了。某些事物已经改变，或已经开始改变。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3568
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_a3ed2e59:

    # "You shake your head vigorously. Your ears flip back and forth."
    "你用力摇摇头。耳朵前后摆动。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3570
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_a02b341d:

    # "Enough thinking. No matter how you look at it, he was still there to make sure you were safe from harm. {w}Or worse."
    "你想够了。无论如何，他当时确确实实在那里，确保你免遭伤害。{w}或陷入更糟的境遇。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3572
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_e67c2699:

    # "And you owe him your thanks for that."
    "你为此欠他一声感谢。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3574
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_920c8b1f:

    # "So you take a deep breath and a step forward."
    "于是你深吸一口气，向前一步。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3577
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_5ab476b0:

    # p "Hey, Wolf..." nointeract
    p "嘿，Wolf……" nointeract

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3581
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_f96cdfaa:

    # p "Mind if I take a seat?"
    p "介意我坐这儿吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3585
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_0a79891f:

    # p "How are you feeling, really?"
    p "你真实感受如何？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3587
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_abf7bd07:

    # "... is what you wanted to say."
    "……这是你本来想说的话。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3589
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_5859de8c:

    # "But by now, there's one thing you should have realized about Wolf."
    "但事到如今，关于Wolf，你早该明白一点——"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3591
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_bc5987dd:

    # w "Why've you been standing there like an idiot for the past five minutes?"
    w "你像个傻子似的在那儿站了五分钟是要干什么？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3593
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ebeeac02:

    # "He's never going to let anyone dictate the terms of engagement."
    "他从不会让任何人来定义相处的规则。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3595
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_7858ebe6:

    # p "Uh..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3597
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_da24781e:

    # w "Don't be daft."
    w "别犯傻。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3599
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_f1a1f588:

    # w "Either get back to sleep or take a seat. You're making me nervous."
    w "要么回去睡觉，要么坐下。你让我紧张了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3601
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_0a0a345a:

    # "{i}He doesn't look nervous though{/i}, you think."
    "{i}但他看起来并不紧张{/i}，你想。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3611
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_eb1c43de:

    # "You climb over the gunwale and sit there, silently staring at the horizon."
    "你翻过船舷坐下，默默凝视着地平线。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3613
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_bc6d807c:

    # "It's promising to be a beautiful day."
    "今天会是个好天气。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3615
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_b3d77c3c:

    # p "You don't sleep much, do you?"
    p "你睡得不多，对吧？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3617
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_4d958f64:

    # w "Not really. Not my thing."
    w "不算多。我没这个习惯。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3619
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_a45efe63:

    # w "Rolling in the hammock gets boring. Up here it's quiet."
    w "在吊床上翻来覆去太无聊。这儿很安静。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3621
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_73ab255b:

    # "You nod. {w}You let silence stretch between you two for a while."
    "你点点头。{w}你让沉默在两人之间延续了片刻。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3623
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_00e106cd:

    # "It's a shared emptiness, as you both look at the sun starting to illuminate more of the horizon."
    "这是共享的空寂，你们一同注视着阳光开始照亮更远的地平线。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3625
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_489562c4:

    # "Michael the cat pushes its head against Wolf's knee."
    "猫咪Michael用头抵着Wolf的膝盖。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3629
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_c67df4de:

    # "Wolf obliges and pets its neck, gaining purrs in response."
    "Wolf顺从地抚摸它的脖颈，换来它满足的呼噜声。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3631
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d2b54c1c:

    # p "You know we're not supposed to feed them."
    p "你知道我们不该喂它们的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3633
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_b8541379:

    # "It's not a question, nor is it an accusation. Just a simple stating of a fact."
    "这不是询问，也非指责。只是在平淡地陈述事实。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3635
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_a9baf71e:

    # "You don't feed cats on a ship. If they hunt mice, they're an asset. If they beg for food, they're a liability."
    "船上不能喂猫。若它们捕鼠，便是资产；若乞食，便是累赘。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3637
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_7db91587:

    # "Though it's impossible to keep a bunch of tough men from suddenly discovering their soft side when two big eyes look at you during dinner."
    "不过，如果有这么一双大眼睛在晚餐时盯着你看，再强硬的汉子也难保不突然心软。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3641
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_991e0399:

    # "In response, Wolf grabs the bowl. {w}He then places it between your legs."
    "作为回应，Wolf拿起碗。{w}然后把它放在你两腿之间。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3650
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_aa781d97:

    # "The cat hops over and resumes eating from its new tavern table, interrupting its meal with some occasional rubbing of the neck on your shirt."
    "猫咪跳过来，在新的“酒馆餐桌”上继续用餐，偶尔用脖子蹭蹭你的衬衫打断进食。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3652
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_1de10e12:

    # "You hold on tight to the gunwale. Michael doesn't seem worried about falling into the water at all."
    "你紧紧抓住船舷。Michael似乎完全不怕掉进水里。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3654
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_cb2884fb:

    # w "Now we're accomplices."
    w "现在我们是共犯了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3656
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_875ce35a_1:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3658
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_67bc024a:

    # p "... Was that a smile?"
    p "……那是微笑吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3660
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_aab20d54:

    # w "Don't make it weird."
    w "别搞得这么怪。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3662
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_b898a217:

    # "You chuckle. All right."
    "你轻笑一声。好吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3664
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_244c2f92:

    # "You pet Michael. He doesn't purr as much as with Wolf. {w}You wonder if he's been feeding him since the start of the trip."
    "你抚摸Michael。它不像对Wolf那样对你打那么多呼噜。{w}你怀疑他是否从航程开始就在喂它。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3666
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_3b39c4fe:

    # "But... As fun as petting Michael can be, you know it's just buying time before the inevitable."
    "但是……尽管抚摸Michael很有趣，你知道这只是为不可避免的对话争取时间。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3670
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_16bb40b9:

    # "You gently push Michael aside, ignoring the annoyed meowing."
    "你轻轻推开Michael，无视它不满的喵叫。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3672
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_567e4d35:

    # "It's time for a talk."
    "是时候谈谈了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3674
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ba16c88b:

    # p "Hey, so..."
    p "嘿，那个……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3676
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8337703c_1:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3678
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_2ed5ffbd:

    # w "... Yeah. Go ahead."
    w "……嗯。说吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3680
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_3c51bddb:

    # p "Wolf, I..."
    p "Wolf，我……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3682
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_c201e769:

    # p "I'm not sure what to say exactly. I've never been in this kind of situation before."
    p "我不太确定该说什么。我以前从没遇到过这种情况。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3684
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_95b6a6fc:

    # p "Farm life doesn't... prepare you for this. But there's something I, well..."
    p "农场生活……无法让你为这种事做好准备。但有件事，嗯……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3686
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_5dd8cd0d:

    # p "I feel I should just let you know, because it matters."
    p "我觉得应该告诉你，因为它很重要。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3688
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_31a8eb17:

    # w "Oh, shut it."
    w "哦，差不多得了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3690
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8067948e:

    # w "I've seen you naked. You've seen me naked. No point in being coy."
    w "我看过你裸体。你看过我裸体。没必要扭捏。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3692
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_eed76c44:

    # "The bluntness doesn't surprise you. But it does cause you to pause."
    "他的直白并未让你惊讶，但确实让你停顿了一下。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3694
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_2a8c1f9a:

    # w "Say what you have to say or give Michael what he wants."
    w "有话快说，不然就把Michael想要的给它。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3696
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_00286af4:

    # "The cat is nuzzling against your knee. You place a hand on its head, turning to look Wolf directly in the eyes."
    "猫咪正依偎着蹭你的膝盖。你伸手轻抚它的头顶，转身直视Wolf的眼睛。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3698
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_42f192bf:

    # "He stares back."
    "他回望着你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3700
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8337703c_2:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3702
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_875ce35a_2:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3704
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_dd5bdf78:

    # p "Thank you."
    p "谢谢你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3706
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_a073d853:

    # p "I never said it properly, but thank you for helping me."
    p "我从未好好说过，但谢谢你帮助我。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3708
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_a5c25259:

    # p "You didn't have to worry about me like that, but you did. I was just a burden yesterday, but you didn't complain once."
    p "你本不必那样担心我，可你还是做了。昨天我只是个累赘，你却一句怨言都没有。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3710
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_1e61198c:

    # p "You just... helped me. And trusted me enough to share things you wouldn't tell anyone."
    p "你只是...帮助了我。还信任我到愿意分享那些不会告诉任何人的事。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3712
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_64cd3096:

    # p "I don't know how to... Well, how to properly handle all this. So... Thank you. I think at the very least, I should do that."
    p "我不知道该怎么...嗯，妥善处理这一切。所以...谢谢你。我想至少我该这么做。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3714
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8337703c_3:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3718
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_9e5514a8:

    # w "You could have thanked me by not making our report to Arthur a circus yesterday..."
    w "你本可以好好道谢的——比如昨天不把向Arthur汇报的事搞成马戏团表演……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3720
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_f9d04cfe:

    # w "I would have accepted that as thanks."
    w "那样我就会接受你的谢意了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3722
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_7bb7ea87:

    # p "I'm sorry."
    p "对不起。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3724
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d5972ba5:

    # w "But no, I don't think you're a burden."
    w "不过不，我不觉得你是累赘。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3728
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ccfa677f:

    # w "... I don't think you're a burden."
    w "...我不觉得你是累赘。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3730
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8b27798d:

    # w "I think you're naive. And green. And way, way too optimistic."
    w "我觉得你天真。青涩。而且过分、过分乐观。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3732
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ce5b09a1:

    # "Touché."
    "Touché.（法语：一针见血）"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3734
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_56e98a80:

    # w "You talk too much. Constantly poke your nose where you shouldn't. Get all up in people's business."
    w "你话太多。总爱打听不该管的事。对别人的事过分上心。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3736
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_90a0e42b:

    # "Touché, again."
    "又是一针见血。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3738
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_cbe5f665:

    # w "You stroll around trying to make friends with everyone. Nary a clue how dangerous that can be. {w}Or annoying."
    w "你到处晃悠，想跟所有人交朋友，根本不懂这有多危险。{w}或者多烦人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3740
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_57ce93a1:

    # "At this point, you're starting to feel like a pincushion."
    "此刻你开始觉得自己像个人形针垫。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3742
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d99ad29f:

    # w "But..."
    w "但是……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3744
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8337703c_4:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3746
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_e94bd369:

    # w "You don't seem to give up."
    w "你似乎从不会放弃。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3748
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ebe80a5b:

    # w "I've seen how hard you work yourself. You try to learn."
    w "我见过你有多拼命。你在努力学。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3750
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_0aa545f7:

    # w "Don't always manage to, but you do."
    w "虽然不总能成功，但你在尽力。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3754
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_dd2a305e:

    # w "Didn't lose your head when you got trapped in the ruins. That was... noteworthy."
    w "困在遗迹里时也没慌了阵脚。这倒是……值得称道。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3756
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8286cd5d:

    # w "As was your willingness to push into that crack. {w}With no regard for your safety."
    w "还有你愿意挤进那道裂缝。{w}完全不顾自身安全。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3760
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_4bd42274:

    # w "Worked yourself to exhaustion while climbing the ruins. Stupid."
    w "攀爬遗迹时把自己累到虚脱。蠢。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3762
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_c2762fe0:

    # w "Not admirable, just stupid."
    w "不值得佩服，就是蠢。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3764
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_487208aa:

    # w "You don't seem to know when to stop. For good and ill."
    w "你好像不懂适可而止。好坏都是。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3766
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_a0b07efb:

    # w "Although you're not as annoying as Julian while at it. That's a positive."
    w "不过你没Julian做这些事时那么烦人。算是个优点。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3768
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_875ce35a_3:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3770
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_916309e0:

    # w "You didn't know when to stop when trying to befriend me either."
    w "你想跟我交朋友时也不懂适可而止。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3772
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_5319b1f9:

    # w "You're not special. I've had people try to chat me up before. Never understood why."
    w "你没什么特别的。以前也有人试图跟我搭话。我一直不明白为什么。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3774
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_94b670da:

    # w "But... You pushed right against the edge. And rarely stepped over it."
    w "但...你刚好踩在边界上。很少越界。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3776
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8c30fc45:

    # w "You're not as bad as you think."
    w "你没自己想的那么糟。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3778
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_5ecec055:

    # p "... Thanks."
    p "...谢谢。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3780
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_546651ee:

    # p "I didn't expect you to understand people this well."
    p "没想到你这么懂人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3782
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_676a2605:

    # w "I've had practice. Far more than you think."
    w "练出来的。练得比你以为的多得多。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3784
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_560a55c9:

    # w "I told you about the group. I've had to take responsibility for it more than once."
    w "我跟你说过那个团队的事。我不得不为此担起责任，不止一次。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3786
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_44c1830f:

    # w "If you don't know your people well, things end in disaster."
    w "若不了解自己人，结局便是灾难。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3788
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_329cdd39:

    # w "When you're wrong about someone, the price is steep. {w}Yeah."
    w "看错人的代价很沉重。{w}是啊。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3790
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_32a8dd8d:

    # w "I've learned to listen and look more than chat. {w}And to not let people know I'm listening. Or looking."
    w "我学会了多听多看，少闲聊。{w}也学会了不让人察觉我在听或是在看。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3792
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_992f5607:

    # w "Sometimes... I wonder if I've forgotten how to talk."
    w "有时候...我怀疑自己是不是忘了怎么说话。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3794
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_a30c4d97:

    # p "It doesn't look like it, to me."
    p "在我看来不像。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3796
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_e2b65c13:

    # p "I think you're good at talking. You don't mince words. Or waste them."
    p "我觉得你很会说话。不拐弯抹角。也不说废话。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3798
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8337703c_5:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3800
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_666f3819:

    # p "I like to hear you talk."
    p "我喜欢听你说话。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3802
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_875ce35a_4:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3804
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_c1d45609:

    # p "I'd like to know more about your group. If you don't mind sharing."
    p "我想多了解你的团队。如果你不介意分享的话。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3806
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8337703c_6:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3808
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ac8d8345:

    # w "... Maybe later. We're out of time."
    w "...也许以后吧。没时间了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3810
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_4e3a3518:

    # w "Sun's almost at the point when people wake up."
    w "太阳快到把人照醒的时辰了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3812
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_356125e6:

    # "He's right. Morning has well and truly started by now."
    "他说得对。此刻早晨已真真切切地开始了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3814
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_cce1645a:

    # w "We better get off. Time to start the day."
    w "我们最好下去。该开始新的一天了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3818
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_1f5cc41a:

    # "He hops off the gunwale, shooing off Michael the cat, utterly indifferent to its lamentations."
    "他跳下船舷，赶走了猫咪Michael，完全无视它的哀怨。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3820
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_5a3ad98a:

    # "You watch him return to the world of tight chaos, rowdy people, and shouted orders that is daily life on the Conway."
    "你看着他回到Conway上那充斥着紧凑混乱、喧闹人群和吆喝命令的日常生活。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3822
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_6d862d44:

    # "You wonder how many times he's done this before."
    "你暗自思忖这样的场景他以前究竟经历多少回。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3832
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_7e27d4e0:

    # "But before leaving the deck, he turns toward you."
    "但在离开甲板前，他转向你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3834
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_fa3fd398:

    # w "You coming?"
    w "你来吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3836
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ab9d3ae4:

    # p "Hmm?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3838
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8c2a9265:

    # w "I don't plan on making Arthur mad again. I'm taking my day off seriously."
    w "我不打算再惹Arthur生气。我要认真休假。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3840
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_87f2843d:

    # w "But I'm not going to spend time in town, that's for sure."
    w "但我肯定不会在镇上消磨时间。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3844
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_72b4c069:

    # w "Do you...{w} Ugh."
    w "你...{w}呃。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3846
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_4da5b962:

    # w "Do you want to go see the beaches around here."
    w "你想去看看附近的海滩吗。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3848
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_875ce35a_5:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3850
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_06e5ee61:

    # p "...Yeah. {w}Wait for me."
    p "...好啊。{w}等我一下。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3858
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_5d21e1c2:

    # "You hop after him just as the first few sailors start trickling up to the deck."
    "你跟着他跳下船舷时，第一批水手正稀稀落落地走上甲板。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3876
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_299e9ff0:

    # "A quick breakfast, a short {i}'hello everyone'{/i} to the rest of the crew, a few minutes listening to Julian complaining about a weird ache in his side. It's an average morning."
    "快速吃完早餐，对船员们简单地打个{i}“大家早上好啊”{/i}得招呼，听Julian抱怨几句侧腹奇怪的酸痛。这是个寻常的早晨。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3878
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d39ad212:

    # "You hear more from the folks who've been spending time exploring Mogador. Apparently the local drinks are pretty nice, and so are the local bathhouses."
    "你听到更多关于探索莫加多尔镇的见闻。据说当地的酒很不错，澡堂也是。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3880
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_5168e944:

    # "They're headed to town again. And again, you decide against it. You have other plans."
    "他们又要去镇上了。而你再次决定不去。你有别的计划。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3882
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_fedc0ab7:

    # "Wolf, unable to abscond at the first sign of a social gathering, responds to questions about his own plans with grunts and non-committal {i}'I 'unno's.{/i}"
    "Wolf没能在社交场合初步形成时溜走，面对关于他个人计划的询问，只用咕哝和含糊的{i}“我哪知道”{/i}来应付。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3884
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_14c901b5:

    # "Soon people get their bellies filled, their faces splashed with water, and their coin purses packed tight inside the pockets of their breeches."
    "很快人们填饱了肚子，用水泼了脸，将钱袋紧紧塞进马裤口袋。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3903
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_c80caa25:

    # "And then it's you and Wolf, alone, again."
    "然后又是只有你和Wolf单独两人了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3908
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8337703c_7:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3910
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_875ce35a_6:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3914
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_91dfb3ac:

    # w "... All right. Let's go."
    w "...好吧。我们走。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3934
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_1e96e0c6:

    # "It's another beautiful day."
    "又是个美好的日子。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3936
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_a9aaff36:

    # "Not as fur-sheddingly hot as yesterday, at least, but nothing to scoff at. And this time, you don't foresee any physical labor in your immediate future."
    "至少不像昨天热得让人掉毛，但也不容小觑。而这一次，你预感不会有体力活要干。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3940
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_72e86c39:

    # "You walked off the pier, through the dock, and right along the coast to see if you could find a place worth relaxing in."
    "你们走下码头，穿过船坞，沿着海岸线寻找值得放松的地方。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3942
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_84ff4f53:

    # "It was immediately clear that, to Wolf, the main factor in your choice of location was how isolated the place would be."
    "你立刻明白，对Wolf而言，选址的首要因素是地点的僻静程度。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3949
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_418b7cf8:

    # "The walk to a suitable beach wasn't particularly long, particularly eventful, or particularly chatty."
    "前往合适海滩的路途不算特别长，没有特别的事发生，你们也没怎么交谈。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3958
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_c20568a7:

    # p "Here's pretty nice, isn't it?"
    p "这儿挺不错，是吧？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3960
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_e29528ea:

    # "A thin strip of land separates the coast of Morocco from the ocean. There's a light breeze, the ever present distant calls of seagulls, and just a light hint of commotion coming from the city off in the distance."
    "一条狭长的陆地将摩洛哥的海岸与海洋隔开。微风轻拂，海鸥的鸣叫自远处恒常传来，远方城市只送来一丝隐约的喧动。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3962
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_cdc608a1:

    # "Quiet, calm, and yes, isolated."
    "安静，平和，还有，僻静。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3964
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_e47157d0:

    # w "It's a beach. Just like any other beach I've seen."
    w "这是个海滩。跟我见过的其他海滩没什么两样。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3966
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_875ce35a_7:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3970
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8337703c_8:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3972
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d45f4b5e:

    # w "This was...{w} a bad idea."
    w "这真是...{w}个馊主意。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3974
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_44b16b1d:

    # p "Come on, Wolf. I think it's great."
    p "别这样，Wolf。我觉得很棒。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3976
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_29f78434:

    # p "Sure, at this point any place that doesn't reek of bilge water and sweat is a king's palace. But the nice weather is certainly a plus."
    p "当然，到了现在，任何没有舱底水和汗臭味的地方都像是皇宫。不过好天气确实加分。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3980
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_fc0d2b02:

    # w "I'm not here to relax. I'm here so I don't get reprimanded. It's just another facet of my job."
    w "我不是来放松的。我来这儿只是为了免遭训斥。这不过是我工作的另一面罢了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3982
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_eb3c9760:

    # p "That's not a great attitude to have. It means giving your whole life to your work."
    p "这种心态可不好，意味着你把整个人生献给工作了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3984
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_0560fb2d:

    # p "Even when you're not working, you're still thinking about work."
    p "即使不在工作时，你也在想着工作。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3988
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_3cf9a683:

    # w "Maybe that's what I want to do."
    w "也许这就是我想做的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3990
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_edc5e859:

    # p "You don't want to be alone with your thoughts?"
    p "你不想独自面对自己的思绪吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3994
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_862fdc39:

    # w "Are you really going there?"
    w "你真要往这方向聊？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3996
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_79b56ea4:

    # w "If you think that, you're not paying attention. I spend most of my time alone with my thoughts."
    w "你要是这么想，那就是没认真观察。我大部分时间都在独自面对我的思绪。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:3998
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_4a586b52:

    # "That he does. Always vanishing off somewhere as soon as he's done, rarely chatting and drinking with other people in the evenings."
    "确实如此。他总是完事后就消失无踪，晚上很少与人喝酒聊天。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4002
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_7b671b4c:

    # w "I'm a tar for the money. That's all there's always been to it."
    w "我当水手是为了钱。从来就只是这样。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4006
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_451662ca:

    # "He's pulling back, you realize. Poked his head out of the cave, got blinded by the sun. And now he's trying to dig himself deeper in."
    "你意识到他在退缩了——刚从洞穴探出头，就被阳光刺了眼。现在他试图把自己埋得更深。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4008
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_3b845b86:

    # "This might be one of the last chances to break the wall."
    "这可能是打破这堵墙的最后机会之一。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4010
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_81199ad2:

    # p "That's what you always say. But... It's hard not to see it in a different light now, after all you told me."
    p "你总是这么说。但...听你说了那些之后，现在很难不换个角度看。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4012
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_3166b4f1:

    # p "I can put two and two together. You're running away. Maybe literally, maybe not, but that doesn't matter."
    p "我能把线索拼起来。你在逃跑。也许是字面意义上的，也许不是，但这不重要。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4014
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_a9875bed:

    # p "The money might help, but that's why you're here. You want to get as far away as possible."
    p "钱可能有帮助，但那是你在这里的原因。你想尽可能逃得远远的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4016
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_91edcb1b:

    # p "No... It's not that you want to. {w}You have to. Or you feel that you have to."
    p "不...不是你想。{w}是你必须如此。或者你觉得自己必须如此。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4020
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_e524610c:

    # p "Did I get it right?"
    p "我说对了吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4022
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8337703c_9:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4026
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_727c4816:

    # w "Heh."
    w "呵。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4028
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_252cb917:

    # w "So what, did they teach how to read people at the farm?"
    w "所以呢，农场还教人怎么读心吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4030
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_875ce35a_8:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4034
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_b4fd0cad:

    # p "Not really."
    p "不算吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4036
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_e4199000:

    # p "I've had some experience handling stubborn animals, though. You end up picking up a few things."
    p "不过我有些对付倔动物的经验。总会学到点东西。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4038
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_bdb819db:

    # p "And you're not answering my question."
    p "而且你没回答我的问题。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4042
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_2bcbb03c:

    # w "Well, I'm no bloody animal. Keep that in mind."
    w "哼，我他妈可不是什么动物。记好了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4044
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ea523904:

    # "There's a part of you that understands this kind of thing take time."
    "你心里有一部分明白这种事需要时间。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4046
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_3cae808a:

    # "That just by being here with you, Wolf is pushing significantly past his comfort zone."
    "Wolf是待在这里陪你，就已经大大超出了他的舒适区。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4048
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ac0cfe0c:

    # "Mentally going to a place he hadn't gone to in a long, long while."
    "他在精神上踏入了一个他很久、很久未曾涉足的地方。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4050
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_89967a83:

    # "And there's a part of you that's starting to get tired of his antics."
    "而你心里有一部分已经开始厌倦他的做作了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4054
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ab6fb618:

    # "So you slam your ass on the sand."
    "于是你一屁股坐在沙滩上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4058
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_1acbdccf:

    # p "I concede, maybe it's a bad idea. But it's at least an idea."
    p "我承认，也许这不是个好主意。但至少是个主意。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4060
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_9d2bed2c:

    # p "What's the plan otherwise? Sitting on the edge of the pier right where the gangway ends? Just so Arthur can get pissed off at you every time he crosses it?"
    p "不然计划是什么？就坐在码头边缘，舷梯尽头那儿？好让Arthur每次经过时都能冲你发火？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4062
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_6083e8ca:

    # p "By the way, what's even going on with him? He seems to keep coming and leaving with stacks of paper."
    p "对了，他到底在忙什么？他好像总是抱着一摞摞的纸来来回回。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4064
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8f127d36:

    # "Wolf shrugs, disinterest in his eyes."
    "Wolf耸耸肩，眼里丝毫不见他的关心。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4068
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_66ea7f14:

    # w "Not a bloody clue. Harbor bureaucracy, if I had to guess."
    w "完全不知道。要我猜的话，大概是港口的官僚文书。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4070
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_28000b31:

    # p "It's odd that he's the one in charge of it, though. I don't think the first mate is supposed to handle that."
    p "不过奇怪的是，居然由他负责这个。我觉得大副不该处理这些事。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4072
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_fed64b53:

    # w "Not my job to care about it."
    w "这不关我的事。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4076
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8337703c_10:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4078
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_875ce35a_9:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4082
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_73797ab2:

    # w "Ugh, okay. Scoot over."
    w "呃，好吧。挪过去点。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4089
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_5e4a443f:

    # "Wolf leans down. You give him the space he needs."
    "Wolf俯下身。你给他腾出需要的空间。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4093
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_04d7f31a:

    # "He sits right next to you on the sand."
    "他在沙滩上紧挨着你坐下。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4095
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_875ce35a_10:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4097
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8337703c_11:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4099
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_7161cd21:

    # "You flick your ears."
    "你抖了抖耳朵。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4101
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_875ce35a_11:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4103
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8337703c_12:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4105
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d4cc6a5f:

    # "Wolf scratches the fur on his neck."
    "Wolf抓了抓脖子上的毛。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4107
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_875ce35a_12:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4109
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_5cd05285:

    # p "So... {w}What do you do to pass the time?"
    p "那么……{w}你都做些什么来打发时间？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4113
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ae25a0e6:

    # p "Outside of the few times Julian managed to drag you to our table to play dice, that is."
    p "我是说，除了Julian那几次硬把你拖到我们桌边玩骰子之外。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4115
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_32a45f0f:

    # w "Sometimes we play cards."
    w "有时候我们打牌。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4117
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_a2973194:

    # "You look thoroughly unimpressed by his response."
    "你对他的回答显得完全不以为然。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4119
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8337703c_13:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4121
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_c8deacde:

    # w "...Nothing."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4123
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_6afd45ec:

    # p "Nothing?"
    p "没什么？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4125
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_bf2ccc0d:

    # w "Nothing."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4127
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_6232ada2:

    # p "Just... Stare at the wall all day?"
    p "就……整天盯着墙看？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4131
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_484bf6e4:

    # w "I'm on a boat. I stare at the sea."
    w "我在船上。所以是盯着海看。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4133
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_fd69829d:

    # p "Oh, come on. Even you can't be {i}that{/i} immune to boredom."
    p "哦，得了吧。连你也不可能对无聊{i}那么{/i}免疫吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4137
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_6e18eeb9:

    # w "Don't knock it 'til you tried it. She is a harsh but beautiful mistress."
    w "没试过就别瞎说。大海可是位严苛又绝情的美人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4139
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_556b267e:

    # p "See, now you're starting to sound like Julian."
    p "瞧，你现在说话开始像Julian了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4143
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_1e147352:

    # "The look he gives you could pierce stone. {w} You put your paws up."
    "他看你的眼神能穿透石头。{w}你举起了爪子。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4145
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_a5750bfd:

    # p "I surrender."
    p "我投降。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4149
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_2874a799:

    # "He pauses, then chuckles. {w}He seems surprised he did."
    "他顿了顿，然后轻笑了一声。{w}他似乎对自己笑出来感到惊讶。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4153
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_4198b574:

    # w "Ever the bloody idiot, aren't you?"
    w "你永远都他妈是个白痴，对吧？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4155
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_94a05c79:

    # p "Old habits die hard, I guess. But I still can't believe you don't do anything all day, when you're off duty. {w}I mean, you feed the cats. That is doing something."
    p "我猜积习难改吧。但我还是不信你下班后整天什么都不做。{w}我是说，你喂猫。那也算做事。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4157
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_18df316c:

    # p "Come on, Wolf. I deserve at least a little respect."
    p "行了，Wolf。我至少该得到一点尊重吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4161
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d742f89c:

    # "Wolf sighs, exasperated."
    "Wolf叹了口气，很是恼火。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4163
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d371d0cb:

    # w "Okay, fine. I also flip my coin in the air. {w}A lot."
    w "好吧，好吧。我还往空中抛硬币。{w}经常抛。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4165
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_c2de58f7:

    # p "... {i}Wolf...{/i}"
    p "... {i}Wolf...{/i}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4169
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_5301bdbf:

    # w "All right, all right! Ugh... {w}It's mostly this."
    w "好啦，好啦！呃……{w}主要是这个。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4171
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_1fffdf3f:

    # "He reaches for a pocket in his breeches. You hear the coin clinking."
    "他伸手探向马裤口袋。你听到硬币叮当作响。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4173
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_476c6e02:

    # "He then pulls out some kind of wooden rod."
    "然后他掏出一根木棍似的东西。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4175
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d25e57ab:

    # "No, wait. It's..."
    "不，等等。这是……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4179
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_a28544e3:

    # p "The fife?"
    p "六孔竖笛？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4181
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_f1da597a:

    # "Wolf nods."
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4183
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_15b8b284:

    # w "I practice. Quietly."
    w "我会练习这个。不过是悄悄地。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4185
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ade9de61:

    # p "Didn't expect you to give up. But I have to say, I can't remember seeing you pulling it out since... well, the last time I saw it."
    p "我从没觉得你会放弃，不过不得不说……自打上回见过之后，我好像再没见你吹过了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4189
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_232fcb57:

    # w "The 'quietly' part was the important part."
    w "“悄悄地”这部分才是重点。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4191
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_a13e5f68:

    # "You nod. Leave it to Wolf to find a way to be unnoticeable even when playing music on a ship."
    "你点点头。也就Wolf能在船上吹奏音乐时还不引人注意。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4193
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_25a49310:

    # p "Can I hear?"
    p "我能听听吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4197
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_08ec9ff5:

    # w "Haven't we been through this already? I'm not a circus attraction."
    w "我们不是已经谈过这个了吗？我又不是马戏团里杂耍的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4199
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_49c72295:

    # p "Yes, but..."
    p "是的，但是……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4203
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_0f6ae0df:

    # p "I don't know. That feels like years ago, by this point."
    p "我不知道。现在感觉那像是几年前的事了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4205
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_02ceb8aa:

    # p "I'd be very curious to see your progress since then."
    p "我很想看看你从那以后进步了多少。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4209
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_78cb017a:

    # "Wolf closes his eyes. You think you heard him take a deep breath, but with how much care he puts into making as little noise as possible, it's hard to tell."
    "Wolf阖上眼。你以为听见他深吸了口气，可他向来动静极轻，难以分辨。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4213
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_25898628:

    # "Then, without saying anything, he puts the fife to his lips."
    "接着，他什么也没说，把竖笛凑到唇边。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4215
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_dc2550f3:

    # "It's a surprising sound. Raw, unfiltered."
    "笛声出人意料。粗粝，未经雕琢。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4217
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_47bc34bc:

    # "The lack of breath control makes it come across as wild. He loses himself in the music, then finds himself again, then wanders in search of an emotion, a thought to chase for the rest of his performance."
    "气息缺乏控制让它听起来狂放不羁。他在乐声中迷失，复又寻回自己，继而游荡着追逐某种情绪、某个念头，直至曲终。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4219
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_3b06d4ea:

    # "You've never heard music played like this before. It's different. It's unique."
    "你从未听过这样的演奏。它如此不同，独一无二。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4221
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_90b93b6a:

    # "It's..."
    "这……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4226
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_de95bb14:

    # w "It's bad. I know."
    w "它很糟。我知道。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4234
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8d4e2726:

    # p "It's not bad at all! You're very confident for a beginner."
    p "一点也不糟！作为一个初学者，你很有底气了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4236
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_6401e943:

    # p "Give yourself some time. I think it's a promising start."
    p "给自己一点时间。我觉得这是个很有希望的开始。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4240
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_1fbc90aa:

    # w "Did Arthur's shouting turn you deaf? I'm awful!"
    w "Arthur的吼叫把你震聋了吗？我吹得烂透了！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4242
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_16a60eed:

    # w "I sound like a dying cat! It's horrible. It's not confident at all."
    w "我吹得像只快死的猫！太难听了。根本谈不上有什么底气。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4244
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_f7d72c3a:

    # w "Sure, I can make the sound come out. Every once in a while. {w}But it's not enough."
    w "没错，我是能让它发出声音。偶尔能。{w}但这还不够。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4250
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ab8c8e53:

    # p "I can't lie. It's abysmal."
    p "我不能撒谎。简直糟透了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4252
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_f1da597a_1:

    # "Wolf nods."
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4254
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_871cb9b5:

    # w "I'm still terrible. Not much to say about that."
    w "我还是很烂。没什么好说的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4256
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_781a6a6b:

    # p "You're still a beginner. Give yourself time, you'll improve eventually."
    p "你还是个初学者。给自己时间，你最终会进步的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4260
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8337703c_14:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4264
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_268e149d:

    # w "Bloody hell. Let's face reality here."
    w "真见鬼。咱们面对现实吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4268
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_e7799ee8:

    # w "I can't remember where to put my fingers. I can barely remember how the tune goes."
    w "我记不住手指该放哪儿。我连调子都快记不清了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4270
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_46a51e2b:

    # w "It's so frustrating. I've been playing this bloody thing every day for the past couple of weeks and... Nothing."
    w "太让人沮丧了。过去几周我每天都在摆弄这该死的东西，结果……毫无长进。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4272
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_3d0f99a2:

    # w "I've nothing to show for it. I just can't get it into my head."
    w "我没有任何长进。我就是没法把它装进脑子里。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4275
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_c4788cc9:

    # w "Julian made it look easy. Hell, the cook's made it look easy. I only got it once that lizard got his fingers all over my face."
    w "Julian吹起来显得很容易。见鬼，连厨子吹起来都显得很容易。我只在当初那只蜥蜴把手指糊了我一脸的时候成功过一次。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4279
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d5249308:

    # w "Sometimes I'm able to pull out a decent sound. Almost play the entire thing start to finish."
    w "有时候我能吹出像样的声音。几乎能从头到尾吹完一整首。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4283
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_6c83f458:

    # w "And then... It's like I can't recall any of it. Goes right out the window when I try."
    w "然后……就好像我全忘了。一试就全抛到九霄云外。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4285
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_4af166e6:

    # "His hands tremble slightly. You wouldn't be able to notice weren't for the tip of the fife exaggerating that shaking in the sun."
    "他的手微微颤抖。要不是竖笛的尖端在阳光下放大了那颤抖，你根本不会察觉。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4292
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ee643dc6:

    # "You shuffle your paws into the sand, awkwardly."
    "你尴尬地用爪子拨弄着沙子。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4294
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_cca7152d:

    # p "Maybe... the fife just isn't your instrument."
    p "也许……竖笛根本不适合你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4296
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_7b7a3c8c:

    # w "It has to be. At some point."
    w "它必须适合。总有一天会适合的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4303
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_db1f5e1a:

    # p "Why?"
    p "为什么？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4305
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_95d3a3e3:

    # w "Take a wild guess."
    w "你猜猜看。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4307
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_875ce35a_13:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4309
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_4afd8393:

    # "You think back to the first time you saw that instrument. The first time it slipped out of Wolf's pocket, way back at the beginning of your journey."
    "你回想起第一次见到那乐器的情景。早在旅程伊始，它从Wolf口袋里滑落出来的那一刻。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4311
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_7150f807:

    # "When he said where he got it from. A gift."
    "当他提到它是从哪儿来的。一份礼物。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4313
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_c0f50a5a:

    # "A gift he didn't want to leave behind."
    "一份他不愿舍弃的礼物。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4315
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_fd5f55ba:

    # p "Oh."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4317
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8337703c_15:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4319
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d68da6a5:

    # p "I... can imagine the frustration."
    p "我……能想象那种挫败感。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4321
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8337703c_16:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4325
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_cacc8632:

    # w "No, you can't. You can't imagine it."
    w "不，你不能。你无法想象。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4327
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_54af37e0:

    # w "Trust me when I say, there is no way in hell you can imagine it."
    w "相信我，你他妈的绝对无法想象。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4329
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ace7a378:

    # w "Look... {w}Let's just stop this conversation where we're at, shall we?"
    w "听着……{w}我们就到此为止，别谈这个了，好吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4331
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_875ce35a_14:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4333
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_e88a0767:

    # p "Sorry."
    p "抱歉。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4337
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_bad47229:

    # "Wolf grunts in response, before going back to staring at the waves."
    "Wolf咕哝了一声作为回应，然后继续凝视着海浪。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4344
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_92b88721:

    # "You do the same."
    "你也一样。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4348
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_a3ae776e:

    # "He slips the fife back into his breeches. You hear the sound of a metal coin hitting wood, again."
    "他把竖笛滑回马裤口袋。你又听到一枚金属硬币撞击木头的声响。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4350
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d8e3f8a5:

    # "His lips curve into a sad smile."
    "他的嘴角弯出一抹苦笑。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4352
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_6494338c:

    # w "Heh... {w}It's funny."
    w "呵……{w}真好笑。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4354
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_21172b5e:

    # w "This fife wasn't even meant to be important. Just a stupid joke."
    w "这竖笛本来根本不重要。只是个愚蠢的玩笑。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4356
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_a134090a:

    # p "A joke?"
    p "玩笑？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4358
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_04264803:

    # "Wolf sniffs before nodding a confirmation."
    "Wolf吸了吸鼻子，然后点头确认。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4360
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_caa3a4a6:

    # w "It's no family heirloom or promise of love. Just a stupid joke someone pulled on me."
    w "它不是传家宝，也不是爱情信物。只是某人对我开的一个愚蠢玩笑。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4362
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_91253ce3:

    # w "Now it's almost all I have left."
    w "现在它几乎是我仅剩的一切了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4369
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_cdf72669:

    # "You're tempted to prod for more. You are so tempted."
    "你很想继续追问下去。你非常想。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4371
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_79d7bdfa:

    # "More details. More names, dates, any kind of information to make more sense of his stories."
    "更多细节。更多名字、日期，任何能让他故事更清晰的信息。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4376
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_fdd72968:

    # "About what kind of joke that was meant to be. And if it worked."
    "关于那原本是个什么样的玩笑。以及它是否管用了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4378
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_53d97144:

    # "And who was the person he's doing this for."
    "还有他做这一切是为了谁。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4385
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_cb64e404:

    # "And..."
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4387
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_e81efaa7:

    # "Wait..."
    "等等……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4389
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ffc72987:

    # p "Is that... Torres?"
    p "那是……Torres吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4391
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_2d9d3545:

    # "Further on the beach, a very feathery shape lies motionless between the sand and rocks."
    "沙滩更远处，一团羽毛蓬松的身影一动不动地伏在沙石之间。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4398
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_c870a633:

    # "The sun now angles in a way that makes his various accessories and decorations shine right into your eyes, making him impossible to miss."
    "此刻阳光的角度让他身上各式佩饰与缀物正好直刺进你们眼里，想不注意都难。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4400
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_909ec9b2:

    # "He's lying there, unmoving.{w} Absorbed in thought and memories, neither of you noticed him before."
    "他一动不动地躺在那儿。{w}沉浸在思绪与回忆里的你俩先前都没发现他。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4404
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_020b8bad:

    # "Without saying a word, both you and Wolf interrupt the moment to check on the falcon's state. More urgent matters are at hand."
    "你们和Wolf一言不发，同时中断了当下的气氛，前去查看那只猎鹰的状况。眼下有更要紧的事。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4415
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_c7fad90a:

    # "The two of you get up and reach him as fast as you can."
    "你们俩站起身，以最快的速度赶到他身边。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4417
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d3901422:

    # w "Torres? Are you all right?"
    w "Torres？你还好吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4421
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_bd3e7969:

    # "Belly-up in the sand, the falcon mumbles a few words you can't make out."
    "他肚皮朝天瘫在沙地上，含糊嘟囔着些听不清的话。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4423
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_5b4567ca:

    # "You both look down with a quizzical expression. {w}Wolf tilts his head."
    "你们俩低头投去疑惑的目光。{w}Wolf歪了歪脑袋。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4425
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_4e352f75:

    # "Torres makes a whistling noise."
    "Torres发出一声尖啸。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4427
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_179bcbb1:

    # "Wolf replies with a grunt."
    "Wolf回以一声咕哝。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4431
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_2909929d:

    # w "Come on, you overgrown pigeon. Up you go..."
    w "拜托，你这只傻大个儿鸽子。快起来啊……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4438
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_6cca9995:

    # "The two of you help the bird back on his feet."
    "你们俩把这只鸟扶了起来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4440
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_b8834ed2:

    # "You hold him by the arm to make sure he doesn't fall. He's unsteady, unsure, but otherwise unharmed."
    "你扶着他的胳膊以防他摔倒。他摇摇晃晃，站不太稳，但除此之外没受什么伤。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4442
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_e911f008:

    # "He also smells of alcohol and perfume in equal measures."
    "他身上还混杂着同样浓烈的酒气和香水味。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4448
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_1080a979:

    # t "Tha... thank you, lads. Whew... Wild night."
    t "谢……谢谢了，伙计们。呼……昨晚可真够疯的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4452
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8c52a548:

    # t "I, hah... May have had one drink too many... But if that's not the sign of a—ow, my head..."
    t "我，哈……可能多喝了一杯……但要不是——哎哟，我的头……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4456
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ca8f66d0:

    # p "Easy there, Torres. Find your balance."
    p "慢点，Torres。找到你的平衡点。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4458
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_48281472:

    # t "Pah!"
    t "呸！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4460
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_9a40b62b:

    # t "What do you know about balance, you... {i}como se llama...{/i} you absolute... {w}Whoa..."
    t "你懂什么平衡，你这个……{i}como se llama...{/i}（西班牙语：你叫什么来着）你这彻头彻尾的……{w}哇啊……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4471
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_b7bd10d9:

    # "He staggers. You catch him just in the nick of time."
    "他一个趔趄。你及时扶住了他。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4477
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_32ff8877:

    # "Talk about three sheets to the wind. The sheets have fully come off and must be well on their way to Galicia."
    "真是醉得不轻。这何止是帆被吹跑，简直是连桅杆都一起吹到加利西亚去了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4479
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_f6b0d77f:

    # "You've never seen him like this before. Not that you spent much time together, but—"
    "你从没见过他这副模样。虽然你们相处时间也不长，但是——"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4483
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_143888e7:

    # t "Hurk...!"
    t "呃呕……！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4485
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_098fce65:

    # "Suddenly, Torres shoves you and Wolf aside."
    "突然，Torres把你和Wolf猛地推开。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4487
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_899c8c4d:

    # "He looks around, holding his beak in his hands. His head stops turning when he realizes the sea is right behind him."
    "他双手捂住喙，环顾四周。当他意识到大海就在身后时，猛地停下了转头的动作。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4497
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8223a3f9:

    # "He stumbles and wobbles before picking up a surprising amount of speed, sprinting toward the water."
    "他跌跌撞撞、摇摇晃晃，却以惊人的速度冲向了海水。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4499
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_7db0fe55:

    # "Then he reaches the edge of the shore and, well..."
    "然后他跑到岸边，接着，嗯……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4501
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_34afa7a8:

    # "All that alcohol went down, it was only bound to come back up eventually."
    "灌下去那么多酒，总归是要吐出来的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4510
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_881b7948:

    # "You respectfully turn the other way."
    "你礼貌地转过身去。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4512
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_45c5f9e2:

    # "Wolf doesn't."
    "Wolf没有。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4514
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_54767662:

    # w "Sigh..."
    w "唉……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4516
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_4e0395da:

    # "You hear a half-grunted swear in Spanish, the sound of rustling sand, then the impact of a body hitting the beach. Then a half-gurgled, more complete swear."
    "你听见一句含混的西班牙语咒骂，沙粒翻动的窸窣声，接着是躯体砸在沙滩上的闷响。随后又是一声更完整些的、混着唾沫的怒骂。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4518
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8337703c_17:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4520
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_875ce35a_15:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4522
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8337703c_18:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4524
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_046127fe:

    # "You're tempted to turn around, but Wolf cuts in."
    "你忍不住想回头，但Wolf插话了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4528
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_5c95a9f8:

    # w "Okay... okay."
    w "好了……好了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4530
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_473c9321:

    # w "Wait here. I'll take care of it."
    w "在这儿等着。我来处理。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4532
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_87febfad:

    # w "Oughta make sure he isn't choking on it. I've seen it happen."
    w "得确保他没被呛到。我见过那种事发生。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4534
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d76a11a6:

    # w "Be back soon."
    w "马上回来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4545
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_b18925f4:

    # "He then leaves, muttering something about how Torres' fancy clothes won't get the same level of attention."
    "他一边离开，一边嘟囔着Torres那身花哨衣服可不会得到同等的关照。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4549
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_e04cc997:

    # "You watch him bend down and roll Torres on his side, looking at him with reluctant care."
    "你看着他弯下腰，把Torres侧翻过来，看向他目光里带着不情不愿的关切。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4551
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_10892037:

    # "You also notice Torres grabbing his arm and dragging him close, muttering something to him."
    "你还注意到Torres抓住他的胳膊，把他拉近，对他低声说着什么。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4553
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_e6e157bf:

    # "You point your ears. It's hard to make out from this distance, but Wolf doesn't seem to understand either."
    "你竖起耳朵。离这么远很难听清，但Wolf似乎也没听懂。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4555
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d8338817:

    # "Torres solves the issue by gripping Wolf's arm even tighter and loudly restating his message."
    "Torres把Wolf的胳膊抓得更紧，大声地重复了他的话，解决了这个问题。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4557
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_32bdb028:

    # t "I SAID YOU'RE TOO NICE TO ME, GOD DAMN IT! I DON'T DESERVE IT!" with vpunch
    t "我说你对我太好了，该死的！我不配！" with vpunch

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4562
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_35980158:

    # "He drags Wolf into a forceful hug on the sand, to the clear disgust of his unwilling lupine companion."
    "他在沙地上强行把Wolf拽进一个拥抱，这显然让他那位不情愿的狼同伴感到厌恶。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4564
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_76c036b7:

    # "Wolf tries to free his arm, to no avail. He switches tactics, aiming to appease Torres with an awkward pat on the back."
    "Wolf试图挣脱胳膊，但无济于事。他转换策略，笨拙的拍了下Torres的背，试图安抚他。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4566
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_0ac1e0fb:

    # "The bird tries to peck Wolf on the face. Wait, maybe it's a kiss on the cheek? He is Spanish, after all. That's something they do, right?"
    "那只鸟试图啄Wolf的脸。等等，也许是想亲脸颊？他毕竟是西班牙人。他们就是会那样做的，对吧？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4568
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d6f354e7:

    # "Hard to tell from this distance. Wolf nevertheless evades it with trained precision, grabbing his beak with a paw. Torres emits a muffled whistle that slowly turns into a whine."
    "离这么远很难分辨。但Wolf还是以训练有素的精准躲开了，用爪子抓住了他的喙。托雷斯发出一声闷闷的哨音，慢慢变成了呜咽。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4570
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_e3bd22b0:

    # "You chuckle. They'll be all right."
    "你轻声笑了。他们会没事的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4572
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d57693b0:

    # "You watch his still-half-drunken attempts at gratefulness with great amusement for a few more minutes."
    "你又饶有兴致地看了几分钟他那仍然半醉的、试图表达感激的举动。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4577
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d8ef4783:

    # "Until a hand on your shoulder makes your hackles raise." with vpunch
    "直到一只手搭上你的肩膀，让你寒毛直竖。" with vpunch

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4579
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_4409a55b:

    # "{i}Cold. Too cold{/i}, screams something in your brain. Way too cold."
    "{i}冷。太冷了{/i}，你脑子里有个声音在尖叫。冷得过分。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4590
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d7cbbd90:

    # "You turn around, a startled expression on your face."
    "你转过身，脸上带着惊愕的表情。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4592
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_b120de3a:

    # "In front of you: a gentleman, snake no doubt."
    "在你面前：一位绅士，无疑是条蛇。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4594
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_acebcdc5:

    # "It's hard to place his age, but his demeanor seems friendly. He isn't smiling, but nothing in his behavior suggests he might be peeved at you."
    "很难判断他的年龄，但他的举止似乎很友善。他没有笑，但他的行为举止中没有任何迹象表明他对你有所不满。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4596
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_e3887ba1:

    # "Interesting choice of clothing too. Elegant but practical, much more than Nomax's usual attire."
    "衣着也选得有意思。优雅又实用，比Nomax平时的装束考究得多。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4598
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ed600a8c:

    # "The unbuttoned shirt, also, suggests a level of comfort and confidence that the painted dog mostly lacks. {w}And... a very toned and well-maintained body underneath."
    "敞开的衬衫也透出一种从容与自信——这通常是那只彩绘犬所欠缺的。{w}而且……底下是副锻炼得当、保养精良的身躯。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4600
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d7ff63c0:

    # "And when he speaks he surprises you."
    "而当他开口时，他让你吃了一惊。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4602
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_fd88a372:

    # q "Bien le bonjour. Alors comme ça, on s'amuse sur la plage?"
    q "Bien le bonjour. Alors comme ça, on s'amuse sur la
  plage?（法语：日安。看来诸位在沙滩上寻欢作乐呢？）"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4604
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_0a7dcfee:

    # p "Uh... I'm sorry, I..."
    p "呃……抱歉，我……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4606
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_44bc6168:

    # "You think it's French, but you're not sure. Could be Dutch, could be any other European language you know nothing about."
    "你觉得是法语，但你不确定。也可能是荷兰语，或者任何其他你一无所知的欧洲语言。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4608
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_77de8bf9:

    # p "I speak English? Sorry, I know French is probably more common around here. But that's what we speak on the ship."
    p "我说英语？抱歉，我知道在这附近法语可能更常用。但我们在船上就说这个。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4610
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_288d243a:

    # "The snake takes a second too long to reply. Well, that makes sense. Much like he did, you just came at him with an entirely unexpected language. It should take a while for a reply."
    "蛇过了一小会儿才回答。嗯，这说得通。就像他刚才那样，你也是用了一种完全出乎他意料的语言。回答需要点时间。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4614
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d81e71d5:

    # "But when he does, he smiles with an eager and warm grin."
    "但当他回答时，他露出了热切而温暖的笑容。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4618
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_9693de84:

    # q "Ah, {i}un anglais!{/i} I haven't seen many of your countrymen around these parts."
    q "啊，{i}un anglais!{/i} （法语：一个英国人！）在这一带我可少见你的同胞。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4620
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d285893e:

    # q "Please forgive my accent, I don't often get a chance to practice. Those r's are so difficult... Such a fascinating language. Like a juvenile version of German."
    q "请原谅我的口音，我不常有机会练习。那些“r”音太难了……真是迷人的语言。像德语的少年版。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4622
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_88938202:

    # q "But where are my manners! I just met you and I'm already planning to take advantage of your patience. I'm terribly sorry about that."
    q "但我太失礼了！我们才刚见面，我就已经在盘算着要占用你的耐心了。对此我深感抱歉。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4626
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_2d57e853:

    # rs "Please, call me René. René Serrault, scholar.{w} Hopefully the long trip across the sea hasn't {i}completely{/i} wasted my brain."
    rs "请叫我René， René Serrault，学者。{w}希望这趟漫长的越洋之旅没有{i}完全{/i}折腾废我的脑子。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4631
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_3827fbee:

    # "He offers you his hand. You shake it, unsure how to reciprocate the friendly attitude."
    "他向你伸出手。你握了握，不知该如何回应这友好的态度。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4633
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_7efde5a1:

    # "The hand is cold. Very cold. Remarking upon that would be very impolite, though."
    "手很冷。非常冷。不过，对此发表评论会非常不礼貌。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4635
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_2cd683f5:

    # p "[name], [name] [family_name]. I'm, uh... a sailor."
    p "[name], [name] [family_name]. 我，呃……是个水手。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4639
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_aea7c741:

    # rs "A sailor? Oh, that makes so much sense! I take it you and the others are on shore leave, yes?"
    rs "水手？哦，这就说得通了！我猜你和另外几位是在上岸休假，对吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4641
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_076baff6:

    # rs "Speaking of, is your friend all right? He seems to be having a, uh... rough morning."
    rs "说到这个，你的朋友还好吗？他看起来，呃……早上过得有点艰难。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4652
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_7c2b9093:

    # "You look at Torres and Wolf. The bird, still lying on the sand, seems to be recounting some kind of story, tears swelling in his eyes. Wolf looks like he's about ready to strangle him."
    "你看向Torres与Wolf。那只鸟还躺在沙地上，似乎在讲述某种故事，眼里噙着泪水。Wolf看起来已经做好掐死他的准备了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4663
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_1414f5fd:

    # p "He's fine. I think he just drank one too many."
    p "他没事。我想他只是喝多了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4667
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_f609f900:

    # rs "Ah, that's too bad. Never overestimate your own body. You rarely end up the victor."
    rs "啊，那太糟糕了。永远不要高估自己的身体。你很少能成为赢家。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4669
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_cd46ebbc:

    # rs "I myself try to stop early. I know I can't hold my alcohol as well as you sailors can. {w}And, well... A scholar's stipend rarely pays enough for a significant tab."
    rs "我自己会尽量早点停。我知道我不像你们水手那么能喝。{w}而且，嗯……学者的津贴很少够付一大笔酒账。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4671
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_b30d0abf:

    # p "Oh, I'm not much of a drinker myself. I'm still figuring out exactly where my limit lies."
    p "哦，我自己也不太能喝。我还在摸索自己的酒量极限到底在哪儿。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4673
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_f7c2a278:

    # p "By the way, your English is impeccable. Much better than I'd have expected from your introduction."
    p "顺便说一句，你的英语无可挑剔。比你自我介绍时我预想的要好得多。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4677
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_3654f2a9:

    # "A joyous smile makes itself even larger on the snake's lips. You chuckle and smile back in response."
    "蛇的嘴角绽放出更加灿烂的喜悦笑容。你轻笑一声，也报以微笑。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4679
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ea8b0d1e:

    # rs "Why, thank you! That's mighty kind of you. I'm just fortunate to have been blessed with a good memory."
    rs "哎呀，谢谢！你真是太客气了。我只是很幸运，记忆力还不错。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4683
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_f8088854:

    # rs "If I may ask, what ship do you hail from? I remember seeing some vessels from the Kingdom at the docks."
    rs "如果可以问的话，你来自哪艘船？我记得在码头看到过几艘来自英国的船只。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4685
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_246c96fc:

    # p "Ah, we're from the Conway. We only made land yesterday, you might not have even seen it yet."
    p "啊，我们来自Conway。我们昨天才靠岸，你可能还没看到它。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4687
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_32d3bf6b:

    # "The snake nods enthusiastically."
    "蛇热切地点点头。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4689
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_e258bc2a:

    # rs "The Conway! But of course, of course. What a beautiful name. Really rolls off the tongue."
    rs "“Conway”！当然了，当然了。多美的名字。读起来真顺口。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4691
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_a6f48788:

    # rs "Conway.{w} Cooohn-way.{w} Con-wah-ee."
    rs "康威。{w}康——昂——威——。{w}康——威——诶。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4693
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_466f65d7:

    # "You find yourself laughing. What a weird guy. Probably a scholar of languages."
    "你发现自己笑了。真是个怪人。可能是个语言学者。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4695
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_f9443c81:

    # p "Come find us at the pier. I'll tell you what the various sails are for. At this point I'm basically an expert."
    p "来码头找我们吧。我会告诉你各种船帆是干什么用的。到现在我基本上算个专家了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4699
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_4d7266b7:

    # "His eyes widen in excitement. You could get used to this, you think."
    "他的眼睛兴奋地睁大了。你觉得你可能会习惯他这样。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4703
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_944d9549:

    # rs "You would? That's fantastic! Ships are so fascinating, but sailors rarely have time for anyone who isn't giving or receiving orders. I'm so intrigued!"
    rs "真的吗？太棒了！船是如此迷人，但水手们很少有时间理会那些不发号施令或不听令的人。我太感兴趣了！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4707
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_c6c8ebfc:

    # rs "Just as long as I'm not getting you in trouble. I know how hard certain officers can be."
    rs "只要不给你惹麻烦就行。我知道有些长官有多难对付。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4709
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_0d3e0293:

    # "{i}Oh, man. You have no idea.{/i}"
    "{i}哦，伙计。你根本不知道。{/i}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4711
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d29ed571:

    # p "Don't worry, it should be fine. I've been meaning to find excuses to beat the boredom anyway."
    p "别担心，应该没问题。反正我也一直想找点借口打发无聊。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4715
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_e6d870e3:

    # "René shakes your hand enthusiastically in agreement. But he pauses suddenly, worry rising on his face."
    "勒内热情地握着你的手表示同意。但他突然停顿了一下，脸上浮现出担忧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4717
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_0b20f63d:

    # rs "Ah, look at me, just yammering away while I should be well on my way."
    rs "啊，看看我，只顾着喋喋不休，我本该赶路的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4719
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ecbfb638:

    # rs "I was supposed to deliver some papers, curse my interest! Then again, without it I probably wouldn't be half the researcher I am."
    rs ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4721
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_545e4b55:

    # rs "Apologies, I should really be going. But I will come to visit at some point!"
    rs "抱歉，我真的该走了。但我会找个时间去拜访的！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4723
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_099f5135:

    # p "Not a problem at all! Try to come right before dinner time. I should be back on the ship by then."
    p "完全没问题！尽量在晚饭前来吧。那时候我应该已经回船上了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4727
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8f7fe3de:

    # rs "It's a date, then!"
    rs "那就说定了！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4733
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_175b84c1:

    # "With a wink and a swish of his tail, René starts a steady walk back towards the city."
    "René眨眨眼，尾巴一甩，迈着稳健的步伐朝城里走去。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4740
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_98eff12e:

    # "What an odd guy, you think. But after seeing the same people over and over for weeks, chatting to someone unknown feels like a breath of fresh air."
    "真是个怪人，你想。但连续几周对着同一批面孔后，和陌生者交谈竟像吸了口新鲜空气。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4747
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_e75766d4:

    # "Someone who still has that sense of wonder and excitement you had when the journey started."
    "这人仍然怀有你启航时那种好奇与兴奋的感觉。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4749
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d31cb806:

    # "You chuckle. All it took was a short chat and you're right back to feeling like when you first set foot aboard the Conway."
    "你轻声笑了。仅仅一次简短的交谈，你就感觉自己仿佛又回到了初次踏上Conway甲板时的样子。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4751
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d88a3c5f:

    # w "Who was that?"
    w "那是谁？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4753
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_86737ad2:

    # "Hidden by his trademark silence, Wolf snuck up on you from the edge of the water."
    "Wolf悄无声息地从水边溜到你身后，他一贯的沉默成了最好的掩护。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4755
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_33400ca7:

    # "He follows René with his eyes. The snake doesn't turn, and doesn't leave his gaze until he's safely hidden by the distant buildings."
    "他用目光追随着René。这条蛇没有回头，直到René的身影安全地消失在远处的建筑群中，他才收回视线。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4757
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_08d98be4:

    # "Not as hidden, Torres is carefully balancing by Wolf's side, one arm firmly held by the canine's hand."
    "Torres也没再瘫着，正被Wolf用手牢牢扶着胳膊，小心翼翼地在他身旁维持平衡。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4759
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_81bdcc04:

    # p "Just another traveling scholar, similar to our passenger. Really funny too."
    p "只是又一位旅行学者，跟我们那位乘客差不多。还挺有趣的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4761
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_75ac222b:

    # p "I told him to come by later to chat about seafaring. {w}Hey, maybe I should introduce him to Nomax. It feels like they'd have lots to talk about."
    p "我让他晚点过来聊聊航海的事。{w}嘿，也许我该把他介绍给Nomax。感觉他们会有很多共同语言。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4763
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_9c2b6402:

    # w "Hmm."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4765
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_2a74a115:

    # "Wolf doesn't add anything else."
    "Wolf没再补充什么。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4767
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_4e51f19f:

    # w "Anyway. That wasn't how I planned for my shore leave to go."
    w "总之。这可不是我计划中上岸休假的样子。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4777
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ef0ce657:

    # "He pulls Torres, shoving him gently but decidedly into your arms."
    "他拽过Torres，温柔但坚定地把他推到你怀里。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4779
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_1db1f8f7:

    # w "We're taking him back to the Conway, now."
    w "我们现在带他回Conway。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4781
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_cb9f52d1:

    # w "Load him on your back. Let's go."
    w "把他背起来。我们走。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4783
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_41311e19:

    # p "What? Why m-"
    p "什么？为什么是——"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4787
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_aa4fb8c2:

    # w "{i}Because{/i} I've already had enough of him for today. That should be justification enough."
    w "{i}因为{/i}我今天已经受够他了。这个理由应该足够了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4789
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_97ccbdf0:

    # "Oh, he's extremely serious. You can see it in his eyes."
    "噢，他无比认真。你能从他眼神里看出来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4794
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ad7ad443:

    # p "All right, Torres. Hop on then..."
    p "好吧，Torres。那就上来吧……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4798
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_cf141e64:

    # "Torres nods. He wobbles over behind you and grabs onto your shoulders."
    "Torres点点头。他摇摇晃晃地走到你身后，抓住了你的肩膀。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4803
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_c6531872:

    # "A small hop and he's on board. You hold his legs, propping him against your back. He holds to you with a tight hug."
    "轻轻一跳，他就上来了。你托住他的腿，让他靠在你背上。他紧紧抱住你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4808
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d1d8e19a:

    # "He's lighter than expected. You suppose it makes sense, for a bird."
    "他比预想的要轻。你觉得这倒也合理，毕竟他是只鸟。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4810
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_7e33fc6d:

    # "His beak rests right on your shoulder."
    "他的喙正好搁在你的肩膀上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4812
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ca8fa411:

    # p "Okay, I think I have him. Hopefully he doesn't start drooling on my shirt."
    p "好了，我想我背稳了。希望他别开始流口水弄脏我衬衫。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4814
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8337703c_19:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4816
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_f39ce53a:

    # w "No point in wasting time then. Let's go."
    w "那就别浪费时间了。走吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4823
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_17ad62fa:

    # "The walk back isn't particularly eventful or noteworthy."
    "回程的路途没什么特别的事发生，不值一提。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4825
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_dce4d5d2:

    # "Seagulls. Locals. Neverending sun. Nothing you'd want to write home about."
    "海鸥。本地人。永无止境的阳光。没什么值得写信给家里说的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4827
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_e60be1bf:

    # "That is, until a beak opens right next to your ear and starts mumbling some words."
    "至少直到一个鸟喙在你耳边张开，开始咕哝些话语之前是这样。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4835
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_aedce946:

    # t "I'm so sorry, lad..."
    t "真的很抱歉，伙计……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4837
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_04c729a2:

    # "The stench of his breath stings, but it's not overwhelming. You smelled worse aboard the ship."
    "他呼吸的臭味有些刺鼻，但还不至于让人无法忍受。你在船上闻到过更糟的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4839
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_7e4af375:

    # t "I... I just..."
    t "我……我只是……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4841
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_b56fb5a7:

    # p "Take it easy, Torres. Happens to the best of us."
    p "没事的，Torres。谁都会有这种时候。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4843
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_01334d60:

    # "You answer without turning to face him and just concentrate on avoiding any of the rocks on the beach."
    "你回答时没有转头看他，只是专心避开沙滩上的石头。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4845
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_10442575:

    # p "No need to say anything. We're crew, after all. We look out for each other."
    p "你不用说什么。我们毕竟是船员。就该互相照应嘛。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4847
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_a7e6d3c5:

    # "The falcon sniffs."
    "这只猎鹰吸了吸鼻子。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4849
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_fe26ec82:

    # t "You're a good sailor, you are. You are..."
    t "你是个好水手，你是。你真是……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4851
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_5de19efb:

    # p "And so are you, that's for sure."
    p "你也是，肯定的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4853
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_cb72f373:

    # t "I know I am!" with vpunch
    t "我知道我是" with vpunch

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4855
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_62403bd2:

    # "The sudden change in tone startles you. Wolf looks back with a raised eyebrow, you mumble a 'no worries' and you're back on your way."
    "他语调的突然转变让你吓了一跳。Wolf挑起眉毛回头看了一眼，你咕哝了一声“没事”，然后继续赶路。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4860
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_5905b05f:

    # t "This... ugh. This isn't about the ship. It's that..."
    t "这个……唉。不是关于船的事。是关于……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4862
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_43bf86ea:

    # t "It's... a little embarrassing..."
    t "是……有点尴尬……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4864
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_9d5f66ad:

    # t "I am, hah... not as popular with the ladies as people think."
    t "我，哈……并不像大家以为的那样受女士们欢迎。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4866
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_04edadf2:

    # "You resist the temptation of rolling your eyes into the back of your skull. Not that he'd be able to see."
    "你忍住了把眼珠翻到后脑勺的冲动。反正他也看不见。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4868
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_37d9a4c0:

    # t "And I... I don't understand why. I bathe, I preen, I dress {i}impeccably{/i}..."
    t "而且我……我不明白为什么。我洗澡，我梳理羽毛，我的穿得也{i}无可挑剔{/i}……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4870
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_1993c6b9:

    # t "Don't get me wrong, I'm no {i}Don Juan{/i}. I don't prey on women. Fun for both of us or none of us, that's my motto."
    t "别误会，我可不是什么{i}唐璜{/i}（注：西班牙民间传说中的风流人物）。我不捕猎女性。要乐就得一起乐，不然就免谈——这是我的座右铭。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4872
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_cf1d3c04:

    # t "Ugh, maybe that's why... I rarely end up ... But I refuse to compromise on that."
    t "唉，也许这就是原因……我很少能……但我拒绝在这方面妥协。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4874
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_5d8342b5:

    # p "That makes you a good guy in my book, Torres."
    p "Torres，在我看来，这让你成了个好人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4876
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_76d14030:

    # t "Thanks, lad. It's just..."
    t "谢了，伙计。只是……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4878
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_f50d508e:

    # t "It's not that it doesn't work. It's just... Well..."
    t "不是说不奏效。只是……嗯……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4883
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_5522e951:

    # t "It seems to only draw in other lads."
    t "这似乎只吸引来其他小伙子。”"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4885
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_875ce35a_16:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4887
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_4dceb520:

    # p "... And?"
    p "……然后呢？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4891
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_cc77677f:

    # "He lets out an angry whistle in your ear, squirming on your back."
    "他在你耳边喷出一声愤怒的尖啸，在你背上扭动挣扎起来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4893
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_b744c8a1:

    # t "What do you mean 'and'?! What are you trying to say?!"
    t "“然后呢”是什么意思？！你什么意思？！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4895
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ff4cf09f:

    # p "Hey! Calm down back there! I'm gonna drop you right where I stand!"
    p "嘿！在后面安静点！不然我马上把你扔在这儿！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4897
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_0f5798d2:

    # "Torres instantly relaxes. You hear him let out a soft, half-whistled 'Owww...,' his sudden movement not having helped with the pounding headache."
    "Torres立刻放松下来。你听到他发出一声轻柔的、半带哨音的“嗷……”，他刚才哪些突然的动作显然没帮上他那抽痛的脑袋。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4899
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d0251972:

    # p "What even happened last night that has you like this?"
    p "昨晚到底发生了什么让你变成这样？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4904
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_4be0156e:

    # p "Some girl at the port questioned your manhood or something? That's an extreme reaction to have, don't you think?"
    p "码头哪个姑娘质疑你的男子气概了还是怎么的？你不觉得你反应也太大了点吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4906
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_86c5f3c4:

    # t "It wasn't anything of the sort. I just..."
    t "完全不是那种事。我只是……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4908
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_db4ba576:

    # t "I just... I met this man."
    t "我只是……我遇到了一个男人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4910
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_38790c3a:

    # t "He saw me at the bar. Bought me a few drinks."
    t "他在酒吧看见了我。请我喝了几杯。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4912
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_cfe5a30f:

    # t "He started asking me about, hah... about how exciting life at sea was. About the Conway and what happened on our trip..."
    t "他开始问我，哈……问海上生活有多刺激。问Conway和我们旅途中发生的事……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4914
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_02e59ca0:

    # t "Asked me about the other sailors and... Was curious about Wolf. There's a mysterious guy. But I couldn't tell him much about him."
    t "问我其他水手的事……还对Wolf很好奇。那家伙很神秘。但我对他了解不多，说不了什么。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4916
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_3e7bd5c2:

    # t "He was just... I could have talked to him for hours. His questions were so thought-provoking! About loneliness, pride, just... an infinite number of things."
    t "他只是……我可以跟他聊上好几个小时。他的问题都发人深省！关于孤独、骄傲，只是……无数的事情。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4918
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_29770433:

    # t "We talked about Parisian fashion and, and {i}picaresca{/i} novels. I've never met anyone else who knows about that!"
    t "我们聊了巴黎的时尚，还有，还有{i}流浪汉小说{/i}（注：西班牙的一种小说体裁）。我从没遇到过其他知道这个的人！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4920
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_1470e348:

    # t "And then he, uh...{w} Invited me to his room."
    t "然后他，呃……{w}邀请我去了他的房间。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4922
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_875ce35a_17:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4924
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_49cfeb79:

    # p "... For more chatting?"
    p "……为了继续聊天？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4926
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_110113e6:

    # "His silence tells you everything you need to know."
    "他的沉默告诉了你所有你需要知道的信息。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4931
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_46c64ad6:

    # p "Well, uh... {w}Did you enjoy it?"
    p "好吧，呃……{w}你很享受吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4933
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_3ae5f7b6:

    # t "I'm not going to give you details! Bloody hell!"
    t "我不会告诉你细节的！该死的！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4935
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_68c8fb52:

    # t ". . ."
    t ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4937
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_c54e9606:

    # "You feel his grip on your chest tighten."
    "你感觉他抱在你胸前的手臂收紧了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4939
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_5341ac40:

    # t "Maybe? I..."
    t "也许吧？我……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4941
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ef8cb7c4:

    # t "I'm not sure..."
    t "我不确定……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4943
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_97b31eeb:

    # t "I definitely didn't want him to stop, and he didn't..."
    t "我肯定不想让他停下，而他也没有……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4945
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_68c8fb52_1:

    # t ". . ."
    t ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4947
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_aced6fdb:

    # t "You're a good listener, lad."
    t "你是个很好的倾听者，伙计。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4949
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_fc65c61f:

    # "You'd love to say that dealing with Wolf taught you the value of silence. You can't deny, however, that what's kept you quiet has more to do with dragging an adult member of the crew on your back in full northern African heat."
    "你很想说，与Wolf打交道教会了你沉默的价值。但你不得不承认，让你保持安静的更多是因为在北非的酷热中，你正背着一个成年船员。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4954
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_38803ca5:

    # "A lighter one than most, but still. And, well... you have to reply something, by now."
    "虽然是比大多数人都轻的一个，但终究是个负担。而且，嗯……现在你总得说点什么。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4956
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_10b728bc:

    # p "{i}Huff{/i}—I try. But, really..."
    p "{i}呼——{/i}我尽力吧。但是，说真的……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4958
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_5418ca33:

    # p "I don't think you should worry. Just go with what you feel, I say."
    p "我觉得你不该担心。跟着感觉走就行了，我是这么想的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4960
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_60c01f32:

    # p "If it doesn't work, then stop. If it does, just... keep going, I suppose?"
    p "如果感觉不对，那就停下。如果感觉对了，那就……继续下去？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4962
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_c0d521ab:

    # p "Only... You should feel confident. Try things because you want to, not because someone else does."
    p "只是……你应该自信点。试着做些你自己想做，而不是别人想做的事。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4964
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_6bbb16e8:

    # p "Hey, you said it, didn't you? Both of us or none of us, right?"
    p "嘿，这话不是你说的吗？要乐就得一起乐，不然就免谈，对吧？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4966
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_694ddee4:

    # p "Right?"
    p "对吧？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4968
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_875ce35a_18:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4970
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_08587e44:

    # p "... Torres?"
    p "... Torres?"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4972
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_04956b2c:

    # "The bird snores on your cheek in response."
    "回应你的是这只鸟在你脸颊边响起的鼾声。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4977
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_c15856a6:

    # w "Hey. You okay back there? I'm not planning to get back by sundown."
    w "嘿。你那边还好吗？我可没打算天黑才回去。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:4979
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_b07b188c:

    # "Okay. Let's drag this sack of potatoes home, you think."
    "好吧。看来得把这袋土豆拖回家了，你想。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5006
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_82ef81e8:

    # k "Ach. Poor lad..."
    k "唉。可怜的伙计……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5010
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_4cd15bb3:

    # k "Ye did the right thing tellin' me. I'll take him off yer back."
    k "你告诉我是对的。我来把他从你背上弄下来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5014
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_7c900a1f:

    # "Konrad pats the bird on the shoulder, an understanding look in his eyes. He's seen many a sailor at their best and worst moments."
    "Konrad拍了拍鸟儿的肩膀，眼中流露出理解的神情。他见过太多水手在巅峰和低谷时的样子了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5016
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_1588f124:

    # "You kept what Torres told you to yourself. You're pretty sure he doesn't want anyone else to know."
    "你把Torres告诉你的事都藏在了心里。你相当确定他不想让其他人知道。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5020
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_96a7998f:

    # k "He's not a bad guy, not a bad guy at all. He's got no problem. I've seen him like this very, very rarely."
    k "他不是坏人，完全不是。他没什么问题。我很少、很少见他这样。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5022
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_e41f2906:

    # k "But I oughta give him an earful. Better I do it than Sam. Or Arthur."
    k "“但我得好好说说他。总比让Sam或者Arthur来说强。”"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5024
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_439cc6a7:

    # k "I'll make sure this won't be a problem in the future. That's for sure."
    k "我会确保以后不会再出这种问题。我可以保证。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5028
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_00d85aeb:

    # "Konrad slaps Torres' face lightly a few times. The bird whistles, brow furrowed, and bats his hand away."
    "Konrad轻轻拍了几下Torres的脸。这只鸟皱着眉，吹了声口哨，把他的手拨开。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5032
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_9d42b60d:

    # k "Awake you are. Can ye walk, lad?"
    k "醒着呐。能自己走不，伙计？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5034
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8bab3664:

    # t "Ugh... Yeah, I think so. Yeah."
    t "呃……嗯，我想可以。可以的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5036
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_700b8222:

    # "Torres holds his head in his hand, drunkenness seemingly replaced entirely by the mother of all hangovers."
    "Torres用手扶着头，醉意似乎已经完全被剧烈的宿醉所取代。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5038
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_272b8c35:

    # "You have no doubt that, if needed, Konrad would be able to carry him to his hammock in his arms with the same ease he carries planks of wood. His question had more to do about sparing him the humiliation."
    "你毫不怀疑，如果需要，Konrad能像扛木板一样轻松地把他抱回吊床上。他刚才的问题，更多的是为了顾全他的面子，免他难堪。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5042
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_f2c142d6:

    # k "All right, lads. Enjoy the rest of yer day off."
    k "好了，伙计们。好好享受你们剩下的休息日吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5044
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_60d3cacb:

    # k "I'll make sure he does so as well. Soberly."
    k "我也会确保他能享受的，清醒地。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5054
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_00372a69:

    # "You and Wolf watch them disappear into the bowels of the Conway."
    "你和Wolf看着他们消失在Conway的船舱深处。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5056
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_7b00e7f6:

    # "You've never talked to Torres much. Almost never alone."
    "你很少和Torres交谈，几乎从没有单独聊过。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5058
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_0d60d2de:

    # "Exchanged a few words, mostly. But mainly he was just another part of the crew, whom you chatted with when drinking all together."
    "最多也就交换过几句话。但基本上，他只是船员中的一员，大家一起喝酒时会聊上几句。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5060
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_cb3cc81c:

    # "He's nice. Perhaps a bit too pompous. But you realise you only think that because of his clothing—you haven't seen enough of him to judge."
    "他人不错。或许有点太浮夸了。但你意识到你之所以这么想，是因为他的衣着——你对他了解不够，无法做出判断。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5062
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d42b1d8d:

    # "Yeah, best to keep what he said to yourself. It is very private matters."
    "是啊，他说的那些话最好还是你自己知道就好。那是非常私密的事情。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5067
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ad1ca349:

    # "If he brings the topic up again, you might discuss it. If not, happy to let him pretend it never happened."
    "如果他再提起这个话题，你们或许可以讨论一下。如果他不提，你也乐意让他假装什么都没发生过。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5072
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_40623f12:

    # "And then you're robbed of your thoughts by a voice calling from the pier."
    "然后，你的思绪被码头传来的一个声音打断了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5081
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d06591be:

    # rs "[name], my friend!"
    rs "[name]，我的朋友！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5083
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_a6ef40ed:

    # "Right below the Conway, a familiar figure is waving your way."
    "就在Conway下方，一个熟悉的身影正朝你挥手。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5088
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_53fb5923:

    # "It's René. You wave back, smiling."
    "是勒内。你也微笑着挥手回应。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5092
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_31cbf508:

    # w "Hmm. There's that snake guy from earlier."
    w "嗯。是早些时候的那只蛇。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5094
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_838b0476:

    # p "Oh, yeah. He's really nice. I promised I'd give him the rundown of the ship."
    p "哦，对。他真的很友善。我答应过要带他参观这艘船的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5096
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_3a2214ea:

    # "You wave at him to come aboard. He shakes his head in response."
    "你挥手示意他上船。他却摇了摇头作为回应。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5100
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_da69f28f:

    # rs "{i}Désolé{/i}, friends. I am afraid I cannot set foot inside your beautiful vessel."
    rs "{i}Désolé{/i}（法语：抱歉），朋友们。恐怕我不能踏上你们这艘美丽的船。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5102
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_620a1cd8:

    # p "Aw, that's terrible. I was planning on giving you the tour!"
    p "啊，那太遗憾了。我还打算带你参观呢！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5104
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ab32b3ca:

    # rs "We shall take care of that another day, then! There's always a new dawn, after all."
    rs "那我们改天再安排吧！毕竟，总会有新的黎明。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5108
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_610ea7cb:

    # rs "And hello there, mysterious and brooding stranger! What an interesting coincidence to meet you here."
    rs "还有你好啊，神秘又忧郁的陌生人！在这里遇见你，真是个有趣的巧合。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5110
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_20fb1d1d:

    # "Wolf is indifferent. His gaze is stone, his face sporting the usual look that says a thousand words with a single stare—most of those words being a variation on 'leave me alone.'"
    "Wolf无动于衷。他的目光如石头般冷硬，脸上带着惯常的表情，一个眼神就胜过千言万语——其中大部分都是“离我远点”的各种变体。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5112
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ee9f12e8:

    # w "I don't believe we know each other."
    w "我想我们并不认识。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5116
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_6c96a1a5:

    # "René smiles a contagiously joyous smile."
    "René露出了一个极具感染力的、欢快的笑容。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5118
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8221819d:

    # rs "But of course, a proper introduction is in order. Really, where are my manners?"
    rs "不过当然，正式的介绍是必要的。真是的，我的礼貌去哪儿了？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5124
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_c1ca3562:

    # rs "My name is René Serrault. I am, how do you say... {w}a {i}chasseur de primes.{/i}"
    rs "我的名字是René Serrault。我是，怎么说呢……{w}一个 {i}chasseur de
  primes.{/i}（注：法语直译为“追捕奖金的人”）"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5128
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_993bef03:

    # "There it is."
    "果然如此。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5130
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_f744289d:

    # "Wolf's face is complete stone. Nobody would be able to read any emotion in it."
    "Wolf'的脸完全像石头一样。没人能从上面读出任何情绪。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5132
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_22d3d0c2:

    # "But... you can see something in his eyes now. It took time, it took danger, but you're starting to read him."
    "但是……你现在能从他的眼睛里看到一些东西了。这需要时间，需要经历危险，但你开始能读懂他了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5134
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_f5149b5d:

    # "And what you're seeing isn't fear. Or concern. Or even anger."
    "而你看到的不是恐惧。也不是担忧。甚至不是愤怒。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5136
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_885e2d24:

    # "It's shock."
    "是震惊。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5138
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_4a33e718:

    # "And Serrault's gaze is not leaving him."
    "而Serrault的目光没有离开他。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5140
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_9b7520d6:

    # p "Uh, well..."
    p "呃，这个……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5145
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ec9e2915:

    # p "I'm sorry, René. I have to say... I'm not familiar with that term. I've never heard of it before."
    p "抱歉，René。我得说……我不熟悉那个词。我以前从没听说过。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5149
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_0fde4a5c:

    # a "It means {i}'bounty hunter.'{/i}"
    a "它的意思是 {i}“赏金猎人。”{/i}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5158
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_af27b4af:

    # "Arthur makes a sudden entrance, walking his way down the pier."
    "Arthur突然出现，沿着码头走来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5160
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d131a909:

    # "He's angry. You can tell just by the way he walks. And he's carrying more paper under his arm."
    "他很生气。从他走路的样子就能看出来。而且他腋下夹着的文件更多了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5162
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_9ef92593:

    # "He stares daggers at René, but doesn't stop until he's walked over the gangway and solidly on board the Conway, gazing at the snake from above."
    "他用锐利的目光瞪着René，但没有停下脚步，直到他走过跳板，稳稳地登上Conway，从高处俯视着这只蛇。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5164
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_16ec59f9:

    # "The bounty hunter."
    "赏金猎人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5168
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_1b28114b:

    # rs "Oh, that's a terribly uncouth term. {i}'Hunter.'{/i}"
    rs "哦，那是个非常粗俗的称呼。{i}“猎人。”{/i}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5170
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_25cd3536:

    # rs "I am not in the habit of doing this for sport. 'Tis but a job for me, a job I reluctantly have to perform."
    rs "我没有把这当作消遣的习惯。这对我来说只是一份工作，一份我不得不勉强执行的工作。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5172
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_e8afa30e:

    # rs "A calling, that term I shall accept. Certainly not a sport. And most certainly not a game."
    rs "天职，我更能接受这个称呼。这当然不是消遣。更绝对不是游戏。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5174
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_719baa88:

    # rs "Some people fish. Some people ship goods across the ocean.{w} I find people."
    rs "有些人捕鱼。有些人跨海运输货物。{w} 而我，寻找人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5178
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_4be742c0:

    # rs "Ah, but look at me! I'm abusing of your time and good will. {w}Let us conduct our business, then."
    rs "啊，但是，看看我！我在浪费你们的时间和好意。{w}那么，让我们来谈正事吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5180
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_155c1708:

    # rs "I believe those are the last papers you require?"
    rs "我想这些是你需要的最后一批文件了吧？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5184
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_74397bf0:

    # a "That remains to be seen."
    a "这还有待分晓。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5186
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_c842512e:

    # "The snake flicks his tongue, his brow furrowed."
    "蛇吐了吐舌头，眉头紧锁。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5188
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_8a912fda:

    # rs "Je ne tolèrerai pas de discours dilatoires supplémentaires. Il est de mon avis que vous êtes parfaitement informé de la légalité de mes revendications."
    rs "我不容许再有推诿之辞。据我所知，你完全清楚我的诉求具有法律效力。（法语）"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5192
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_b297c099:

    # "His voice is different. Gone is the mellifluous tone and friendly, even suave mannerisms. It's a cold, direct, confrontational sound that offers no opportunity for counter-arguments."
    "他的语气变了。先前那种圆润的语调、友善乃至温文的举止荡然无存。此刻声音冰冷、直接、充满对抗性，不容辩驳。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5194
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_3137d7ce:

    # a "Néanmoins, il reste à débattre que votre présence soit permise sur un navire ne battant point pavillon français. Et un doute raisonnable ne résoudra pas cette question."
    a "然而，您是否被允许停留于一艘未悬挂法国旗帜的船上仍需商榷。合理的怀疑并不能解决此事。（法语）"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5196
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_07e1150e:

    # "Arthur responds in tone. It's not a conversation. It's iron against iron."
    "Arthur以同样的语气回应。这不是对话。是钢铁间的碰撞。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5198
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_87fdd807:

    # "And knowing him, not one you'd like to take to the chest."
    "而且因为了解他，你绝不会想承受这种碰撞。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5200
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_96bfed57:

    # "You have no idea what they're saying. But one thing at least is clear: there is a clash happening before your eyes."
    "你不知道他们在说什么。但至少有一点很清楚：一场冲突正在你眼前发生。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5202
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_ab0a675e:

    # rs "J'estime qu'au point où nous en sommes, il est de mon droit d'exiger une audience auprès du capitaine de ce navire."
    rs "事已至此，我认为我有权要求面见本船船长。（法语）"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5204
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_7bdb00e5:

    # a "Et j'estime que la responsabilité m'incombe encore en ce qui concerne les membres subalternes de l'équipage, à moins que des preuves tangibles d'actes criminels ne soient présentées."
    a "然而，我认为在提供确凿犯罪证据前，我仍对船员的从属行为负有责任。（法语）"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5206
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_a6a738b5:

    # a "Preuves dont, selon ces documents, et malgré toutes les pressions diplomatiques auxquelles vous pourriez faire appel..."
    a "而根据这些文件，尽管您可能动用一切外交施压手段……（法语）"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5208
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_0df70b63:

    # a "... vous ne disposez toujours pas."
    a "……您手中依然没有这样的证据。（法语）"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5212
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_3c8017e3:

    # "The bounty hunter winces."
    "赏金猎人退缩了一下。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5214
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_c52761e7:

    # "He seems at a loss for words. The snake looks at the gangway, then at you two."
    "他似乎无言以对。蛇看了看跳板，又看了看你们俩。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5216
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_1bac691e:

    # rs "Lady Luck does indeed favor the daring..."
    rs "幸运女神确实眷顾勇者……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5220
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_835311df:

    # "The earnest smile returns to his face, as he performs a perfect bow for his unwilling audience."
    "真诚的笑容回到他的脸上，他对着他这群不情愿的观众完美地鞠了一躬。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5222
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_bbd3545d:

    # "He doesn't strike you as noble, you think. But a realization suddenly dawns on you."
    "你觉得他并不像贵族。但你突然意识到一点。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5224
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_3d9b7102:

    # "This is a man able to fit in wherever he may go. Be it high society, low society, or no society at all."
    "这是一个无论走到哪里都能融入的人。无论是上流社会、底层社会，还是根本没有社会的地方。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5226
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_791b91a6:

    # rs "Gentlemen, we are blessed to live in interesting times."
    rs "先生们，我们很幸运，生活在一个有趣的时代。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5228
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_d25f94b9:

    # rs "The seas may be calm in this slice of the world, but Europe is abuzz with {i}frénésie{/i}. And nowhere is that more evident than in my beloved motherland."
    rs "世界的这一隅或许风平浪静，但欧洲却充满了 {i}frénésie{/i}（法语：狂热）。而这一点，在我深爱的祖国体现得最为明显。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5232
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_2f6b2672:

    # rs "I will return tomorrow morning with proper, ah... Support for my petition. And a helping hand or two."
    rs "明天早上我会回来，带着合适的，呃……支持我请求的材料。以及一两个帮手。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5236
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_0d1caa32:

    # rs "For now, I bid you {i}au revoir{/i}. "
    rs ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5238
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_47c9b5a3:

    # "A tip of an invisible hat, as a final punchline. His face still with that eager, wholehearted, almost childish expression of warm joy."
    "他做了一个脱帽致意的动作，作为最后画龙点睛般的收尾。他的脸上仍然带着那种热切、真诚、近乎孩子气的温暖喜悦表情。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5240
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_2e7dd9e8:

    # "But before he turns to leave, his eyes fixate on you."
    "但在他转身离开之前，他的目光锁定在你身上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5244
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_e4fc56e1:

    # "And his smile widens."
    "他的笑容扩大了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5246
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_3ccacfd9:

    # rs "Ah... One last thing."
    rs "啊……还有最后一件事。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5248
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_26637921:

    # "His tongue swishes in the air. {i}He's excited{/i}, you think. You don't know how you know this, but you know he's excited."
    "他的舌头在空中摆动。{i}他很兴奋{/i}，你想。你不知道自己是怎么知道的，但你知道他很兴奋。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5250
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_9c470b8d:

    # "Your hackles raise. Your pupils narrow. {i}What is he...{/i}"
    "你寒毛直竖。瞳孔收缩。{i}他想干什么……{/i}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5254
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_f864870a:

    # rs "[name]... {w}Thank you."
    rs "[name]…… {w}谢谢你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5256
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_f0156955:

    # "{i}No...{/i}"
    "{i}不……{/i}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5258
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_b7a1770e:

    # rs "The French government is grateful for your help in identifying the {i}terroriste{/i}. However this may end."
    rs "法国政府感谢你帮助指认了那个 {i}terroriste{/i}（法语：恐怖分子）。无论此事结局如何。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5262
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_72c973e9:

    # rs "It was an incredibly brave thing, secretly joining the crew. No matter what happens, I want you to know... {w}I'm proud of you."
    rs "秘密加入船员队伍，是件极其勇敢的事。无论发生什么，我希望你知道……{w}我为你感到骄傲。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5264
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_f0156955_1:

    # "{i}No...{/i}"
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5266
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_59d52cbf:

    # rs "You can consider your contract fulfilled. Come see me any time for your share of the bounty."
    rs "你可以认为你的合同已经履行完毕。随时可以来找我领取你的那份赏金。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5268
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_26a91699:

    # "Before you can even think of anything to say, he turns his back on the Conway."
    "你还没来得及想好说什么，他就转身背对着Conway。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5270
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_557b59ff:

    # rs "I'll see you tomorrow, gentlemen."
    rs "明天见，先生们。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5274
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_fc4d414f:

    # "And then he's gone."
    "然后他就走了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5285
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_7602245d:

    # "You turn toward Wolf."
    "你转向Wolf。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5287
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_772c2e9a:

    # p "He's lying! I've never seen him before today!"
    p "他在撒谎！在今天之前我从来没见过他！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5289
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_6e27567f:

    # p "He's trying to pit us against each other! Wolf, you have to believe me!"
    p "他想挑拨我们之间的关系！Wolf，你必须相信我！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5291
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_abf7bd07_1:

    # "... is what you wanted to say."
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5295
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_c8de7b2a:

    # "But you freeze like a puddle in winter when you see Wolf's face."
    "但当你看到Wolf的脸时，你像冬天的水坑一样冻住了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5297
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_f40519fa:

    # "And before you can recover from the shock, Arthur cuts through the deathly silence in your head."
    "还没等你从震惊中恢复过来，Arthur就打破了你们脑海中死一般的寂静。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5304
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_1754fe92:

    # a "You two. To the lower decks."
    a "你们两个。到底舱去。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5306
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_6c6aadc2:

    # a "{i}Now.{/i}"
    a "{i}现在。{/i}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5314
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_4788d077:

    # "Arthur turns and leaves without checking if you're following him."
    "Arthur转身离开，没有检查你们是否跟着他。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5316
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_7698c383:

    # "You want to, but your body isn't letting you."
    "你想跟上，但你的身体却不听使唤。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5318
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_36b2d133:

    # "His eyes."
    "他的眼睛。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5322
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_4af2e913:

    # "His gorgeous silvery eyes."
    "他那双漂亮的银灰色眼睛。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5324
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_951c0d68:

    # "They're terrified."
    "它们充满了恐惧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5326
translate Chinese day15_wolf_morocco_torres_6c8c005b:

    # "Of you."
    "是对你的恐惧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5334
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_f86b79c3:

    # "After seconds that feel like centuries, Wolf turns."
    "在感觉像几个世纪那么漫长的几秒钟后，Wolf转过身去。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5339
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_fd3eb58b:

    # "He quietly follows Arthur into the bowels of the Conway. You stand there, frozen, trying to think of what to say. {w}Nothing comes to mind."
    "他默默地跟着Arthur走进了Conway的船舱深处。你站在那里，僵住了，试图思考该说什么。{w}但大脑一片空白。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5341
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_6b52ca7d:

    # "You follow suit."
    "你也跟了上去。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5350
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_d3c11ee5:

    # "It's a short walk down the stairs and into a corridor. {w}Arthur turns back once every few steps to check you are still there. Wolf never does."
    "你们沿着楼梯向下走，穿过一条短廊。{w}Arthur每走几步就回头确认你们还在。Wolf一次都没回头。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5352
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_af2f32b0:

    # "The three of you reach a door, which Arthur opens."
    "你们三人来到一扇门前，Arthur打开了门。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5354
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_0e929282:

    # "The room is relatively bare. There's cupboards, a table, nothing worth caring about in this moment."
    "房间相对简陋。有几个橱柜，一张桌子，并没有什么此刻值得在意的东西。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5356
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_6b4d55f6:

    # a "Wait here. I need to speak to the captain."
    a "在这里等着。我需要和船长谈谈。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5358
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_12abe76c:

    # "You and Wolf follow his orders, entering the room."
    "你和Wolf听从他的命令，走进了房间。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5360
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_4e20b5b4:

    # a "I'll be back soon. Don't leave."
    a "我很快就回来。别离开。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5370
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_42531f5e:

    # "He closes the door behind him. {w}You hear the unmistakable sound of a key being turned, sealing you in."
    "他在身后关上了门。{w}你清楚地听到了钥匙转动的声音，他把你们锁在了里面。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5376
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_00237b19:

    # "You turn to face Wolf."
    "你转身面对Wolf.。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5378
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_300701d2:

    # p "I..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5382
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_55976d4e:

    # w "Shut up."
    w "闭嘴。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5386
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_56de7388:

    # "Wolf closes his eyes."
    "Wolf.闭上了眼睛。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5388
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_09dc47e1:

    # "He stands in a corner of the room, leaning against the wooden planks. Crossed arms, eyes closed, facing down."
    "他站在船舱一角，背靠木板，双臂交叠，垂首闭目。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5390
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_bd15ddbf:

    # "It doesn't take too long for you to realise what he's doing. He doesn't want you to look him in the eyes."
    "没过多久，你就意识到他这么做的用意。他不想让你直视他的眼睛。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5392
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_fa43c30e:

    # "Because, at this point, he also knows."
    "因为，此时，他也已经知道了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5394
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_84bff6c4:

    # "He knows you are the only person able to read him. To tell when he's cross, or tense, or happy. When he's scared."
    "他知道你是唯一能读懂他的人。能看出他何时生气，何时紧张，何时开心。何时恐惧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5396
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_9bee71cc:

    # "And he doesn't want you to do that."
    "而他不想让你这么做。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5398
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_875ce35a:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5400
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_f03eecb6:

    # "The silence lingers."
    "寂静持续蔓延。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5402
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_07cdd52f:

    # "You linger along within it."
    "你在这片寂静中徘徊。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5406
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_ddaddeaa:

    # "When Arthur finally returns, you remember how to breathe properly."
    "当Arthur终于回来时，你才想起该如何正常呼吸。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5412
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_e219ca3f:

    # a "... You. Wait outside."
    a "……你。到外面等着。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5414
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_318f02d7:

    # "You leave the room. No point in arguing."
    "你离开了房间。争辩毫无意义。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5418
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_fc67d604:

    # "Arthur locks the door behind you."
    "Arthur在你身后锁上了门。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5424
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_5c6c58ad:

    # "And there you wait. Cut off from whatever's going to happen to Wolf, or whatever Arthur has planned for solving the situation. {w}Or punishing those involved. {w}Or worse."
    "于是你就在那里等着。对Wolf即将面临什么、Arthur打算如何解决事态{ w}——或如何惩处涉事者{
  w}——乃至更糟的结局，一概无从知晓。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5426
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_cd390510:

    # "You have no way of knowing."
    "你无从知晓。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5428
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_8534ca42:

    # ". . ."
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5430
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_a5cb5de7:

    # "Except..."
    "除非……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5432
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_c37b41f7:

    # "You can hear muffled voices, words made incomprehensible by the thick layer of wood separating you from the conversation."
    "你能听到沉闷的说话声——厚厚的木板将你与对话隔开，使话语变得模糊难辨。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5434
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_c40bd7ab:

    # "It's impossible to tell what they're saying—you can barely tell what emotions are being conveyed. It's worse than fragmentary, it's crumbs of meaning."
    "根本听不清他们在说什么——你甚至几乎无法辨别其中传达的情绪。这比支离破碎更糟，简直是意义的碎屑。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5436
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_1c5ac311:

    # "But... Maybe putting your ear to the door would allow you to get an idea."
    "可是……或许把耳朵贴到门上能听出点眉目。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5438
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_843ad5b1:

    # "You feel ridiculous. Life lately has taken the shape of a penny-a-dozen adventure novel. {w}You used to pine for this kind of excitement."
    "你觉得自己真可笑。近来日子过得像本三流冒险小说。{w}你从前还总渴盼这种刺激。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5440
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_f4d99702:

    # "You press your ear against the wood."
    "你把耳朵贴在了木板上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5446
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_9298f78f:

    # "The words are still muffled, but much easier to make out. You reconnect with the conversation before it's able to reach an ending."
    "话音依然沉闷，但已清晰不少。你在对话结束前重新跟上了节奏。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5448
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_3cf5b881:

    # a "{alpha=0.4}... which has been entrusted to me.{/alpha}"
    a "{alpha=0.4}……已托付于我。{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5450
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_b22d8b44:

    # a "{alpha=0.4}Now... Dedicating your life to the Sea, in search of meaning or redemption, is amongst the noblest pursuits a man can embark on.{/alpha}"
    a "{alpha=0.4}现在……将生命奉献给大海，追寻意义或救赎，是一个人所能从事的最高尚的追求之一。{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5452
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_8786626a:

    # a "{alpha=0.4}I myself understand that meaning well. Better than most, I'd hazard.{/alpha}"
    a "{alpha=0.4}这层意味我自己也明白，恐怕甚至比绝大多数人更明白。{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5454
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_e246bd68:

    # "His tone is heavy with gravitas. "
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5456
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_de96bf80:

    # a "{alpha=0.4}However, using seafaring as an escape from responsibility is something I cannot in good conscience allow on my ship. If, and I wish to stress 'if', these accusations are true.{/alpha}"
    a "{alpha=0.4}然而，将航海作为逃避责任的手段，这是我凭良心无法允许在我的船上发生的事。如果——我希望能强调这个“如果”——这些指控属实的话。{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5458
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_1c7e8355:

    # a "{alpha=0.4}So far, Mr. Hvidt, nothing in your tenure has suggested even the semblance of impropriety. In fact, your overzealousness has been noted—and previously addressed.{/alpha}"
    a "Hvidt先生，迄今为止，您的履职记录中甚至未见任何不当迹象。事实上，您的过度勤勉已被留意——并曾被予以告诫。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5460
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_9498999f:

    # a "{alpha=0.4}Unlike some other wanna-be sailors.{/alpha}"
    a "“不像某些自诩水手的人。”"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5462
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_0a88623e:

    # w "{alpha=0.4}. . .{/alpha}"
    w "{alpha=0.4}……{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5464
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_71c8b60e:

    # a "{alpha=0.4}I shall be direct.{/alpha}"
    a "{alpha=0.4}我就直说了。{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5466
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_0a55f6d2:

    # a "{alpha=0.4}I see before me a man who fears no hardship nor hard work. I see a long, bright future ahead of you in sailing, be it on the Conway or wherever the seafaring life might take you.{/alpha}"
    a "{alpha=0.4}在我面前，我看到的是一个不畏艰辛、不惧劳苦的人。我看到你面前有一条漫长而光明的航海未来，无论是在Conway上，还是航海生活可能带你去的任何地方。{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5468
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_d8c25db0:

    # a "{alpha=0.4}But I cannot turn a blind eye to this matter.{/alpha}"
    a "{alpha=0.4}但我不能对这件事视而不见。{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5470
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_29c2bf7f:

    # a "{alpha=0.4}Therefore I'll ask once, and I demand that you answer truthfully.{/alpha}"
    a "{alpha=0.4}因此我会问一次，并要求你如实回答。{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5472
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_703566a1:

    # "You hear the sound of papers being flipped, then rustling against wood."
    "你听到纸张翻动的声音，然后是纸张在木头上摩擦的沙沙声。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5474
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_2bc84e33:

    # a "{alpha=0.4}Is this person you?{/alpha}"
    a "{alpha=0.4}这个人是你吗？{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5476
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_ee241c08:

    # w "{alpha=0.4}No.{/alpha}"
    w "{alpha=0.4}不是。{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5478
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_b095a1c4:

    # "The answer is instantaneous. You can't perceive even a hint of hesitation."
    "回答立刻传来。你甚至察觉不到一丝犹豫。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5480
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_c65934ef:

    # "And... there's something unnerving about it."
    "而且……这回答有种令人不安的东西。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5482
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_98d24af0:

    # w "{alpha=0.4}Don't know who this is supposed to be. But it's certainly not me.{/alpha}"
    w "{alpha=0.4}不知道这应该是谁。但肯定不是我。{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5484
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_b783f0f1:

    # "It comes to him so easily."
    "他说得如此轻松。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5486
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_301d734a:

    # "He's clearly lying—you know his story. But he's so good at it that there's no way at all to tell, unless you know him. And you know him."
    "他显然在撒谎——你知道他的故事。但他如此擅长此道，以至于除非你了解他，否则根本无从分辨。而你了解他。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5488
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_b8c2203b:

    # "At least, you think you know him. Unless he lied to you with the same ease."
    "至少，你以为你了解他。除非他也曾同样轻松地向你撒过谎。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5490
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_7dd71ac5:

    # "You silence that thought."
    "你压下了这个念头。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5492
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_2f6724de:

    # "Arthur sighs."
    "Arthur叹了口气。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5494
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_bc1ec264:

    # a "{alpha=0.4}I will not deny that I expected this answer, Mr. Hvidt. I did, however, still need to hear it from your own lips.{/alpha}"
    a "{alpha=0.4}赫维特先生，我不否认我预料到了这个回答。然而，我确实仍需要听你亲口说出来。{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5496
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_f788bc5f:

    # a "{alpha=0.4}If you are telling the truth, which I would like to believe you are, then that is the only available option to you.{/alpha}"
    a "{alpha=0.4}如果你说的是实话——我愿意相信你是——那么这就是你唯一的选择。{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5498
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_ecf97942:

    # a "{alpha=0.4}But if you are lying, you would still be denying all allegations as you're dragged off this ship by force. Which means...{/alpha}"
    a "{alpha=0.4}但如果你在撒谎，即使被强行拖下这艘船，你依然会否认所有指控。这意味着……{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5500
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_f9916b7e:

    # a "{alpha=0.4}I will have to rely on someone else to get my answer.{/alpha}"
    a "{alpha=0.4}我将不得不依靠别人来得到答案。{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5502
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_0c066722:

    # a "{alpha=0.4}Send him in.{/alpha}"
    a "{alpha=0.4}让他进来。{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5507
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_71639a16:

    # "You don't need to hear Wolf's steps to know he's heading to the door. {w}You step a few paces away before it opens."
    "你无需听到Wolf的脚步声就知道他正走向门口。{w}你在门开前向后退了几步。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5514
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_162fbf2d:

    # "He nods at you without looking, hinting you should get in the room. So you do."
    "他没有看你，只是朝你点了点头，暗示你应该进房间。于是你照做了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5516
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_ea7fcbc6:

    # "He doesn't say a single word. You don't say a single word."
    "他一言不发。你也一言不发。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5520
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_500c4776:

    # "The door closes behind you."
    "门在你身后关上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5529
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_f1194b75:

    # a "...Runt."
    a "……小不点。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5531
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_09f8a45d:

    # "Arthur says nothing else."
    "Arthur没再说别的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5533
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_06dde493:

    # "You open your mouth to speak. But before you're able to utter a word, Arthur silences you with a gesture."
    "你张开嘴想说话。但在你吐出一个字之前，Arthur就做了个手势让你安静。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5535
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_9a58adc6:

    # a "No."
    a "没有"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5537
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_726d044c:

    # "You steel yourself for one of his speeches. Something about responsibility, danger, how you're worth less than the rustiest nail in the most rotten board of the ship."
    "你绷紧神经，准备迎接他的一番说教。无非是关于责任、危险，以及你比船上最烂的木板里最锈的钉子还不值钱之类的话。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5539
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_8a3ba409:

    # "He says nothing."
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5541
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_977674f9:

    # "He says nothing for what may well be a minute. It feels like an hour.{w} He just sits there, looking at you. Thinking. {w}Thinking?"
    "他沉默了可能有一分钟之久。感觉像过了一个小时。{w}他只是坐在那里，看着你。思考着。{w}思考？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5543
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_9529ba94:

    # "Waiting."
    "等待着。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5547
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_320ad41b:

    # "Just as your nerves start to get the better of you, there's a knocking at the door."
    "就在你的紧张情绪即将占据上风时，敲门声响起。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5552
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_a81b51e7:

    # a "Come in."
    a "进来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5559
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_40b02583:

    # s "Sir. You called?"
    s "长官。您叫我？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5561
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_d9150dbe:

    # "Wolf is leaning against a wall on the other side of the corridor. Still looking downward. Still clammed up in his shell."
    "Wolf靠在走廊另一侧的墙上。仍然低着头。仍然紧闭心扉。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5565
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_8e662af7:

    # a "Please accompany Mr. Hvidt to his sleeping quarters."
    a "请护送Hvidt先生回他的寝舱。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5569
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_31232e44:

    # "Sam looks at him with a puzzled expression, then at you. {w}Then curiosity takes the reins."
    "Sam困惑地看了他一眼，然后又看向你。{w}接着，好奇心占了上风。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5571
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_c7c85ecf:

    # s "Is he under... punitive measures?"
    s "他这是……在受罚吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5573
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_9a58adc6_1:

    # a "No."
    a ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5575
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_3a01042c:

    # s "Should I ask what this is about, sir?"
    s "长官，我该问一下这是怎么回事吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5577
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_9a58adc6_2:

    # a "No."
    a ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5581
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_ae1c19a3:

    # s "Very well."
    s "很好。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5583
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_a7d4f706:

    # "Sam shoots Wolf a suspicious look. But [he]'s diligent, you think. A good sailor. If the first mate says no issues and no questions, then that's how it's going to be. Sam trusts Arthur has a reason for it."
    "Sam朝Wolf投去怀疑的一瞥。但[他]很勤勉，你暗想。是个好水手。既然大副说了不必过问，那就照办。Sam相信Arthur自有其道理。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5590
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_90cdced5:

    # a "Wait."
    a "等等"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5602
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_6a75cbec:

    # "Arthur takes a long look at Wolf from inside the room. {w}He walks up to the doorway, ignoring your presence."
    "Arthur从房间里久久地注视着Wolf。{w}他走到门口，无视了你的存在。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5604
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_808daf79:

    # "Wolf raises his head, eyes locked into his."
    "Wolf抬起头，目光锁定他的眼睛。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5606
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_41c8de55:

    # a "Trust is a complicated thing, Mr. Hvidt."
    a "信任是件复杂的事，Hvidt先生。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5608
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_c1085677:

    # a "Deciding who deserves it can take up the best part of our lives."
    a "决定谁值得信任，可能会占据我们生命中最好的时光。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5610
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_8a76a3c3:

    # a "And making the wrong decision can no doubt be a painful experience."
    a "而判断失误，无疑会是惨痛的教训。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5612
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_1b85320f:

    # a "I am choosing to extend part of mine to you. In turn, I trust you will not attempt to leave the Conway until matters are settled."
    a "我选择将我的一部分信任给予你。相应地，我相信你在事情解决之前，不会试图离开Conway。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5614
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_8337703c:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5616
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_326f6d8d:

    # w "I... {w}Thank you, sir."
    w "我……{w}谢谢您，长官。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5618
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_736d9016:

    # a "In the meanwhile, take a moment to collect your thoughts. You can resume your time off duty afterwards, as long as you remain on board."
    a "同时，花点时间整理一下思绪。之后你可以继续你的休假时间，只要你留在船上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5620
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_5bdca5ed:

    # a "We shall talk again. That is all for now."
    a "我们还会再谈话的。目前就这样。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5627
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_aa0119b0:

    # "Arthur waits until the steps have faded before acknowledging you're also there."
    "Arthur等到脚步声远去，才意识到你也在场。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5629
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_0c79bead:

    # a "And now for the hard part."
    a "现在轮到难办的部分了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5634
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_5f40f95c:

    # "He closes the door. His eyes finally turn your way, scanning you from head to toe. Slowly."
    "他关上门。他的目光终于转向你，从头到脚慢慢地打量着你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5636
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_86135985:

    # "He looks...{w} tired."
    "他看起来……{w}很疲惫。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5640
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_ff31ea2a:

    # a "I think Mr. Hvidt is smart enough to realise that trying to get him to run is part of that bounty hunter's plan."
    a "我想Hvidt先生足够聪明，能意识到试图让他逃跑正是那个赏金猎人计划的一部分。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5642
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_8d990056:

    # a "That the provocations he threw our way were aimed specifically at tempting him into escape. We are being watched from the shore, I assume.{w} That is what I would do, at least."
    a "他向我们抛出的挑衅，目的就是引诱他逃跑。我猜岸上有人在监视我们。{w}至少，换做是我就会这么做。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5644
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_0ec6b952:

    # a "Now."
    a "现在。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5652
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_7e4249ab:

    # "He walks back to the other side of the table, but doesn't sit down."
    "他走回桌子的另一侧，但没有坐下。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5656
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_3d42db83:

    # a "You have made a lot of friends among the crew. I am fully aware of that, and I am also aware of Mr. Hvidt being among them."
    a "你在船员中交了很多朋友。我对此心知肚明，我也知道Hvidt先生是其中之一。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5658
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_825b495a:

    # a "To the point that you two have grown rather... close, lately. Certainly closer than most members of the crew have to him."
    a "以至于你们俩最近变得相当……亲密。你与他的关系肯定比大多数船员与他的关系都要近。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5661
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_6d8aadfe:

    # a "I am fully aware that the two of you have grown rather... close, lately. {w}Or better, closer than most members of the crew who frequent Mr. Hvidt."
    a "我完全清楚你们俩最近变得相当……亲密。{/w}或者说，比大多数常与Hvidt先生来往的船员都要近。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5663
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_10ad1349:

    # a "I have reason to believe he has been confiding to you about his private matters, even, which I am not privy to."
    a "我有理由相信，他甚至向你透露过私事——连我都不知道的那些。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5665
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_30760520:

    # a "I don't expect a man like him to have been exhaustive, nor entirely truthful. Which limits your usefulness in this situation."
    a "我不指望像他那样的人会详尽无遗，或者完全诚实。这限制了你在这种情况下能起到的作用。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5669
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_f9053be6:

    # a "But I also believe that, unlike him, you have pressing need for returning into the good graces of your superior officer."
    a "但我也相信，与他不同，你迫切需要重新获得你上级长官的青睐。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5673
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_8c2e29ba:

    # a "In short: answer honestly and, loathe as I am to admit it, I will consider rehabilitating you in my eyes. A chance I will not be giving you again."
    a "简而言之：诚实回答，尽管我极不情愿承认，但我会考虑重塑对你的看法。这种机会我不会给你第二次。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5677
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_c1e69b41:

    # a "Not just for your actions being part of the crew but your plentiful personal offenses that I had the displeasure to be privy to."
    a "不仅因你在船上的作为，更因你那些我有幸耳闻的诸多私人冒犯之举。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5679
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_9edf445d:

    # "Your ears droop."
    "你的耳朵耷拉下来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5681
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_586ed8a2:

    # a "Both what I've heard from our sugeon and—difficult as it may be to get the image from my mind—the frivolous behaviour between you and our passenger."
    a "既包括我从我们船医那里听到的，也包括——尽管这画面很难从我脑海中抹去——你和我们那位乘客之间轻浮的行为。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5685
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_d49c42b7:

    # a "Both for your actions as part of the crew, and I will even forget—difficult as it may be—the frivolous behaviour between you and our passenger."
    a "既包括你作为船员的行为，我也会尽力忘记——尽管这很难——你和我们乘客之间轻浮的行为。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5689
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_79da8c43:

    # a "Both for your actions as part of the crew, and the personal offenses that our surgeon shared with me."
    a "既包括你作为船员的行为，也包括我们船医与我分享的那些个人冒犯之举。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5691
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_127e0865:

    # a "The question is:"
    a "问题是："

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5695
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_4478890f:

    # a "Though of course it goes without saying that I still expect you to be truthful."
    a "不过，当然不用说，我仍然期望你说实话。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5697
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_3e494c13:

    # a "In any case, what I want to know is:"
    a "无论如何，我想知道的是："

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5701
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_beabb7e6:

    # a "Are you aware of anything that ties Mr. Hvidt to France?"
    a "你是否知道任何将Hvidt先生与法国联系起来的事情？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5703
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_a1d0be65:

    # a "Anything that suggests he might have spent time in that country?"
    a "任何暗示他可能曾在那个国家待过的事情？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5707
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_9459be1c:

    # a "Because if there is, then my hands are more tied than I thought."
    a "因为如果有，那我的手就比我想象的更受束缚了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5709
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_004a7ef4:

    # "You think. But not about the question."
    "你在思考。但不是关于这个问题。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5712
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_ae911fe8:

    # "Of course there is. You've known for a while. Since that dinner on the first day you met."
    "当然有。你早就知道了。自从你们相遇第一天的那顿晚餐起。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5714
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_4c6f3c63:

    # "Since you first took a closer look at that coin."
    "自从你第一次仔细查看那枚硬币起。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5717
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_f06bea78:

    # "Of course there is. You've known for a while. Since you first took a closer look at that coin."
    "当然有。你早就知道了。自从你第一次仔细查看那枚硬币起。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5719
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_73734102:

    # "That unmistakable foreign coin."
    "那枚绝不会认错的外国硬币。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5721
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_5a8951f2:

    # "What you're pondering isn't whether he has ties to France. He does. With evidence."
    "你琢磨的不是他是否与法国有联系。他有。而且有证据。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5723
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_c19d3821:

    # "What you're thinking is whether you want to reveal that information or not."
    "你思考的是你是否想透露这个信息。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5725
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_9ad674fb:

    # "Whether you're willing to break the law for him. {w}Or whatever thing's closest to the law aboard the Conway."
    "你是否愿意为他违法。{w}或者说，在Conway上最接近法律的东西。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5727
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_bcf19719:

    # "Is it worth to already risk what little grace Arthur has given you?"
    "冒着失去Arthur给予你的那点微薄恩惠的风险，值得吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5731
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_14cf76bd:

    # a "Don't rush. Think. Take the time you need."
    a "别急。想想。你需要多少时间都可以。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5733
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_d1c93ddc:

    # a "Any hint at all?"
    a "有任何线索吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5748
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_a9409330:

    # p "He... carries a French coin, sir."
    p "他……持有一枚法国硬币，长官。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5752
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_255c256e:

    # a "On himself?"
    a "带在身上？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5756
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_b402134f:

    # p "S-sometimes, sir. Well, most of the time."
    p "有-有时候，长官。嗯，大多数时候。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5760
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_711b4505:

    # p "S-Sometimes, sir."
    p "有-有时候，长官。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5762
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_f19e0f65:

    # a "Are you sure? How do you know it's a French coin specifically?"
    a "你确定？你怎么知道它就是法国硬币？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5766
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_64a5a7d4:

    # p "He confirmed it to me, sir."
    p "他向我证实过了，长官。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5768
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_d72b82c1:

    # p "But besides, it's hard to miss, sir. It has those French flowers on it."
    p "但除此之外，它也很难被忽略，长官。上面有那些法国花朵图案。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5772
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_13871d95:

    # p "It's hard to miss, sir. It has those French flowers on it."
    p "它很难被忽略，长官。上面有那些法国花朵图案。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5776
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_e168fa2a:

    # "He closes his eyes, his large, strong hands rubbing his face with a suppressed sigh. You don't know if he expected a different answer, but it's clear that he was hoping for one."
    "他闭上眼睛，那双粗壮有力的大手揉着脸，发出一声压抑的叹息。你不知道他是否期待一个不同的答案，但很明显他曾希望如此。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5778
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_4d3bd088:

    # a "I have to say... This is a disappointment."
    a "我不得不说……这真令人失望。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5782
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_c150b9d6:

    # "His eyes wander across the room. You see him resist the temptation to sit and slump back in a chair. He sighs, steeling himself."
    "他的目光在房间里游移。你看到他克制住想坐下、瘫倒在椅子里的冲动。他叹了口气，让自己镇定下来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5784
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_35f9a6e8:

    # a "We are all spiders tangled in different webs of lies. Sometimes we weave, sometimes we strain. Sometimes it's hard to tell where one web ends and another begins."
    a "我们都是纠缠在不同谎言蛛网中的蜘蛛。有时我们编织，有时我们挣扎。有时很难分清一张网在哪里结束，另一张又从哪里开始。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5786
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_7a19115e:

    # a "But I expected more unity from my crew."
    a "但我期望我的船员能更团结一致。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5790
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_99b247c3:

    # a "Your honesty is appreciated. Even though it harbours bad news, know that I am satisfied by your behaviour."
    a "你的诚实值得赞赏。尽管这带来了坏消息，但要知道，我对你的行为感到满意。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5792
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_e21b0ee3:

    # "He doesn't look satisfied, though. Quite the opposite. He looks lost in thought, silent, a man watching the shore vanish into the distance for what feels like the final time."
    "可他看上去并不满意。恰恰相反，他神思恍惚，沉默不语，像个望着海岸渐行渐远、仿佛永诀之人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5796
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_659519d8:

    # a "That harbors bad news, I'm afraid."
    a "恐怕，这预示着坏消息。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5798
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_b8352f0c:

    # "He looks lost in thought, silent, a man watching the shore vanish into the distance for what feels like the final time."
    "他神思恍惚，沉默不语，像个望着海岸渐行渐远、仿佛永诀之人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5800
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_c44c0655:

    # p "Sir... {w}What happens now, then?"
    p "长官……{w}那么，现在会发生什么？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5804
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_38840e36:

    # a "Hmm?{w} Now? Now we wait."
    a "嗯？{w}现在？现在我们等待。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5808
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_fa48a623:

    # a "That bounty hunter promised he'd be back tomorrow morning. I will not volunteer information. {w}But were he to ask me the same question I asked you, I will not be allowed to deny it, now that I have been informed. If he's thorough, he will."
    a "那个赏金猎人保证他明早会回来。我不会主动提供信息。{w}但如果他问了我跟我刚才问你的同样问题，既然我已经知情，我就不能否认了。如果他查得仔细，他会问的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5810
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_359903b6:

    # a "I also estimate a chance he will have official permission to come aboard and search Mr. Hvidt's belongings. Or at least bring enough brute force that our opposition won't make a difference."
    a "我还估计，他有可能获得官方许可登船搜查Hvidt先生的物品。或者至少带来足够让我们无法反对的蛮力。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5816
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_12199608:

    # a "Are you a religious man, Mr. [family_name]?"
    a ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5818
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_4cf9df6f:

    # a "Nevermind, I doubt it. Though even still, praying might be your best course of action."
    a "算了，我表示怀疑。不过即便如此，祈祷或许是你最好的选择。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5822
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_ef463759:

    # a "Are you a religious man, Mr. [family_name]? Because praying might be your best course of action."
    a ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5824
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_83356e3c:

    # a "If he finds the coin you mentioned, then we will have to hand Mr. Hvidt over to local authorities for extradition."
    a "如果他找到你提到的那枚硬币，那么我们将不得不把Hvidt先生移交给当地机构进行引渡。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5826
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_b60b53f3:

    # "You swallow. {i}Oh, no.{/i}"
    "你咽了下口水。{i}哦，不。{/i}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5830
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_b3dfb9b5:

    # a "Now leave."
    a "现在离开。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5841
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_bb32461e:

    # p "No, sir. Nothing comes to mind."
    p "不，长官。我什么也想不起来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5843
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_80799543:

    # a "Very well."
    a ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5847
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_59a5b288:

    # a "Unfaltering. Just how I like to see it."
    a "坚定不移。正是我喜欢看到的样子。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5853
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_2589b09d:

    # "Arthur leans over the table separating the two of you. There's papers on it, you realise. But you can't take your eyes off him."
    "Arthur俯身靠近隔开你们两人的桌子。你意识到上面有文件。但你的目光无法从他身上移开。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5855
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_466986a4:

    # "He's staring at you with unusual intensity."
    "他以一种不同寻常的强度盯着你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5857
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_f7001a72:

    # a "Because if someone were to... find anything of the sort, then Mr. Hvidt's position will become untenable."
    a "因为如果有人……发现任何此类东西，那么Hvidt先生的处境将变得无法维持。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5859
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_d52d18e8:

    # a "I have done everything in my power to keep it from being so. But there are lines I am not keen on crossing."
    a "我已竭尽全力避免这种情况。但有些界限我并不想跨越。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5863
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_0c444b40:

    # "There's a glint in his eye you have not seen before."
    "他的眼中闪烁着你从未见过的光芒。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5865
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_cbd576c7:

    # a "However, if there truly is no proof of Mr. Hvidt ever being in France..."
    a "然而，如果确实没有证据表明Hvidt先生曾到过法国……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5867
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_29ea3341:

    # a "If nobody is able to find a shred of evidence connecting him to that God-forsaken country..."
    a "如果没有人能找到一丝一毫将他与那个被上帝遗弃的国家联系起来的证据……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5869
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_ab5439d2:

    # a "...Then we have nothing to worry about."
    a "……那么我们就没什么好担心的了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5873
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_ec076ea9:

    # a "{i}If.{/i}"
    a "{i}如果。{/i}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5878
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_25e1e0a5:

    # "He pauses."
    "他停顿了一下。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5880
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_1e684d43:

    # a "Have I made myself clear?"
    a "我说清楚了吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5882
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_8e6f2ac8:

    # p "I...{w} think so, sir."
    p "我……{w}我想是的，长官。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5886
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_9b9af47f:

    # "Arthur nods."
    "Arthur点点头。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5888
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_dde38533:

    # a "Clichè as it sounds... a crew is in fact a family. Or so I like to believe."
    a "听来或许老套……但船员确实亲如一家。至少我愿这么相信。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5890
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_4595775d:

    # a "Often moreso than the ones we have left behind awaiting our return."
    a "常常比我们留在身后、等待我们归来的那个家庭更是如此。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5892
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_20affad8:

    # a "A bond ties all men that brave the seas together. Like a seaworthy rope, it has to be wound and cared for with patience and attention, lest it snaps once tested."
    a "这是一种将所有敢于出海的人联系在一起的纽带。就像一条适合航海的绳索，必须耐心、细心地缠绕和保养，以免在考验中断裂。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5894
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_5235bbbe:

    # a "With not seldomly fatal consequences."
    a "其结果往往不乏致命性。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5896
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_8db48f27:

    # a "And the responsibility for fostering that bond falls on the shoulders of us officers."
    a "而培养这种纽带的责任就落在了我们这些长官的肩上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5900
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_b8d4dc38:

    # a "Mr. [family_name]. You did not sacrifice your crewmate, even when offered a prize you require."
    a "[family_name]先生。你并没有牺牲你的船员同伴，即使在你急需的奖赏被提供时也是如此。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5902
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_86c1744e:

    # a "There might be hope for you yet."
    a "你可能还有希望。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5906
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_30708d64:

    # a "Now go. I have plenty of other headaches to worry about before the day is done."
    a "现在走吧。在天黑之前，我还有一大堆其他头疼的事要操心。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5913
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_fc97ad31:

    # "You leave the room and close the door behind you."
    "你离开房间，关上了身后的门。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5915
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_b62403b4:

    # "You have... a lot to think about. Most of it unpleasant. Some of it... maybe..."
    "你有……很多事情要考虑。大部分都不愉快。有些……也许……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5925
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_ae00caaa:

    # p "Ah!"
    p "啊！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5927
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_8c35cb44:

    # p "Sorry, you startled me."
    p "抱歉，你吓到我了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5929
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_d3b13d3c:

    # s "Am I that scary?"
    s "我那么吓人吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5931
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_23e38758:

    # p "No, no, it's nothing."
    p "不，不，没什么。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5935
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_03c5a6b5:

    # "You're immediately startled by the presence of a certain small sailor."
    "你立刻被某个小水手的出现吓了一跳。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5937
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_3666bce4:

    # s "So."
    s "所以。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5939
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_51a6e07a:

    # p "...So."
    p "……所以。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5943
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_2fd5774f:

    # s "Arthur did not share what this is all about with me. Which I hafta say... Not a fan."
    s "Arthur没有告诉我这到底是怎么回事。我不得不说……我不喜欢这样。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5945
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_f08154a2:

    # s "But being crew means trusting your superiors know what they're doing."
    s "但身为船员，就意味着要相信你的上级知道他们在做什么。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5947
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_357d17d6:

    # "You nod. A lesson you're starting to understand."
    "你点点头。你开始明白这一课。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5951
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_f3198eb0:

    # s "However. In all this, I am in fact your superior, lad."
    s "然而。在所有这一切中，我实际上就是你的上级，小伙子。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5953
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_58d05837:

    # s "You tell me. Should I be concerned?"
    s "你告诉我。我应该担心吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5955
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_875ce35a_1:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5957
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_7b54c21b:

    # p "No. Not at all."
    p "不。完全不用。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5959
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_8b423de5:

    # p "There's been some... issues with Wolf. Mainly bureaucratical. But it's all going to get solved."
    p "Wolf遇到了一些……问题。主要是官僚程序上的。但一切都会解决的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5961
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_b03f519f:

    # p "It's all going to get solved soon."
    p "一切很快就会解决的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5963
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_df2c133a:

    # s "All right. That's good enough for me."
    s "好吧。这对我来说就足够了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5969
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_853edbc8:

    # "Sam wraps [his] arm around your shoulder, a grin on [his] face. That gesture of camaraderie, tiny as it is, flickers the first ember of warmth you felt inside in a while."
    "Sam用[他的]手臂搂住你的肩膀，脸上带着咧嘴笑。那份情谊的表示，虽然微小，却点燃了你内心许久未感受到的第一丝温暖。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5971
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_e9431651:

    # s "Hey, the wolf's got secrets. But don't we all?"
    s "嘿，那只狼有秘密。但我们不都有吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5975
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_c5250ec4:

    # p "Yes..."
    p "是啊……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5977
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_9d05cf3c:

    # p "Don't we all..."
    p "我们不都有吗……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5979
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_8534ca42_1:

    # ". . ."
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5981
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_6c21fedb:

    # p "Hey Sam?"
    p "嘿，Sam？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5985
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_40d86de1:

    # s "Yes?"
    s ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5987
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_95c74789:

    # p "You probably struggle with some secrets you keep, don't you?"
    p "你可能也在为一些你保守的秘密而挣扎，对吧？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5993
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_7cf5d332:

    # s "Should be no surprise to you that I do. Yes, there are things I'd much rather have out in the open without the fear of what it might mean."
    s "我有，这应该不让你惊讶。是的，有些事情我宁愿公之于众，而不必担心它可能意味着什么。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5995
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_de3bb3ce:

    # s "But sometimes the world's not like that, and we have to live with the cards we are dealt."
    s "但有时世界并非如此，我们必须接受我们拿到手的牌。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:5997
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_112e1c81:

    # s "Heavy as they may be on occasion."
    s "尽管有时这些牌可能很沉重。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6003
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_9962509e:

    # s "It's normal, innit? Some just weigh heavier than others."
    s "这很正常，不是吗？有些就是比另一些更沉重。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6007
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_2d5e14be:

    # s "Why? Need to get something off your chest?"
    s "为什么？需要倾诉些什么吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6009
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_353c8f9d:

    # p "No, no. It's nothing..."
    p "不，不。没什么……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6013
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_65c5f9bf:

    # s "Is it because what you asked of Rajeeyah back then?"
    s "是因为你那时对Rajeeyah提出的要求吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6015
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_8e77da71:

    # p "She told you?!"
    p "她告诉你了？！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6017
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_2922d769:

    # s "You were an idiot, 'course she did."
    s "你当时就是个傻瓜，她当然说了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6019
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_53976138:

    # "You shake your head."
    "你摇摇头"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6021
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_5a35babf:

    # p "It's not that, though. I apologized to her already."
    p "不过，不是因为这个。我已经向她道过歉了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6023
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_a75c5abf:

    # s "Well, what is it then?"
    s "那到底是什么事？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6025
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_7aa4cbb2:

    # p "...As I said, it's nothing. Don't worry..."
    p "……就像我说的，没什么。别担心……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6043
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_4af54537:

    # "Time moves by so slowly."
    "时间流逝得如此缓慢。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6045
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_b875dc29:

    # "It's afternoon by now, you estimate. You're sitting in the common area, unsure what to do. You skipped lunch, but you're not feeling hungry at all."
    "你估计现在已经是下午了。你坐在公共区域，不知道该做什么。你没吃午饭，但一点也不觉得饿。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6047
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_2dd44086:

    # "You tried looking for Wolf around the ship. No trace. He's good at not getting found when he doesn't want you to."
    "你试着在船上找过Wolf。毫无踪迹。他不想让你找到的时候，很擅长不被发现。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6049
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_01a0b674:

    # "You know he's still on the ship. The sailors on watch duty at the gangwalk haven't spotted him since the two of you came on board, and for as good as he is at being unnoticed, he's no ghost. You think."
    "你知道他还在船上。从你们俩上船以来，舷梯上值班的水手就没见过他，而且尽管他擅长不引人注意，但他也不是什么幽灵。你这么想着。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6054
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_98bdb239:

    # "A feathered shape looms over you, shadowing your thoughts."
    "一个带羽毛的身影笼罩在你上方，遮住了你的思绪。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6061
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_1a3c1fa8:

    # t "Hey..."
    t "嘿……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6063
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_38ac1d02:

    # p "Huh? Oh. Hey, Torres. How's things."
    p "嗯？哦。嘿，Torres。情况怎么样。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6065
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_2139aa33:

    # "He looks tense, you think. But you're finding it a little hard to care, at the moment."
    "他看起来很紧张，你这么觉得。但眼下，你发现自己有点难以在意。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6067
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_53dcd79f:

    # t "Things are, uh... fine, I suppose. Cannot complain."
    t "事情嘛，呃……我想还好吧。没什么可抱怨的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6069
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_1b3a3de4:

    # t "Listen, I talked to Wolf and apologised for my behaviour this morning. He... gave me what I believe was a grunt of forgiveness."
    t "听着，我跟Wolf谈过了，为今天早上的行为道了歉。他……给了我一声，我认为是表示原谅的咕哝。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6071
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_0355778e:

    # p "Uh, this... morning?"
    p "呃，今天……早上？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6073
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_486fac2c:

    # "Oh, right. The drunken thing. With everything going on, it almost slipped your mind. {w}It hasn't even been a day yet, you realise with weariness."
    "哦，对了。醉酒那事。发生了这么多事，你差点都忘了。{w}你疲惫地意识到，这甚至还没过一天呢。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6075
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_6845ce79:

    # "The... fun night he had with an unidentified male stranger. Right."
    "他……和那个身份不明的男性陌生人度过的那个有趣的夜晚。对。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6077
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_fb2601e3:

    # "And his embarrassment."
    "以及他的窘迫。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6081
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_0e0d2740:

    # t "I wanted to apologise to you as well. That was, uh... {w}Undignified."
    t "我也想向你道歉。那实在是，呃……{w}有失体面。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6083
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_a65366ca:

    # p "Wait... {w}You said you met Wolf?"
    p "等等……{w}你说你见到Wolf了？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6087
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_2fcdbd2f:

    # "He raises an eyebrow."
    "他挑起一边眉毛。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6089
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_3fc7bf9f:

    # t "Yes? Is anything wrong?"
    t "是的？有什么问题吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6091
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_f72fff26:

    # p "I... Did he look like there was anything wrong?"
    p "我……他看起来有什么不对劲吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6095
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_03642b61:

    # "Torres shrugs."
    "Torres耸了耸肩。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6097
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_85da8918:

    # t "No, not really. I met him at his hammock, it was the first place I went looking. I offered my apologies for being a pain yesterday."
    t "不，没有。我在他的吊床上找到他的，那是我去找的第一处地方。我为昨天惹的麻烦道了歉。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6099
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_169aa09e:

    # t "He just grunted at me and left.{w} Which is about as much acknowledgment as I expected."
    t "他只是对我咕哝了一声就走开了。{w}这大概就是我预料中的那种程度的回应。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6101
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_9cc92922:

    # t "I caught him stuffing his belongings in his bag. Well, what few things he carries around. {w}He made sure to put that coin of his inside a folded shirt. He really doesn't want to lose it."
    t "我撞见他把他的东西塞进包里。嗯，就是他随身带的那些少得可怜的东西。{w}他特意把那枚硬币放进一件叠好的衬衫里。他真的很不想弄丢它。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6103
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_1042bd91:

    # t "Should rather spend it now we're in a harbor. Isn't gonna do him much good tucked away."
    t "既然我们在港口，不如现在就花掉。藏起来对他没什么好处。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6105
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_148a750d:

    # t "It didn't seem out of the ordinary. Maybe heading to shore again."
    t "这看起来没什么不寻常的。也许又是要上岸去了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6107
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_3e7c5317:

    # "He left the coin? {i}That's odd{/i}, you think. He never seemed to separate from it. Always in his breeches."
    "他把硬币留下了？{i}这有点奇怪，{/i}你想。他以前似乎从不和它分开。总是放在马裤里。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6109
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_24ddeb75:

    # "It takes a few seconds for the information to connect."
    "过了几秒钟，信息才串联起来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6111
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_65ae66f8:

    # "That means... {w}the coin is unattended."
    "这意味着……{w}那枚硬币现在无人看管。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6115
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_e99a06e4:

    # t "And... uh..."
    t "而且……呃……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6117
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_95dc7ac8:

    # "Torres, not having noticed your silence, seems to be going through some complex mental processes of his own."
    "Torres没有注意到你的沉默，似乎自己也正经历着一些复杂的心理活动。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6119
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_a33c3bd8:

    # t "The... things I might have confided you..."
    t "我……可能向你倾诉过的那些事……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6121
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_7c1802fd:

    # t "You know, about... Last night and, my thoughts..."
    t "你知道，关于……昨晚，还有我的想法……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6123
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_5470baf0:

    # t "Did you, uh, happen to mention..."
    t "你，呃，有没有碰巧提到……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6125
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_bd6a7c5c:

    # "{i}Oh, right. That.{/i}"
    "{i}哦，对了。那件事。{/i}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6127
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_7a8d78b6:

    # p "Ah... Don't worry, Torres. I haven't told a soul. {w}It's private matters. I'm keeping it between us."
    p "啊……别担心，Torres。我没告诉任何人。{w}这是私事。我会保密，你知我知。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6131
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_08363793:

    # "A weight lifts off his shoulders."
    "他肩上无形的重担卸了下来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6133
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_6d2cb675:

    # t "Thank you, friend. Yes, it's... very private."
    t "谢谢你，朋友。是的，这……非常私密。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6137
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_14e7e06c:

    # t "I'd rather nobody else on board hears about it. I'd... very much like not having to worry about it at all."
    t "我不想让船上其他任何人听到这件事。我……非常希望能完全不用为此担心。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6139
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_20a31033:

    # p "I can imagine. But hey, at least it was fun. {w}Very fun, from the way you described it."
    p "我能想象。不过嘿，至少那很有趣。{w}非常有趣，从你的描述来看。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6143
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_7502362e:

    # "Oh boy. Looking the other way. Not a good sign."
    "哦天哪。他把脸转向一边。这不是个好兆头。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6145
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_a3264756:

    # "Were Torres not having such a hard time coming to terms with his newfound attraction to men, you'd cackle."
    "若非Torres正为发现自己对男性产生好感而纠结不已，你早嗤笑出声了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6147
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_b1372433:

    # "But you don't."
    "但你没有。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6149
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_ff321376:

    # "You know what he's going through. You remember exactly how it feels. You've been there."
    "你知道他正在经历什么。你清楚地记得那种感觉。你也曾经历过。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6151
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_d2f7c259:

    # "And if someone had cackled at you, back then, you would have lost it."
    "而如果那时候有人嘲笑你，你肯定会崩溃的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6153
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_461b4a30:

    # "Some people start exploring it early in their lives. Some people do it late. Some don't do it at all."
    "有些人很早就开始探索这些，有些人则很晚。有些人一辈子都不会。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6155
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_31fb8563:

    # "Some feel it, get scared, and run for the hills."
    "有些人感觉到了，却吓得逃之夭夭。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6157
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_3f718668:

    # "Few people take offense with someone's preferences, but ones own self-perception is often the most troublesome wall to break down."
    "很少人会对他人的取向心存芥蒂，但自我认知往往才是最难逾越的那堵墙。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6161
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_8c12d7a8:

    # t "He wanted to see me again tonight, but... {w}Uh..."
    t "他今晚想再见我，但是……{w}呃……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6163
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_f547c588:

    # t "Let's..."
    t "我们……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6165
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_1f82e110:

    # t "Let's just... never talk about it again, yes? That sounds like a plan. Me and you don't even know each other much."
    t "我们就……再也别提这事了，好吗？这听起来是个好主意。我和你甚至都不太熟。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6171
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_74f11bb2:

    # "Torres doesn't wait for your reply. {w}He turns around, heading for the upper decks. Ready to close the book on the entire topic."
    "Torres没有等你的回答。{w}他转过身，朝上层甲板走去。准备把这个话题彻底封存。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6173
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_713752e5:

    # "But now you can't stop thinking about it."
    "但现在你无法不去想这件事了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6175
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_6924bda3:

    # "You don't really know Torres. That is true. And none of this is your business, which is also true."
    "你并不真正了解Torres。这是真的。而且这些事都与你无关，这也是真的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6177
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_2eed8b85:

    # "This instinct to say something, to push him to do something... You can't pretend it's not there."
    "这种想说点什么、想推动他做点什么的冲动……你无法假装它不存在。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6179
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_5724416e:

    # "He still hasn't reached the stairs, and the two of you are alone. If you want to mention it, no better chance than now."
    "他还没走到楼梯，而且你们俩单独在一起。如果你想提，没有比现在更好的机会了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6181
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_2ec726fc:

    # "But... he might need time. Maybe he needs to be more comfortable with those feelings before exploring them."
    "但是……他可能需要时间。也许他需要在探索这些感情之前，先对它们感到更自在一些。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6183
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_339f006e:

    # "Maybe pushing him isn't the best choice. Maybe, on his own terms, he'll come around to it. {w}Maybe he has to start on this path on his own. He did take a first step on his own, after all. {w}A very unsteady one, but still."
    "或许逼迫他并非上策。可能按他自己的节奏，他终会接受。{w}或许这条路必须由他自己迈出第一步。毕竟，他已经独自迈出了一小步。{w}虽踉踉跄跄，但终究是迈出去了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6185
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_df49c14c:

    # "Or maybe he'll refuse to think about it for the rest of his life."
    "或者，也许他余生都会拒绝去思考这件事。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6187
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_9eb6439a:

    # "And spend it wondering why he feels so empty."
    "然后在困惑为何内心如此空虚中度过。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6201
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_a8505eac:

    # p "Hey, Torres?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6205
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_6ab72bc5:

    # "He stops."
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6207
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_926df70c:

    # "Torres slowly turns to look your way. He doesn't want to, it's clear. But you're calling out to him."
    "Torres慢慢转过身看向你。他显然不想这样。但你在叫他。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6209
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_0125ecea:

    # "And he knows what you're about to say."
    "而且他知道你要说什么。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6213
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_55aecead:

    # t "...Yes, lad?"
    t "……什么事，伙计？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6215
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_d11ec6af:

    # p "One guy to another... You're going to have to face it eventually."
    p "男人对男人……你最终总得面对它的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6219
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_76783c18:

    # t "I'm... not sure I follow."
    t "我……不太明白你的意思。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6221
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_ba390f65:

    # p "You seemed into it when you talked about it to me. You made it sound like a hell of a night."
    p "你跟我谈起这事的时候，看起来挺投入的。你说得那晚简直棒极了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6223
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_65e57537:

    # p "Your feelings might be messy, but you walked willingly into all that happened, and made sure to see everything through."
    p "你的心绪或许纷乱，但你是自愿踏入那个良夜的，并且确保自己亲身经历了整个过程。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6227
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_4619ffb4:

    # p "I mean... You accepted this man's invitation. You felt good in the moment. You clearly enjoyed it a lot."
    p "我是说……你接受了那个男人的邀请。那一刻你感觉很好。你显然非常享受。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6229
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_9d9ece56:

    # p "I think that's at least worth acknowledging."
    p "我觉得这至少值得承认。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6231
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_91a41f3b:

    # "He just looks back at you, saying nothing. But his poker face is nowhere near as good as Wolf's."
    "他只是看着你，一言不发。但他那扑克脸远不如Wolf的好。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6233
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_19b99455:

    # "It's not the face of someone with a lifetime of experience in hiding his true self."
    "这不是一张拥有多年隐藏真实自我经验的人的脸。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6235
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_5d8b753a:

    # "It's the face of someone who has no idea what emotion he's feeling."
    "这是一张对自己正感受着何种情绪毫无头绪的人的脸。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6237
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_f7c75706:

    # p "Listen, I'm not going to force this conversation. It's your business, after all, and we're already up in eachother's business more than we probably like on a ship like this."
    p "听着，我不会强求进行这次谈话。毕竟，这是你的事，而且在这艘船上，我们可能已经比我们自己希望的更多地干涉彼此的事了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6239
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_d7d2a1f6:

    # p "But, if you ever want to talk about it, well..."
    p "但是，如果你什么时候想谈谈，嗯……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6243
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_c919a481:

    # p "Let's just say... it's one of a few fields I have some experience in."
    p "这么说吧……这是我略有经验的少数几个领域之一。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6245
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_9a655563:

    # p "I can help sort your emotions out, I think. {w}More people than you know have gone through what you're going through."
    p "我想我能帮你理清情绪。{w}经历过你正在经历的事情的人，比你想象的要多。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6247
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_ed5aded9:

    # p "At the very least I can give you some practical tips, if you find yourself considering it again. Might not be much, but it's better than nothing."
    p "至少，如果你发现自己再次考虑这件事，我可以给你一些实用的建议。可能不多，但总比没有好。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6251
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_8a37c93c:

    # p "I'm always ready to listen. You don't have to deal with it alone."
    p "我随时愿意倾听。你不必独自面对。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6253
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_aaffe695:

    # p "I'll keep everything under wraps, you have my word. Me and you will remain the only people who hear about it."
    p "我会保守一切秘密，我保证。我和你将是唯一知道这件事的人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6255
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_c8feb82f:

    # p "I think it might help."
    p "我觉得这或许会有帮助。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6259
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_68c8fb52:

    # t ". . ."
    t ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6261
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_458fdcc8:

    # p "Hey... I've been where you are. I know how confusing it can feel."
    p "嘿……我曾处在你的位置。我知道那感觉有多令人困惑。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6263
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_664bdac8:

    # p "But I think it's worth it, personally. I wouldn't have it any other way."
    p "但就我个人而言，我觉得这是值得的。我不会选择其他方式。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6265
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_ab4ffeb1:

    # p "I think you should go see him again. But only if you feel okay with trying."
    p "我觉得你应该再去见他一次。但前提是你觉得可以尝试。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6267
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_ebd8e7af:

    # p "And if you need to talk, my door is always open. {w}Metaphorically."
    p "如果你需要谈谈，我的门永远为你敞开。{w}比喻意义上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6269
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_68c8fb52_1:

    # t ". . ."
    t ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6271
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_a6362013:

    # t "I..."
    t ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6273
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_d2d88d93:

    # t "I don't..."
    t "我不……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6275
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_3e5ca1ce:

    # "He stays quiet for a while."
    "他沉默了一会儿。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6277
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_24509461:

    # "A long while."
    "很长一会儿。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6281
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_185f9f7c:

    # t "I'll... think about it. {w}Yeah. I'll think about it."
    t "我会……考虑一下的。{w}嗯。我会考虑的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6283
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_70fcbca1:

    # p "That's all I ask for."
    p "我别无所求。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6293
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_499e53f5:

    # "No, you decide."
    "不，你决定了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6295
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_c028c026:

    # "You have enough on your plate for the rest of the day. The rest of the entire journey, even."
    "你今天剩下的时间已经够忙的了。甚至整个航程剩下的时间都是。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6297
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_93610c29:

    # "No need to add another person's plight to your own. That, and... it wouldn't be right."
    "没必要再把别人的困境加到自己身上。而且……那样也不对。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6299
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_3080b344:

    # "He has to take that step on his own. He knows the way is there, but he has to be the one to leave the house first."
    "他得自己迈出那一步。路就在那儿，但他必须是先跨出门的那个人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6301
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_6f512ba2:

    # "You can't push him and risk him retreating even further. And it's not fair to impose what you think is best on someone who doesn't agree."
    "你不能逼迫他，否则他可能退缩得更远。将你认为最好的强加给不认同的人，这并不公平。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6303
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_fc1c5d5d:

    # "This is what you tell yourself."
    "你如此告诉自己。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6305
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_62eacde3:

    # "Meanwhile, Torres is still there, still not on the steps taking him toward the hot Moroccan sun."
    "而此刻，Torres仍站在原地，仍未踏上引他向摩洛哥灼热烈阳的台阶。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6307
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_0e070665:

    # "Pensive, conflicted, hesitant. {w}Waiting for something, perhaps."
    "他沉思着，内心矛盾，犹豫不决。{w}也许在等待着什么。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6312
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_5ca10504:

    # "His head turns towards you."
    "他的头转向你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6314
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_68c8fb52_2:

    # t ". . ."
    t ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6316
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_b7d7dd8c:

    # p "... Yeah?"
    p "……嗯？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6318
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_68c8fb52_3:

    # t ". . ."
    t ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6322
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_0b30f8ab:

    # t ". . . It's nothing."
    t "……没什么。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6329
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_1a9cc341:

    # "And up the stairs he disappears."
    "然后他走上楼梯，消失了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6331
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_6f94bdec:

    # "You shake your head. Poor thing."
    "你摇了摇头。可怜的家伙。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6333
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_750f0b4f:

    # "That feeling of confusion... you'd rather not even think about it. Not that there's much to think there—if there's something you're confident on, is the kind of people you enjoy spending your alone time with."
    "那种困惑感……你甚至不愿多想。倒也没什么可想的——若说有什么让你确信的，那就是你乐意与何种人共度独处时光。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6337
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_ff2f5d15:

    # "He might be a more experienced sailor than you are, but you have more... let's charitably call it 'people experience'.{w} Life isn't one single straight road, you think."
    "他航海经验或许比你丰富，但你的……姑且善意地称之为“人情世故”更老到些。{w}你想，人生从来不是一条笔直的单行道。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6340
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_d555d01d:

    # "He might be a more experienced sailor than you are, but you have your own experiences, and life isn't a straight road like that."
    "他航海经验或许比你丰富，但你自有你的经历，而人生本就不是那般笔直的路。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6344
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_bca32c30:

    # "You chuckle softly, allowing yourself to feel amusement for the first time in a while. {w}Heh. {i}Straight{/i}."
    "你轻声笑了出来，许久以来第一次感到些微的趣意。{w}呵。{i}直{/i}。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6346
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_bfce5f18:

    # "He did find Wolf though, packing stuff in his bag and all. Or rather, Wolf allowed Torres to find him. But not you."
    "他确实找到了Wolf——在收拾行囊之类的。或者说，是Wolf允许Torres找到了他。但不是你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6348
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_0654608e:

    # "You try not to think about the implications there."
    "你尽量不去想这其中的含义。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6350
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_8534ca42_2:

    # ". . ."
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6354
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_bbcda134:

    # "Wait a goddamned second!"
    "等他妈的一下下！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6359
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_c1efa9ab:

    # "Packing his bag!?"
    "收拾他的行李！？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6368
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_1753c7c1:

    # "You flee the common area, heading straight for the hammocks."
    "你逃离公共区域，直奔吊床区。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6370
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_d619a34c:

    # "You cross dark corridors and confused sailors. Nobody questions you, a few send curious glances your way."
    "你穿过黑暗的走廊和困惑的水手们。没有人质问你，只有几个人向你投来好奇的目光。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6372
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_e9e54e49:

    # "You don't run into anyone you know. Maybe a few faces you recognise, but nobody you're on speaking terms with."
    "没遇见熟面孔。或许有几个眼熟的，但都谈不上有交情。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6374
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_c5fa6fdf:

    # "Good."
    "不错"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6376
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_495efe8e:

    # "And when you reach Wolf's hammock, nobody else is there."
    "当你到达Wolf的吊床时，那里没有别人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6390
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_d82079fa:

    # "Nobody but you and the lupine."
    "除了你和这匹狼，别无他人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6392
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_4d2c00e0:

    # p "Don't—hah—don't run."
    p "别——哈——别跑。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6394
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_8337703c_1:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6405
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_aa5ba565:

    # "You try to keep your panting under control. Hard, after the mad dash you did, but you still somehow manage."
    "你试图控制住喘息。很难，在刚才的狂奔之后，但你仍然设法做到了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6407
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_e51da7a7:

    # "Wolf is holding a bag—his bag. He seems to have finished stuffing things in."
    "Wolf正拿着一个包——他的包。他似乎已经塞完东西了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6409
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_c68a24a7:

    # p "I've been looking for you all over."
    p "我一直在到处找你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6411
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_ded8ca46:

    # p "Don't. Run."
    p "别。跑。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6419
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_fe935b1f:

    # p "He wants you to run. It's what he's hoping for."
    p "他想让你跑。这正是他所希望的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6421
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_566b1ec5:

    # p "He's been provoking you all this time. None of what he said is true."
    p "他一直都在挑衅你。他说的没一句是真的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6423
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_e5c46684:

    # p "Wolf. {w}He's hoping you make a mistake."
    p "Wolf。{w}他希望你犯错。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6425
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_8337703c_2:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6427
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_41ff63c2:

    # "He's still not looking at you. Still not trusting."
    "他仍然没有看你。仍然不信任。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6429
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_2f12373f:

    # "But... still here. Still stopped by your presence. That's worth something."
    "但他……仍然在这里。仍然因为你的出现而停下了脚步。这值得肯定。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6431
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_8337703c_3:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6433
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_b5a47bd4:

    # "And then he talks."
    "然后他开口了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6437
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_6fbf2f79:

    # w "Not... saying I don't believe you. But..."
    w "不是……说我不相信你。但是……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6439
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_8effceb0:

    # w "Such is life, at times. Don't expect a goodbye."
    w "人生有时便是如此。别指望会有告别。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6441
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_0f7c5dba:

    # p "Do you really believe that I'm a partner of his?"
    p "你真的相信我是他的同伙吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6445
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_63b4257e:

    # w "You joined the crew when I did. You talked with him yesterday on the beach."
    w "你和我同时加入船员。你昨天在沙滩上和他谈过话。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6447
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_d1ed6067:

    # w "I... cannot run the risk. {w}That's all."
    w "我……不能冒这个险。{w}仅此而已。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6449
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_f6bba783:

    # "You had it wrong. For once, Wolf isn't uncaring or brooding or concerned with self-preservation.{w} He's simply not confident in what he's doing."
    "你搞错了。这一次，Wolf并非漠不关心、郁郁寡欢或只顾自保。{w}他只是对自己正在做的事情缺乏信心。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6451
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_736fddda:

    # "He's shaken."
    "他动摇了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6453
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_2c8aedd5:

    # "His voice isn't as secure as it usually sounds. He's unsure on the best course of action. This time, running and hiding might not be the obvious choice."
    "他的声音不像平时那样坚定。他不确定最佳的行动方案是什么。这一次，逃跑和躲藏可能不是显而易见的选择。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6455
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_bba98544:

    # "He doesn't want to look you in the eyes."
    "他不想看你的眼睛。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6457
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_624476eb:

    # "And there's only one thing you can think of doing about it."
    "而你能想到的应对方法只有一个。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6459
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_5b2de1aa:

    # p "How can you possibly be this naive!?"
    p "你怎么能这么天真！？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6461
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_32f0daa9:

    # "You have to go full Wolf."
    "你必须摆出十足的“Wolf”架势。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6465
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_4c14b563:

    # w "Wha-"
    w "什——"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6467
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_e179a946:

    # p "Where's this going to take you next? Morocco? The rest of Africa? Asia? What's your plan once you're out there on land?"
    p "接下来你要去哪里？摩洛哥？非洲其他地方？亚洲？一旦你上了岸，你有什么计划？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6469
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_0f9d4e3a:

    # p "You get ashore, you're not making it ten feet before someone jumps you and we never hear from you again. How's {i}that{/i} for a goodbye!?"
    p "你上了岸，走不到十英尺就会有人袭击你，然后我们就再也听不到你的消息了。这样的{i}告别{/i}怎么样！？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6473
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_4954670e:

    # w "I know how to-"
    w "我知道怎么——"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6475
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_5785a924:

    # p "No, you don't! You don't know this place, you don't speak the language, you don't even know what you're hiding from!"
    p "不，你不知道！你不了解这个地方，你不会说这里的语言，你甚至不知道自己在躲避什么！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6477
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_abd3ce9f:

    # p "Come on! You know better than I do that life isn't a cheap novel. You have the officers of the Conway backing you up here, and you want to toss that away?! Are you out of your mind?!"
    p "得了吧！你比我更清楚生活不是三六小说。在这里你有Conway的长官们支持你，你却想抛弃这些？！你疯了吗？！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6481
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_90afd617:

    # w "Enough!"
    w "够了！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6487
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_285e5710:

    # "He tries to walk past you, pretending to ignore your words."
    "他试图从你身边走过，假装无视你的话。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6489
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_d3f3bbf9:

    # "He's done.{w} Or so he wants you to believe."
    "他听够了。{w}或者是他想让你这么认为。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6491
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_772c77c3:

    # "You place a firm paw on his chest."
    "你将一只坚实的爪子按在他的胸前。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6496
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_c6041400:

    # w "Will you stop it with this-"
    w "你能不能别这样——"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6498
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_1fe006ed:

    # "His complaint is halted in his throat by your temerity. {w}You stand between him and the passage to the stairs, blocking his way."
    "你的鲁莽让他把抱怨的话咽了回去。{w}你站在他和通往楼梯的通道之间，挡住了他的去路。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6500
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_bf9ae706:

    # p "No. This is stupid."
    p "不。这太蠢了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6504
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_521fc1ba:

    # "Wolf snarls. You can see his muscles tense, his eyes focusing on you. His attitude switching."
    "Wolf发出低吼。你能看到他的肌肉绷紧，眼睛紧盯着你。他在转变态度。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6506
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_9631edf5:

    # "He could push you out of the way if he wanted to. He could probably break your arm without much of a sweat."
    "如果他愿意，他可以推开你。他可能不费吹灰之力就能折断你的手臂。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6508
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_72821050:

    # "You don't have much time before the inevitable. Maybe one last line."
    "在无可避免的事情发生之前，你没有多少时间了。也许还能说最后一句话。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6510
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_dd54175d:

    # "But you don't need to choose. You know what to say."
    "但你不需要选择。你知道该说什么。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6512
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_78f5e9d4:

    # p "{i}Aren't you tired of running away?{/i}"
    p "{i}“你还没厌倦逃避吗？”{/i}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6514
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_8433ab22:

    # "The question cuts deep."
    "这个问题直击要害。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6516
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_9c93dc8c:

    # "Wolf snarls once, but the sound slowly dies in his throat."
    "Wolf 又低吼了一声，但声音慢慢在他喉咙里消失了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6520
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_60fde96d:

    # "His muscles tense one last time before relaxing into a slump."
    "他的肌肉最后一次绷紧，然后松弛下来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6524
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_f92f9404:

    # "The light of anger leaves his eyes, and his eyes leave yours one more time."
    "愤怒的光芒从他眼中褪去，他的目光再次离开了你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6526
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_8337703c_4:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6528
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_35b3bcb8:

    # w "You..."
    w "你……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6530
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_61cd794b:

    # w "You have no idea what I'm tired of."
    w "你根本不知道我厌倦了什么。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6532
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_426694fd:

    # w "You don't want to know what I'm tired of."
    w "你也不会想知道我厌倦了什么。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6534
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_794192b5:

    # "A cornered animal is at its most dangerous, whether it's wild or one of your own. {w}You know that from your growing up in the countryside and the farm. You have to tire them out before reining them in."
    "无论是野兽还是你自己的同类，被逼入绝境的动物都是最危险的。{w}你在乡村和农场的成长经历让你明白这一点。在控制它们之前，你必须先耗尽它们的力气。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6536
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_124cb251:

    # "But that's only the first half of taking a scared sheep back to the fold. You know what you have to say next."
    "但这只是把受惊的羊带回羊圈的第一步。你知道接下来必须说什么。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6538
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_6bbb164f:

    # p "It's not over yet. You just have to trust that other people can save you, for once."
    p "还没结束。你只需相信，仅此一次，别人也能拯救你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6540
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_65d1442d:

    # p "I'll give you trust. I'll prove it to you. I'll fix this mess."
    p "我会给你信任。我会向你证明。我会收拾这个烂摊子。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6542
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_bf64e255:

    # p "I have a plan."
    p "我有计划。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6544
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_a018564c:

    # "You lie. But you lie {i}convincingly{/i}, and that's what matters."
    "你在撒谎。但你撒得{i}令人信服{/i}，这才是关键。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6546
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_9b73dcce:

    # p "You have to trust us, Wolf.{w} This is your chance to cut free. Get out of this mess and nobody's ever gonna chase after you where we're going next."
    p "你必须相信我们，Wolf。{w}这是你脱身的机会。甩掉这堆破事，等我们去了下个地方，没人会再追捕你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6548
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_472215ac:

    # p "If you leave the {i}Conway{/i} and it's over. Nobody will be able to protect you. And they know exactly who they're looking for this time."
    p "如果你离开{i}Conway{/i}，一切就结束了。没有人能保护你。而且这次他们非常清楚要找的是谁。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6550
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_d2411a4b:

    # p "Come on. We can do this.{w} I believe in you. Hell, {i}Arthur{/i} believes in you! Do you think that's happened by chance?"
    p "来吧。我们能行的。{w}我相信你。靠，{i}Arthur{/i}都相信你！你觉得这是偶然吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6552
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_8337703c_5:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6556
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_8337703c_6:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6558
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_875ce35a_2:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6562
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_c6c9c05d:

    # w "... All right."
    w "……好吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6566
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_4feaa437:

    # "He drops his bag at the feet of his hammock. You hear the soft thud of clothing hitting wood."
    "他把包丢在吊床边。你听到衣物轻轻撞击木头的闷响。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6568
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_47d23814:

    # w "I'm not going to ask if you listened in on me and Arthur. I'd have done the same."
    w "我不会问你有没有偷听我和Arthur的谈话。换作是我也会这么做。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6570
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_2629865f:

    # w "I...{w} trust you. And him. I'll stay on the {i}Conway{/i} until things're settled."
    w "我……{w}相信你。也相信他。在事情解决之前，我会留在{i}Conway{/i}上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6574
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_2a79d53e:

    # w "Just leave me alone until then. I won't flee the ship."
    w "在那之前别管我就行。我不会逃离这艘船。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6576
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_a3d2b7a0:

    # p "Do I have your word?"
    p "你说话算话？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6580
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_7cc66ffc:

    # "Wolf sighs slowly."
    "Wolf缓缓叹了口气。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6584
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_bee18402:

    # w "You have my word. I'll remain on board until everything's over. Promise."
    w "我说话算话。在一切结束之前，我会留在船上。我保证。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6586
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_d0d79e7a:

    # "You nod. That's one issue taken care of. By far not the biggest, but... You take your victories where you get them."
    "你点点头。一桩麻烦算是解决了。远非最大的那桩，但……有胜绩就该抓住。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6588
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_726d93bd:

    # p "What do you plan to do until then?"
    p "在那之前你打算做什么？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6592
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_33ed7dfa:

    # "Wolf replies with a shrug."
    "Wolf 耸耸肩作为回答。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6596
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_b3e2831b:

    # w "I 'unno. The usual. {w}Practice the fife. Feed the cats. Look at the ocean."
    w "我不知道。照常吧。{w}练习横笛。喂猫。看看海。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6598
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_a2208daf:

    # w "Maybe the latter. I'm getting fond of it."
    w "也许是最后一项。我开始喜欢上它了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6600
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_f95d2875:

    # w "Might be the last chance I get."
    w "这可能是我最后的机会了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6602
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_888f37dc:

    # "You nod. You don't really know what to reply to that. You don't think Wolf wants you to reply to that."
    "你点点头。你并不知道该如何回应。你觉得Wolf也不希望你回应。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6604
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_fbd1829d:

    # w "However things may go... it all ends tomorrow. Might as well cut it shorter than intended."
    w "不管事情如何发展……明天一切都会结束。不如让它比预期的更早结束。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6608
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_cd2cacf5:

    # w "I'm surprised. Figured I'd be scared, but I'm feeling almost relieved. Nothing else I can do about it."
    w "我很惊讶。原以为我会害怕，但现在几乎感到解脱了。我对此无能为力。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6610
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_23263207:

    # w "Just let me be until then. Please."
    w "在那之前，就让我一个人待着吧。拜托了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6612
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_a13599c9:

    # p "I will."
    p "我会的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6614
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_5799db91:

    # p "I'll see you tomorrow, Wolf."
    p "明天见，Wolf。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6621
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_e3f1c7ba:

    # "Wolf nods. Then he heads out to the upper decks, leaving his bag behind."
    "Wolf点了点头，然后转身走向上层甲板，把包留在了原地。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6623
translate Chinese morocco_wolf_ending_5f4259bc:

    # "You follow, but only after it's been long enough for him to be gone."
    "你等了好一会儿，直到他走远后，才跟了上去。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6641
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_ca1b415e:

    # "Okay. Think."
    "好了，好好想想。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6643
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_cf3dbd67:

    # "There's chaos swimming around in your head. It's hard to pull at a single thread and unravel everything. The noise of sailors eating dinner around you doesn't help."
    "你的脑子里一片混乱，很难理清头绪。周围水手们吃晚饭的喧闹声更是让你心烦意乱。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6645
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_37ec0fe8:

    # "You're afraid that pulling at one might cause the entire mess of ideas and feelings in your head to collapse. Or to tighten in ways impossible to untangle."
    "你害怕拉扯其中任何一缕，就会让脑中那团乱麻般的思绪与情绪彻底崩塌。或是缠结成再也解不开的死结。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6647
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_1ae52daa:

    # "But you're pretty certain that the coin is the key."
    "但你几乎可以肯定，那枚硬币是关键。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6649
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_5f50623f:

    # "It's the only thing you can think of, at least. The last piece of evidence tying Wolf to France and... whatever he was doing there before coming aboard the Conway."
    "至少，这是你唯一能想到的线索。这是将Wolf与法国联系起来、并牵扯到他登上Conway之前所做之事的最后一件证据。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6651
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_204aae54:

    # "René, as far as you're aware, has no idea about it. So making it disappear and crossing your fingers might be your best choice. Your only choice."
    "据你所知，René对此毫不知情。所以，让这枚硬币消失，然后祈祷一切顺利，或许是你最好的选择，也是唯一的选择。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6656
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_34aa9a98:

    # "Hmm. It's odd, though. {w}The way he's been moving about this situation. You don't have much experience in bounty hunting, but..."
    "嗯，不过有点奇怪。{w}他处理这件事的方式……你虽然没什么赏金猎人的经验，但是……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6663
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_dcc23a18:

    # j "Hey, by the way... Who's the snake?"
    j "对了，顺便问一句……那条蛇是谁？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6665
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_e44aee63:

    # "{i}What?{/i}"
    "{i}什么？{/i}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6667
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_004a653a:

    # p "...What?"
    p "……什么？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6671
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_dfda3cb2:

    # j "The snake, you know? Quite the charming fellow, that one."
    j "就是那只蛇，你知道吗？那家伙还挺有魅力的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6673
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_2e7ee248:

    # p "How... {w}How do you know him?"
    p "你怎么……{w}你怎么认识他的？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6675
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_09f4c0d3:

    # j "I don't, to be frank. I just saw him around a few times."
    j "老实说，我不认识他。只是见过他几次。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6677
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_f053067d:

    # j "Is he a new recruit? Looks way too fancy to be a simple sailor. Then again, so does Torres—with all his clothes and preening and accessories."
    j "他是新来的吗？看着可太讲究了，不像普通水手。不过话说回来，Torres也一样——衣着光鲜，打扮精致，还浑身挂件。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6681
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_4a610eb9:

    # "Julian smiles."
    "Julian笑了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6685
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_a9dbee0b:

    # j "Hey, maybe that's why they hit it off so well."
    j "嘿，也许这就是他们俩那么投缘的原因吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6687
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_5961ae0b:

    # "{i}Wait...{/i}"
    "{i}等等……{/i}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6689
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_b797e8a6:

    # p "Wait, he and Torres..."
    p "等等，他和 Torres……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6693
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_9cf5f668:

    # j "Oh yeah. Our feathery fellow was all over him last night. I saw them together at that bar I wanted to try."
    j "哦，是啊。我们那位鸟人昨晚可黏着他了。我想去试试的那家酒吧里，看到他们在一起。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6695
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_643c0b93:

    # j "I have to say, Torres always was so adamant about being into ladies to me, but maybe snake boy is just that good."
    j "我得说，托雷斯以前总跟我强调他只对女人感兴趣，但也许那蛇就是有那么大魅力。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6697
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_b6449fa7:

    # j "Hah! I'm almost jealous."
    j "哈！我都有点嫉妒了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6699
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_8d209f01:

    # j "Then again, I guess wearing expensive clothes and being incredibly fit does help. {w}And all the free drinks, lest we forget."
    j "不过话说回来，穿得贵气又体格精悍确实管用。{w}还有喝不完的免费酒水——这点可别忘了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6705
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_e127bbb3:

    # j "Hey, if you haven't made a pass at him yet then I'm taking my chances first."
    j "嘿，如果你还没对他下手，那我可要捷足先登了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6709
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_9cd65245:

    # j "Unless Torres is the jealous kind. I don't want to overstep boundaries."
    j "除非Torres是那种爱吃醋的类型。我可不想越界。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6713
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_93f8e717:

    # j ". . ."
    j ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6715
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_81281827:

    # j "James? Are you all right?"
    j "James?你还好吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6717
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_68065162:

    # "{i}That's Torres' mysterious lover?!{/i}"
    "{i}那就是Torres的神秘情人？！{/i}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6719
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_300701d2:

    # p "I..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6721
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_f3a3a158:

    # "Thoughts race. What to do with this information? How? Does this mean he has an advantage on you or..."
    "思绪飞转。这消息该怎么用？如何用？这是否意味着他比你更有优势，还是……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6723
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_27c77a38:

    # "He was already inside the {i}Conway's{/i} crew circle, much deeper than you even thought. You should have seen this coming."
    "他早就打入了Conway船员的圈子，比你想象的还要深。你早该料到这一点的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6725
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_06754b51:

    # "But you were too focused on Wolf to think about that. Still...{w} He didn't manage to."
    "但你当时太专注于Wolf了，没往这方面想。不过……{w}他也没能得逞。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6727
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_2b630b1d:

    # "Torres didn't lead him back to the ship. He just slammed beak-first into the biggest hangover of his life on a random beach."
    "Torres并没有把他带回船上。他只是醉醺醺地一头栽倒在某个不知名的海滩上，经历了人生中最严重的一次宿醉。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6729
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_df6085f5:

    # "And now... the news could spread. Of René's real purpose."
    "而现在……这个消息可能会传开——René'的真实目的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6731
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_80bbd3ce:

    # "Okay. Think. Think. What do we do?"
    "好了，想想，快想想。我们该怎么办？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6733
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_62478534:

    # p "Can you keep this a secret?"
    p "你能保守这个秘密吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6735
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_b0301b30:

    # "We buy time."
    "我们需要争取时间。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6737
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_a3894932:

    # j "Sorry?"
    j "什么？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6739
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_ac671c7f:

    # p "The snake person thing. Can... Can you keep it a secret? From everyone else?"
    p "关于那个蛇男的事。你……你能保密吗？不告诉任何人？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6743
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_b42a7c71:

    # "Julian smiles a sly smile."
    "Julian狡黠地笑了笑。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6745
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_652aafbe:

    # j "I don't knowwwww."
    j "我不知道诶——"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6750
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_a20c46e5:

    # j "What's in it for me?"
    j "对我有什么好处？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6752
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_59a7774f:

    # j "Come on, make it interesting."
    j "来吧，给点有意思的交换条件。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6754
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_fa18aa63:

    # p "Julian. {i}Please...{/i}"
    p "Julian。{i}求求你……{/i}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6758
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_2f6f7c6e:

    # "Your seriousness strikes him. His lips uncurl, amusement fading from his face."
    "你的严肃态度让他一怔。他收起了笑容，脸上的嬉闹神色消失了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6763
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_15145157:

    # j "Whoa, don't worry. I was just having some fun."
    j "哇哦，别担心。我只是开个玩笑。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6765
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_27d034ac:

    # j "James, what is going on here?"
    j "James，这到底是怎么回事？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6767
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_300701d2_1:

    # p "I..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6769
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_875ce35a:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6771
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_74c44e5a:

    # "You cannot involve Wolf in this. You just can't."
    "你不能把Wolf卷进来。绝对不行。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6773
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_a62a932a:

    # "Whatever relationship you had with him is hanging by a thread. You can't fix this by making things worse. And sharing his secrets with others is a point of no return."
    "你和他的关系本就岌岌可危。把事情搞得更糟解决不了问题。而把他的秘密告诉别人，更是无法挽回的一步。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6775
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_b3398212:

    # "So, with your brain running at full speed, you cover it up as best you can."
    "于是，你的大脑飞速运转，尽可能地把事情遮掩过去。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6777
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_fe483a37:

    # p "... it's just that Torres isn't handling it well."
    p "……只是Torres应付得不太好。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6779
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_2021b445:

    # "{i}I'm sorry{/i}. "
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6783
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_51ef4e4c:

    # p "Me and Wolf found him three sheets to the wind at a random beach this morning. He was a mess."
    p "今天早上我和Wolf在一个海滩上发现他烂醉如泥。他当时一团糟。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6785
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_94e1a506:

    # p "Crying, incoherent... just horrible. Apparently he expected more than just a one-night fling. That snake guy let him down badly."
    p "哭哭啼啼，语无伦次……简直糟透了。显然他期待的不仅仅是一夜情。那个蛇男让他伤透了心。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6787
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_2eb1dd8f:

    # p "He... asked me not to tell anyone. He's really hurt."
    p "他……求我不要告诉任何人。他真的受伤很深。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6791
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_28772581:

    # j "Oh... okay, I see."
    j "哦……好吧，我明白了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6793
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_00655eb5:

    # j "I won't bring it up again. Is he doing better now?"
    j "我不会再提这事了。他现在好点了吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6795
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_ccba5b40:

    # p "He's... faking it. I think. But he's keeping it together a lot better than when we found him."
    p "他……在强装没事吧，我想。但比我们找到他时好多了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6797
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_1d675256:

    # p "Please, not a word of this to anyone. Including Torres himself."
    p "拜托，这件事对谁都不要说。包括Torres本人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6799
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_301b86c8:

    # p "And forget about the snake. He just takes advantage of people."
    p "也忘了那条蛇吧。他只是个利用别人的家伙。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6805
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_d4bbc238:

    # j "Yeah, don't worry about that. I don't stick my dick in assholes. {w}Just the regular garden-variety pricks at most. If they're hot."
    j "放心吧，我可不把家伙往混蛋里塞。{w}顶多就是些普通货色的刺头——如果他们够辣的话。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6809
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_d6124940:

    # j "Yeah, don't worry about that. I'll give him a wide berth. That kind of man isn't worth wasting time on."
    j "是啊，别担心这个。我会离他远远的。那种男人不值得浪费时间。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6811
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_371cf43e:

    # "You nod in agreement. Wisdom for the ages."
    "你点头表示赞同。真是至理名言。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6815
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_d3ad7bec:

    # "The conversation continues on inane stuff and pointless gossip for a few minutes. You feign interest. It's hard."
    "接下来的几分钟，谈话内容转向了无聊的话题和毫无意义的八卦。你假装感兴趣，这很困难。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6817
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_f4717051:

    # "You wonder if this is what it's like to be Wolf."
    "你想知道这是否就是Wolf的日常。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6821
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_84fca1f6:

    # "Making up stories, thinking on your feet, twisting truth around your fingers so that everything seems logical and correct."
    "编造故事，随机应变，把事实玩弄于股掌之间，让一切听起来都合情合理、天衣无缝。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6827
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_2aa5b21f:

    # "But that's not it, you think as Julian finally heads off to drink with the other sailors."
    "但当Julian终于起身去和其他水手喝酒时，你意识到并非如此。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6829
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_e8e85e02:

    # "Wolf is many things, but a spinner of lies isn't one of them. He doesn't make up tall tales or fancy stories. Nor boring anecdotes or normal lives."
    "Wolf有很多面，但绝非编谎者。他不编造离奇故事或华丽传说，也不讲乏味轶事或平凡人生。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6831
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_99300bcf:

    # "He doesn't get people off his back by coming up with falsehoods. Moody as he's always been, he never tried that hard to pretend to be something he's not."
    "他从不靠虚构来摆脱他人纠缠。虽一贯阴郁，却从未费力伪装成另一个人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6833
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_1c726388:

    # "He just never let anyone get close enough to need lying to. And when he has to, it's quick, painless, and effective."
    "他只是从不让人近到需要说谎的地步。而当不得不说时，总是迅速、干脆、有效。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6839
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_49a4e893:

    # "Unlike what you did to Julian and Torres."
    "不像你对Julian与Torres所做的那样。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6841
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_4434cdc1:

    # "You think about how awful that made you feel."
    "你想着刚才的谎言让自己感觉有多糟糕。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6843
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_f242f68d:

    # "And you realise it's a lot easier to live with lying if you just don't talk to begin with."
    "然后你意识到，如果一开始就不说话，带着谎言生活会容易得多。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6845
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_454ba560:

    # "But those thoughts will have to wait. Right now..."
    "但这些想法只能暂且搁置。眼下……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6847
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_e952cbbd:

    # "You are the only member of the crew with the whole picture."
    "你是船员中唯一了解全貌的人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6849
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_be5b3240:

    # "René tried to force Arthur's hand. He tried to scare Wolf into leaving. He tried to use Torres to enter the Conway, but didn't even manage to find the ship. He failed on all counts."
    "René试图逼Arthur就范，试图吓退Wolf，试图利用Torres混上Conway——却连船都没找着。他一败涂地。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6851
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_7b66b565:

    # "He doesn't have any proof."
    "他没有任何证据。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6853
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_b22c1fa1:

    # "He's bluffing. And that last lie he launched your way about sharing the bounty... That wasn't just aimed at forcing Wolf to commit a mistake."
    "他只是在虚张声势。而他最后对你撒的那个谎，说什么平分赏金……那不仅仅是为了逼Wolf犯错。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6855
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_4eaed8b7:

    # "He was trying to tempt you into selling him out."
    "他是想引诱你出卖Wolf。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6857
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_99bf309b:

    # "You grin as things fall into place for you."
    "当一切在你脑海中串联起来时，你咧嘴笑了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6859
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_30f08b0b:

    # "A bounty hunter doesn't bet."
    "一个赏金猎人不会下注。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6861
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_cd8a0c3c:

    # "A bounty hunter doesn't risk playing with his food. They'd just strike."
    "一个赏金猎人不会冒险戏耍他的猎物。他们只会直接出击。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6863
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_33b839be:

    # "And a {i}good{/i} bounty hunter would have all his papers in order before making a move."
    "而一个{i}优秀{/i}的赏金猎人，会在行动前把所有文件手续都准备妥当。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6865
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_74ee806f:

    # "{i}He's great at manipulating people... {w}but he's really bad at everything else.{/i}"
    "{i}他擅长操纵人心……{w}但除此之外，他一塌糊涂。{/i}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6872
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_82bc69ef:

    # "Okay, but what now?"
    "好吧，但现在该怎么办？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6874
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_ddedf767:

    # "Even if your assumptions are correct, you aren't exactly in a position of enough authority to sway anyone involved."
    "即使你的推测正确，你也没有足够的权威去影响任何相关的人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6880
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_8969d312:

    # "But, you can think of two plans that might turn the tables to your advantage."
    "但是，你可以想到两个可能扭转局势、对你有利的计划。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6882
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_ad5e13bf:

    # "Plan number one, the safest."
    "计划一，最稳妥的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6887
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_98106dc3:

    # "Get that damn coin. Hide it somewhere. Doesn't matter where, as long as nobody can prove it exists."
    "拿到那该死的硬币。把它藏起来。藏在哪儿都行，只要没人能证明它存在。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6892
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_07a0d4c1:

    # "And then hope that he doesn't have anything else on him besides that."
    "然后希望他除了那枚硬币，没有其他证据。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6898
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_c443ba19:

    # "Trust that it will be enough to avoid the worst. That your intuition about René having nothing in his hands is correct, and that searching Wolf and his stuff is just another of his stupid bets."
    "相信这足以避免最坏的情况发生，相信你关于René手中空无一物的直觉是正确的，相信搜查Wolf和他的东西只是他另一个愚蠢的赌注。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6901
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_48520050:

    # "Plan number two. Hit him with a bet of your own."
    "计划二。用你自己的赌注来反击他。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6907
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_5f0209d8:

    # "Find where Torres was supposed to meet René tonight. Show up. Persuade him that tomorrow you will sell Wolf out."
    "找到Torres今晚本该与René见面的地方。现身。说服他，你明天会出卖Wolf。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6913
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_f4f6ccc0:

    # "Make him believe he's won. Then, when the time comes, humiliate him by pretending you have no idea what he's talking about."
    "让他相信他已经赢了。然后，当时机到来时，假装完全不知道他在说什么，让他当众出丑。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6919
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_ddb95064:

    # "Throw sand in the machine. Cast doubt on his methods. He's so full of himself he won't be able to see beyond his supposed victory."
    "给他的计划里掺沙子。让他的方法受到质疑。他如此自负，一旦自以为胜券在握，就再也看不到其他可能。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6921
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_19b99ab6:

    # "Either way, you'd be able to give Arthur more to work with. You hope."
    "无论哪种方式，你都能为Arthur提供更多可操作的空间。你希望是如此。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6923
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_948266f2:

    # "Neither plan persuades you fully. A lot relies on luck. On trusting that someone else will take advantage of the window you're opening."
    "两个计划都不能完全说服你。很大程度上得靠运气。得指望别人能抓住你创造的机会。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6925
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_486d1319:

    # "But there's one thing that, by now, is clear to you."
    "但有一件事，此刻对你来说已经很清楚。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6927
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_30a6abec:

    # "You must do {i}something{/i}."
    "你必须{i}做点什么{/i}。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6942
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_a7c4b545:

    # "Okay. Let's go with the safe one."
    "好吧。就选稳妥的方案。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6954
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_7f80328b:

    # "You decide it's time to skip dinner—not that you'd be able to hold anything in anyway—and take advantage of everyone being otherwise busy."
    "你决定不吃晚饭了——反正你也吃不下什么东西——趁大家都在忙别的事时行动。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6956
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_f37bc602:

    # "You run into Sam, whom you exchange vague chitchat with. She tells you something about the baths. It goes in one ear and out the other."
    "你撞见了Sam，和她闲聊了几句。她说了些关于浴室的事。你左耳进右耳出。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6958
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_2a20e280:

    # "You run into Torres again. He avoids looking you in the eyes. You don't have the brain space for that at the moment."
    "你又碰见了Torres。他避开了你的目光。你现在没心思管这个。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6960
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_10ea726f:

    # "Everyone seems to be here, you think after scanning the environment. {w}Time to put fate to test"
    "环视四周，你心想所有人似乎都到这儿了。{w}是时候把命运押上赌桌了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6962
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_237669e5:

    # "It's a short trip to your sleeping quarters and, specifically, to Wolf's hammock."
    "去你的卧舱——确切地说，去Wolf的吊床——路程很短。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6971
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_c7af04ba:

    # "There's a couple sailors hanging out nearby, but nothing impeding your plans. Wolf is nowhere to be seen."
    "附近有几个水手在闲逛，但不妨碍你的计划。Wolf不见踪影。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6973
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_3b5ee9e3:

    # "You nod a 'hullo'. They nod back, uninterested in your presence. You pretend to be interested in something inside your bag."
    "你点头致意“你好”。他们敷衍地点头回应，对你的出现不感兴趣。你假装对包里的东西感兴趣。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6975
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_d1cad9bb:

    # sail "Yeah, so I think the food's got a bit too much spice for my taste, you know? I'm down to try stuff but I can't say my money was well spent.{w} Wonderful sights though. And tea's great. The best I ever ha—"
    sail "是啊，我觉得食物对我来说香料放太多了，知道不？我愿意尝试新东西，但这钱花得不太值。{w}不过景色很棒。茶也很好。我喝过最好的——"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6977
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_c17f5014:

    # sailmussel "My GOD, you sound like my mother. Wanna talk about crocheting as well?"
    sailmussel "天啊，你说话像我妈。还想聊聊钩针编织吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6979
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_d1bdb251:

    # sail "Listen, you don't get this chance every port! {w}I just like to take in things I've never tried before."
    sail "听着，不是每个港口都有这种机会！{w}我只是喜欢体验从未尝试过的东西。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6981
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_8939d3c4:

    # sailmussel "There's only one thing I want to try every port and they better be good at takin' it in!"
    sailmussel "我每个港口只想尝试一件事，而且他们最好擅长“接纳”！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6983
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_428c34eb:

    # "The second sailor laughs wildly as the first one repeatedly punches his shoulder."
    "第一个水手不停捶打同伴的肩膀，第二个水手狂笑起来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6985
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_62a5e6ef:

    # "{i}Come on...{/i}"
    "{i}快点啊...{/i}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6987
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_ff03b7fd:

    # sailmussel "Wow, is this how a man of refined taste like you acts? I better watch my back!"
    sailmussel "哇，这就是你这种品味高雅之人的做派？我得小心背后了！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6989
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_6e811527:

    # sail "Hey, you weren't this cynical back at those waterfalls in Spain. I know you got a soul in there! I might just keep digging to find it!"
    sail "嘿，在西班牙瀑布那儿你可没这么刻薄。我知道你骨子里有灵魂！我可能要继续挖掘才能找到它！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6991
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_c7ff3f2b:

    # sailmussel "Hah! I'm just having a bit of a lark... {w}Ow, that one hurt!"
    sailmussel "哈！我只是开个玩笑...{w}嗷，这下真疼！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:6993
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_4849f50f:

    # "{i}Get a move on already!{/i}"
    "{i}赶紧走啊！{/i}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7001
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_ee090048:

    # "After what feels like an eternity, they finally leave."
    "仿佛过了永恒之久，他们终于离开了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7003
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_544a0b6b:

    # "You take a quick look around you. The coast is clear."
    "你迅速环顾四周。海岸空无一人。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7007
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_a7682b64:

    # "You start digging through Wolf's bag."
    "你开始翻找沃夫的包。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7012
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_35e2ec77:

    # "{cps=2}. . .{/cps}"
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7018
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_0d49d2ec:

    # "And you keep digging."
    "继续翻找。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7020
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_eb3d7363:

    # "And digging."
    "再翻找。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7022
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_7bcb22a2:

    # "You empty the bag on the floor in a panic. Nothing."
    "你惊慌地把包里的东西全倒在地板上。什么都没有。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7024
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_25eea88c:

    # "No coin, just clothes and a few random items. Nothing even resembling a coin."
    "没有硬币，只有衣服和几件零碎物品。连类似硬币的东西都没有。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7026
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_12e2dc98:

    # "Did he pull it back out?{w} If so... You need to find him and tell him. Fast."
    "他又拿回去了？{w}如果是这样...你得找到他告诉他。要快。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7028
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_6435beff:

    # "But... Good luck with that. He's extremely hard to track down on a normal day. There's no way you can find him now that he doesn't want you to."
    "但是...祝你好运。平时就很难追踪他。现在他不想见你，你更不可能找到他。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7030
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_0e74b117:

    # "Okay. Plan B it is."
    "好吧。那就执行B计划。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7032
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_a1a50f60:

    # "Let's go find a snake."
    "去找那条蛇吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7039
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_2a218231:

    # "You ram Wolf's belongings back in the bag and dash for the upper deck."
    "你把Wolf的物品胡乱塞回包里，冲向上层甲板。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7041
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_ecac7c44:

    # "Has to be somewhere nearby, you think, if Torres stumbled upon him. Your only bet is the port's inn—not that there's anywhere else you know about. You can at least try that one."
    "你寻思，若Torres能撞见他，那地方必定不远。你唯一的指望是港口的旅店——虽说不认识别处，至少可以试试那儿。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7047
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_68e1976b:

    # "You reach the upper deck and start heading for the gangway..."
    "你到达上层甲板，走向舷梯..."

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7049
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_5e7eec55:

    # "... which isn't there."
    "...但舷梯不见了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7052
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_2b977c32:

    # "{i}What?!{/i}"
    "{i}什么？！{/i}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7057
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_c2a39486:

    # "The pier's right where it always is, but the distance between where you are and where you want to be is vast."
    "码头还在老位置，但你所在处与目的地之间隔着遥远的距离。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7059
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_64667db6:

    # "You stare at the water below. You can hear it, but even you only barely see the movement of the waves in the dakness. And you know it's way too far for a jump."
    "你盯着下方的海水。能听见涛声，但在黑暗中连浪涌的痕迹都难以辨认。而你知道，这距离远非一跃可及。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7061
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_4f5ea81d:

    # "That's it, then. Jumping in the dark for a distance you know you can't cover?"
    "只能这样了。在黑暗中跳向明知无法抵达的远方？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7063
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_4128d419:

    # "You can already hear Wolf remarking on how stupid that would be."
    "你仿佛已听见Wolf嘲讽这有多蠢。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7065
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_071c81fb:

    # "The soft rocking of the ship clashes with the turmoil of your thoughts. You tried. Nothing else you can do about it now."
    "船身轻柔的摇晃与你纷乱的思绪激烈冲撞。你试过了。眼下已无计可施。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7068
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_2f064b9a:

    # "Fuck!"
    "靠！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7071
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_32caec46:

    # "Fuck! {size=+20}{color=#e96a6a}Fuck!{/color}{/size} {size=+40}{color=#ef4646}Fuck!{/color}{/size}"
    "妈的！{size=+20}{color=#e96a6a}妈的！{/color}{/size}
  {size=+40}{color=#ef4646}妈的！{/color}{/size}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7075
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_9d0bb391:

    # "You blindly smack some part of the ship with your palm, leaving a momentary throbbing sensation behind."
    "你用手掌胡乱拍打船体某处，留下阵阵刺痛。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7077
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_0af744ff:

    # "Maybe, if Wolf has the coin, that would be enough? Maybe they won't search him, just his bag?"
    "也许，如果Wolf拿着硬币，那样就够了？也许他们不会搜他身，只搜他的包？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7079
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_59ddcdc4:

    # "Yeah. Sure.{w} Wishful thinking. Like that's going to take you far."
    "是啊。当然。{w}痴心妄想。这想法可帮不了你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7084
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_295d0f16:

    # "Face it. You tried what you could."
    "面对现实吧。你已经尽力了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7086
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_a7eb43ed:

    # "You're no Mate, certainly no Captain. Your hands as a Landsman are tied."
    "你不是大副，更不是船长。身为航海新手，你束手无策。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7088
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_84d20ead:

    # "There's nothing you can do but accept the only part you can play now."
    "除了接受现在唯一能扮演的角色，你无能为力。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7093
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_5fd5859d:

    # "It doesn't take long. You feel your way around the bundle of clothes and other harder things you decide not to investigate further. You recognise the shape of the coin immediately."
    "没花多久时间。你在那堆衣服和其他你决定不再深究的硬物中摸索。立刻辨认出了硬币的形状。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7095
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_a96f962d:

    # "You pull it out of the bag, making sure to put the latter back exactly where you found it and as close to its own original arrangement as you can remember."
    "你把它从包里拿出来，确保把包放回原处，并尽量按记忆恢复原样。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7097
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_9e5c8cb5:

    # "The coin is shiny, unmistakably French—that hairstyle and those stylized flowers are hard to misplace, even for someone who spent most of his youth working the fields."
    "硬币闪烁着光泽，无疑是法国样式——那种发髻与风格化的花卉纹样，纵使大半生都在田间劳作的人也不会错认。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7099
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_43d02efa:

    # "A hole pierces right through it. Not in the center though, but closer to the edge. To turn it into a... charm? A medallion?"
    "硬币上有个孔。不过不在正中，而是靠近边缘。是为了把它变成...护身符？勋章？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7101
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_07626192:

    # "It's clear this was meant to be more than a simple memento. Maybe, to Wolf and whoever gave it to him, this was never intended to be a coin at all."
    "显然这不仅仅是简单的纪念品。也许，对Wolf和赠予者而言，它从来就不是一枚硬币。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7103
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_bc3f0842:

    # "Then again... A medallion sporting a few {i}Fleurs de Lis{/i}? Meaning what? {w}That's a somewhat common symbol, so much so even you recognise it. Not exactly secret society material."
    "可话说回来……一枚饰有几朵{i}鸢尾花{/i}的徽章？这意味着什么？{w}这图案相当常见，连你都认得，实在不像秘密组织的凭证。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7105
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_cef7b46c:

    # "Maybe you're overthinking it. Unless... {w}You flip the coin around. Unless the symbolic part is the lone head of a king?"
    "或许你想多了。除非……{w}你将硬币翻转过来。除非关键在那孤零零的国王头像上？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7107
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_b33f5e85:

    # "{i}Wolf... What were you doing in France?{/i}"
    "{i}Wolf...你在法国干了什么？{/i}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7109
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_a965a845:

    # "The sound of people approaching rips your thoughts away from you."
    "有人靠近的声音打断了你的思绪。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7111
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_1cad95f8:

    # "You quickly slip the coin into your breeches and leave. No need to hang around any longer."
    "你迅速把硬币塞进马裤离开了。没必要再逗留了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7113
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_e825d0b1:

    # "All right. We got the coin. Now..."
    "好了。硬币到手。现在是..."

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7115
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_8d39333c:

    # "The worst part. Waiting."
    "最糟的部分。等待。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7123
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_172e820b:

    # "You think about going back to dinner with the others, but there's not a shred of hunger in your stomach—even though you can't remember the last time you had a bite."
    "你想过回去和其他人一起吃晚饭，但胃里毫无饥饿感——尽管你不记得上次进食是什么时候。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7125
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_f2375bb9:

    # "Wolf wasn't there either. Still on the ship somewhere, you hope. All you can do for now is trust him."
    "Wolf也不在。你希望他还在船上的某个地方。现在你能做的只有相信他。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7127
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_859a0905:

    # "You're just desperately looking for things to do, at this point. But the truth is, there's nothing to do except leaving time to do its job."
    "说穿了，你不过是在绝望地找事做。但事实是，除了等待时间发酵，别无他法。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7129
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_f3efd4f3:

    # "Deep breaths. This is the worst part."
    "深呼吸。这是最糟的部分。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7131
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_b31c387c:

    # "Waiting things out until your plot resumes."
    "等待事态发展，直到你的计划继续。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7143
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_8534ca42:

    # ". . ."
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7145
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_49a8eb83:

    # "All right. It's time to trick a snake."
    "好吧。是时候耍弄毒蛇了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7147
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_dff864e5:

    # "And to do that, you need to find a certain bird."
    "为此，你需要找到某只鸟。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7149
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_d4d8fc59:

    # "You walk. Then you jog. Then you run."
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7153
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_5e5b4dc3:

    # "It's starting to get late. Maybe too late. You have no idea how much longer you have left before whatever encounter René planned is cancelled. {w}But, for once, you get really lucky."
    "天色渐晚。也许太晚了。你不知道在René计划的会面取消前还剩多少时间。{w}但这一次，你真的很走运。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7162
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_1a050432:

    # "You turn a corner and run face-first into the bird's chest."
    "你转过拐角，一头撞进鸟的胸膛。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7164
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_75bf9903:

    # p "TORRES!"
    p "TORRES!"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7169
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_17a37425:

    # t "Uh, what..."
    t "呃，什么..."

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7171
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_7a34862d:

    # p "The guy! Was he a snake?"
    p "那家伙！他是条蛇吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7173
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_63b7d16b:

    # t "What are you even—"
    t "你到底在——"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7175
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_ae559e90:

    # p "The guy you f—ugh! The guy you told me about!"
    p "你跟我说过的那家伙——呃！你跟我说的那家伙！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7177
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_c0ea8ea4:

    # p "This is important! Was he a snake?"
    p "这很重要！他是条蛇吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7179
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_68bf5c0f:

    # t "Y... yeah. How did you—"
    t "是...是的。你怎么——"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7181
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_942a4cf4:

    # p "You said he wanted to meet again, right? Where?"
    p "你说他想再见面，对吧？在哪儿？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7183
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_ba61b978:

    # t "He, uh... He said around nine at that inn near the port. You know the one? It's visible from the ship, actually—"
    t "他，呃...他说九点左右在港口附近的那家旅馆见面。你知道那家吗？其实从船上就能看见——"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7185
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_89e6ad3a:

    # "Nine... It's still doable, you think. But you'll have to run."
    "九点...你觉得还来得及。但得跑着去。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7187
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_4e643fde:

    # p "Thank you! I'll explain when I'm back, I promise!"
    p "谢谢！我回来再解释，我保证！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7189
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_b2540efa:

    # "You scarper away from the common area."
    "你从公共区域溜走了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7195
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_c5b70c46:

    # "Sneaking off the Conway isn't as hard as you feared."
    "溜下Conway没有你担心的那么难。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7197
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_e05bf123:

    # "Most sailors are below deck enjoying their dinner, and the few that are still on watch aren't paying much attention. An empty merchant ship is of little to no interest to thieves."
    "多数水手正在下层甲板享用晚餐，少数值勤的也心不在焉。一艘空荡荡的商船可引不起盗贼什么兴致。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7201
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_98121151:

    # "The docks are dark and empty. There's people around—a port is never truly, completely empty, even at night—but nobody paying any attention to a foreign sailor passing through its piers."
    "码头黑暗空旷。周围有人——港口永远不会真正完全空无一人，即使在夜晚——但没人注意一个经过码头的外国水手。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7203
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_cc59ffc6:

    # "You think you see shadows move, a couple of mysterious figures vanishing into side alleys as you speed by. Must be your imagination."
    "你觉得瞥见阴影移动，几个神秘身影在你飞奔而过时消失在侧巷。一定是错觉。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7205
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_e15abbc0:

    # "It isn't long before you find yourself in front of the inn."
    "不久，你发现自己站在旅馆前。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7207
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_5c75e2a2:

    # "It takes a few more minutes of questions and gesticulating at the person behind the counter before he points you towards a door that, according to what few words you could somewhat figure out, belongs to a snake person from France."
    "又花了几分钟询问和向柜台后的人比划，他才指向一扇门——根据你勉强听懂的只言片语，那属于一条来自法国的蛇。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7215
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_74b47a32:

    # "You knock on that door."
    "你敲了那扇门。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7217
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_209cfbf3:

    # rs "{i}Oui?{/i}"
    rs "{i}Oui?{/i}（法语：谁？）"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7219
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_1a40c67e:

    # "Here we go. You take a deep breath."
    "开始吧。你深吸一口气。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7221
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_ec3836be:

    # p "It's... It's me. The sailor from the {i}Conway{/i}."
    p "是...是我。{i}Conway{/i}上的那个水手。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7223
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_6f69ee7a:

    # p "You talked about my share of the bounty. Well, here I am. I want it."
    p "你提过我的那份赏金。嗯，我来了。我想要。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7228
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_5ef47505:

    # "There's a moment of silence. Then the sound of a key turning in a lock, and of the door creaking open."
    "一阵沉默。然后是钥匙转动、门吱呀打开的声音。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7230
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_98324a9d:

    # rs "Well, well, well.{w} Turns out there is at least one smart sailor among the crew."
    rs "好啊，好啊，好啊。{w}看来船员里至少有个聪明水手。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7232
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_6871fa80:

    # rs "Please, make yourself at home and let us talk."
    rs "请自便，我们谈谈。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7243
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_ecf81efc:

    # "The room is... surprisingly spartan. A few books, some papers and writing implements, nothing remarkable, and the little candle one the desk struggles to light it. Definitely not a place René plans to spend much time."
    "房间...简朴得令人意外。几本书、一些纸张和文具，没什么特别，桌上的小蜡烛勉强照亮房间。绝对不是René打算久留的地方。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7246
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_ddd16cc2:

    # "René gestures to one of the chairs. You sit down, eyes trained on the snake as he sits opposite of you."
    "勒内示意其中一把椅子。你坐下，目光紧盯着在你对面坐下的毒蛇。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7248
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_1dc9a2ee:

    # rs "So.{w} Money.{w} The wind that keeps boats sailing, {i}n'est pas{/i}?"
    rs "那么。{w}钱。{w}让船只航行的风，{i}n'est pas?{/i}（法语：不是吗？）"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7250
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_875ce35a_1:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7252
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_96489040:

    # rs "A man of few words? I trust you heard the saying about how actions speak louder."
    rs "沉默寡言的人？我相信你听过行动胜于雄辩这句话。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7256
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_41083cc9:

    # rs "That poor wolf... Tsk, tsk. Betraying him like that. {w}Then again, in the eyes of justice and morality, it's his fault for trying to escape the law. Really, I do believe you're doing him a favour."
    rs "那只可怜的狼……啧啧。那样背叛他。{w}不过话说回来，在正义与道德的眼中，试图逃避法律是他的错。真的，我确实相信你是在帮他一个忙。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7258
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_46ea28aa:

    # "He's gloating. He takes extreme pleasure in flaunting power over others. He keeps talking, but you start to tune all his poison out."
    "他正得意洋洋。炫耀对他人的掌控权让他快意非凡。他还在滔滔不绝，但你已开始屏蔽所有的毒言恶语。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7262
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_036dd18b:

    # "He speaks with the cocksuredness of someone who's never had to face failure or consequence before. You wonder if he's of noble origin."
    "他以一种从未面对过失败或后果之人的狂妄自信说话。你怀疑他是否出身贵族。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7264
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_5bbf74f3:

    # "He might have been backstabbed before without even realizing. He sure's not good at keeping people on his side."
    "他可能以前被人在背后捅刀了都没意识到。他肯定不擅长让别人站在他这边。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7266
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_6613d677:

    # "You suppress a grin. It's pivotal that he perceives you as defeated, if not traitorous."
    "你强压笑意。必须让他觉得你已溃败——即便不算背叛的话。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7268
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_b7a2d788:

    # "Pretend to give him what he wants. Look to the side, all defeated. Voice unsteady."
    "假装顺从他的意愿：侧过脸，摆出一副颓丧模样。声音发颤。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7270
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_567ee15c:

    # p "I don't... want to think about this any longer than I need to."
    p "我……不想再为这件事多费心思了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7274
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_ae775fbc:

    # rs "Ah, {i}mon ami{/i}, but this is exactly what is worth thinking about! A tale of redemption over the sea, a dangerous criminal finally handed over to Law. For a fairly reasonable sum, all things considered."
    rs "“啊，{i}我的朋友{/i}，这才值得思量！一段海上救赎的故事，一名危险的罪犯终被移交法办。考虑到方方面面，酬劳也算相当合理。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7276
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_4921b234:

    # p "Yeah... {w}So... what's the sum?"
    p "是啊……{w}那么……金额是多少？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7278
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_d67aecd6:

    # rs "What a mercenary way of settling things! Patience, patience. Let us not be hasty in putting a price on justice, yes?"
    rs "真是雇佣兵一般的解决方式！耐心，耐心。我们不要急于为正义标价，好吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7282
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_adf97653:

    # "He grins. A cocky, looking-down-at-you grin you'll never get accustomed to."
    "他咧嘴笑了。一个傲慢的、俯视你的笑容，你永远也适应不了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7284
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_df6e8cf8:

    # rs "All I need you to do is confirm he's from, or has lived in, France. That and his description will allow me to do the rest. Your reward will come after."
    rs "我需要你做的，只是确认他来自法国，或在法国生活过。再加上他的外貌描述，剩下的就交给我。你的报酬之后会给你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7286
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_1b70a54f:

    # "You feel your knuckles itch. But erasing it from his face would cause more troubles than it would solve. {w}Still, the temptation is very much there."
    "你感到指关节发痒。但把他脸上的笑容抹掉会带来比解决的问题更多的麻烦。{w}尽管如此，诱惑依然非常强烈。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7290
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_c67109ac:

    # "Your lack of reaction seems to be starting to bore him, though. His gloating turns into dismissive instructions."
    "但你毫无反应，这似乎正让他渐感乏味。他的得意逐渐转为敷衍的指示。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7292
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_4fe9ff63:

    # rs "Hmm. I'll show up tomorrow before dawn, you'll point at Wolf, we'll all go home a little richer at the end of the day."
    rs "嗯。我明天黎明前会出现，你指认Wolf，然后我们大家都能在一天结束时更富有一点。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7294
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_a6e81800:

    # rs "There is no more information you need to know. And I'm not in the habit of sharing, you know. It's bad for business."
    rs "没有更多你需要知道的信息了。而且我没有分享的习惯，你知道的。这对生意不好。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7296
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_f4befc13:

    # rs "I am, however, in the habit of... taking advantage of opportunities when they come by and present themself."
    rs "然而，我确实有……抓住机会的习惯，当机会来临时。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7298
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_6991d28d:

    # "René takes a few seconds to think."
    "René花了几秒钟思考。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7302
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_a7088835:

    # rs "And you are quite the opportunity, aren't you?"
    rs "而你，就是那个机会，不是吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7304
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_b236ef31:

    # rs "I'll tell you what. I'll be generous with you if you are ready to make a deal."
    rs "我告诉你吧。如果你准备好做笔交易，我会对你慷慨一点。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7306
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_4c8f7366:

    # rs "Show me a fun time. Show me what you can do when you {i}really{/i} put your heart into it."
    rs "让我见识点有趣的。让我看看你{i}真正{/i}用心投入时能做些什么。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7308
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_e0b867a3:

    # rs "But it better be fun. You sit there like a half-empty sack of potatoes when you should be enjoying our victory."
    rs "但最好是有趣点。你本该享受我们的胜利，却像半袋土豆一样坐在那里。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7310
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_ee471b4e:

    # rs "And victory is best enjoyed in good company, is it not?"
    rs "胜利最好与良伴共享，不是吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7312
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_b0295ab4:

    # rs "I can tell you have a good body. Lean and no doubt strong from your time at sea."
    rs "我看得出你身材不错。精瘦，而且毫无疑问，因为海上生活而强壮。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7314
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_bc6847c3:

    # "His forked tongue flicks out for the briefest moment."
    "他分叉的舌头极快地探了一下。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7316
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_968e1daa:

    # rs "Even back on the beach I had the desire to see if you know how to use it."
    rs "甚至早在海滩上时，我就想看看你是否知道如何使用它。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7320
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_70197045:

    # "He licks his lips. You can't say you're surprised—he's exactly the kind of guy who'd do something like that. Power over others. {w}But his next line gives you pause."
    "他舔了舔嘴唇。你不能说你很惊讶——他正是那种会做这种事的人。仗势欺人。{w}但他的下一句话让你停顿了一下。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7322
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_ecad0f64:

    # rs "In exchange... I'll tell you something about our \"Mr. Hvidt\" that even {i}he{/i} isn't aware of."
    rs ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7324
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_f40b247c:

    # rs "But I'm warning you. I've bedded scores of men before. {w}Women, too. If they're interesting enough. You better make it worth my while, or the deal is off."
    rs "但我警告你。我以前睡过很多男人。{w}女人也有。只要她们足够有趣。你最好让我觉得值，否则交易取消。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7326
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_199c9766:

    # rs "And don't worry. I'm a proper gentleman, as the Brits say. I'll make sure to reciprocate your efforts."
    rs "别担心。我是个正派的绅士，就像英国人说的那样。我保证会回报你的努力。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7330
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_d5e524bc:

    # "He shifts provocatively in his chair, crossing his legs. Something about Wolf that... even he doesn't know?"
    "他在椅子上挑衅地动了动，翘起腿。关于Wolf的某些事……连他自己都不知道？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7332
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_e2ec6c72:

    # "Curiosity starts to bite at the back of your head. And you know what they say about that and cats."
    "好奇心开始在你的后脑勺作祟。你也知道好奇害死猫的说法。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7334
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_22bf3b78:

    # "But at the same time, maybe Wolf would want to know about... whatever it is. It doesn't feel like he's lying. He does know something Wolf doesn't."
    "但同时，也许Wolf会想知道……不管那是什么事。感觉他不像在撒谎。他确实知道一些Wolf不知道的事。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7336
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_11bc9157:

    # rs "What say you then, young sailor? Do the winds blow your way?"
    rs "那么，你怎么说，年轻的水手？风向对你有利吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7348
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_cde92cc7:

    # p "No."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7352
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_11cdd7f6:

    # rs "Hmm... {w}Would some wine help sweeten the deal?"
    rs "嗯……{w}来点酒能让这笔交易更显诱人吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7354
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_d1f8745a:

    # "His faux affability continues unabated, even in the face of your firm rejection."
    "即便你断然回绝，他那虚伪的殷勤仍不见收敛。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7356
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_7a81b9c8:

    # p "No. I just..."
    p "不。我只是……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7358
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_5799c4cd:

    # "Careful. Not {i}too{/i} firm. He has to believe you're dancing in the palm of his hand."
    "小心。别{i}太{/i}坚定。他必须相信你正在他的掌心里跳舞。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7360
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_1790a9c6:

    # p "I just want my money. That's why I came here... I don't want to be part of anything else."
    p "我只想要我的钱。这就是我来这里的原因……我不想掺和任何其他事情。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7362
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_96f7d1a2:

    # p "Please. Don't make it harder than it already is."
    p "拜托。别让事情变得更难了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7366
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_47a50279:

    # "His smile widens once again."
    "他的笑容再次扩大。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7368
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_844a837a:

    # rs "Ah, my friend, you really should learn to appreciate the finest experiences in life."
    rs "啊，我的朋友，你真该学会欣赏生活中最美好的体验。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7372
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_6c204eb8:

    # rs "All this drama, all the excitement and betrayal and potential for monetary gain... You will miss it once you're old, and frail, and gazing at the horizon with {i}nostalgie{/i}."
    rs "所有这些戏剧性，所有的兴奋、背叛和潜在的金钱收益……等你老了，虚弱了，用{i}怀旧之情{/i}凝视地平线时，你会怀念这一切的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7376
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_77bf63b3:

    # rs "If you make it that far, that is."
    rs "前提是你能活到那个时候。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7378
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_875ce35a_2:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7380
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_4ffdcf23:

    # "Your face betrays anger. But you suspect that's the point. {w}He doesn't just want to own you. He wants you to get mad about it. To rage about the fact he has power and you have none."
    "你的脸上流露出愤怒。但你怀疑这正是他的目的。{w}他不仅想拥有你。他想让你为此生气。为他有权力而你一无所有这个事实而愤怒。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7382
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_b4cf3aef:

    # "And you gave him exactly what he wanted."
    "而你恰恰给了他想要的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7384
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_12283007:

    # "He takes a few more second to soak in the feeling. {w}Until it's time to move things along."
    "他又花了几秒钟沉浸在这种感觉里。{w}直到该继续推进事情的时候了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7388
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_ef83d33d:

    # rs "Well then! Don't let me hold you. You know what to do."
    rs "那么好吧！我不耽误你了。你知道该怎么做。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7390
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_c8cc7fd9:

    # rs "Tomorrow, before dawn. Confirm that you know for certain that your friend, the wolf, spent time in France. That's all you have to do."
    rs "明日，破晓前。只需确认你清楚知道：你的朋友，那只狼，曾在法国待过。你只需做到这点。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7394
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_ba679c73:

    # rs "{i}Allons-y{/i}, then! Off you go! Chop chop!"
    rs "{i}Allons-y{/i}！（法语：走吧）快走吧！快点快点！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7403
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_58136507:

    # "You raise from the chair—slowly, as if unsure of what you're doing. He gestures toward the door, which you dutifully reach for."
    "你从椅子上站起来——慢慢地，好像不确定自己在做什么。他朝门做了个手势，你顺从地走了过去。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7405
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_6142c19d:

    # "One last regretful look back at him and his grin—maybe a little too dramatic, you think—and you're out of the room."
    "最后悔恨地回头看了他一眼和他的笑容——也许有点太戏剧化了，你想——然后你离开了房间。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7413
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_f1f269b5:

    # "All right. That's done. Now for..."
    "好了。完成了。现在该……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7415
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_50dbf593:

    # "... getting back on board, getting some sleep in, and keeping your fingers crossed the whole time."
    "……回到船上，睡一会儿，并一直祈祷好运。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7425
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_b873939c:

    # "Today's the day."
    "就是今天了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7432
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_e2a3b5bd:

    # "You watch sunlight sneak its way into the insides of the ship. {w}It's shortly before dawn and you're already awake. Or still awake."
    "你看着阳光悄悄溜进船的内部。{w}黎明将至，你已经醒了。或者说，还醒着。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7436
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_43c1b473:

    # "You tossed and turned all night. You can't tell if you managed to get some shut-eye or if you just waited in a half-dazed state until darkness started to recede."
    "你整夜辗转反侧。你分不清自己是设法睡了一会儿，还是只是半昏半醒地等到黑暗开始消退。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7438
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_f89a3f28:

    # "Either way, it's time."
    "无论如何，时候到了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7440
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_175871eb:

    # "You get off your hammock. Everyone else seems to still be asleep, enjoying their time off duty in all its sleepy glory."
    "你从吊床上下来。其他人似乎都还在睡觉，享受着他们慵懒荣耀的休息时间。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7442
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_5df0093e:

    # "Hopefully things will be over before they wake up. {w}One way or the other."
    "希望事情能在他们醒来前结束。{w}无论以哪种方式。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7444
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_81bf826a:

    # "You notice that one person is missing. Makes sense. He doesn't get much sleep in the first place."
    "你注意到有一个人不见了。很合理。他本来就不怎么睡觉。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7448
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_d627c5fd:

    # "Time to head up."
    "该上去了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7464
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_a7b2795d:

    # "As you suspected, he's already there."
    "正如你所料，他已经在那里了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7474
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_b8d4905e:

    # "And so is Arthur. {w}And, of course, {i}him.{/i}"
    "Arthur也在。{w}当然，还有{i}他{/i}。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7483
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_da1e95d4:

    # rs "Gentlemen. A good morning to you all."
    rs "先生们。大家早上好。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7485
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_b754e562:

    # "He's surrounding himself with guards and official-looking bureaucrauts, or so you assume."
    "他身边围满了卫兵和看起来像官员的人，或者至少你是这么认为的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7487
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_c84704e6:

    # "They don't seem particularly interested in the proceedings, yawning and chatting among themselves. The vast majority look like they don't appreciate the early rise at all."
    "他们似乎对程序并不特别感兴趣，打着哈欠互相聊天。绝大多数人看起来完全不喜欢这么早起床。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7489
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_50e76edb:

    # "You suspect René dragged them there as soon as his authority was able to be established."
    "你怀疑René一确立自己的权威就把他们拖来了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7491
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_051361d8:

    # rs "So, I trust we all know the reason for this little {i}tete à tete{/i}?"
    rs "那么，我相信我们都知道这次小小{i}tete à tete{/i}（法语：亲密交谈）的原因了？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7500
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_c5df286f:

    # a "Make your case and be on your way."
    a "陈述你的情况，然后就可以走了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7509
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_fda03091:

    # rs "Surely you mean {i}or{/i} be on your way, hmm?"
    rs "你肯定是说{i}或者{/i}可以走了，嗯？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7511
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_49cd8746:

    # "Arthur doesn't waste breath on a reply."
    "Arthur懒得浪费口舌回应。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7515
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_39a25ce5:

    # rs "Well then! Let the curtains fall where they may. And let them fall quickly, if we're in such a hurry to get to the gran finale."
    rs "既然如此！就让帷幕落下吧。既然我们这般急着收场，那就让它落得快些。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7517
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_35b4e218:

    # rs "The case is simple. We can start by reviewing the charges, then."
    rs "案情很简单。我们可以先回顾一下指控。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7519
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_1b621489:

    # rs "Among your crew is a man wanted in—but not hailing from—the Kingdom of France, for the crimes of..."
    rs "在你的船员中，有一个人被法兰西王国通缉——但他并非来自该国——罪名是……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7521
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_02ec2ee9:

    # rs "Theft, assault with deadly weapon, sedition, rebellion, propaganda against the State, harbouring dangerous criminals, harbouring foreign agents, and abetting in prostitution without a license."
    rs "盗窃、使用致命武器袭击、煽动叛乱、叛乱、反国家宣传、窝藏危险罪犯、窝藏外国间谍以及无证协助卖淫。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7523
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_e2db919e:

    # rs "Quite the résumé, is it not?"
    rs "履历可真够丰富的，不是吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7527
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_c9917e1d:

    # rs "Though I would have thought that scum like you would at least have the blood of one innocent staining your claws."
    rs "虽然我以为，像你这样的渣滓，爪子上至少该沾着一个无辜者的血。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7529
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_8337703c:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7533
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_66ed9c6a:

    # rs "Quite the mouthful nonetheless, I have to say. {w}The man in question is that man. Hiding under a false identity to flee the continent."
    rs "不过话说回来，这罪名可真够长的。{w}当事人就是用假身份潜逃出大陆的那位。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7535
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_8240833d:

    # rs "I am willing to... entertain the notion that his real identity has been unknown to the esteemed leadership of the {i}Conway{/i} for the time he's been on board."
    rs "我愿意……暂且相信尊敬的{i}Conway{/i}领导层在他登船期间并不知道他的真实身份。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7537
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_108bc4d2:

    # rs "However, this is going to be settled today. {w}Anything to say before we move on?"
    rs "然而，这件事今天就要了结。{w}在我们继续之前，有什么要说的吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7546
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_7ea6c069:

    # a "As far as the {i}Conway{/i} is concerned, we have no reason to suspect that Mr. Hvidt, present here, was ever part of any wrongdoing."
    a "就{i}Conway{/i}而言，我们没有理由怀疑在场的Hvidt先生曾参与任何不法行为。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7548
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_670a5cf0:

    # "Arthur's voice is heavy and authoritative. If he's got any doubt about the side he's taking, it's impossible to tell from the outside. His voice is resolute and stalwart as granite."
    "Arthur的嗓音低沉而威严。即便他对自己所站的立场存有疑虑，从外表也绝看不出分毫。他的声音如花岗岩般坚定不移。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7550
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_01ab54c2:

    # a "His record as a sailor has been more than impeccable and the information he shared about his past clear, consistent, and incompatible with these accusations."
    a "他作为水手的记录无可挑剔，他分享的关于过去的经历清晰、一致，并且与这些指控不符。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7559
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_6879bd22:

    # rs "You're not making this any easier for yourself, my friend—"
    rs "你这是在给自己找麻烦，我的朋友——"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7568
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_daac8957:

    # a "Kindly refrain from assuming friendship where there is none."
    a "请不要在并无交情处强充友好。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7577
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_47805295:

    # "René's smile falters. He's not used to pushback, and Arthur is not used to being pushed to the side."
    "René的笑容僵住了。他不习惯遭遇反抗，而Arthur也不习惯被人轻慢。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7581
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_4cd59c53:

    # rs "Well then. You want to play hard? Let us play hard."
    rs "那么好吧。你想玩硬的？那我们就玩硬的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7588
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_24dd7e4e:

    # rs "You. With the white fur."
    rs "你。那个白毛的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7590
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_1f895a5a:

    # "The guards and public officials jolt from their lethargy, turning your way. You're up. Time for the performance of Wolf's lifetime."
    "胃病与公务官员们顿时从倦怠中惊醒，齐刷刷转向你。该你上场了。对Wolf此生最关键的一场表演该开始了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7592
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_7c8f3eef:

    # "You avoid looking his way. You don't need any more stress, and you don't want to even try to read his emotions at the moment."
    "你避免看向他那边。你不需要更多的压力，此刻你甚至不想尝试解读他的情绪。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7596
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_c78816ea:

    # rs "I believe you might know something about this man's past that might have escaped our esteemed first mate, yes?"
    rs "我相信你可能知道一些关于这个人过去的、可能被我们尊敬的大副忽略的事情，是吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7598
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_263d7ea4:

    # "All right. It's your line. Here you go."
    "好了。该你说台词了。上吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7600
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_b22ba14b:

    # "Make it good. Make it believable. Make it matter."
    "演好它。让它可信。让它有意义。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7602
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_5cf19016:

    # "You get one chance to sell things, a performance that makes thespians everywhere fall to their knees in tear."
    "你只有一次兜售故事的机会，一场足以让四海剧伶跪地泣服的表演。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7604
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_40f0a613:

    # "One line, one reaction. Hit it. {w}Go."
    "一句台词，一个反应。把握住。{w}开始。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7614
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_7963ea42:

    # rs "Are you stupid? You have information on him. Spit them out."
    rs "你傻了吗？你有关于他的信息。快说出来。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7621
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_b44afce3:

    # rs "What the—yes, you. Come on. Say your piece."
    rs "什么——是的，就是你。快点。说出你知道的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7625
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_dcc16758:

    # p "Look, I have no clue what's going on here."
    p "看，我完全不知道这里发生了什么。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7627
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_c746dd25:

    # "Befuddlement paints over your face. The most innocently confused look you can manage."
    "困惑的神情浮现在你脸上。你能摆出的最无辜、最困惑的表情。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7629
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_04cda284:

    # p "I'm just here for some fresh morning air, sir. I don't know anything about this."
    p "我只是来这里呼吸一下清晨的新鲜空气，先生。我对此事一无所知。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7631
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_0c7b90bd:

    # "Murmurs start to snake between the crowd, as the snake."
    "人群中开始窃窃私语，像蛇一样蔓延。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7633
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_3da019b8:

    # rs "Are you—This man! Was he in France?"
    rs "你——这个人！他在法国待过吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7635
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_4018a6d6:

    # p "I don't think so? He never mentioned anything about France. He said he was from the northern countries."
    p "我不这么认为？他从未提过任何关于法国的事。他说他来自北方国家。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7637
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_66497509:

    # p "All I know is that you came here yesterday and started throwing accusations around and barking orders in French, sir. {w}May I ask what's going on? I'm very confused."
    p "我只知道您昨天来到这里，就开始用法语到处指控和发号施令，先生。{w}我能问问是怎么回事吗？我非常困惑。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7646
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_9bcc04f1:

    # a "Nothing a sailor should worry about."
    a "这不是一个水手该操心的事。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7648
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_00d2c303:

    # "Arthur takes over the conversation, taking advantage of your opening."
    "Arthur接过话头，利用你创造的机会。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7652
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_1c46599d:

    # rs "As you can surmise by my helping hands, I was given authorization to search your ship for anything that might help my case. "
    rs ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7656
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_2eda5c0d:

    # rs "Let's get to that, shall we?"
    rs "我们开始吧，好吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7658
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_6d0a6dcd:

    # "He gives the guards a signal with his hand."
    "他用手给卫兵们打了个信号。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7664
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_2ea2da1e:

    # "They board the Conway without deigning anyone of a single stare. Arthur moves aside."
    "他们登上Conway，甚至不屑于看任何人一眼。Arthur让到一边。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7671
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_76834361:

    # "One of them grabs Wolf's wrists and lifts them up. Another starts searching him thoroughly and aggressively."
    "一人抓起Wolf的手腕高举过头，另一人开始粗暴地彻底搜身。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7673
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_b14ae9ed:

    # "He sticks his hands under his shirt, in his breeches, with complete disregard for any sense of personal space. Wolf lets him without a single sign of discomfort."
    "那双手探进他衬衣下摆，伸进马裤，毫无顾忌地侵犯着私人界限。Wolf任其动作，未表现出一丝不适。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7677
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_06a873a6:

    # "He only flinches when he pulls out the fife. {w}And flinches even harder when it's tossed aside, bouncing over the deck. But says nothing."
    "他只在短笛被抽出时瑟缩了一下。{w}当它被随手抛在甲板上弹跳时，他缩得更紧了。但一言未发。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7685
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_5f763d0e:

    # "The guard barks something you don't understand to René. He replies angrily in French, looking at Arthur."
    "卫兵朝René吼了句你听不懂的话。René愤怒地用法语回敬，目光却射向Arthur。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7687
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_47883d02:

    # "He says something drily in response. The guards hurry down into the ship."
    "Arthur冷淡地回应了一句。卫兵们匆忙下到船舱里。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7689
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_6d42b604:

    # "They come back a few minutes later with Wolf's bag. {w}They rip it open, spreading its contents all over the deck."
    "几分钟后，他们拿着狼的包回来了。{w}他们撕开包，把里面的东西撒了一甲板。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7691
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_13311e13:

    # "And they don't find the coin."
    "他们没有找到那枚硬币。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7693
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_2a8b6059:

    # "Minutes pass as they search. But... they don't seem to find anything of interest. Just clothes, random leftover scraps ships biscuits, nothing out of the ordinary."
    "他们搜查了几分钟。但是……他们似乎没有找到任何有意思的东西。只有衣服、零散的剩船饼干，没什么特别的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7695
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_31efc335:

    # "Part of you takes notice of how exceedingly anonymous Wolf's belongings are. Makes sense. {w}Another part is starting to understand that the more time they spend filtering through his things, the clearer it gets that there's nothing they can use."
    "你的一部分注意到狼的物品是多么地平淡无奇。有道理。{w}另一部分开始明白，他们花越多时间翻检他的东西，就越清楚地意识到他们找不到任何有用的东西。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7697
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_e045e9e0:

    # "And Arthur isn't letting that momentum stall."
    "而Arthur不会让这股势头停滞。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7706
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_8b7ab685:

    # a "Apparently, we are being pestered by a {i}private{/i} individual attempting to enact justice on behalf of a foreign power, with no available proof whatsoever."
    a "显然，我们正被某个{i}私人{/i}个体纠缠，他试图代表外国势力执行司法，却拿不出半点可靠证据。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7708
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_1fb31039:

    # a "We are civilized people or am I mistaken? And that means we follow the rule of law with the need to produce the required evidence rather than mere accusations."
    a "我们是文明人，还是我理解错了？这意味着我们遵循法治，需要出示确凿证据，而非空口指控。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7710
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_c0425de0:

    # "A member of the crowd translates into the ear of the closest and most important-looking official. {w}Arthur speaks slowly, making sure each of his words makes it through the language barrier."
    "人群中有人把话翻译给最近、看起来最重要的官员听。{w}Arthur说得很慢，确保他的每句话都能穿透语言障碍。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7714
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_ff9e0e66:

    # a "Is this what Mogador has to offer to merchant ships passing through? Petty bullies trying to will wild flights of fancy into existence?"
    a "这就是摩加多尔提供给过往商船的东西吗？卑劣的恶霸试图将异想天开变成现实？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7716
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_a2a12253:

    # a "I shall have to inform the captain that this port may not be as condusive to foreign trade as the Sultan promised the world. And he shall have to inform the company and government.{w} We would rather our ships find more... receptive trading partners, I believe."
    a "我将不得不禀报船长：此港对外贸的友善程度，恐不及苏丹向世人所承诺的那样。而船长亦须告知公司与政府。{w}我想，我们更倾向于为船只寻找更……善意的贸易伙伴。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7720
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_9d7f806c:

    # "The murmurs turn a darker shade of shocked. Hurried words in a language you can't speak."
    "低语声渐转为震惊的暗调。急促的异国言语你一句也听不懂。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7729
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_78c5e1e6:

    # "René tries to quell the doubts, certainly talking to the officials about how Arthur must be bluffing. They don't seem impressed."
    "René试图平息疑虑，肯定是在向官员们说Arthur一定是在虚张声势。他们似乎不为所动。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7731
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_85850f41:

    # "There's some polite back-and-forth in a language you don't know. Then some more French that you can't make out. Then..."
    "他们用你不懂的语言进行了一些礼貌的来回交锋。然后又是更多你听不懂的法语。接着……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7733
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_5700d611:

    # "René starts getting some unkind looks from the bureaucrats."
    "René开始受到官僚们一些不友善的目光。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7735
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_8111199a:

    # "They exchange a few words with him. He replies with a huffy tone, then with barely restrained anger."
    "他们和他交谈了几句。他用恼怒的语气回答，然后是几乎压抑不住的愤怒。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7737
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_dbb2e0d8:

    # "The officials reply with polite but clearly adverse tones. {w}They're keeping it civil, but they're clearly more and more cross."
    "官员们用礼貌但明显不利的语气回应。{w}他们保持着文明，但显然越来越生气。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7741
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_b1b6a913:

    # "Until one of them start shouting at René. And then the dam breaks."
    "直到其中一人开始对René大喊大叫。然后，堤坝决口了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7750
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_d0496a05:

    # p "Should we..."
    p "我们应不应该……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7754
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_8aab924d:

    # a "No. Let it play out."
    a "不。我们静观其变。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7763
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_def3c4a4:

    # "You can't tell what's happening, but you can tell that René is getting a very informal earful from some very angry people of power."
    "你听不懂发生了什么，但你能看出René正被一些非常愤怒的当权者非常不客气地训斥。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7770
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_8f53b793:

    # "His irate tone is quickly replaced by bewilderment and a hint of pleading, but to no avail."
    "他愤怒的语调迅速转为困惑，甚至带上一丝恳求，但毫无作用。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7772
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_0af27bbd:

    # "Soon, the public officials all leave—not all at once, but once again, it only takes one to turn the tide against the snake."
    "很快，公务人员悉数离去——虽非同时撤走，但再度印证了只需一人便能逆转局势，让那蛇孤立无援。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7774
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_6303534b:

    # "He remains there on the pier, along with a handful of confused guards."
    "他仍滞留在码头，身边只剩几名茫然的卫兵。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7782
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_f6311a58:

    # a "Mr. Serrault..."
    a "Serrault先生……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7786
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_f9ccad9d:

    # rs "What! What do you want!?"
    rs "什么！你想干什么！？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7790
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_43d4f2ac:

    # a "Are you familiar with the Netherlands?"
    a "你熟悉荷兰吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7794
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_14e17fb6:

    # rs "I... What are you trying to..."
    rs "我……你想说什么……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7798
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_1b294228:

    # a "Fascinating country, that one. Besieged by tidal waves, its people have for centuries held steadfast against the encroaching water and fought back with wild fervor, willing arable land into being through sheer persistence and genius."
    a "那片国度着实迷人。潮汐围困百年，其民却始终坚守，以狂热的斗志抗击海水侵吞的洪流，凭坚韧与才智反击，硬生生垦出可耕之地。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7800
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_7352285b:

    # a "They have this captivating saying... {w}'Three things rule the waves: the moon, the wind, and us.'"
    a ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7804
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_a7c35c80:

    # a "Personally, I think trying to commandeer the sea is little more than folly born of hubris. But I respect a people willing to put everything on the line against a seemingly immovable force."
    a "我个人认为，试图驾驭海洋不过是傲慢催生的愚行。但我敬重这样一个甘愿押上一切、对抗似不可撼之力的民族。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7806
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_499a8c9a:

    # a "For you see, we sailors and the land-loving Dutch have a common understanding; that by fighting the sea, men turn into something more than men."
    a "你看，我们水手和热爱土地的荷兰人有一个共识；通过与大海搏斗，人会变成超越凡人的存在。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7808
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_0fa85751:

    # a "Mr. Serrault, you are no force of nature. And you are most definitely not 'us.'"
    a "Serrault先生，你不是自然之力。你也绝对不是“我们”。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7810
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_03e6e4f0:

    # rs ". . ."
    rs ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7814
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_beb17707:

    # rs "...What in ze GODDAMN FUCK are you talking abou—"
    rs "……你他妈了个逼的到底在说什——"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7816
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_d3302656:

    # a "Do enjoy your return trip to France."
    a "好好享受你回法国的旅程吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7818
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_17facd17:

    # a "Now back to your posts, men! The {i}Conway{/i} could use some manning, and I could use a hearty breakfast."
    a "现在，回到你们的岗位上去，伙计们！{i}Conway{/i}需要人手，我也想吃顿丰盛的早餐了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7823
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_f57085cf:

    # "It's all theatrics, you can tell—the ship is nearly empty, most sailors having not much to do before leaving Mogador. And yet, both you and Wolf can't help but join in."
    "这都是演戏，你能看出来——船几乎是空的，大多数水手在离开摩加多尔前没什么事可做。然而，你和狼都忍不住加入了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7825
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_acf37c31:

    # p "Aye aye, sir!"
    p "遵命，长官！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7827
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_d377e05f:

    # w "Aye, sir!"
    w "遵命，长官！"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7836
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_61cae33a:

    # "Down on the pier, a snakes {i}seethes{/i}."
    "码头下，一条蛇{i}愤怒至极{/i}。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7838
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_c7db9270:

    # "You never truly understood the meaning of that word until now. Guards retreating, functionaries yawning and chatting among themselves in the distance, René stands alone at the end of a long and lonely pier."
    "直到此刻，你才真正理解这个词的含义。卫兵们退去，官员们在远处打着哈欠互相聊天，René独自站在漫长而孤寂的码头尽头。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7840
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_a1dfbd0a:

    # "He looks at you with murder in his eyes. You flash him a polite smile."
    "他用充满杀意的眼神看着你。你礼貌地朝他笑了笑。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7842
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_08de98e8:

    # "Should you wave?"
    "你该挥手吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7844
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_53f3173c:

    # "You probably shouldn't."
    "你或许不该。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7846
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_29bd9003:

    # "Angering a bounty hunter sounds like a bad idea."
    "激怒一个赏金猎人听起来不是个好主意。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7848
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_94c012de:

    # "It'll just make him even more mad."
    "那只会让他更生气。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7850
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_5958b66d:

    # "But, on the other hand..."
    "但是，另一方面……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7857
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_37af3488:

    # "Your smile grows into enough of a grin that your canines begin to peek past your lips."
    "你的微笑扩大成咧嘴笑，以至于你的犬齿开始露出嘴唇。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7859
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_3f78ac86:

    # "You wave to him, almost excessively so and god you {i}hope{/i} it makes him mad."
    "你朝他挥手，几乎有点过分了，天啊你{i}希望{/i}这能激怒他。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7861
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_169b9f14:

    # "In an instant your wish is fulfilled, and his glare turns even more vicious.{w}He then turns to your lupine companion."
    "瞬间你的愿望就实现了，他的瞪视变得更加恶毒。{w}然后他转向你的狼同伴。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7865
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_8965b6ec:

    # "Naaaah...{w} You shouldn't..."
    "算~了吧……{w}你不该……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7874
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_8534ca42_1:

    # ". . ."
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7876
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_dedea76c:

    # ". . . . ."
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7878
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_ab88a0ea:

    # "You pause in your step."
    "你停下了脚步。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7880
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_f66999e2:

    # "Ah, you just can't help yourself."
    "啊，你就是忍不住。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7882
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_7b442fcb:

    # "And besides... {w}Fuck him."
    "而且……{w}去他妈的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7891
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_53f33703:

    # "You turn to René for a last look, your smile grows into a broad gleeful grin."
    "你转向René最后看了他一眼，你的微笑扩大成欢快的大笑。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7893
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_e02a7f24:

    # "Somehow his glare turns even more vicious. {w}He then turns to your lupine companion."
    "不知怎的，他的瞪视变得更加恶毒了。{w}然后他转向你的狼同伴。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7902
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_f8a34cc6:

    # "Wolf is staring him back without a shred of emotion on his face."
    "狼正回瞪着他，脸上没有一丝表情。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7904
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_40ddb810:

    # "The lupine looks like he's about to say something, but then changes his mind."
    "狼看起来像是要说什么，但随后改变了主意。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7908
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_676033e3:

    # "He just smiles at the snake."
    "他只是对那条蛇笑了笑。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7915
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_0f6f4fdd:

    # "He walks back to where the fife fell during his frisking, picking it up and slipping it into his breeches."
    "他走回搜身时笛子掉落的地方，捡起来，塞回马裤里。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7917
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_126e27d1:

    # "Then, slowly, he picks his clothes and the pieces of his bag up."
    "然后，慢慢地，他捡起他的衣服和背包的碎片。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7922
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_442b33a0:

    # "Then he heads below deck."
    "接着他走向下甲板。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7924
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_5544ad19:

    # rs "{i}Putain...{/i}"
    rs "{i}Putain...{/i}（法语：杂种）"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7931
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_006b7257:

    # "René looks at you, then at Arthur, then back at you again. You can see endless fantasies of violence playing out behind his eyes."
    "René看着你，又看向Arthur，然后再看回你。你能看到他眼中上演着无数暴力的幻想。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7936
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_a0efc8c2:

    # "But, no matter how hard he wills it, reality writes its terms in much stronger ink. {w}He spits on the wooden pier and, finally, storms off without attempting a theatrical goodbye."
    "但无论他如何不甘，现实的条款总以更浓墨书写。{w}他朝木码头啐了一口，终是愤然离去，连场戏剧性的告别都未曾尝试。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7940
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_9b9af47f:

    # "Arthur nods."
    ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7949
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_b13f170e:

    # a "And that is that, recruit. Curtain call."
    a "就这样了，新兵。谢幕。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7953
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_d4a13919:

    # a "I would recommend avoiding heading into town for the rest of our stay after what you just did. I wouldn't put it past Mr. Serrault to pull some dirty tricks, but as long as you and Mr. Hvidt remain around the docks and piers, things should be fine."
    a "鉴于你刚才的所作所为，我建议在我们停留的剩余时间里避免进城。我不排除Serrault先生会耍些肮脏手段，但只要你和Hvidt先生待在码头和港口附近，应该就没事。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7955
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_ab6c4394:

    # a "And aboard the {i}Conway{/i}, of course. You'll always enjoy safety here."
    a "当然，在{i}Conway{/i}上也是。你们在这里总是安全的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7959
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_41140ec0:

    # "The sun is finally making its way up the edge of the world. The first few lazy sailors—enjoying the last few days of idleness they can afford before resuming their duty—are starting to crowd the deck."
    "太阳终于从世界的边缘升起。第一批慵懒的水手——享受着恢复职责前最后几天能负担得起的闲散——开始聚集在甲板上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7961
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_ad4a3533:

    # "They're none the wiser, you think. That they came this close to losing one of their own. {w}Laughter, banter, a few very sparse orders start to fill the air."
    "他们一无所知，你想。他们差点就失去了自己的一员。{w}笑声、戏谑、零星的命令开始在空中弥漫。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7963
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_196b0f2b:

    # "Arthur, lost in thought, idly follows their moves with his eyes."
    "Arthur陷入沉思，目光懒散地跟随着他们的动作。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7965
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_7de6438e:

    # "Then he focuses back to you, as if only now noticing you're still standing beside him."
    "然后他把注意力转回到你身上，仿佛现在才注意到你还站在他旁边。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7971
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_8eb8a656:

    # a "Yes, recruit? Anything you need?"
    a "什么事，新兵？你需要什么吗？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7973
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_875ce35a_3:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7975
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_98720c2f:

    # p "Sir?"
    p "长官？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7977
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_fa5a3fd9:

    # a "What is it?"
    a "怎么了？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7979
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_3df6972f:

    # p "You knew about the coin all along."
    p "你一直都知道那枚硬币的事。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7983
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_a4e6b72e:

    # a "Runt... I'm the first mate. I have decades of sailing experience."
    a "小不点……我是大副。我有几十年的航海经验。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7985
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_e3ae3b5e:

    # a "I spent coins from countries whose name you can't pronounce in ports you will never even hear about."
    a "我在你连名字都念不出的港口，花过你闻所未闻的国家的硬币。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7987
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_d513d3ec:

    # a "I knew that was a French coin since the first time he held it."
    a "从他第一次拿着它的时候，我就知道那是枚法国硬币。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7989
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_40f3d1a3:

    # p "But...{w} If you knew, then why the ruse?"
    p "但是……{w}如果你知道，那为什么还要演戏？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7991
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_6b7e4b02:

    # "Arthur sighs. It's a deep, almost rumbling sound."
    "Arthur叹了口气。那声音低沉，几乎带着隆隆的尾音。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7993
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_1372cc2f:

    # a "Because, as important as rules and regulations are, there is more to being crew than following them."
    a "因为，虽然规章制度很重要，但作为一名船员，绝不能不仅仅是遵守它们。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7995
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_998a086b:

    # a "I chose to trust in Mr. Hvidt, and he in turn chose to trust in me. But he also chose to trust in {i}you{/i}."
    a "我选择信任Hvidt先生，而他也选择信任我。但他还选择信任{i}你{/i}。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:7999
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_fd7beca7:

    # a "I had to see for myself that his trust was well-earned."
    a "我必须亲眼确认，他配得上这份信任。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8003
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_c1735f71:

    # a "I was curious to see if he wasn't a fool for trusting you."
    a "我想看看，他信任你是不是个愚蠢的决定。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8005
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_bb5cfde1:

    # p "But... I still don't understand."
    p "可是……我还是不明白。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8007
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_323cbf67:

    # p "Why go through all the trouble of setting this up? Why not just tell him to toss the coin overboard, and... and that's it?"
    p "为什么要这么大费周章地设这个局？为什么不直接让他把硬币扔下船，然后……不就完了？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8012
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_075d282a:

    # a "Runt?"
    a "小子？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8014
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_061e5381:

    # p "Yes?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8016
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_7422a161:

    # a "I believe this belongs to Mr. Hvidt."
    a "我想这东西是属于 Hvidt先生的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8020
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_e2e6e265:

    # "It's... the coin. French king, hole and all. Almost comically tiny, in Arthur's large hands. {w}He had it the whole time."
    "是……那枚硬币。法国国王，还有那个孔什么的。在Arthur的大手里，它显得小得几乎滑稽。{w}他一直都拿着它。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8022
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_545019a6:

    # "You swallow as he places it in your palm."
    "当他把它放在你掌心时，你咽了口唾沫。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8024
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_be3fd392:

    # a "Bring it to him."
    a "拿去给他。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8026
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_1c7b3d0f:

    # a "That will be all."
    a "就这样吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8028
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_98720c2f_1:

    # p "Sir?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8032
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_29f73c33:

    # a "I'm warning you, runt. My temper has been ground {i}very{/i} short this morning."
    a "我警告你，小子。我今天早上的耐性已经被磨得{i}非常{/i}少了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8034
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_4bae719f:

    # a "{i}Weigh your next line carefully.{/i}"
    a "{i}你接下来要说的话，最好仔细掂量。{/i}"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8036
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_875ce35a_4:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8038
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_db1f5e1a:

    # p "Why?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8040
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_26c8c55e:

    # a ". . ."
    a ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8042
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_674f5053:

    # "The years weigh heavily on his face."
    "岁月的痕迹沉重地显露在他的脸上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8044
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_4a1b4a99:

    # "For a second, you catch a glimpse of all the miles of foam and waves that accumulated on Arthur's back. But it's just a glimpse."
    "有那么一瞬，你窥见了积压在Arthur肩头的万里涛痕。但也只是一瞥。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8046
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_640371d8:

    # a "Maybe one day you will understand."
    a "也许有一天你会明白。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8050
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_6aa47ef3:

    # a "Until then... Enjoy what little of your shore leave you have left. And try not to bother me anymore."
    a "在那之前……好好享受你剩下的那点岸上假期吧。还有，尽量别再烦我了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8054
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_de87b5b3:

    # a "You're dismissed."
    a "你可以走了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8071
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_087b12a3:

    # p "It's over."
    p "结束了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8073
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_c8509b23:

    # "The insides of the Conway are quiet. Most sailors being out and about, drinking booze and visiting new places, make for a pretty solitary ship."
    "Conway内部很安静。大多数水手都在外面，喝酒，逛新地方，使得这艘船相当冷清。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8075
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_821dc2aa:

    # "It fits Wolf well."
    "这很适合Wolf。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8077
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_9b95af7d:

    # w "So it is. It's over."
    w "所以就这样了。结束了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8079
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_4af5ec6e:

    # p "I'm glad. Things were getting a bit too tense up there. {w}I can't wait to return to worrying about... bilge water and ropes, or whatever they'll make us do next."
    p "我很高兴。刚才上面的气氛有点太紧张了。{w}我等不及要回去操心……舱底水啊，缆绳啊，或者他们接下来要让我们干的什么活了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8081
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_9a526f1d:

    # p "And, uh..."
    p "还有，呃……"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8084
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_95646dad:

    # "You fish the coin out of your breeches."
    "你从裤子里摸出了那枚硬币。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8086
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_30edf5a7:

    # p "This is yours."
    p "这是你的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8088
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_8337703c_1:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8093
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_e017191e:

    # "Wolf takes it without saying a word. He holds it in his paw, looking at it with no expressed emotion."
    "Wolf一言不发地接了过去。他把它握在爪子里，看着它，脸上没有表露任何情绪。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8095
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_26ebf7a3:

    # w "So that's where it disappeared to."
    w "原来它消失到那儿去了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8097
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_4dd2a6af:

    # p "Arthur said it might be a risk.{w} Well, he didn't exactly say that. I put two and two together and figured there was {i}something{/i} I could do to help."
    p "Arthur说这可能是个风险。{w}嗯，他倒没明说。我自己推断了一下，觉得我或许能做{i}点什么{/i}来帮忙。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8099
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_8eeeed3c:

    # "Wolf says nothing. He just stares at the coin."
    "Wolf什么也没说。他只是盯着那枚硬币。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8101
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_aa210b47:

    # p "I... didn't expect you to lie to him about your name, back then. I thought he'd earned your trust. Or at least your respect."
    p "我……没想到你当时会对他隐瞒你的名字。我以为他赢得了你的信任。或者至少是你的尊重。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8105
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_08ae85e2:

    # w "I didn't lie."
    w "我没有撒谎。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8107
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_8d004f41:

    # w "The name on those papers, that wasn't me. Not anymore."
    w "文件上的那个名字，那不是我。不再是了。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8109
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_5538b734:

    # p "That's word games. You know what I mean."
    p "这是文字游戏。你懂我的意思。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8113
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_ad4abc2d:

    # w "If you say so."
    w "随你怎么说。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8115
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_ff46a0d3:

    # w "Whatever happened in the past... I'm not that person anymore. Hearing that name has become too painful."
    w "无论过去发生了什么……我都不再是那个人了。听到那个名字太过痛苦。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8117
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_4962b747:

    # w "My name is Wolf. I'm another face in a crowd. That's all there is to me, and that's all I want there to be."
    w "我叫Wolf。不过是人海中的一张脸。这就是我的全部，也是我想要的仅此而已。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8121
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_80d29002:

    # p "Was Wolf the best you could come up with"
    p "Wolf就是你当时能想到最好的名字？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8123
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_9c9f27f9:

    # "His eyes suddenly target you."
    "他的目光突然锁定你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8125
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_1bd00e36:

    # p "I'm just saying. It's very...{w} on-the-nose."
    p "我只是说说。这名字非常……{w}直白。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8127
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_07e50d8e:

    # w "That's what makes it work."
    w "正因为如此才管用。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8129
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_fef196e9:

    # p "It's what makes it obvious. Could have gone with... Bob."
    p "也正因为如此才明显。你本可以用……Bob的。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8131
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_5ca3d823:

    # p "No? Jebediah perhaps?"
    p "不行？那Jebediah呢？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8135
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_36eb56d7:

    # "He snarls, his eyes having returned to the coin already."
    "他低吼了一声，目光早已回到了硬币上。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8137
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_28bbd7c3:

    # "You take the hint."
    "你明白了他的暗示。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8141
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_8337703c_2:

    # w ". . ."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8143
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_40f6e308:

    # w "I owe Arthur. And... {w}I owe you."
    w "我欠Arthur一个人情。而且……{w}我也欠你。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8145
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_1023c7be:

    # w "Not used to saying it. But... thank you. I owe you."
    w "我不习惯说这个。但是……谢谢。我欠你一回。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8147
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_59016c19:

    # "You smile. A hint of sweetness, at last? Facade coming crumbling down?"
    "你笑了。终于透出一丝温情了？伪装开始瓦解了？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8151
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_81608c29:

    # w "Hmm..."
    w ""

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8153
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_35743654:

    # w "Don't like how it feels. {w}How can I pay you back? I don't want any debts."
    w "我不喜欢这种感觉。{w}我怎么还你人情？我可不想欠债。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8155
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_f6f8449e:

    # "Your smile turns into a chuckle. There's the Wolf you know."
    "你的微笑变成了一声轻笑。这才是你认识的那个Wolf。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8157
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_87eec5f2:

    # "Emotionally closed off, and aggressively so. But... Something's different about it, this time. {w}There's a—"
    "情感上封闭，而且是带有攻击性的那种封闭。但是……这次有点不一样。{w}有那么一丝——"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8159
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_f9ee2b26:

    # "Suddenly your stomach makes its presence known. Loudly."
    "突然，你的胃大声宣告了它的存在。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8161
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_2d50ae18:

    # p "Well... Arthur recommended to stay either on the Conway or near the docks until we sail off again."
    p "嗯……Arthur建议我们在再次起航前，要么待在Conway上，要么待在码头附近。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8163
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_c9715a11:

    # p "I'm thinking... how about breakfast at the port's inn?"
    p "我在想……去港口旅馆吃顿早餐怎么样？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8167
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_1b983fe7:

    # w "Breakfast?"
    w "早餐？"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8169
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_d0632b35:

    # p "Yeah, breakfast. I haven't had a bite since yesterday afternoon, the least you can do is buy me breakfast."
    p "对，早餐。我从昨天下午到现在一口东西没吃，你至少能请我吃顿早餐吧。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8173
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_45e31acb:

    # p "And no funny business. No dice or cards to weasel yourself out of it or steal my food again."
    p "别耍花样。别想用骰子或纸牌糊弄过去，或者再偷我的食物。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8177
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_7826d57d:

    # p "And don't try to cheap out on me. I know your wage. It's the same as mine."
    p "也别想对我抠门。我知道你的工资。跟我的一样。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8181
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_cc69e7f0:

    # w "... Heh."
    w "……呵。"

# game/script morocco wolf.rpy:8185
translate Chinese day15_james_plan_1591ac19:

